               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In the N=4 super Yang-Mills theory, we consider the \
higher order anomalous\\ndimensions gamma_L(g) of purely gluonic operators \
Tr(F^L) where F is a\\ncomponent of the self-dual field strength. We propose \
compact closed\\nexpressions depending parametrically on L that reproduce the \
prediction of\\nBethe Ansatz equations up to five loop order, including \
transcendental dressing\\ncorrections. The size dependence follows a simple \
pattern as the perturbative\\norder is increased and suggests hidden \
relations for these special operators.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
