prediction of\nBethe Ansatz equations up to five loop order, including \
transcendental dressing\ncorrections. The size dependence follows a simple \
pattern as the perturbative\norder is increased and suggests hidden relations \
for these special operators.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Mon, 1 Oct 2007 07:20:09 GMT"}, {
