          TagBox[
           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"0710.4348\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Daniel Green\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Daniel Green, Michael Mulligan, David Starr\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Boundary Entropy Can Increase Under Bulk RG Flow\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"20 pages\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Nucl.Phys.B798:491-504,2008\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1016/j.nuclphysb.2008.01.010\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"SU-ITP-07/19, SLAC-PUB-12907\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"hep-th cond-mat.stat-mech\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The boundary entropy log(g) of a critical \
one-dimensional quantum system (or\\ntwo-dimensional conformal field theory) \
is known to decrease under\\nrenormalization group (RG) flow of the boundary \
theory. We study instead the\\nbehavior of the boundary entropy as the bulk \
theory flows between two nearby\\ncritical points. We use conformal \
perturbation theory to calculate the change\\nin g due to a slightly relevant \
bulk perturbation and find that it has no\\npreferred sign. The boundary \
entropy log(g) can therefore increase during\\nappropriate bulk flows. This \
is demonstrated explicitly in flows between\\nminimal models. We discuss the \
applications of this result to D-branes in\\nstring theory and to impurity \
problems in condensed matter.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
