                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  We survey and discuss the applications of the \
non-linear integral equation in\\nthe framework of the Bethe Ansatz type \
equations which are conjectured to give\\nthe eigenvalues of the dilatation \
operator in ${\\\\cal {N}}=4$ SYM. Moreover, an\\noriginal idea (different \
from that of \\\\cite {FMQR}) to derive a non-linear\\nintegral equation is \
briefly depicted in Section 4.\\n\""}]}, {
