               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study a refined large spin limit for twist operators \
in the sl(2) sector\\nof AdS/CFT. We derive a novel non-perturbative equation \
for the generalized\\ntwo-parameter scaling function associated to this \
limit, and analyze it at weak\\ncoupling. It is expected to smoothly \
interpolate between weakly coupled gauge\\ntheory and string theory at strong \
coupling.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
