               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this paper we give a new derivation of the \
generalized Luscher F-term\\nformula from a summation over quadratic \
fluctuations around a given soliton.\\nThe result is very general providing \
that S-matrix is diagonal and is valid for\\narbitrary dispersion relation. \
We then apply this formalism to compute the\\nleading finite size corrections \
to the giant magnon dispersion relation coming\\nfrom quantum \
fluctuations.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
