, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  We propose a scheme for determining a generalised \
scaling function, namely\\nthe Sudakov factor in a peculiar double scaling \
limit for high spin and large\\ntwist operators belonging to the $sl(2)$ \
sector of planar ${\\\\cal N}=4$ SYM. In\\nparticular, we perform explicitly \
the all-order computation at strong 't Hooft\\ncoupling regarding the first \
(contribution to the) generalised scaling\\nfunction. Moreover, we compare \
our asymptotic results with the numerical\\nsolutions finding a very good \
agreement and evaluate numerically the\\nnon-asymptotic contributions. \
Eventually, we illustrate the agreement and\\nprediction on the string \
side.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
