 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The concept of integrable boundary conditions is \
applied to hydrodynamic type\\nsystems. Examples of such boundary conditions \
for dispersionless Toda systems\\nare obtained. The close relation of \
integrable boundary conditions with\\nintegrable reductions of multi-field \
systems is observed. The problem of\\nconsistency of boundary conditions with \
the Hamiltonian formulation is\\ndiscussed. Examples of Hamiltonian \
integrable hydrodynamic type systems on a\\nsegment and a semi-line are \
presented.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
