nontrivial scaling\nbehavior in the limit when their Lorentz spin grows \
exponentially with the\ntwist. To describe the corresponding scaling function \
in planar N=4 SYM theory,\nwe analyze an integral equation recently proposed \
by Freyhult, Rej and\nStaudacher and argue that at strong coupling it can be \
