, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  We exactly compute the energy density of the \
integrable O(n) non-linear sigma\\nmodel as a convergent series. This series \
is specifically analysed for the very\\nimportant O(6) symmetry, since it was \
suggested to result as a peculiar limit\\nof the AdS string theory by Alday \
and Maldacena [1]. In this respect, the O(6)\\nmodel gives also refined \
confirmations and predictions once compared with the\\nSYM Bethe Ansatz \
[2,3].\\n\""}]}, {
