 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We propose a set of Bethe equations yielding the full \
asymptotic spectrum of\\nthe AdS4/CFT3 duality proposed in arXiv:0806.1218 to \
all orders in the t'Hooft\\ncoupling. These equations interpolate between the \
2-loop Bethe ansatz of\\nMinahan and Zarembo arXiv:0806.3951 and the string \
algebraic curve of\\narXiv:0807.0437. The several SU(2|2) symmetries of the \
theory seem to highly\\nconstrain the form of the Bethe equations up to a \
dressing factor whose form we\\nalso conjecture.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
