 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We derive the one-loop correction to the space-time \
energy of a folded string\\nin AdS_4 x CP^3 carrying spin S in AdS_4 and \
angular momentum J in CP^3 in the\\nlong string approximation. From this \
general result in the limit J << log S we\\nobtain the one-loop correction to \
the cusp anomalous dimension which turns out\\nto be -5 log 2/(2\\\\pi). This \
value appears to be in conflict with the prediction\\nfrom the recently \
conjectured all-loop Bethe ansatz.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
