 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Based on the recent formulation of a general scheme to \
construct boundary Lax\\npairs,we develop this systematic construction for \
the $A_n^{(1)}$ affine Toda\\nfield theories (ATFT). We work out explicitly \
the first two models of the\\nhierarchy, i.e. the sine-Gordon ($A_1^{(1)}$) \
and the $A_2^{(1)}$ models. The\\n$A_2^{(1)}$ Toda theory is the first \
non-trivial example of the hierarchy that\\nexhibits two distinct types of \
boundary conditions. We provide here novel\\nexpressions of boundary Lax \
pairs associated to both types of boundary\\nconditions.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
