Tseytlin\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Structure of large spin expansion of anomalous dimensions \
at strong\\n  coupling\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"43 pages. v2: minor comments added, misprints corrected; \
v3: one-loop\\n  coefficients are expressed in terms of one constant not \
fixed by our method\\n  of computation, conclusion about parity invariance is \
unchanged, note added;\\n  v4: minor correctionsin eq (3.34) and below (3.37)\
\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Nucl.Phys.B812:144-180,2009\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
