 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We have recently proposed an S-matrix for the planar \
limit of the N=6\\nsuperconformal Chern-Simons theory of Aharony, Bergman, \
Jafferis and Maldacena\\nwhich leads to the all-loop Bethe ansatz equations \
conjectured by Gromov and\\nVieira. An unusual feature of this proposal is \
that the scattering of A and B\\nparticles is reflectionless. We consider \
here an alternative S-matrix, for\\nwhich A-B scattering is not \
reflectionless. We argue that this S-matrix does\\nnot lead to the Bethe \
ansatz equations which are consistent with \
perturbative\\ncomputations.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
