 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We consider finite-size effects for the dyonic giant \
magnon of the type IIA\\nstring theory on AdS_4 x CP^3 by applying Luscher \
mu-term formula which is\\nderived from a recently proposed S-matrix for the \
N=6 super Chern-Simons\\ntheory. We compute explicitly the effect for the \
case of a symmetric\\nconfiguration where the two external bound states, each \
of A and B particles,\\nhave the same momentum p and spin J_2. We compare \
this with the classical\\nstring theory result which we computed by reducing \
it to the\\nNeumann-Rosochatius system. The two results match \
perfectly.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
