          TableForm[{
           "id" -> "0810.2079", "submitter" -> "Changrim Ahn", "authors" -> 
            "Changrim Ahn, P. Bozhilov", "title" -> 
            "Finite-size Effect of the Dyonic Giant Magnons in N=6 super \
Chern-Simons\n  Theory", "comments" -> "15 pages, References added", 
            "journal-ref" -> "Phys.Rev.D79:046008,2009", "doi" -> 
            "10.1103/PhysRevD.79.046008", "report-no" -> Null, "categories" -> 
            "hep-th", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  We consider finite-size effects for the dyonic giant magnon of \
the type IIA\nstring theory on AdS_4 x CP^3 by applying Luscher mu-term \
formula which is\nderived from a recently proposed S-matrix for the N=6 super \
Chern-Simons\ntheory. We compute explicitly the effect for the case of a \
symmetric\nconfiguration where the two external bound states, each of A and B \
particles,\nhave the same momentum p and spin J_2. We compare this with the \
classical\nstring theory result which we computed by reducing it to the\n\
Neumann-Rosochatius system. The two results match perfectly.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Mon, 13 Oct 2008 19:00:14 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Tue, 21 Oct 2008 05:13:37 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2011-04-28", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"Ahn", "Changrim", ""}, {
              "Bozhilov", "P.", ""}}}], "Tooltip"]& ], 
