 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study general rotating string solution in the AdS(4) \
X CP**3 background\\nwith a B_NS holonomy turned on over ${\\\\bf CP}^1$ \
$\\\\subset $ $ {\\\\bf CP}^3$. We\\nfind the giant magnon and single spike \
solutions for the string moving in this\\nbackground corresponding to open \
spin chain. We calculate the corresponding\\ndispersion relation among \
various conserved charges for both the cases. We\\nfurther study the finite \
size effect on both the giant magnon and single spike\\nsolutions.\\n\""}]}, {
              
