            "title" -> 
            "Spiky strings in AdS_3 x S^1 and their AdS-pp-wave limits", 
            "comments" -> 
            "34 pages, 4 figures; v2: references added; v3: typos corrected", 
            "journal-ref" -> "Phys.Rev.D79:026006,2009", "doi" -> 
