 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We generalize the one magnon solution in R X S^2 to \
unbounded M magnon and\\nfind the corresponding solitonic string \
configuration in the string sigma\\nmodel. This configuration gives rise to \
the expected dispersion relation\\nobtained from the spin chain model in the \
large 't Hooft coupling limit. After\\nconsidering (M,M) multi-magnon or \
spike on R X S^2 X S^2 as a subspace of\\nAdS(5)XS^5 or AdS(4)XCP^3, we \
investigate the dispersion relation and the\\nfinite size effect for (M,M) \
multi-magnon or spike.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
