 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this paper, we investigate the semiclassical strings \
in AdS(3)XS^2, in\\nwhich the string configuration of AdS(3) is classified to \
three cases depending\\non the parameters. Each of these has a different \
anomalous dimension\\nproportional to logS, S^(1/3) and S, where S is a \
angular momentum on AdS(3).\\nFurther we generalize the dispersion relations \
for various string configuration\\non AdS(3)XS^2.\\n\""}]}, {
