                  "\"On the high spin expansion in the $sl(2)$ ${\\\\cal \
N}=4$ SYM theory\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Nucl.Phys.B822:467-492,2009\""}]}, {
                
