            "title" -> "Dressed Giant Magnons on CP^3", "comments" -> 
            "13 pages, harvmac; v3: fixed misstatement of the dispersion\n  \
relation(!), v3: typos fixed and a few clarifying remarks added", 
            "journal-ref" -> "JHEP 0907:006,2009", "doi" -> 
