 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We consider classical string spectrum of R x CP^3, and \
construct a family of\\nsolutions with residual SU(2) symmetry by the \
dressing method on SU(4)/U(3)\\nsigma model. All of them obey the square-root \
type dispersion relation, as is\\nexpected from the su(2|2) symmetry. A \
single dyonic giant magnon is not found\\nin this approach.\\n\""}]}, {
