            "Dyonic Giant Magnons in CP^3: Strings and Curves at Finite J", 
            "comments" -> 
            "22 pages, 3 figures, 2 tables. v2 adds note on breather \
solution, and\n  minor clarifications", "journal-ref" -> 
            "Phys.Rev.D80:026005,2009", "doi" -> "10.1103/PhysRevD.80.026005",
             "report-no" -> "BROWN-HET 1580, UUITP-11/09", "categories" -> 
