N=6 Chern-Simons\\n  theory\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"15 pages, JHEP LaTeX style\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 0909:017,2009\""}]}, {
               
