                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We consider twist-L operators in the planar N=6 \
superconformal Chern-Simons\\nABJM theory. Their anomalous dimension \
gamma_L^{CS}(N) is a function of the\\ntwist L, the spin N, and the dressed \
coupling of ABJM. We show that at\\nnext-to-leading order in the large spin \
expansion, this anomalous dimension is\\nrelated to that of N=4 SYM twist \
operators by a simple scaling law.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
