                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We obtain the exact expression for the Von Neumann \
entropy for an infinite\\nbipartition of the XYZ model, by connecting its \
reduced density matrix to the\\ncorner transfer matrix of the eight vertex \
model. Then we consider the\\nanisotropic scaling limit of the XYZ chain that \
yields the 1+1 dimensional\\nsine-Gordon model. We present the formula for \
the entanglement entropy of the\\nlatter, which has the structure of a \
dominant logarithmic term plus a constant,\\nin agreement with what is \
generally expected for a massive quantum field\\ntheory.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
