            "  We obtain the exact expression for the Von Neumann entropy for \
an infinite\nbipartition of the XYZ model, by connecting its reduced density \
matrix to the\ncorner transfer matrix of the eight vertex model. Then we \
consider the\nanisotropic scaling limit of the XYZ chain that yields the 1+1 \
