                 "\"Stefan Fredenhagen, Matthias R. Gaberdiel and \
Cornelius\\n  Schmidt-Colinet\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Bulk flows in Virasoro minimal models with \
boundaries\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"34 pages, 6 figures. v4: Typo in fig. 2 corrected\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"J.Phys.A42:495403,2009\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1088/1751-8113/42/49/495403\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"AEI-2009-063\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The behaviour of boundary conditions under relevant \
bulk perturbations is\\nstudied for the Virasoro minimal models. In \
particular, we consider the bulk\\ndeformation by the least relevant bulk \
field which interpolates between the mth\\nand (m-1)st unitary minimal model. \
In the presence of a boundary this bulk flow\\ninduces an RG flow on the \
boundary, which ensures that the resulting boundary\\ncondition is conformal \
in the (m-1)st model. By combining perturbative RG\\ntechniques with insights \
from defects and results about non-perturbative\\nboundary flows, we \
determine the endpoint of the flow, i.e. the boundary\\ncondition to which an \
arbitrary boundary condition of the mth theory flows to.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Wed, 15 Jul 2009 11:14:46 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
