                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"16 pages, 4 figures. v2: typos corrected, references \
added, series\\n  expansion of anomalous dimension added. v3: a reference \
added, comment on\\n  calculation in gauge theory\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 0911:024,2009\""}]}, {
               
