                 "\"  We analyze the higher conserved charges of type IIB \
superstring on AdS5 x S5\\nfrom the perspective of a recently discovered \
generalized Gribov-Lipatov\\nreciprocity. We provide several evidences that \
reciprocity holds for all the\\nhigher charges and not only for the energy. \
This is discussed in the simple\\ncase of twist L=2, and 3 operators in the \
sl(2) subsector at (a) multi-loop\\nlevel in weak coupling, (b) classical \
level at strong coupling for the dual\\nfolded string.\\n\""}]}, {
