                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the exact spectrum of the AdS4/CFT3 duality \
put forward by Aharony,\\nBergman, Jafferis and Maldacena (ABJM). We derive \
thermodynamic Bethe ansatz\\n(TBA) equations for the planar ABJM theory, \
starting from \\\"mirror\\\" asymptotic\\nBethe equations which we \
conjecture. We also propose generalization of the TBA\\nequations for excited \
states. The recently proposed Y-system is completely\\nconsistent with the \
TBA equations for a large subsector of the theory, but\\nshould be modified \
in general. We find the general asymptotic infinite length\\nsolution of the \
Y-system, and also several solutions to all wrapping orders in\\nthe strong \
coupling scaling limit. To make a comparison with results obtained\\nfrom \
string theory, we assume that the all-loop Bethe ansatz of N.G. and \
P.\\nVieira is the valid worldsheet theory description in the asymptotic \
regime. In\\nthis case we find complete agreement, to all orders in \
wrappings, between the\\nsolution of our Y-system and generic quasi-classical \
string spectrum in AdS3 x\\nS.\\n\""}]}, {
