 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We examine certain classical continuum long wave-length \
limits of prototype\\nintegrable quantum spin chains. We define the \
corresponding construction of\\nclassical continuum Lax operators. Our \
discussion starts with the XXX chain,\\nthe anisotropic Heisenberg model and \
their generalizations and extends to the\\ngeneric isotropic and anisotropic \
gl_n magnets. Certain classical and quantum\\nintegrable models emerging from \
special \\\"dualities\\\" of quantum spin chains,\\nparametrized by c-number \
matrices, are also presented.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
