deformation of\nAdS5/CFT4 have been proposed by Beisert and Roiban. We \
propose a Drinfeld twist\nof the AdS5/CFT4 S-matrix, together with c-number \
diagonal twists of the\nboundary conditions, from which we derive these Bethe \
