                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We review the computation of the anomalous dimension of \
twist operators in\\nthe planar limit of N=4 SYM using the asymptotic Bethe \
ansatz and demonstrate\\nhow this quantity is obtained at weak, strong and \
intermediate values of the\\ncoupling constant. The anomalous dimension of \
twist operators in the limit of\\nlarge Lorentz spin played a major role in \
the construction as well as in many\\ntests of the asymptotic Bethe \
equations, this aspect of the story is\\nemphasised.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
