               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"1012.3994\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Romuald A. Janik\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Romuald A. Janik\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Review of AdS/CFT Integrability, Chapter III.5: Luscher \
corrections\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"18 pages, see also overview article arXiv:1012.3982, v2: \
references\\n  to other chapters updated, v3: references added; v4: various \
comments added,\\n  journal version\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/s11005-011-0511-z\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In integrable quantum field theories the large volume \
spectrum is given by\\nthe Bethe Ansatz. The leading corrections, due to \
virtual particles circulating\\naround the cylinder, are encoded in so-called \
Luscher corrections. In order to\\napply these techniques to the AdS/CFT \
correspondence one has to generalize\\nthese corrections to the case of \
generic dispersion relations and to\\nmultiparticle states. We review these \
various generalizations and the\\napplications of Luscher's corrections to \
the study of the worldsheet QFT of the\\nsuperstring in AdS5xS5 and, \
consequently, to anomalous dimensions of operators\\nin N=4 SYM \
theory.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
