 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We revisit the derivation of hybrid nonlinear integral \
equations of the XXX\\nmodel starting from the linearization of the T-system \
related to spinon\\nvariables. We obtain two sets of equations, corresponding \
to two linearly\\nindependent solutions of A_1 TQ-relation. Recalling that \
the TQ-relations in\\nthe horizontal strips of the su(2|4|2)-hook is of A_1 \
type, we replace the\\ncorresponding Y-functions by a finite number of \
auxiliary variables.\\n\""}]}, {
