Representations\\n  of Integrable Quantum Models\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"38 pages, two references added, minor \
modifications\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 1103:123,2011\""}]}, {
               
