                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Starting with a discussion of the general applicability \
of the simplified\\nmirror TBA equations to simple deformations of the AdS_5 \
x S^5 superstring, we\\nproceed to study a specific type of orbifold to which \
the undeformed simplified\\nTBA equations directly apply. We then use this \
set of equations, as well as\\nL\.7fuscher's approach, to determine the NLO \
wrapping correction to the energy of\\nwhat we call the orbifolded Konishi \
state, and show that they perfectly agree.\\nIn addition we discuss wrapping \
corrections to the ground state energy of the\\norbifolded model under \
consideration.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
