 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We propose a twisted Y-system for the calculation of \
leading wrapping\\ncorrections to physical states of general Z_S orbifold \
projections of N=4 super\\nYang-Mills theory. Agreement with available \
thermodynamical Bethe Ansatz\\nresults is achieved in the non supersymmetric \
case. Various examples of new\\ncomputations, including other supersymmetric \
orbifolds are illustrated.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
