accepted for publication\\n  in Journal of Physics A: Mathematical and \
Theoretical. IOP Publishing Ltd is\\n  not responsible for any errors or \
omissions in this version of the manuscript\\n  or any version derived from \
it. v2: fixed sign in (15), added comment about\\n  Jacobi identity in \
