 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Using the recently proposed set of discontinuity \
relations we translate the\\nAdS/CFT Y-system to TBA integral equations and \
quantization conditions for a\\nlarge subset of excited states from the sl(2) \
sector of the $AdS_5 \\\\times S^5$\\nstring sigma-model. Our derivation \
provides an analytic proof of the fact that\\nthe exact Bethe equations \
reduce to the Beisert-Staudacher equations in the\\nasymptotic limit. We also \
construct the corresponding T-system and show that in\\nthe language of \
T-functions the energy formula reduces to a single term which\\ndepends on a \
single T-function.\\n\""}]}, {
