               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"1105.3577\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Matteo Beccaria\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Matteo Beccaria, Guido Macorini, CarloAlberto \
Ratti\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Wrapping corrections, reciprocity and BFKL beyond the \
sl(2) subsector in\\n  N=4 SYM\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"18 pages\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 1106:071,2011\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP06(2011)071\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We consider N=4 SYM and a class of spin N, length-3, \
twist operators beyond\\nthe well studied sl(2) subsector. They can be \
identified at one-loop with three\\ngluon operators. At strong coupling, they \
are associated with spinning strings\\nwith two spins in AdS5. We exploit the \
Y-system to compute the leading\\nweak-coupling four loop wrapping correction \
to their anomalous dimension. The\\nresult is written in closed form as a \
function of the spin N. We combine the\\nwrapping correction with the known \
four-loop asymptotic Bethe Ansatz\\ncontribution and analyze special limits \
in the spin N. In particular, at large\\nN, we prove that a generalized \
Gribov-Lipatov reciprocity holds. At negative\\nunphysical spin, we present a \
simple BFKL-like equation predicting the\\nrightmost leading poles.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
