K-matrices\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"J. Phys. A: Math. Theor. 45 (2012) 025201\""}]}, {
               
