                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We present a method of removing all infinite sums from \
the various forms of\\nthe mirror TBA equations and the energy formula of the \
AdS/CFT spectral\\nproblem. This new formulation of the TBA system is \
quasi-local because\\nY-functions that are connected by the TBA equations are \
at most next to nearest\\nneighbors with respect to the Y-system diagram of \
AdS/CFT.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
