TBA\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"v3, 20 pages, 1 figure, 2 tables, as published\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 1109:050,2011\""}]}, {
               
