                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We describe a qualitative feature of the AdS_5 x S^5 \
string spectrum which is\\nnot captured by the asymptotic Bethe ansatz. This \
is reflected by an enhanced\\ndiscrete symmetry in the asymptotic limit, \
whereby extra energy degeneracy\\nenters the spectrum. We discuss how finite \
size corrections should lift this\\ndegeneracy, through both perturbative (L\
\.7fuscher) and non-perturbative\\napproaches (the Mirror TBA), and \
illustrate this explicitly on two such\\nasymptotically degenerate states.\\n\
\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
