            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"1108.4914\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Zoltan Bajnok\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Changrim Ahn, Zoltan Bajnok, Diego Bombardelli, Rafael I. \
Nepomechie\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"TBA, NLO Luscher correction, and double wrapping in \
twisted AdS/CFT\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"42 pages, 2 figures, v2: references added, v3: minor \
corrections\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP12(2011)059\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"UMTG-271\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The ground-state energy of integrably-twisted theories \
is analyzed in finite\\nvolume. We derive the leading and next-to-leading \
order (NLO) L\\\\\\\"uscher-type\\ncorrections for large volumes of the \
vacuum energy for integrable theories with\\ntwisted boundary conditions and \
twisted S-matrix. We then derive the twisted\\nthermodynamic Bethe ansatz \
(TBA) equations to describe exactly the ground\\nstate, from which we obtain \
an untwisted Y-system. The two approaches are\\ncompared by expanding the TBA \
equations to NLO, and exact agreement is found.\\nWe give explicit results \
for the O(4) model and for the three-parameter family\\nof \
$\\\\gamma$-deformed (non-supersymmetric) planar AdS/CFT model, where \
the\\nground-state energy can be nontrivial and can acquire finite-size \
corrections.\\nThe NLO corrections, which correspond to double-wrapping \
diagrams, are\\nexplicitly evaluated for the latter model at six \
loops.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
