with a\nlight-like polygonal boundary in AdS_3. We find a concise expression \
of the\nremainder function in terms of the T-function of the associated \
thermodynamic\nBethe ansatz (TBA) system. Continuing our previous work on the \
analytic\nexpansion around the CFT/regular-polygonal limit, we derive a \
