 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We discuss the spectral problem for integrable \
superstrings on generically\\ntwisted AdS_5 x S^5, meaning all its orbifolds \
and TsT transformed versions. We\\nexplicitly give the asymptotic description \
of these theories through a twisted\\ntransfer matrix, and carefully match \
the geometric deformations with twists\\nallowed by integrability. We then \
discuss the mirror TBA equations that\\ndescribe these theories at finite \
size. This unifies the treatment of various\\nspecific deformations \
previously considered in this setting, and extends it to\\ncompletely general \
twists.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
