            "authors" -> "Marius de Leeuw and Stijn J. van Tongeren", "title" -> 
            "The spectral problem for strings on twisted AdS_5 x S^5", 
            "comments" -> "42 pages, 1 figure, v3; as published in NPB", 
            "journal-ref" -> "Nuclear Physics B 860 (2012) 339-376", "doi" -> 
            "10.1016/j.nuclphysb.2012.03.004", "report-no" -> Null, 
            "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  We discuss the spectral problem for integrable superstrings on \
generically\ntwisted AdS_5 x S^5, meaning all its orbifolds and TsT \
transformed versions. We\nexplicitly give the asymptotic description of these \
theories through a twisted\ntransfer matrix, and carefully match the \
geometric deformations with twists\nallowed by integrability. We then discuss \
the mirror TBA equations that\ndescribe these theories at finite size. This \
unifies the treatment of various\nspecific deformations previously considered \
in this setting, and extends it to\ncompletely general twists.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Fri, 6 Jan 2012 17:01:47 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Tue, 24 Jan 2012 16:41:47 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v3", "created" -> 
               "Tue, 27 Mar 2012 14:15:57 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2015-06-03", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"de Leeuw", "Marius", ""}, {
              "van Tongeren", "Stijn J.", ""}}}], "Tooltip"]& ], 
