                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Surface free energy of the open XXZ spin-1/2 chain\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"35 pages, 11 figures, V3: some new plots added\""}]}, {
