for the\nspectral problem of the super sigma model of AdS/CFT and its \
gamma-deformations\nare derived by replacing the semi-infinite SU(2) and \
SU(4) parts of the AdS/CFT\nTBA equations by a few appropriately chosen \
complex NLIE variables, which are\ncoupled among themselves and to the \
Y-functions associated to the remaining\ncentral nodes of the TBA diagram. \
The integral equations are written explicitly\nfor the ground state of the \
gamma-deformed system. We linearize these NLIE\nequations, analytically \
calculate the first correction to the asymptotic\nsolution and find agreement \
with analogous results coming from the original TBA\nformalism. Our equations \
differ substantially from the recently published\nfinite FiNLIE formulation \
of the spectral problem.\n", 
