 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The set-theoretical reflection equation and its \
solutions, the reflection\\nmaps, recently introduced by two of the authors, \
is presented in general and\\nthen applied in the context of quadrirational \
Yang-Baxter maps. We provide a\\nmethod for constructing reflection maps and \
we obtain a classification of\\nsolutions associated to all the families of \
quadrirational Yang-Baxter maps\\nthat have been classified \
recently.\\n\""}]}, {
