 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We make a proposal for incorporating massless modes \
into the spin-chain of\\nthe AdS3/CFT2 integrable system. We do this by \
considering the alpha to 0 limit\\nof the alternating d(2,1;alpha)^2 \
spin-chain constructed in arXiv:1106.2558. In\\nthe process we encounter \
integrable spin-chains with non-irreducible\\nrepresentations at some of \
their sites. We investigate their properties and\\nconstruct their R-matrices \
in terms of Yangians.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
