                 "\"22 pages, 7 figures. An term in eq. (3.12) was deleted. \
After the\\n  paper was published in JHEP, We corrected some errors \
especially the ones in\\n  the action of $\\\\beta$-deformed ABJM theory in \
the e-print on arXiv. Main\\n  conclusion and results are unchanged\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"JHEP 1304 (2013) 012; Erratum 1604 (2016) 139\""}]}, {
               
