                "\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Mehrdad Mirbabayi\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Sergei Dubovsky, Victor Gorbenko, and Mehrdad \
Mirbabayi\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Natural Tuning: Towards A Proof of Concept\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"25 pages, 6 figures\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP09(2013)045\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th gr-qc hep-ph\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The cosmological constant problem and the absence of \
new natural physics at\\nthe electroweak scale, if confirmed by the LHC, may \
either indicate that the\\nnature is fine-tuned or that a refined notion of \
naturalness is required. We\\nconstruct a family of toy UV complete quantum \
theories providing a proof of\\nconcept for the second possibility. Low \
energy physics is described by a tuned\\neffective field theory, which \
exhibits relevant interactions not protected by\\nany symmetries and \
separated by an arbitrary large mass gap from the new\\n\\\"gravitational\\\" \
physics, represented by a set of irrelevant operators.\\nNevertheless, the \
only available language to describe dynamics at all energy\\nscales does not \
require any fine-tuning. The interesting novel feature of this\\nconstruction \
is that UV physics is not described by a fixed point, but rather\\nexhibits \
asymptotic fragility. Observation of additional unprotected scalars at\\nthe \
LHC would be a smoking gun for this scenario. Natural tuning also \
favors\\nTeV scale unification.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
