, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  By converting the Asymptotic Bethe Ansatz (ABA) of \
${\\\\cal N}=4$ SYM into\\nnon-linear integral equations, we find 2D \
scattering amplitudes of excitations\\non top of the GKP vacuum. We prove \
that this is a suitable and powerful set-up\\nfor the understanding and \
computation of the whole S-matrix. We show that all\\nthe amplitudes depend \
on the fundamental scalar-scalar one.\\n\""}]}, {
