similar to the ones obtained for the\npreviously-studied AdS(5)/CFT(4) case. \
Together with the Y-system and more\nbasic analyticity conditions, they are \
completely equivalent to the TBA\nequations. We expect these results to be \
useful to derive alternative nonlinear\nintegral equations for the \
AdS(4)/CFT(3) spectrum.\n", 
