                 "\"Spectrum of the open QCD flux tube in d=2+1 and its \
effective string\\n  description\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"5 pages, 2 figures, talk presented at the European \
Physical Society\\n  Conference on High Energy Physics (EPS-HEP) 2013 in \
Stockholm\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
