 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We propose a next-to-leading Luescher-like formula for \
the finite-size\\ncorrections of the excited states energies in integrable \
theories. We\\nconjecture the expressions of the corrections for both the \
energy and the\\nparticles' rapidities by interpreting the excited states as \
momenta-dependent\\ndefects. We check the resulting formulas in some simple \
relativistic model and\\nconjecture those for the AdS5/CFT4 case.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
