 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We construct a new representation for two- and \
three-point correlators of\\noperators from sl(2) sector of planar N = 4 SYM. \
The spin and twist of\\noperators are arbitrary. We start with the \
correlation function of light-ray\\noperators and carry out a projection to \
particular local operators using the\\nmethod of Separated Variables. With \
the same calculation we obtain polynomials\\nwhich are dual to wave functions \
of sl(2,R) spin-chain.\\n\""}]}, {
