, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  Recently, it was shown that the spectrum of anomalous \
dimensions and other\\nimportant observables in N = 4 SYM are encoded into a \
simple nonlinear\\nRiemann-Hilbert problem: the P\\\\mu-system or Quantum \
Spectral Curve. In this\\nletter we present the P\\\\mu-system for the \
spectrum of the ABJM theory. This may\\nbe an important step towards the \
exact determination of the interpolating\\nfunction h(\\\\lambda) \
characterising the integrability of the ABJM model. We also\\ndiscuss a \
surprising symmetry between the P\\\\mu-system equations for N = 4 SYM\\nand \
ABJM.\\n\""}]}, {
