                 "\"On the exact spectrum and mirror duality of the (AdS_5 x \
S^5)_eta\\n  superstring\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"v2, reference added, arxiv author name corrected, 36 \
pages, 2 figures\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Theor.Math.Phys. 182 (2015) 1, 23-51\""}]}, {
               
