Gorbenko\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Flux Tube Spectra from Approximate Integrability at Low \
Energies\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"44 pages, 19 figures, v2: references added, to appear in \
special\\n  issue of JETP dedicated to Valery Rubakov's 60th birthday\""}]}, {
              
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1134/S1063776115030188\""}]}, {
