 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The $q$-deformation of the infinite-dimensional \
$n$-algebra is investigated.\\nBased on the structure of the $q$-deformed \
Virasoro-Witt algebra, we derive a\\nnontrivial $q$-deformed Virasoro-Witt \
$n$-algebra which is nothing but a\\nsh-$n$-Lie algebra. Furthermore in terms \
of the pseud-differential operators on\\nthe quantum plane, we construct the \
(co)sine $n$-algebra and the $q$-deformed\\n$SDiff(T^2)$ $n$-algebra. We \
prove that they are the sh-$n$-Lie algebras for\\nthe case of even $n$. An \
explicit physical realization of the (co)sine\\n$n$-algebra is \
given.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
