 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We derive the non-perturbative worldsheet S matrix for \
fundamental\\nexcitations of Type IIB superstring theory on AdS_3 x S^3 x T^4 \
with\\nRamond-Ramond flux. To this end, we study the off-shell symmetry \
algebra of the\\ntheory and its representations. We use these to determine \
the S matrix up to\\nscalar factors and we derive the crossing equations that \
these scalar factors\\nsatisfy. Our treatment automatically includes \
fundamental massless excitations,\\nremoving a long-standing obstacle in \
using integrability to study the\\nAdS_3/CFT_2 correspondence. The present \
paper contains a detailed derivation of\\nresults first announced in \
arXiv:1403.4543.\\n\""}]}, {
