 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We review the recent progress towards applying \
worldsheet integrability\\ntechniques to the $AdS_3/CFT_2$ correspondence to \
find its all-loop S matrix\\nand Bethe-Yang equations. We study in full \
detail the massive sector of\\n$AdS_3\\\\times S^3\\\\times T^4$ superstrings \
supported by pure Ramond-Ramond (RR)\\nfluxes. The extension of this \
machinery to accommodate massless modes, to the\\n$AdS_3\\\\times \
S^3\\\\times S^3\\\\times S^1$ pure-RR background and to \
backgrounds\\nsupported by mixed background fluxes is also reviewed. While \
the results\\ndiscussed here were found elsewhere, our presentation sometimes \
deviates from\\nthe one found in the original literature in an effort to be \
pedagogical and\\nself-contained.\\n\""}]}, {
