Vescovi\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"One-loop spectroscopy of semiclassically quantized \
strings: bosonic\\n  sector\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"v2, references and two footnotes added\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1088/1751-8113/48/8/085401\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"HU-EP-14/29\""}]}, {
