the ground\nstate of a D-brane anti-D-brane system in AdS/CFT. The \
hybrid-NLIE equations\npresented in the paper are finite component \
alternatives of the previously\nproposed TBA equations and they admit an \
appropriate framework for the\nnumerical investigation of the ground state of \
the problem. Straightforward\nnumerical iterative methods fail to converge, \
thus new numerical methods are\nworked out to solve the equations. Our \
numerical data confirm the previous TBA\ndata. In view of the numerical \
results the mysterious L = 1 case is also\ncommented in the paper.\n", 
