geometry of quiver\\n  gauge theories\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"32 pages, 5 figures, v3: minor corrections\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
