\\\\\"orn Leder,\\n  Edoardo Vescovi\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Green-Schwarz superstring on the lattice\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"33 pages, 14 figures, 2 Tables. Text overlap with the \
Conference\\n  Proceedings where some preliminary results were presented, \
arXiv:1601.04670v1\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP07(2016)014\""}]}, {
               
