          DiskBox[{8.865193261511548, -4.329006780476703}, 
           0.10102143756118451],
          TagBox[
           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"1607.00914\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Olof Ohlsson Sax\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Riccardo Borsato, Olof Ohlsson Sax, Alessandro Sfondrini, \
Bogdan\\n  Stefanski, and Alessandro Torrielli\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"On the Dressing Factors, Bethe Equations and Yangian \
Symmetry of Strings\\n  on AdS3 x S3 x T4\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"69 pages, 12 figures\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1088/1751-8121/50/2/024004\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"DMUS-MP-16/13, Imperial-TP-RB-2016-04, \
NORDITA-2016-79\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Integrability is believed to underlie the AdS3/CFT2 \
correspondence with\\nsixteen supercharges. We elucidate the role of massless \
modes within this\\nintegrable framework. Firstly, we find the dressing \
factors that enter the\\nmassless and mixed-mass worldsheet S matrix. \
Secondly, we derive a set of\\nall-loop Bethe Equations for the closed \
strings, determine their symmetries and\\nweak-coupling limit. Thirdly, we \
investigate the underlying Yangian symmetry in\\nthe massless sector and show \
that it fits into the general framework of Yangian\\nintegrability. In \
addition, we compare our S matrix in the near-relativistic\\nlimit with \
recent perturbative worldsheet calculations of Sundin and Wulff.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Mon, 4 Jul 2016 14:46:34 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
              
