explicit\\ncomputation of the $2n$-scalar term at any coupling by means of \
Young tableaux,\\nparalleling, under certain aspects, the Nekrasov-Okounkov \
expressions for\\n$\\\\mathcal N =2$ SYM prepotential.\\n\""}]}, {
