 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We initiate the study of four-point functions of large \
BPS operators at any\\nvalue of the coupling. We do it by casting it as a sum \
over exchange of\\nsuperconformal primaries and computing the structure \
constants using\\nintegrability. Along the way, we incorporate the nested \
Bethe ansatz structure\\nto the hexagon formalism for the three-point \
functions and obtain a compact\\nformula for the asymptotic structure \
constant of a non-BPS operator in a higher\\nrank sector.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
