           "id" -> "1701.04462", "submitter" -> "Frank Coronado Idrogo", 
            "authors" -> 
            "Benjamin Basso, Frank Coronado, Shota Komatsu, Ho Tat Lam, Pedro\
\n  Vieira, De-liang Zhong", "title" -> "Asymptotic Four Point Functions", 
            "comments" -> 
            "18 pages + appendices, 13 figures, 2 tables, 1 Mathematica \
notebook\n  attached; v2 minor typo corrections and references added", 
            "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> Null, "report-no" -> Null, 
            "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  We initiate the study of four-point functions of large BPS \
operators at any\nvalue of the coupling. We do it by casting it as a sum over \
exchange of\nsuperconformal primaries and computing the structure constants \
using\nintegrability. Along the way, we incorporate the nested Bethe ansatz \
structure\nto the hexagon formalism for the three-point functions and obtain \
a compact\nformula for the asymptotic structure constant of a non-BPS \
operator in a higher\nrank sector.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
