                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We establish a framework for calculating the Hagedorn \
temperature of\\nAdS5/CFT4 via integrability. Concretely, we derive the \
thermodynamic Bethe\\nansatz equations that yield the Hagedorn temperature of \
planar N=4 super\\nYang-Mills theory at any value of the 't Hooft coupling. \
We solve these\\nequations perturbatively at weak coupling via the associated \
Y-system,\\nconfirming the known results at tree-level and one-loop order as \
well as\\nderiving the previously unknown two-loop Hagedorn temperature. \
Finally, we\\ncomment on solving the equations at finite coupling.\\n\""}]}, {
              
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
