 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this work we revisit the problem of the quantization \
of the\\ntwo-dimensional O(3) non-linear sigma model and its one-parameter \
integrable\\ndeformation -- the sausage model. Our consideration is based on \
the so-called\\nODE/IQFT correspondence, a variant of the Quantum Inverse \
Scattering Method.The\\napproach allowed us to explore the integrable \
structures underlying the quantum\\nO(3)/sausage model. Among the obtained \
results is a system of non-linear\\nintegral equations for the computation of \
the vacuum eigenvalues of the quantum\\ntransfer-matrices.\\n\""}]}, {
