                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Andrea Mauri, Silvia Penati and Jia-ju Zhang\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"New BPS Wilson loops in $\\\\mathcal N \\\\textbf{= 4}$ \
circular quiver\\n  Chern-Simons-matter theories\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"32 pages; v2: minor improvements, general classification \
of BPS WLs\\n  added; v3: comments added, typos fixed, JHEP published version\
\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP11(2017)174\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We construct new families of 1/4 BPS Wilson loops in \
circular quiver\\n$\\\\mathcal N=4$ superconformal Chern-Simons-matter (SCSM) \
theories in three\\ndimensions. They are defined as the holonomy of \
superconnections that contain\\nnon-trivial couplings to scalar and fermions, \
and cannot be reduced to\\nblock-diagonal matrices. Consequently, the new \
operators cannot be written in\\nterms of double-node Wilson loops, as the \
ones considered so far in the\\nliterature. For particular values of the \
couplings the superconnection becomes\\nblock-diagonal and we recover the \
known fermionic 1/4 and 1/2 BPS Wilson loops.\\nThe new operators are \
cohomologically equivalent to bosonic 1/4 BPS Wilson\\nloops and are then \
amenable of exact evaluation via localization techniques.\\nMoreover, in the \
case of orbifold ABJM theory we identify the corresponding\\ngravity duals \
for some of the 1/4 and 1/2 BPS Wilson loops.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
