Fioravanti\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Conical Twist Fields and Null Polygonal Wilson \
Loops\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"35 pages, 16 figures. Small typos corrected in v2\""}]}, {
                
