 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We consider the problem of exact integration of the \
$T\\\\bar{T}$-deformation of\\ntwo dimensional quantum field theories, as \
well as some higher dimensional\\nextensions in the form of $\\\\det \
T$-deformations. When the action can be shown\\nto only depend algebraically \
on the background metric the solution of the\\ndeformation equation on the \
Lagrangian can be given in closed form in terms of\\nsolutions of the \
(extended) Burgers' equation. We present such examples in two\\nand higher \
dimensions.\\n\""}]}, {
