 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study two dimensional conformal field theory with a \
left-moving conserved\\ncurrent $J$, perturbed by an irrelevant, Lorentz \
symmetry breaking operator\\nwith the quantum numbers of $J\\\\bar{T}$, using \
a combination of field and string\\ntheoretic techniques. We show that the \
spectrum of the theory has some\\ninteresting features, which may shed light \
on systems of interest for\\nholography and black hole physics.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
