            "  Recently we showed how non-homogeneous second-order difference \
equations\nappearing within ABJM quantum spectral curve description could be \
solved using\nMellin space technique. In particular we provided explicit \
results for\nanomalous dimensions of twist 1 operators in sl(2) sector at \
arbitrary spin\nvalues up to four loop order. It was shown that the obtained \
results may be\nexpressed in terms of harmonic sums decorated by fourth root \
