            "  We generalize the $T\\overline{T}$ deformation of CFT$_2$ to\n\
higher-dimensional large-$N$ CFTs, and show that in holographic theories, the\
\nresulting effective field theory matches semiclassical gravity in AdS with \
a\nfinite radial cutoff. We also derive the deformation dual to arbitrary \
