                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We point out that the arguments of Zamolodchikov and \
others on the\\n$T\\\\overline T$ and similar deformations of two-dimensional \
field theories may\\nbe extended to the more general non-Lorentz invariant \
case, for example\\nnon-relativistic and Lifshitz-type theories. We derive \
results for the\\nfinite-size spectrum and $S$-matrix of the deformed \
theories.\\n\""}]}, {
