Tartaglino-Mazzucchelli,\n  Harriet Walsh", "title" -> 
            "On $T\\bar{T}$ deformations and supersymmetry", "comments" -> 
            "V3: comments, references, and a new subsection 2.5 added; \
version to\n  appear in JHEP; 29 pages", "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> 
