solvable $T\n\\overline{T}$ deformation of two-dimensional field theories. \
For theories with\n$(1,1)$ and $(0,1)$ supersymmetry, the deformation is \
defined by adding a term\nto the superspace Lagrangian built from a \
superfield containing the\nsupercurrent. We prove that the energy levels of \
