            "  In previous works, we have developed an approach to fix the \
leading behaviors\nof the pure AdS$_3$ and BTZ black hole from the \
entanglement entropies of the\nfree CFT$_2$ and finite temperature CFT$_2$, \
respectively. We exclusively use\nholographic principle only and make no \
