dynamics. In order to verify the universality\nand correctness of our method, \
in this paper, we apply it to the $T\\bar{T}$\ndeformed CFT$_2$, which breaks \
the conformal symmetry. In terms of the physical\narguments of the \
$T\\bar{T}$ deformed CFT$_2$, the derived metric is a deformed\nBTZ black \
