propagation speed calculated with this deformed BTZ metric are the same as\n\
these derived from $T\\bar{T}$ deformed CFT$_2$. We furthermore fix the dual\n\
geometry of highly excited states with our approach. The result contains the\n\
descriptions for the conical defect and BTZ black hole.\n", 
