 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this article left invariant measures and functionals \
on locally compact\\nnonassociative fan loops are investigated. For this \
purpose necessary\\nproperties of topological fan loops, estimates and \
approximations of functions\\non them are studied. An existence of nontrivial \
left invariant measures on\\nlocally compact fan loops is proved. Abundant \
families of fan loops are\\nprovided with the help of different types of \
their products.\\n\""}]}, {
