                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Two Mathematica notebooks attached, v3: Corrected a sign \
error, which\\n  allowed us to extend the large c analysis odd KdV charges, \
too. Additionally\\n  we have corrected a few typos, and added a few \
references\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Phys. Rev. D 101, 086025 (2020)\""}]}, {
               
