 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We investigate the solution space of the \
$\\\\beta$-deformed Quantum Spectral\\nCurve by studying a sample of \
solutions corresponding to single-trace operators\\nthat in the undeformed \
theory belong to the Konishi multiplet. We discuss how\\nto set the precise \
boundary conditions for the leading Q-system for a given\\nstate, how to \
solve it, and how to build perturbative corrections to the\\n$\\\\mathbf{P}\\\
\\mu$-system. We confirm and add several loop orders to known results\\nin \
the literature.\\n\""}]}, {
