Tartaglino-Mazzucchelli\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"$T\\\\bar{T}$ deformations with $\\\\mathcal{N}=(0,2)$ \
supersymmetry\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Phys. Rev. D 100, 046017 (2019)\""}]}, {
               
