Stefa\\\\'nski, jr.,\\n  Alessandro Torrielli\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"The Effectiveness of Relativistic Invariance in AdS${}_3$\
\""}]}, {
