perturbative\\n  solution\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"38 pages\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
