propose a brute force calculation where\nthe nonlocality is associated to a \
new Lie algebra valued field, and from this\nprescription we impose several \
constraints on the algebra of nonlocal charges.\nPossible applications for \
Yang-Baxter and holographic \\(T\\bar{T}\\) and\n\\(T\\bar{J}\\) deformations \
are also discussed.\n", 
