                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Using the fermionic basis discovered in the 6-vertex \
model, we derive exact\\nformulas for the expectation values of local \
operators of the sine-Gordon\\ntheory in any eigenstate of the Hamiltonian. \
We tested our formulas in the pure\\nmulti-soliton sector of the theory. In \
the ultraviolet limit, we checked our\\nresults against Liouville 3-point \
functions, while in the infrared limit, we\\nevaluated our formulas in the \
semi-classical limit and compared them upto\\n2-particle contributions \
against the semi-classical limit of the previously\\nconjectured \
LeClair-Mussardo type formula. Complete agreement was found in \
both\\ncases.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
