 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We present the technique for resummation of flux tube \
excitations series\\narising in pentagon operator expansion program for \
polygonal Wilson loops in\\nN=4 SYM. Here we restrict ourselves with \
contributions of one-particle\\neffective states and consider as a particular \
example NMHV 6 particle amplitude\\nat one-loop. The presented technique is \
also applicable at higher loops for one\\neffective particle contributions \
and has the potential for generalization for\\ncontributions with more \
effective particles.\\n\""}]}, {
