 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We consider the most general set of integrable \
deformations extending the\\n$T\\\\bar{T}$ deformation of two-dimensional \
relativistic QFTs. They are CDD\\ndeformations of the theory's factorised \
S-matrix related to the higher-spin\\nconserved charges. Using a mirror \
version of the generalised Gibbs ensemble, we\\nwrite down the finite-volume \
expectation value of the higher-spin charges, and\\nderive a generalised flow \
equation that every charge must obey under a\\ngeneralised $T\\\\bar{T}$ \
deformation. This also reproduces the known flow\\nequations on the \
nose.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
