Tateo\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Geometric aspects of the ODE/IM correspondence\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Partially based on lectures given at the Young \
Researchers\\n  Integrability School 2017,in Dublin. 62 pages, 8 figures. \
Minor amendments.\\n  Version published in J. Phys A \\\"Special Issue on \
Recent Advances in AdS/CFT\\n  Integrability\\\"\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"J. Phys. A: Math. Theor. (2020)\""}]}, {
               
