               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  I review recent results concerning the construction of \
generalised \\\"latitude\\\"\\nWilson loops in ABJM theory. In particular, \
the parametric Matrix Model\\ndetermining these operators exactly is \
presented, as well as the exact\\nprescription for computing different types \
of Bremsstrahlung functions from\\ncircular Wilson loops. In this context the \
physical meaning of framing in\\nnon-topological three-dimensional theories \
is clarified.\\n\""}]}, {
