 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We propose the full system of Baxter Q-functions \
(QQ-system) for the\\nintegrable spin chains with the symmetry of the $D_r$ \
Lie algebra. We use this\\nQQ-system to derive new Weyl-type formulas \
expressing transfer matrices in all\\nsymmetric and antisymmetric \
(fundamental) representations through $r+1$ basic\\nQ-functions. Our \
functional relations are consistent with the Q-operators\\nproposed recently \
by one of the authors and verified explicitly on the level of\\noperators at \
small finite length.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
