                 "\"Shinji Hirano, Tatsuki Nakajima, Masaki Shigemori\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"$T\\\\bar{T}$ Deformation of Stress-Tensor Correlators \
from Random Geometry\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"v2: JHEP version + minor corrections\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"J. High Energ. Phys. 2021, 270 (2021)\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP04(2021)270\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"YITP-20-159\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study stress-tensor correlators in the \
$T\\\\bar{T}$-deformed conformal field\\ntheories in two dimensions. Using \
the random geometry approach to the\\n$T\\\\bar{T}$ deformation, we develop a \
geometrical method to compute\\nstress-tensor correlators. More specifically, \
we derive the $T\\\\bar{T}$\\ndeformation to the Polyakov-Liouville conformal \
anomaly action and calculate\\nthree and four-point correlators to the \
first-order in the $T\\\\bar{T}$\\ndeformation from the deformed \
Polyakov-Liouville action. The results are\\nchecked against the standard \
conformal perturbation theory computation and we\\nfurther check consistency \
with the $T\\\\bar{T}$-deformed operator product\\nexpansions of the stress \
tensor. A salient feature of the $T\\\\bar{T}$-deformed\\nstress-tensor \
correlators is a logarithmic correction that is absent in two \
and\\nthree-point functions but starts appearing in a four-point function.\\n\
\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
