                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"21 pages, 2 figures. V2: extra comments and references, \
typos\\n  corrected, note added\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
