                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We review the recent advances on exact results for \
dynamical correlation\\nfunctions at large scales and related transport \
coefficients in interacting\\nintegrable models. We discuss Drude weights, \
conductivity and diffusion\\nconstants, as well as linear and nonlinear \
response on top of equilibrium and\\nnon-equilibrium states. We consider the \
problems from the complementary\\nperspectives of the general hydrodynamic \
theory of many-body systems, including\\nhydrodynamic projections, and \
form-factor expansions in integrable models, and\\nshow how they provide a \
comprehensive and consistent set of exact methods to\\nextract large scale \
behaviours. Finally, we overview various applications in\\nintegrable spin \
chains and field theories.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
