Marco Rossi\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Traffic models and traffic-jam transition in quantum \
($N$+1)-level\\n  systems\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"24 pages, 13 figures\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"SciPost Phys. Core 5, 022 (2022)\""}]}, {
               
