         Annotation[#, 
          
          TableForm[{
           "id" -> "2104.13680", "submitter" -> "Hongfei Shu", "authors" -> 
            "Katsushi Ito, Takayasu Kondo, Kohei Kuroda, Hongfei Shu", 
            "title" -> "WKB periods for higher order ODE and TBA equations", 
            "comments" -> 
            "1+31 pages, references added, typos corrected, discussions on\n  \
wall-crossing added, published version", "journal-ref" -> "JHEP10(2021)167", 
            "doi" -> "10.1007/JHEP10(2021)167", "report-no" -> 
            "TIT/HEP-684, NORDITA 2021-032", "categories" -> 
            "hep-th math-ph math.MP", "license" -> 
            "http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  We study the WKB periods for the $(r+1)$-th order ordinary \
differential\nequation (ODE) which is obtained by the conformal limit of the \
linear problem\nassociated with the $A_r^{(1)}$ affine Toda field equation. \
We compute the\nquantum corrections by using the Picard-Fuchs operators. The \
ODE/IM\ncorrespondence provides a relation between the Wronskians of the \
solutions and\nthe Y-functions which satisfy the thermodynamic Bethe ansatz \
(TBA) equation\nrelated to the Lie algebra $A_r$. For the quadratic \
potential, we propose a\nformula to show the equivalence between the \
logarithm of the Y-function and the\nWKB period, which is confirmed by \
solving the TBA equation numerically.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Wed, 28 Apr 2021 10:07:45 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Thu, 6 May 2021 08:42:05 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v3", "created" -> 
               "Thu, 7 Oct 2021 00:38:34 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2021-10-22", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"Ito", "Katsushi", ""}, {
              "Kondo", "Takayasu", ""}, {"Kuroda", "Kohei", ""}, {
              "Shu", "Hongfei", ""}}}], "Tooltip"]& ], 
