 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study (2,2s+1) RSOS lattice models deformed by the \
current-current\\noperator. Solving the deformed Bethe ansatz equations for \
the model in the\\nregime III we find explicit expressions for the ground \
state energy as well as\\nfor the energy, the momentum and the scattering \
matrix of the breather-like\\nexcitations. In the scaling limit we get an \
additional confirmation to the\\nproposal that the bi-local deformations are \
a lattice analogue of the TT\\nperturbations of integrable massive QFTs \
proposed by Smirnov and Zamolodchikov.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
