in superconformal\\nfield theory and more general coset CFT's related to the \
affine Yangian\\n$\\\\textrm{Y}\\\\big(\\\\widehat{\\\\mathfrak{gl}}(2)\\\\\
big)$. We derive the relation\\nbetween the RLL and current realizations and \
prove Bethe anzatz equations for\\nthe spectrum of Integrals of \
Motion.\\n\""}]}, {
