 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this article topologies on metagroups are studied. \
They are related with\\ngeneralized $C^*$-algebras over ${\\\\bf R}$ or \
${\\\\bf C}$. Homomorphisms and\\nquotient maps on them are investigated. \
Structure of topological metagroups is\\nscrutinized. In particular, \
topologies on smashed products and smashed twisted\\nwreath products of \
metagroups are scrutinized, which are making them\\ntopological metagroups. \
Moreover, their inverse homomorphism systems are\\nstudied.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
