 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We propose the refined topological string \
correspondence to the expectation\\nvalues of half-BPS Wilson loop operators \
in 5d $\\\\mathcal{N}=1$ gauge theory\\npartition function on the \
Omega-deformed background\\n$\\\\mathbb{R}^4_{\\\\epsilon_{1,2}}\\\\times \
S^1$. We provide the refined topological\\nvertex method and the refined \
holomorphic anomaly equation method in the\\ntopological string theory, from \
which we have exact computations on the 5d\\nWilson loops partition functions \
in both A- and B-models. Finally, with the\\nexact results we have in \
B-model, we recover the quantum periods of \
local\\n$\\\\mathbb{P}^1\\\\times\\\\mathbb{P}^1$ model and local \
$\\\\mathbb{P}^2$ model in the\\nstudy of quantum geometry and we further \
give a refined generalization of\\nA-period.\\n\""}]}, {
