            "  We present an exact formula for the thermal scalar two-point \
function in\nfour-dimensional holographic conformal field theories. The \
problem of finding\nit reduces to the analysis of the wave equation on the \
AdS-Schwarzschild\nbackground. The two-point function is computed from the \
connection coefficients\nof the Heun equation, which can be expressed in \
terms of the\nNekrasov-Shatashvili partition function of an SU(2) \
