Roberto Tateo\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Deforming the ODE/IM correspondence with $\\\\mathrm{T}\\\
\\bar{\\\\mathrm{T}}$\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"27 pages, 4 figures\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
