Paola Ruggiero\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Entanglement R\\\\'enyi Entropies from Ballistic \
Fluctuation Theory: the\\n  free fermionic case\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"53 pages, 2 figures\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"SciPost Phys. Core 7, 005 (2024)\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.21468/SciPostPhysCore.7.1.005\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
