               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We explore $T \\\\overline T$ deformations of Warped \
Conformal Field Theories\\n(WCFTs) in two dimensions as examples of \
$T\\\\overline T$ deformed\\nnon-relativistic quantum field theories. WCFTs \
are quantum field theories with\\na Virasoro$\\\\times$U(1) Kac-Moody \
symmetry. We compute the deformed symmetry\\nalgebra of a $T\\\\overline T$ \
deformed holographic WCFT, using the asymptotic\\nsymmetries of AdS$_3$ with \
$T \\\\overline T$ deformed Comp\\\\'ere, Song and\\nStrominger (CSS) \
boundary conditions. The U(1) Kac-Moody symmetry survives\\nprovided one \
allows the boundary metric to transform under the asymptotic\\nsymmetry. The \
Virasoro sector remains but is now deformed and no longer chiral.\\n\""}]}, {
