                 "\"Completing the Bootstrap Program for\\n  $\\\\mathrm{T}\\\
\\bar{\\\\mathrm{T}}$-Deformed Massive Integrable Quantum Field\\n  \
Theories\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
