            "  We find the connection between relativistic and \
non-relativistic string vacua\nin AdS$_5 \\times$S$^5$ in terms of a free \
parameter $c$ flow. First, we show\nthat the famous relativistic BMN vacuum \
flows in the large $c$ parameter to an\nunphysical solution of the \
