                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this paper we return to the question of the modular \
properties of a\\ngeneralised Gibbs ensemble of a single free fermion. We \
extend our previous\\nproposals to a GGE containing an arbitrary number of \
conserved charges and\\nprovide a physical interpretation of the result in \
terms of a line defect. The\\ndefect description perfectly explains the \
product formula for the modular\\ntransformation we found previously. We also \
give a proposal for a Hamiltonian\\napproach to the line defect.\\n\""}]}, {
