                  "\"Hidden local, quasi-local and non-local Symmetries in \
Integrable Systems\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"32 pages, Latex file\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Nucl.Phys. B577 (2000) 500-528\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"10.1016/S0550-3213(00)00151-6\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"DTP/99/65, EP/99/156\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th nlin.SI\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  The knowledge of {\\\\it non usual} and sometimes \
{\\\\it hidden} symmetries of\\n(classical) integrable systems provides a \
very powerful setting-out of\\nsolutions of these models. Primarily, the \
understanding and possibly the\\nquantisation of intriguing symmetries could \
give rise to deeper insight into\\nthe nature of field spectrum and \
correlation functions in quantum integrable\\nmodels. With this perspective \
in mind we will propose a general framework for\\ndiscovery and investigation \
of local, quasi-local and non-local symmetries in\\nclassical integrable \
systems. We will pay particular attention to the structure\\nof symmetry \
algebra and to the r\\\\^ole of conserved quantities. We will also\\nstress a \
nice unifying point of view about KdV hierarchies and Toda field\\ntheories \
with the result of obtaining a Virasoro algebra as exact symmetry \
of\\nSine-Gordon Model.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Sat, 22 Jan 2000 15:10:22 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2009-10-31\""}]}, {
