                  "\"6 pages, JHEP proceedings style, talk presented at the \
Conference\\n  \\\"Nonperturbative Quantum Effects 2000\\\"\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
