                  "\"From the braided to the usual Yang-Baxter \
relation\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"13 Latex pages\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
