                RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  With the aim of exploring a massive model \
corresponding to the perturbation\\nof the conformal model [hep-th/0211094] \
the nonlinear integral equation for a\\nquantum system consisting of left and \
right KdV equations coupled on the\\ncylinder is derived from an integrable \
lattice field theory. The eigenvalues of\\nthe energy and of the transfer \
matrix (and of all the other local integrals of\\nmotion) are expressed in \
terms of the corresponding solutions of the nonlinear\\nintegral equation. \
The analytic and asymptotic behaviours of the transfer\\nmatrix are studied \
and given.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
