            TagBox[
             GridBox[{{
                RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0404014\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Roberto Tateo\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Patrick Dorey, Davide Fioravanti, Chaiho Rim, Roberto \
Tateo\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Integrable quantum field theory with boundaries: the \
exact g-function\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"21 pages, 9 figures, Latex 2e. v2: typos fixed and \
comments added.\\n  v3: Published version: minor typos corrected, numerical \
results included and\\n  a note added\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Nucl.Phys. B696 (2004) 445-467\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"10.1016/j.nuclphysb.2004.06.045\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"DCPT-04/11, SPhT-T04/037\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"hep-th cond-mat.stat-mech nlin.SI\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  The g-function was introduced by Affleck and Ludwig in \
the context of\\ncritical quantum systems with boundaries. In the framework \
of the thermodynamic\\nBethe ansatz (TBA) method for relativistic scattering \
theories, all attempts to\\nwrite an exact integral equation for the \
off-critical version of this quantity\\nhave, up to now, been unsuccesful. We \
tackle this problem by using an\\nn-particle cluster expansion, close in \
spirit to form-factor calculations of\\ncorrelators on the plane. The leading \
contribution already disagrees with all\\nprevious proposals, but a study of \
this and subsequent terms allows us to\\ndeduce an exact infrared expansion \
for g, written purely in terms of TBA\\npseudoenergies. Although we only \
treat the thermally-perturbed Ising and the\\nscaling Lee-Yang models in \
detail, we propose a general formula for g which\\nshould be valid for any \
model with entirely diagonal scattering.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Fri, 2 Apr 2004 16:15:26 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v2\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
