          Annotation[#, 
           
           TableForm[{
            "id" -> "hep-th/0404014", "submitter" -> "Roberto Tateo", 
             "authors" -> 
             "Patrick Dorey, Davide Fioravanti, Chaiho Rim, Roberto Tateo", 
             "title" -> 
             "Integrable quantum field theory with boundaries: the exact \
g-function", "comments" -> 
             "21 pages, 9 figures, Latex 2e. v2: typos fixed and comments \
added.\n  v3: Published version: minor typos corrected, numerical results \
included and\n  a note added", "journal-ref" -> 
             "Nucl.Phys. B696 (2004) 445-467", "doi" -> 
             "10.1016/j.nuclphysb.2004.06.045", "report-no" -> 
             "DCPT-04/11, SPhT-T04/037", "categories" -> 
             "hep-th cond-mat.stat-mech nlin.SI", "license" -> Null, 
             "abstract" -> 
             "  The g-function was introduced by Affleck and Ludwig in the \
context of\ncritical quantum systems with boundaries. In the framework of the \
thermodynamic\nBethe ansatz (TBA) method for relativistic scattering \
theories, all attempts to\nwrite an exact integral equation for the \
off-critical version of this quantity\nhave, up to now, been unsuccesful. We \
tackle this problem by using an\nn-particle cluster expansion, close in \
spirit to form-factor calculations of\ncorrelators on the plane. The leading \
contribution already disagrees with all\nprevious proposals, but a study of \
this and subsequent terms allows us to\ndeduce an exact infrared expansion \
for g, written purely in terms of TBA\npseudoenergies. Although we only treat \
the thermally-perturbed Ising and the\nscaling Lee-Yang models in detail, we \
propose a general formula for g which\nshould be valid for any model with \
entirely diagonal scattering.\n", 
             "versions" -> {{
               "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
                "Fri, 2 Apr 2004 16:15:26 GMT"}, {
               "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
                "Tue, 20 Apr 2004 14:39:00 GMT"}, {
               "version" -> "v3", "created" -> 
                "Thu, 11 Nov 2004 12:34:53 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
             "2009-11-10", 
             "authors_parsed" -> {{"Dorey", "Patrick", ""}, {
               "Fioravanti", "Davide", ""}, {"Rim", "Chaiho", ""}, {
               "Tateo", "Roberto", ""}}}], "Tooltip"]& ]}, 
