            "  The integrals of motion of the tricritical Ising model are \
obtained by\nThermodynamic Bethe Ansatz (TBA) equations derived from the A_4 \
integrable\nlattice model. They are compared with those given by the \
conformal field theory\nleading to a unique one-to-one lattice-conformal \
