                RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  Bound state excitations of the spin 1/2-XYZ model are \
considered inside the\\nBethe Ansatz framework by exploiting the equivalent \
Non-Linear Integral\\nEquations. Of course, these bound states go to the \
sine-Gordon breathers in the\\nsuitable limit and therefore the scattering \
factors between them are explicitly\\ncomputed by inspecting the \
corresponding Non-Linear Integral Equations. As a\\nconsequence, abstracting \
from the physical model the Zamolodchikov-Faddeev\\nalgebra of two $n$-th \
elliptic breathers defines a tower of $n$-order Deformed\\nVirasoro Algebras, \
reproducing the $n=1$ case the usual well-known algebra \
of\\nShiraishi-Kubo-Awata-Odake \\\\cite{SKAO}.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
