            Null, "abstract" -> 
            "  The generalized open XXZ model at $q$ root of unity is \
considered. We review\nhow associated models, such as the $q$ harmonic \
oscillator, and the lattice\nsine-Gordon and Liouville models are obtained. \
Explicit expressions of the\nlocal Hamiltonian of the spin ${1 \\over 2}$ XXZ \
spin chain coupled to dynamical\ndegrees of freedom at the one end of the \
chain are provided. Furthermore, the\nboundary non-local charges are given \
for the lattice sine Gordon model and the\n$q$ harmonic oscillator with open \
boundaries. We then identify the spectrum and\nthe corresponding Bethe \
states, of the XXZ and the q harmonic oscillator in the\ncyclic \
representation with special non diagonal boundary conditions. Moreover,\nthe \
spectrum and Bethe states of the lattice versions of the sine-Gordon and\n\
Liouville models with open diagonal boundaries is examined. The role of the\n\
conserved quantities (boundary non-local charges) in the derivation of the\n\
spectrum is also discussed.\n", 
