            "authors" -> "Ivan Kostov, Didina Serban, Dmytro Volin", "title" -> 
            "Strong coupling limit of Bethe Ansatz equations", "comments" -> 
            "Typos corrected, references added, discrepancy with Beccaria at \
al.\n  eliminated", "journal-ref" -> "Nucl.Phys.B789:413-451,2008", "doi" -> 
            "10.1016/j.nuclphysb.2007.06.017", "report-no" -> "SPhT-T07/029", 
            "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> Null, "abstract" -> 
            "  We develop a method to analyze the strong coupling limit of \
the Bethe ansatz\nequations supposed to give the spectrum of anomalous \
dimensions of the planar\n${\\cal N}=4$ gauge theory. This method is \
particularly adapted for the three\nrank-one sectors, $su(2)$, $su(1|1)$ and \
$sl(2)$. We use the elliptic\nparametrization of the Bethe ansatz variables, \
which degenerates to a\nhyperbolic one in the strong coupling limit. We \
analyze the equations for the\nhighest excited states in the su(2) and \
$su(1|1)$ sectors and for the state\ncorresponding to the twist-two operator \
in the $sl(2)$ sector, both without and\nwith the dressing kernel. In some \
cases we were able to give analytic\nexpressions for the leading order magnon \
densities. Our method reproduces all\nexisting analytical and numerical \
results for these states at the leading\norder.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Mon, 5 Mar 2007 15:27:42 GMT"}, {
