models\n  $M(p,p')$ and the trinomial analogue of Bailey's lemma", "comments" -> 
            "34 pages, 15 figures, harvmac. References added and the TBA\n  \
conjecture refined", "journal-ref" -> "Nucl.Phys. B519 (1998) 597-625", "doi" -> 
