             "Non-Local Virasoro Symmetries in the mKdV Hierarchy", 
             "comments" -> "11 pages, LaTex file", "journal-ref" -> 
             "Phys.Lett. B447 (1999) 277-283", "doi" -> 
             "10.1016/S0370-2693(98)01600-1", "report-no" -> "DTP-98-67", 
             "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> Null, "abstract" -> 
             "  We generalize the dressing symmetry construction in mKdV \
hierarchy. This\nleads to non-local vector fields (expressed in terms of \
vertex operators)\nclosing a Virasoro algebra. We argue that this algebra \
realization should play\nan important role in the study of 2D integrable \
field theories and in\nparticular should be related to the Deformed Virasoro \
Algebra (DVA) when the\nconstruction is perturbed out of the critical theory.\
\n", "versions" -> {{
