            "  In this paper, we construct a Q-operator as a trace of a \
representation of\nthe universal R-matrix of $U_q(\\hat{sl}_2)$ over an \
infinite-dimensional\nauxiliary space. This auxiliary space is a \
four-parameter generalization of the\nq-oscillator representations used \
