sub-sectors. In the context of the large spin limit of the\nAdS/CFT \
correspondence, we map the Lagrangians of these sub-sectors to\ncorresponding \
truncations of the $PSU(2,2|4)/PS(U(2|2)^2)$ Landau-Lifshitz\nsigma-model.\n",
