               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Notes on Superconformal Chern-Simons-Matter \
Theories\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"47 pages, 20 figures\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 0708:056,2007\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1088/1126-6708/2007/08/056\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The three dimensional N=2 supersymmetric Chern-Simons \
theory coupled to\\nmatter fields, possibly deformed by a superpotential, \
give rise to a large\\nclass of exactly conformal theories with Lagrangian \
descriptions. These\\ntheories can be arbitrarily weakly coupled, and hence \
can be studied\\nperturbatively. We study the theories in the large N limit, \
and compute the\\ntwo-loop anomalous dimension of certain long operators. Our \
result suggests\\nthat various N=2 U(N) Chern-Simons theories coupled to \
suitable matter fields\\nare dual to open or closed string theories in AdS4, \
which are not yet\\nconstructed.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
