        TagBox[
         TooltipBox[DiskBox[{18.63849643003765, -3.2871227251495245`}, 0.],
          TagBox[
           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"0705.3131\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Amir Esmaeil Mosaffa\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"A. E. Mosaffa, B. Safarzadeh\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Dual Spikes; New Spiky String Solutions\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Added references\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 0708:017,2007\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1088/1126-6708/2007/08/017\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"IPM/P-2007/033\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We find a new class of spiky solutions for closed \
strings in flat,\\n$AdS_3\\\\subset AdS_5$ and $R\\\\times S^2(\\\\subset \
S^5)$ backgrounds. In the flat\\ncase the new solutions turn out to be T-dual \
configurations of spiky strings\\nfound by Kruczenski hep-th/0410226. In the \
case of solutions living in $AdS$,\\nwe make a semi classical analysis by \
taking the large angular momentum limit.\\nThe anomalous dimension for these \
dual spikes is similar to that for rotating\\nand pulsating circular strings \
in AdS with angular momentum playing the role of\\nthe level number. This \
replaces the well known logarithmic dependence for\\nspinning strings. For \
the dual spikes living on sphere we find that no large\\nangular momentum \
limit exists.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Tue, 22 May 2007 10:31:19 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v2\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Thu, 28 Jun 2007 13:18:51 GMT\""}]}], "}"}]}], 
                   "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2009-04-30\""}]}, {
