            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"0706.1525\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Sakura Schafer-Nameki\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Andrei Mikhailov, Sakura Schafer-Nameki\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Perturbative study of the transfer matrix on the string \
worldsheet in\\n  AdS(5)xS(5)\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"52 pages, 5 figures; v3: added explanations and complete \
proof of the\\n  cancellation of the 1-loop logarithmic divergences in \
Section 6\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"CALT-68-2649\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Quantum non-local charges are central to the quantum \
integrability of a\\nsigma-model. In this paper we study the quantum \
consistency and UV finiteness\\nof non-local charges of string theory in \
AdS(5)xS(5). We use the pure spinor\\nformalism. We develop the near-flat \
space expansion of the transfer matrix and\\ncalculate the one-loop \
divergences. We find that the logarithmic divergences\\ncancel at the level \
of one loop. This gives strong support to the quantum\\nintegrability of the \
full string theory. We develop a calculational setup for\\nthe \
renormalization group analysis of Wilson line type of operators on \
the\\nstring worldsheet.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
