               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We perform a first-principles semi-classical \
computation of the one-loop\\ncorrections to the dispersion relation and \
S-matrix of Giant Magnons in AdS_5 x\\nS^5 string theory. The results agree \
exactly with expectations based on the\\nstrong coupling expansion of the \
exact Asymptotic Bethe Ansatz equations. In\\nparticular we reproduce the \
Hernandez-Lopez term in the dressing phase.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
