           "id" -> "0707.0668", "submitter" -> "Heng-Yu Chen HYC", "authors" -> 
            "Heng-Yu Chen, Nick Dorey and Rui F. Lima Matos", "title" -> 
            "Quantum Scattering of Giant Magnons", "comments" -> 
            "47 pages, 2 figures. References added, to be submitted to JHEP", 
            "journal-ref" -> "JHEP 0709:106,2007", "doi" -> 
            "10.1088/1126-6708/2007/09/106", "report-no" -> "DAMTP-07-51", 
            "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> Null, "abstract" -> 
            "  We perform a first-principles semi-classical computation of \
the one-loop\ncorrections to the dispersion relation and S-matrix of Giant \
Magnons in AdS_5 x\nS^5 string theory. The results agree exactly with \
expectations based on the\nstrong coupling expansion of the exact Asymptotic \
Bethe Ansatz equations. In\nparticular we reproduce the Hernandez-Lopez term \
in the dressing phase.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
