Trancanelli\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Wilson loops: From four-dimensional SYM to \
two-dimensional YM\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"9 pages, LaTeX\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Phys.Rev.D77:047901,2008\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1103/PhysRevD.77.047901\""}]}, {
               
