           "id" -> "0708.1762", "submitter" -> "Niklas Beisert", "authors" -> 
            "N. Beisert, F. Spill", "title" -> 
            "The Classical r-matrix of AdS/CFT and its Lie Bialgebra \
Structure", "comments" -> 
            "31 pages, v2: added comment on classical double structure in \
4.5. new\n  section 5 on relation to other algebras (from old appendix and \
new results).\n  fixed typos and mathematical inaccuracies, added references, \
v3: improved\n  mathematical presentation, to appear in CMP", "journal-ref" -> 
            "Commun.Math.Phys.285:537-565,2009", "doi" -> 
            "10.1007/s00220-008-0578-2", "report-no" -> 
            "AEI-2007-116, HU-EP-07/31", "categories" -> 
            "hep-th math.QA nlin.SI", "license" -> Null, "abstract" -> 
            
            "  In this paper we investigate the algebraic structure of \
AdS/CFT in the\nstrong-coupling limit. We propose an expression for the \
classical r-matrix with\n(deformed) u(2|2) symmetry, which leads to a \
quasi-triangular Lie bialgebra as\nthe underlying symmetry algebra. On the \
fundamental representation our r-matrix\ncoincides with the classical limit \
of the quantum R-matrix.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Mon, 13 Aug 2007 19:54:50 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Wed, 31 Oct 2007 12:50:46 GMT"}, {
