            "Microscopic formulation of the S-matrix in AdS/CFT", "comments" -> 
            "23 pages, no figures; v2: references and minor clarifications \
added,\n  version to be published in JHEP", "journal-ref" -> 
            "JHEP 0712:044,2007", "doi" -> "10.1088/1126-6708/2007/12/044", 
            "report-no" -> "UTHEP-548", "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> 
            Null, "abstract" -> 
            "  We develop the derivation we proposed in hep-th/0703177 of the \
dressing phase\nof the S-matrix in the AdS/CFT correspondence in the \
framework of the\nunderlying bare integrable model. We elaborate the \
configuration of the Bethe\nroots describing the physical vacuum, which \
consists of a long Bethe string\nstretched along the imaginary axis and \
stacks distributed along the real axis.\nWe determine the distribution of all \
Bethe roots in the thermodynamic limit. We\nthen directly compute the \
scattering phase of the fundamental excitations over\nthe physical vacuum and \
reproduce the BHL/BES dressing phase.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
