               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We compute here the Yang-Mills effective action on \
Moyal space by integrating\\nover the scalar fields in a noncommutative \
scalar field theory with harmonic\\nterm, minimally coupled to an external \
gauge potential. We also explain the\\nspecial regularisation scheme chosen \
here and give some links to the Schwinger\\nparametric representation. \
Finally, we discuss the results obtained: a\\nnoncommutative possibly \
renormalisable Yang-Mills theory.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
