               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this paper we prove that the Grosse-Wulkenhaar type \
non-commutative\\norientable complex scalar $\\\\phi^6_3$ theory, with two \
non-commutative\\ncoordinates and the third one commuting with the other two, \
is renormalizable\\nto all orders in perturbation theory. Our proof relies on \
a multiscale analysis\\nin x space.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
