               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study thermal effects for a noncommutative real \
scalar field in 2+1\\ndimensions including a Grosse-Wulkenhaar term. Using a \
perturbative expansion\\nfor the free energy, we deduce some general \
properties of the corresponding\\ncontributions, in the thermodynamic limit. \
We show that the model can be\\nconsistently interpreted as defined on a \
finite volume, which is naturally\\ndetermined by the noncommutativity scale.\
\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
