               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Using the coherent state formalism we calculate matrix \
elements of the\\none-loop non-planar dilatation operator of ${\\\\cal N}=4$ \
SYM between operators\\ndual to folded Frolov-Tseytlin strings and observe a \
curious scaling behavior.\\nWe comment on the {\\\\it qualitative} similarity \
of our matrix elements to the\\ninteraction vertex of a string field theory. \
In addition, we present a solvable\\ntoy model for string splitting and \
joining. The scaling behaviour of the matrix\\nelements suggests that the \
contribution to the genus one energy shift coming\\nfrom semi-classical \
string splitting and joining is small.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
