               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"0711.0155\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Arkady Tseytlin\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"M. Grigoriev and A.A. Tseytlin\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 
                 "\"Pohlmeyer reduction of AdS_5 x S^5 superstring sigma \
model\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"56 pages. v2: section 6.4 expanded with comments on mass \
spectrum and\\n  the corresponding S-matrix; v3,v4: minor corrections and \
clarifications added\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Nucl.Phys.B800:450-501,2008\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1016/j.nuclphysb.2008.01.006\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Imperial-TP-AT-2007-4, NI07093\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Motivated by a desire to find a useful 2d \
Lorentz-invariant reformulation of\\nthe AdS_5 x S^5 superstring world-sheet \
theory in terms of physical degrees of\\nfreedom we construct the \
Pohlmeyer-reduced version of the corresponding sigma\\nmodel. The Pohlmeyer \
reduction procedure involves several steps. Starting with\\na coset space \
string sigma model in the conformal gauge and writing the\\nclassical \
equations in terms of currents one can fix the residual \
conformal\\ndiffeomorphism symmetry and kappa-symmetry and introduce a new \
set of variables\\n(related locally to currents but non-locally to the \
original string coordinate\\nfields) so that the Virasoro constraints are \
automatically satisfied. The\\nresulting gauge-fixed equations can be \
obtained from a Lagrangian of a\\nnon-abelian Toda type: a gauged WZW model \
with an integrable potential coupled\\nalso to a set of 2d fermionic fields. \
A gauge-fixed form of the\\nPohlmeyer-reduced theory can be found by \
integrating out the 2d gauge field of\\nthe gauged WZW model. Its \
small-fluctuation spectrum contains 8 bosonic and 8\\nfermionic degrees of \
freedom with equal masses. We conjecture that the reduced\\nmodel has \
world-sheet supersymmetry and is ultraviolet-finite. We show that in\\nthe \
special case of the AdS_2 x S^2 superstring model the reduced theory \
is\\nindeed supersymmetric: it is equivalent to the N=2 supersymmetric \
extension of\\nthe sine-Gordon model.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Thu, 1 Nov 2007 19:57:01 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v2\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Tue, 6 Nov 2007 19:52:08 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v3\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Mon, 12 Nov 2007 20:52:24 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v4\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Mon, 7 Jan 2008 17:07:38 GMT\""}]}], "}"}]}], 
