                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Cesar Gomez, Johan Gunnesson, Rafael Hernandez\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"The Ising model and planar N=4 Yang-Mills\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"24 pages. v2: References added and minor typos \
corrected\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"J.Phys.A41:275205,2008\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1088/1751-8113/41/27/275205\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The scattering-matrix for planar Yang-Mills with N=4 \
supersymmetry relies on\\nthe assumption that integrability holds to all \
orders in perturbation theory.\\nIn this note we define a map from the \
spectral variables x^{\\\\pm},\\nparameterizing the long-range magnon \
momenta, to couplings in a two-dimensional\\nIsing model. Under this map \
integrability of planar N=4 Yang-Mills becomes\\nequivalent to the \
Yang-Baxter equation for the two-dimensional Ising model, and\\nthe \
long-range variables x^{\\\\pm} translate into the entries of the \
Ising\\ntransfer matrices. We explore the Ising correlation length which \
equals the\\ninverse magnon momentum in the small momentum limit. The \
critical regime is\\nthus reached for vanishing magnon momentum. We also \
discuss the meaning of the\\nKramers-Wannier duality transformation on the \
gauge theory, together with that\\nof the Ising model critical \
points.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Wed, 21 Nov 2007 16:26:15 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v2\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Wed, 5 Dec 2007 16:40:52 GMT\""}]}], "}"}]}], 
                   "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2008-11-26\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
