         Annotation[#, 
          
          TableForm[{
           "id" -> "0711.3895", "submitter" -> "Mannque Rho", "authors" -> 
            "Mannque Rho", "title" -> 
            "Hidden Local Symmetry and Dense Half-Skyrmion Matter", 
            "comments" -> "6 pages, 1 figure, 1 reference corrected", 
            "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> Null, "report-no" -> Null, 
            "categories" -> "nucl-th hep-ph hep-th", "license" -> Null, 
            "abstract" -> 
            "  Transition from baryonic matter to color-flavor-locked quark \
matter is\ndescribed in terms of skyrmion matter changing into half-skyrmion \
matter. The\nintermediate phase between the density $n_p$ at which a skyrmion \
turns into two\nhalf skyrmions and the chiral transition density $n_c^{\\chi \
SR}$ at which\nhadronic matter changes over to quark matter corresponds to a \
chiral symmetry\nrestored phase characterized by a vanishing quark condensate \
and a {\\em\nnon-vanishing} pion decay constant. When hidden local fields are \
incorporated,\nthe vector manifestation of Harada-Yamawaki HLS theory implies \
that as density\napproaches $n_c^{\\chi SR}$, the gauge coupling $g$ goes to \
zero (in the chiral\nlimit) and the symmetry \"swells\" to $SU(N_f)^4$ as \
proposed by Georgi for the\n\"vector limit.\" This enhanced symmetry, not \
present in QCD, can be interpreted\nas \"emergent\" in medium due to \
collective excitations. The fractionization of\nskyrmions into half-skyrmions \
resembles closely the magnetic N\\'eel--to-valence\nbond solid (VBS) \
paramagnet transition where \"baby\" half-skyrmions enter as\nrelevant \
degrees of freedom in the intermediate phase. It is suggested that the\n\
half-skyrmion phase in dense matter corresponds to the \"hadronic freedom\"\n\
regime that plays a singularly important role in inducing kaon condensation\n\
that leads to the collapse of massive compact stars into black holes..\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Sun, 25 Nov 2007 12:52:16 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Wed, 28 Nov 2007 07:22:35 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2007-11-28", "authors_parsed" -> {{"Rho", "Mannque", ""}}}], 
          "Tooltip"]& ], 
