 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We present the planar four-loop anomalous dimension of \
the composite operator\\ntr(phi[Z,phi]Z) in the flavour SU(2) sector of the \
N=4 SYM theory. At this loop\\norder wrapping interactions are present: they \
give rise to contributions\\nproportional to zeta(5) increasing the level of \
transcendentality of the\\nanomalous dimension. In a sequel of this paper all \
the details of our\\ncalculation will be reported.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
