                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"1+45 pages, 10 figures, v2: references added, discussion \
in section\\n  3.2 corrected, v3: references added, minor corrections, v4: \
published\\n  version, v5: Revised subsection 2.3, section 3 and some \
appendices to correct\\n  mistakes. Added the case 1 < Q << g\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
