Vieira\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Quantum Wrapped Giant Magnon\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"17 pages, 2 figures\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Phys.Rev.D78:026006,2008\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1103/PhysRevD.78.026006\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"CALT-68-2667, LPTENS 08/04, SPhT-t08/017\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Understanding the finite-size corrections to the \
fundamental excitations of a\\ntheory is the first step towards completely \
solving for the spectrum in finite\\nvolume. We compute the leading \
exponential correction to the quantum energy of\\nthe fundamental excitation \
of the light-cone gauged string in AdS(5) x S(5),\\nwhich is the giant magnon \
solution. We present two independent ways to obtain\\nthis correction: the \
first approach makes use of the algebraic curve\\ndescription of the giant \
magnon. The second relies on the purely\\nfield-theoretical Luscher formulas, \
which depend on the world-sheet S-matrix.\\nWe demonstrate the agreement to \
all orders in g/Delta of these approaches,\\nwhich in particular presents a \
further test of the S-matrix. We comment on\\ngeneralizations of this method \
of computation to other string configurations.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Thu, 24 Jan 2008 19:06:12 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2008-11-26\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Gromov\"", ",", "\"Nikolay\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"Schafer-Nameki\"", ",", "\"Sakura\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Vieira\"", ",", "\"Pedro\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}]}], "}"}]}]}}, RowSpacings -> 1, ColumnAlignments -> 
