 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Candidates for renormalisable gauge theory models on \
Moyal spaces constructed\\nrecently have non trivial vacua. We show that \
these models support vacuum\\nstates that are invariant under both global \
rotations and symplectic\\nisomorphisms which form a global symmetry group \
for the action. We compute the\\nexplicit expression in the position space \
for these vacuum configurations in\\ntwo and four dimensions.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
