            "  We construct Drinfeld's second realization of the Yangian \
based on\npsu(2|2)xR^3 symmetry. The second realization is traditionally more \
suitable\nfor deriving the quantum double and the universal R matrix with \
respect to the\nfirst realization, originally obtained by Beisert, and it is \
