 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  A recently discovered generalized Gribov-Lipatov \
reciprocity holds for the\\nanomalous dimensions of various twist operators \
in N=4 SYM. Here, we consider a\\nclass of scaling psu(2,2|4) operators that \
reduce at one-loop to twist-3\\nmaximal helicity gluonic operators. We \
extract from the asymptotic long-range\\nBethe Ansatz a closed expression for \
the spin dependent anomalous dimension at\\nfour loop order and provide a \
complete proof of reciprocity. We comment about\\nthe interplay with \
possible, yet unknown, wrapping corrections.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
