                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"23 pages, 2 figures. Improved and enlarged version. Some \
references\\n  have been added and updated. Two subsections and a discussion \
on the\\n  appearence of Higgs fiels in noncommutative gauge theories have \
been added\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"J. Noncommut. Geom.5:39-67, 2011\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.4171/JNCG/69\""}]}, {
