 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We extend the Zamolodchikov-Faddeev algebra for the \
superstring sigma model\\non $AdS_{5}\\\\times S^{5}$, which was formulated \
by Arutyunov, Frolov and\\nZamaklar, to the case of open strings attached to \
maximal giant gravitons,\\nwhich was recently considered by Hofman and \
Maldacena. We obtain boundary\\n$S$-matrices which satisfy the standard \
boundary Yang-Baxter equation.\\n\""}]}, {
