 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Recently, a gauged linear sigma model was proposed by \
Berkovits and Vafa\\nwhich can be used to describe the AdS_5xS^5 superstring \
at finite and zero\\nradius. In this paper we show that the model is \
classically integrable by\\nconstructing its first non-local conserved charge \
and a superspace Lax\\n\\\"quartet\\\". Quantum conservation of the non-local \
charge follows easily from\\nsuperspace rules.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
