 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We prove that the beta function of the \
Grosse-Wulkenhaar model including a\\nmagnetic field vanishes at all order of \
perturbations. We compute the\\nrenormalization group flow of the relevant \
dynamic parameters and find a\\nnon-Gaussian infrared fixed point. Some \
consequences of these results are\\ndiscussed.\\n\""}]}, {
