 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We use the reduction of the string dynamics on R_t x \
S^3 to the\\nNeumann-Rosochatius integrable system to map all string \
solutions described by\\nthis dynamical system onto solutions of the complex \
sine-Gordon integrable\\nmodel. This mapping relates the parameters in the \
solutions on both sides of\\nthe correspondence. In the framework of this \
approach, we find finite-size\\nstring solutions, their images in the \
(complex) sine-Gordon system, and the\\nleading finite-size effects of the \
single spike \\\"E-\\\\Delta\\\\phi\\\" relation for\\nboth R_t x S^2 and R_t \
x S^3 cases.\\n\""}]}, {
