                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study finite size effects for composite operators in \
the SU(2) sector of\\nthe superconformal beta-deformed N=4 SYM theory. In \
particular we concentrate\\non the spectrum of one single magnon. Since in \
this theory one-impurity states\\nare non BPS we compute their anomalous \
dimensions including wrapping\\ncontributions up to four loops and discuss \
higher order effects.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
