, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  We study the anomalous dimensions for scalar operators \
for a\\nthree-dimensional Chern-Simons theory recently proposed in \
arXiv:0806.1218. We\\nshow that the mixing matrix at two-loop order is that \
for an integrable\\nHamiltonian of an SU(4) spin chain with sites alternating \
between the\\nfundamental and the anti-fundamental representations. We find a \
set of Bethe\\nequations from which the anomalous dimensions can be \
determined and give a\\nproposal for the Bethe equations to the full \
superconformal group of\\nOSp(2,2|6).\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
