 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Quantum field theory has been shown recently \
renormalizable on flat Moyal\\nspace and better behaved than on ordinary \
space-time. Some models at least\\nshould be completely finite, even beyond \
perturbation theory. In this paper a\\nfirst step is taken to extend such \
theories to non-flat backgrounds such as\\nsolvable symmetric \
spaces.\\n\""}]}, {
