regularization ambiguity\\n  added; v3,4: minor corrections; v5: treatment of \
fermionic contribution\\n  corrected, a new appendix and a note added\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
