behaviour of\nanomalous dimensions of \"short\" gauge theory operators we \
consider the famous\nexample of folded spinning string in AdS_5 in the limit \
of small semiclassical\nspin parameter \\S = S/sqrt[lambda]. In this limit \
the string becomes short and\nis moving in a near-flat central region of \
