 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We derive the perturbative four loop anomalous \
dimension of the Konishi\\noperator in N=4 SYM theory from the integrable \
string sigma model by evaluating\\nthe finite size effects using Luscher \
formulas adapted to multimagnon states at\\nweak coupling. We obtain these \
multiparticle generalizations of Luscher\\nformulas by studying certain \
exactly solvable relativistic integrable quantum\\nfield theories. The final \
result involves a summation of all bound states in\\nthe mirror theory and \
agrees with gauge theory perturbative computations.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
