 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We present the OSp(2,2|6) symmetric algebraic curve for \
the AdS4/CFT3 duality\\nrecently proposed in arXiv:0806.1218. It encodes all \
classical string solutions\\nat strong t'Hooft coupling and the full two loop \
spectrum of long single trace\\ngauge invariant operators in the weak \
coupling regime. This construction can\\nalso be used to compute the complete \
superstring semi-classical spectrum around\\nany classical solution. We \
exemplify our method on the BMN point-like string.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
