 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study a giant magnon and a spike solution for the \
string rotating on\\nAdS(4) X CP**3 geometry. We consider rigid rotating \
fundamental string in the\\nSU(2) X SU(2) sector inside the CP**3 and find \
out the general form of all the\\nconserved charges. We find out the \
dispersion relation corresponding to both\\nthe known giant magnon and the \
new spike solutions. We further study the finite\\nsize correction in both \
cases.\\n\""}]}, {
