            "  This review cover our current understanding of strongly \
coupled Quark-Gluon\nPlasma (sQGP), especially theoretical progress in (i) \
explaining the RHIC data\nby hydrodynamics, (ii) describing lattice data \
using electric-magnetic duality;\n(iii) understanding of gauge-string duality \
known as AdS/CFT and its\napplication for \"conformal\" plasma. In view of \
