questions in solving\nplanar AdS/CFT. In this paper we discuss these effects \
in the AdS_5xS^5 string\ntheory at one-loop in the world-sheet coupling. \
First we provide a very\ngeneral, efficient way to compute the fluctuation \
frequencies, which allows to\ndetermine the energy shift for very general \
