 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The folded spinning string in AdS3 gives us an \
important insight into AdS/CFT\\nduality. Recently its one-loop energy was \
analyzed in the context of AdS4/CFT3\\nby McLoughlin and Roiban \
arXiv:0807.3965, by Alday, Arutyunov and Bykov\\narXiv:0807.4400 and by \
Krishnan arXiv:0807.4561. They computed the spectrum of\\nthe fluctuations \
around the classical solution.\\n  In this paper we reproduce their results \
using the algebraic curve technique\\nand show that under some natural \
resummation of the fluctuation energies the\\none-loop energy agrees \
perfectly with the predictions of arXiv:0807.0777. This\\nprovides a further \
support of the all-loop Bethe equations and of the AdS4xCP3\\nalgebraic curve \
developed in arXiv:0807.0437.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
