 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We consider the three-particle scattering S-matrix for \
the Landau-Lifshitz\\nmodel by directly computing the set of the Feynman \
diagrams up to the second\\norder. We show, following the analogous \
computations for the non-linear\\nSchr\\\\\\\"{o}dinger model, that the \
three-particle S-matrix is factorizable in the\\nfirst non-trivial \
order.\\n\""}]}, {
