on. As a\nparticular application, we describe a dyonic D3-brane in AdS_5 x \
S^1, dual to\n1/4 BPS states of N=4$ SYM.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Tue, 9 Sep 2008 18:56:08 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2010-05-12", "authors_parsed" -> {{"Fiol", "Bartomeu", ""}}}], 
