Fundamental\\n  Strings in Anti-de Sitter Supergravity Dual\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"v1. 34 pages, 11 figures: v2. major revision, all loop \
proof added 42\\n  pages, 11 figures\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 0903:127,2009\""}]}, {
               
