 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this contribution it is shown how closed formulas \
for anomalous dimensions\\nof two classes of operators in N=4 SYM can be \
derived, either by investigating\\nthe numerics or on the basis of \
QCD-inspired assumptions. We discuss the case\\nof twist three \\\"gauge\\\" \
operators in which a complete proof of reciprocity can\\nbe carried \
out.\\n\""}]}, {
