               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"0810.2008\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Radoslav Rashkov\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"M. Kreuzer, R.C. Rashkov and M. Schimpf\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Near Flat Space limit of strings on AdS_4 x CP^3\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"20 pages, typos corrected, references added\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Eur.Phys.J.C60:471-480,2009\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1140/epjc/s10052-009-0919-0\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"TUW-08-11\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The non-linear nature of string theory on non-trivial \
backgrounds related to\\nthe AdS/CFT correspondence suggests to look for \
simplifications. Two such\\nsimplifications proved to be useful in studying \
string theory. These are the\\npp-wave limit which describes point-like \
strings and the so called \\\"near flat\\nspace\\\" limit which connects two \
different sectors of string theory -- pp-waves\\nand \\\"giant magnons\\\". \
Recently another example of AdS/CFT duality emerged -\\n$AdS_4/CFT_3$, which \
suggests duality between $\\\\mathcal N=6$ CS theory and\\nsuperstring theory \
on $AdS_4\\\\times \\\\cp$. In this paper we study the \\\"near \
flat\\nspace\\\" limit of strings on the $AdS_4\\\\times \\\\cp$ background \
and discuss\\npossible applications of the reduced theory.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
