                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"17 pages (plus appendices) and 1 figure. v2 has new \
discussion of\\n  placing finite-J giant magnons into CP^3, adds many \
references, and corrects\\n  a few typos\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 0904:136,2009\""}]}, {
               
