 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We introduce the new notion of epsilon-graded \
associative algebras which\\ntakes its root into the notion of commutation \
factors introduced in the context\\nof Lie algebras. We define and study the \
associated notion of\\nepsilon-derivation-based differential calculus, which \
generalizes the\\nderivation-based differential calculus on associative \
algebras. A corresponding\\nnotion of noncommutative connection is also \
defined. We illustrate these\\nconsiderations with various examples of \
epsilon-graded algebras, in particular\\nsome graded matrix algebras and the \
Moyal algebra. This last example permits\\nalso to interpret mathematically a \
noncommutative gauge field theory.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
