 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The anomalous dimensions of twist two operators have to \
satisfy certain\\nconsistency requirements derived from BFKL. For N=4 SYM it \
was shown that at\\nfour loops, the anomalous dimensions derived from the \
all-loop asymptotic Bethe\\nansatz do not pass this test. In this paper we \
obtain the remaining wrapping\\npart of these anomalous dimensions from \
string theory and show that these\\ncontributions exactly cure the problem \
and lead to agreement with both LO and\\nNLO BFKL expectations.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
