                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We determine spectral curves for the known spiky string \
solutions in AdS\\nspace in the limit of large angular momentum. We also \
construct generic\\nmulti-spike solutions in this limit and compute the \
corresponding spectral\\ndata. The resulting spectral curves precisely match \
those of the classical spin\\nchain describing the dual operators in one-loop \
gauge theory. Our results\\nconfirm the map between string theory and gauge \
theory degrees of freedom\\nproposed in arXiv:0805.4387 [hep-th].\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
