\n  Theoretical Department SPb State University, (2) SPb Department of \
Steklov\n  Institute of Mathematics)", "title" -> 
            "On a property of branching coefficients for affine Lie algebras",
             "comments" -> 
            "17 pages, 3 figures, to be published in Algebra i Analiz", 
            "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> Null, "report-no" -> 
            "SPbU-IP-08-03", "categories" -> "math.RT math-ph math.MP", 
            "license" -> 
