               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"0812.2431\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Alin Tirziu\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"R. Ishizeki, M. Kruczenski, A. Tirziu and A.A. \
Tseytlin\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Spiky strings in AdS_3 x S^1 and their AdS-pp-wave limits\
\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"34 pages, 4 figures; v2: references added; v3: typos \
corrected\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Phys.Rev.D79:026006,2009\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1103/PhysRevD.79.026006\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study a class of classical solutions for closed \
strings moving in AdS_3 x\\nS^1 part of AdS_5 x S^5 with energy E and spin S \
in AdS_3 and angular momentum\\nJ and winding m in S^1. They have rigid shape \
with n spikes in AdS_3. We find\\nthat when J or m are non-zero, the spikes \
do not end in cusps. We consider in\\ndetail a special large n limit in which \
S ~ n^2, J ~ n, i.e. S >> J >> 1, with\\n(E+S)/ n^2, (E-S)/ n, J/n, m/n \
staying finite. In that limit the spiky spinning\\nstring approaches the \
boundary of AdS_5. We show that the corresponding\\nsolution can be \
interpreted as describing a periodic-spike string moving in\\nAdS_3 --pp-wave \
x S^1 background. The resulting expression for the string\\nenergy should \
represent a strong-coupling prediction for anomalous dimension of\\na class \
of dual gauge theory states in a particular thermodynamic limit of \
the\\nSL(2) spin chain.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Fri, 12 Dec 2008 17:15:29 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v2\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Wed, 21 Jan 2009 19:13:56 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v3\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Thu, 25 Feb 2010 19:58:25 GMT\""}]}], "}"}]}], 
                   "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2010-02-25\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Ishizeki\"", ",", "\"R.\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Kruczenski\"", ",", "\"M.\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Tirziu\"", ",", "\"A.\"", ",", "\"\""}], "}"}],
