 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study relation between T-duality and integrability. \
We develop the\\nHamiltonian formalism for principal chiral model on general \
group manifold and\\non its T-dual image. We calculate the Poisson bracket of \
Lax connections in\\nT-dual model and we show that they are non-local as \
opposite to the Poisson\\nbrackets of Lax connection in original model. We \
demonstrate these calculations\\non two specific examples: Sigma model on \
S(2) and sigma model on AdS(2).\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
