 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We present arguments that the structure of the spectrum \
of the supersymmetric\\nmatrix model with 16 real supercharges in the large N \
limit is rather\\nnontrivial, involving besides the natural energy scale \
~\\\\lambda^{1/3} = (g^2\\nN)^{1/3} also a lower scale \
~\\\\lambda^{1/3}N^{-5/9}. This allows one to\\nunderstand a nontrivial \
behaviour of the mean internal energy of the system, E\\nproportional to \
T^{14/5}, predicted by AdS duality arguments.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
