~\\lambda^{1/3} = (g^2\nN)^{1/3} also a lower scale ~\\lambda^{1/3}N^{-5/9}. \
This allows one to\nunderstand a nontrivial behaviour of the mean internal \
energy of the system, E\nproportional to T^{14/5}, predicted by AdS duality \
arguments.\n", 
