 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study some of the properties of dual giant gravitons \
- D2-branes wrapped\\non an $S^{2}\\\\subset AdS_{4}$ - in type IIA string \
theory on $AdS_{4}\\\\times\\n\\\\mathbb{CP}^{3}$. In particular we confirm \
that the spectrum of small\\nfluctuations about the giant is both real and \
independent of the size of the\\ngraviton. We also extend previously \
developed techniques for attaching open\\nstrings to giants to this D2-brane \
giant and focus on two particular limits of\\nthe resulting string sigma \
model: In the pp-wave limit we quantize the string\\nand compute the spectrum \
of bosonic excitations while in the semiclassical\\nlimit, we read off the \
fast string Polyakov action and comment on the\\ncomparison to the \
Landau-Lifshitz action for the dual open spin chain.\\n\""}]}, {
