 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We discuss the states which contribute in the \
thermodynamic limit of the\\nmirror theory, the latter is obtained from the \
light-cone gauge-fixed string\\ntheory in the AdS_5 x S^5 background by the \
double-Wick rotation. We analyze\\nthe Bethe-Yang equations for the mirror \
theory and formulate the string\\nhypothesis. We show that in the \
thermodynamic limit solutions of the Bethe-Yang\\nequations arrange \
themselves into Bethe string configurations similar to the\\nones appearing \
in the Hubbard model. We also derive a set of equations\\ndescribing the \
bound states and the Bethe string configurations of the \
mirror\\ntheory.\\n\""}]}, {
