            "  We investigate Poisson-Lie symmetry for T-dual sigma models on \
supermanifolds\nin general and on Lie supergroups in particular. We show that \
the integrability\ncondition on this super Poisson-Lie symmetry is equivalent \
to the super Jacobi\nidentities of the Lie super-bialgebras. As examples we \
