                 "\"16 pages; v2: The Type IIA D-brane probe calculation has \
been\\n  corrected, and now agrees with the M theory calculation. Appendix on\
\\n  conventions for RR fields and D-brane actions added. Note added on a \
possible\\n  correction due to a parity anomaly. References added\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 0907:016,2009\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1088/1126-6708/2009/07/016\""}]}, {
