 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study higher order corrections to the \
radius/M2-brane charge of AdS_4 x\\nS^7/Z_k. There are two sources of \
corrections: one from the orbifold\\nsingularity of C^4/Z_k, and the other \
from the discrete torsion associated with\\nthe homology 3-cycle \
H_3(S^7/Z_k,Z) = Z_k. We give a precise formula for the\\ncharge shift. These \
corrections are relevant, for example, at two loops in the\\nAdS_4 x CP^3 \
sigma model, and therefore for the strong coupling test of the all\\nloop \
Bethe ansatz.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
