 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We introduce an anti-symmetric metric into a 3-algebra \
and call it a\\nsymplectic 3-algebra. The N=6, Sp(2N) X U(1) superconformal \
Chern-Simons-matter\\ntheory with SU(4) R-symmetry in three dimensions is \
constructed by specifying\\nthe 3-brackets in a symplectic 3-algebra. We also \
demonstrate that the N=6,\\nU(M) X U(N) theory can be recast into this \
symplectic 3-algebraic framework.\\n\""}]}, {
