 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  By making an appropriate choice for gauge fixing \
kappa-symmetry we obtain a\\nrelatively simple form of the actions for a D=11 \
superparticle in AdS(4) x\\nS(7)/Z_k, and for a D0-brane, fundamental string \
and D2-branes in the AdS(4) x\\nCP(3) superbackground. They can be used to \
study various problems of string\\ntheory and the AdS4/CFT3 correspondence, \
especially in regions of the theory\\nwhich are not reachable by the \
OSp(6|4)/U(3) x SO(1,3) supercoset sigma-model.\\nIn particular, we present a \
simple form of the gauge-fixed superstring action\\nin AdS(4) x CP(3) and \
briefly discuss issues of its T-dualization.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
