                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We use S-duality and planarity to propose an argument \
for the\\nnon-renormalization of the dispersion relation of giant magnon \
solutions in\\ntype IIB string theory on AdS_5 x S^5. We compute the spectrum \
of giant magnons\\nfor (p,q)-strings from field theory at strong coupling by \
using the central\\ncharge properties of electrically and magnetically \
charged supersymmetric\\nstates in the Coulomb branch of N=4 super \
Yang-Mills. We argue that the\\ncoupling dependence of the giant magnon \
dispersion relation conjectured in the\\nliterature using integrability \
assumptions is in fact the only functional\\ndependence compatible with \
S-duality.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
