                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We find point-like and classical string solutions on \
the AdS_5 x X^5, where\\nX^5 are the 5-dimensional Sasaki-Einstein manifolds \
Ypq and Lpqr. The number of\\nacceptable solutions is limited drastically in \
order to satisfy the constraints\\non the parameters and coordinates of the \
manifolds. The energy of the solutions\\ndepends on the parameters of the \
Sasaki-Einstein manifolds and on the conserved\\nmomenta transcendentally. A \
discussion on BPS solutions is presented as well.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Mon, 20 Apr 2009 23:21:59 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
