 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We identify the leading finite-size (Luscher-type) \
correction to the energy\\nof open strings ending on maximal giant gravitons. \
In particular we obtain the\\nleading finite size correction at weak 't Hooft \
coupling and in the planar\\nlimit to the energy of very short vacuum states. \
These results are shown to\\nagree with certain 1, 2, 3 and 4-loop dual gauge \
theory perturbative\\ncalculations, which we also perform.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
