 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study confinement property of pure SU(3) gauge \
theory, combining in this\\neffort the non-perturbative gluon and ghost \
propagators obtained as solutions\\nof Dyson--Schwinger equations with \
solutions of an integral ladder diagram\\nsummation type equation for the \
Wilson loop. We obtain the string potential and\\neffective UV \
coupling.\\n\""}]}, {
