 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  AdS_4/CFT_3 duality relating IIA string theory on AdS_4 \
x CP^3 to N=6\\nsuperconformal Chern-Simons theory provides an arena for \
studying aspects of\\nintegrability in a new potentially exactly solvable \
system. In this paper we\\nexplore the tree-level worldsheet scattering for \
strings on AdS_4 x CP^3. We\\ncompute all bosonic four-, five- and six-point \
amplitudes in the gauge-fixed\\naction and demonstrate the absence of \
particle production.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
