               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"0906.0706\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Stijn van Tongeren\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Marcin Dukalski, Stijn J. van Tongeren\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Fermionic reductions of the AdS4 x CP3 superstring\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"24 pages, v3 as published\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Phys.Rev. D 80 (2009) 046005\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1103/PhysRevD.80.046005\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"ITP-UU-09/21, SPIN-09/20\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We discuss fermionic reductions of type IIA \
superstrings on AdS4 x CP3 in\\nrelation to the conjectured AdS4/CFT3 \
duality. The superstring theory is\\ndescribed by means of a coset model \
construction, which is classically\\nintegrable. We discuss the global \
light-cone symmetries of the action and\\nrelated kappa-symmetry gauge \
choices, and also present the complete quartic\\naction in covariant form \
with respect to these. Further, we study integrable\\n(fermionic) reductions, \
in particular, a reduction yielding a quadratic action\\nof two complex \
fermions on the string world-sheet. Interestingly, this model\\nappears to be \
exactly the same as the corresponding integrable reduction found\\nin the \
AdS5 x S5 case.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
