            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  We discuss fermionic reductions of type IIA superstrings on \
AdS4 x CP3 in\nrelation to the conjectured AdS4/CFT3 duality. The superstring \
theory is\ndescribed by means of a coset model construction, which is \
classically\nintegrable. We discuss the global light-cone symmetries of the \
action and\nrelated kappa-symmetry gauge choices, and also present the \
complete quartic\naction in covariant form with respect to these. Further, we \
study integrable\n(fermionic) reductions, in particular, a reduction yielding \
a quadratic action\nof two complex fermions on the string world-sheet. \
Interestingly, this model\nappears to be exactly the same as the \
corresponding integrable reduction found\nin the AdS5 x S5 case.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
