               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"0906.1572\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Simone Giombi\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Simone Giombi, Vasily Pestun\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Correlators of local operators and 1/8 BPS Wilson loops \
on S^2 from 2d\\n  YM and matrix models\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"38 pages, 4 figures\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 1010:033,2010\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP10(2010)033\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We propose that, in N=4 Super Yang-Mills theory, \
correlation functions of\\ncertain 1/8 BPS Wilson loops and local operators \
inserted on a S^2 in\\nspace-time may be computed in terms of analogous \
observables in the\\n\\\"zero-instanton\\\" sector of 2d Yang-Mills theory. \
The Wilson loops are mapped to\\nthe standard Wilson loops of the 2d theory, \
as recently conjectured, while the\\nlocal operators are mapped to powers of \
the 2d field strength. We give several\\nperturbative checks of the \
correspondence, and derive from 2d Yang-Mills a\\ntwo-matrix model for the \
correlator of a local operator and a Wilson loop of\\narbitrary shape. We \
show that the strong coupling planar limit of the\\ntwo-matrix model \
precisely agrees with a string theory calculation in AdS_5 x\\nS^5.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Mon, 8 Jun 2009 19:37:23 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
              
