                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study marginal deformations of superconformal \
Chern-Simons matter theories\\nthat are based on 3-algebras. For this, we \
introduce the notion of an\\nassociated 3-product, which captures very \
general gauge invariant deformations\\nof the superpotentials of the BLG and \
ABJM models. We also consider conformal\\nmulti-trace deformations preserving \
N=2 supersymmetry. We then use N=2\\nsupergraph techniques to compute the \
two-loop beta functions of these\\ndeformations. Besides confirming conformal \
invariance of both the BLG and ABJM\\nmodels, we also verify that the \
recently proposed beta-deformations of the ABJM\\nmodel are indeed marginal \
to the order we are considering.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
