 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We propose Wronskian-like determinant formulae for the \
Baxter Q-functions and\\nthe eigenvalues of transfer matrices for spin chains \
related to the quantum\\naffine superalgebra U_{q}(hat{gl}(M|N)). In contrast \
to the supersymmetric\\nBazhanov-Reshetikhin formula (the quantum \
supersymmetric Jacobi-Trudi formula)\\nproposed in [Z. Tsuboi, J. Phys. A: \
Math. Gen. 30 (1997) 7975], the size of the\\nmatrices of these \
Wronskian-like formulae is less than or equal to M+N. Base on\\nthese \
formulae, we give new expressions of the solutions of the T-system\\n(fusion \
relations for transfer matrices) for supersymmetric spin chains\\nproposed in \
the abovementioned paper. Baxter equations also follow from \
the\\nWronskian-like formulae. They are finite order linear difference \
equations with\\nrespect to the Baxter Q-functions. Moreover, the \
Wronskian-like formulae also\\nexplicitly solve the functional relations for \
Backlund flows proposed in [V.\\nKazakov, A. Sorin, A. Zabrodin, Nucl. Phys. \
B790 (2008) 345\\n[arXiv:hep-th/0703147]].\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
