                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"26 pages, 4 figures; v2: comments and references added; \
v3: typos\\n  corrected, clarifying comments and references added; Based on \
Plenary Lecture\\n  delivered at the XXIX Encontro Nacional de Fisica de \
Particulas e Campos, Sao\\n  Lourenco, Brasil, September 22-26, 2008; Final \
version to be published in\\n  General Relativity and Gravitation\""}]}, {
               
