            "  We derive the perturbative five loop anomalous dimension of \
the Konishi\noperator in N = 4 SYM theory from the integrable string sigma \
model by\nevaluating finite size effects using Luscher formulas adapted to \
multimagnon\nstates at weak coupling. In addition, we derive the five loop \
wrapping\ncontribution for the L=2 single impurity state in the beta deformed \
theory,\nwhich may be within reach of a direct perturbative computation. The \
Konishi\nexpression exhibits two new features - a modification of Asymptotic \
Bethe\nAnsatz quantization and sensitiveness to an infinite set of \
