 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this article we review the recently discovered \
asymptotic integrability in\\nthe planar N = 4 SYM theory and discuss its \
breakdown beyond the asymptotic\\nregion due to the wrapping interactions. We \
also discuss novel dynamical tests\\nof the AdS/CFT correspondence one can \
perform in the special cases when the\\nwrapping interactions may be \
neglected.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
