                 "\"  We calculate the expectation value of one circular \
Wilson loop and the\\ncorrelator of two concentric circular Wilson loops in \
AdS/QCD using the\\nmodified AdS_5-metric given in Ref.[1]. The confinement \
properties of this\\nmetric in AdS/QCD are analyzed and compared with QCD and \
Nambu-Goto theory in\\nfour dimensions.\\n\""}]}, {
