                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Renormalization of Twist-Four Operators in QCD\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"64 pages\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Nucl.Phys.B826:235-293,2010\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1016/j.nuclphysb.2009.10.005\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-ph hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Extending the work by Bukhvostov, Frolov, Lipatov and \
Kuraev (BFLK) on the\\nrenormalization of quasipartonic operators we derive a \
complete set of\\ntwo-particle renormalization group kernels that enter QCD \
evolution equations\\nto twist-four accuracy. It is shown that the 2->2 \
evolution kernels which\\ninvolve ``non-partonic'' components of field \
operators, and, most remarkably,\\nalso 2->3 kernels do not require \
independent calculation and can be restored\\nfrom the known results for \
quasipartonic operators using conformal symmetry and\\nLorentz \
transformations. The kernels are presented for the renormalization \
of\\nlight-ray operators built of chiral fields in a particular basis such \
that the\\nconformal symmetry is manifest. The results can easily be recast \
in momentum\\nspace, in the form of evolution equations for generalized \
parton distributions.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Wed, 12 Aug 2009 12:09:44 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2009-11-18\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
