 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the class of pulsating strings on AdS_4 x CP3. \
Using a generalized\\nansatz for pulsating string configurations we find new \
solutions of this class.\\nFurther we quasi-classically quantize the theory \
and obtain the first\\ncorrections to the energy. The latter, due to AdS/CFT \
correspondence, is\\nsupposed to give the anomalous dimensions of operators \
of the gauge theory dual\\nN=6 Chern-Simons theory.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
