 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We calculate Wilson loops on boundaries of \
Lifshitz-like dual backgrounds\\nwith different scaling parameters, assuming \
existence of a field theory dual to\\nstring theory in the bulk. We consider \
scaling parameters to be variable\\nquantities which are subject to \
cosmological evolution. It is observed that\\nthere are discontinuities in \
the classical string action at some values of the\\nscaling \
parameters.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
