                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We construct the Lax connection of the Green-Schwarz \
superstring in AdS_5 x\\nS^5 within the Hamiltonian formalism and obtain \
precisely that used in\\n0810.4136. It differs in a crucial way from the \
Bena-Polchinski-Roiban\\nconnection by terms proportional to the Hamiltonian \
constraints. These extra\\nterms ensure firstly that the integrals of motion \
are all first class and\\nsecondly that the Lax connection is flat in the \
strong sense.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
