 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  A noteworthy feature of the S-matrix which has been \
proposed for AdS4/CFT3 is\\nthat the scattering of an A-particle (\\\"soliton\
\\\") with a B-particle\\n(\\\"antisoliton\\\") is reflectionless. We argue, \
following Zamolodchikov, that the\\nabsence of reflection is a result of the \
existence of certain local conserved\\ncharges which act differently on the \
two types of particles.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
