            "  We study the spectrum around the \"antiferromagnetic\" states \
of the planar\nAdS_5/CFT_4 duality. In contrast to the familiar large-spin \
limit J \\to \\infty\nwhere each magnon momentum scales as p \\sim 1/J << 1, \
we consider a novel\n\"large-winding\" limit in which the total momentum \
becomes infinitely large,\n\\sum_j p_j \\to \\infty. Upon taking the limit we \
