 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  It is developed the phase-space formulation for the \
Type IIA superstring on\\nthe AdS_4 x CP^3 background in the kappa-symmetry \
light-cone gauge for which\\nthe light-like directions are taken from the D=3 \
Minkowski boundary of AdS_4.\\nAfter fixing bosonic light-cone gauge the \
superstring Hamiltonian is expressed\\nas a function of the transverse \
physical variables and in the quadratic\\napproximation corresponds to the \
light-cone gauge-fixed IIA superstring in flat\\nspace.\\n\""}]}, {
