            "comments" -> 
            "12 pages, LaTeX; v2 minor improvements of the text, misprints\n  \
corrected, reference added; v3: missing terms in Eqs.(8),(53) and (56) added",
             "journal-ref" -> "Mod.Phys.Lett.A25:1251-1265,2010", "doi" -> 
