 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We analyze the properties of low-energy bound states in \
the transverse-field\\nIsing model and in the XXZ model on the square \
lattice. To this end, we develop\\nan optimized implementation of \
perturbative continuous unitary transformations.\\nThe Ising model is studied \
in the small-field limit which is found to be a\\nspecial case of the toric \
code model in a magnetic field. To analyze the XXZ\\nmodel, we perform a \
perturbative expansion about the Ising limit in order to\\ndiscuss the fate \
of the elementary magnon excitations when approaching the\\nHeisenberg point.\
\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
