correspondence\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"43 pages, 4 figures; v2: misprints corrected; v3: \
clarifications on\\n  validity of quantum Bethe equations added in sec. 7.4, \
misprints corrected\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 1003:058,2010\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
