 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the holographic dual string configuration of \
1/2 BPS circular Wilson\\nloops in N=4 super Yang-Mills theory by using the \
global coordinate of AdS. The\\ndual string worldsheet is given by the \
Poincare disk AdS_2 sitting at a\\nconstant global time slice of AdS_5. We \
also analyze the correlator of two\\nconcentric circular Wilson loops from \
the global AdS perspective and study the\\nphase transition associated with \
the instability of annulus worldsheet\\nconnecting the two Wilson \
loops.\\n\""}]}, {
