                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"LaTeX, feynmp, 70 pages; v2: signs of three diagrams due \
to\\n  inconsistent Feynman rules corrected, modifying the final result, \
typos\\n  corrected, formulations improved\""}]}, {
               
