                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In arXiv:0908.2463 we computed the four-loop correction \
to a function\\ndepending on the 't Hooft coupling(s) that appears in the \
magnon dispersion\\nrelation of the spin chains derived from single trace \
operators in N=6\\nsuperconformal Chern-Simons theories. In this paper we \
give detailed\\ndescriptions of this calculation and the computation of the \
four-loop wrapping\\ncorrections for a length four operator in the 20 of \
SU(4), the R-symmetry group\\nfor these theories. Here, we give all relevant \
Feynman diagrams and loop\\nintegrals explicitly, and also demonstrate the \
cancellation of double poles in\\nthe logarithm of the renormalization \
constant.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
