               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"0912.5440\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Domenico Seminara\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Antonio Bassetto, (Padua U. & INFN, Padua), Luca \
Griguolo, (Parma U. &\\n  INFN, Parma), Fabrizio Pucci, (Florence U. & INFN, \
Florence), Domenico\\n  Seminara, (Florence U. & INFN, Florence), Shiyamala \
Thambyahpillai, (Padua U.\\n  & INFN, Padua), Donovan Young, (Humboldt U., \
Berlin)\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Correlators of supersymmetric Wilson loops at weak and \
strong coupling\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"34 pages, 16 figures\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 1003:038,2010\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP03(2010)038\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"HU-EP-09/66\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We continue our study of the correlators of a recently \
discovered family of\\nBPS Wilson loops in N=4 supersymmetric U(N) Yang-Mills \
theory. We perform\\nexplicit computations at weak coupling by means of \
analytical and numerical\\nmethods finding agreement with the exact formula \
derived from localization. In\\nparticular we check the localization \
prediction at order g^6 for different BPS\\n\\\"latitude\\\" configurations, \
the N=4 perturbative expansion reproducing the\\nexpected results within a \
relative error of 10^(-4). On the strong coupling\\nside we present a \
supergravity evaluation of the 1/8 BPS correlator in the\\nlimit of large \
separation, taking into account the exchange of all relevant\\nmodes between \
the string world-sheets. While reproducing the correct\\ngeometrical \
dependence, we find that the associated coefficient does not match\\nthe \
localization result.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
