                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We obtain a general class of polynomials for which the \
Schrodinger operator\\nhas a discrete spectrum. This class includes all the \
scalar potentials in\\nmembrane, 5-brane, p-branes, multiple M2 branes, BLG \
and ABJM theories. We\\nprovide a proof of the discreteness of the spectrum \
of the associated\\nSchrodinger operators. This a a first step in order to \
analyze BLG and ABJM\\nsupersymmetric theories from a non-perturbative point \
of view.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
