 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We construct constant mean curvature surfaces of the \
general finite-gap type\\nin AdS_3. The special case with zero mean curvature \
gives minimal surfaces\\nrelevant for the study of Wilson loops and gluon \
scattering amplitudes in N=4\\nsuper Yang-Mills. We also analyze properties \
of the finite-gap solutions\\nincluding asymptotic behavior and the \
degenerate (soliton) limit, and discuss\\npossible solutions with null \
boundaries.\\n\""}]}, {
