A. Tseytlin\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Exact computation of one-loop correction to energy of \
spinning folded\\n  string in AdS_5 x S^5\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"52 pp, 12 figures; v3: footnote 9 added\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"J. Phys. A 43:165402,2010\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
