               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"The Classical Trigonometric r-Matrix for the \
Quantum-Deformed Hubbard\\n  Chain\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"41 pages, v2: minor textual improvements, references \
added, v3: minor\\n  improvements, references added, change of convention \
x(v2)=h'x(v3)-ih\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"J.Phys.A44:265202,2011\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1088/1751-8113/44/26/265202\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"AEI-2010-016\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"math-ph hep-th math.MP math.QA\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The one-dimensional Hubbard model is an exceptional \
integrable spin chain\\nwhich is apparently based on a deformation of the \
Yangian for the superalgebra\\ngl(2|2). Here we investigate the \
quantum-deformation of the Hubbard model in\\nthe classical limit. This leads \
to a novel classical r-matrix of trigonometric\\nkind. We derive the \
corresponding one-parameter family of Lie bialgebras as a\\ndeformation of \
the affine gl(2|2) Kac-Moody superalgebra. In particular, we\\ndiscuss the \
affine extension as well as discrete symmetries, and we scan for\\nsimpler \
limiting cases, such as the rational r-matrix for the undeformed\\nHubbard \
model.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Fri, 5 Feb 2010 09:58:32 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
