Plefka\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"One-Loop Superconformal and Yangian Symmetries of \
Scattering Amplitudes\\n  in N=4 Super Yang-Mills\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"64 pages, v2: typos and minor corrections in (6.14) and \
(6.17), to\\n  appear in JHEP\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 1004:085,2010\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP04(2010)085\""}]}, {
               
