                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We revisit the semiclassical computation of the \
fluctuation spectrum around\\ndifferent circular string solutions in \
AdS_5xS^5 and AdS_4xCP^3, starting from\\nthe Green-Schwarz action. It has \
been known that the results for these\\nfrequencies obtained from the \
algebraic curve and from the worldsheet\\ncomputations sometimes do not \
agree. In particular, different methods give\\ndifferent results for the \
half-integer shifts in the mode numbers of the\\nfrequencies. We find that \
these discrepancies can be removed if one carefully\\ntakes into account the \
transition matrices in the spin bundle over the target\\nspace.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
