Wereszczynski\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"On correlation functions of operators dual to classical \
spinning string\\n  states\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"27 pages, 3 figures; v2: references and comments \
added.\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 1005:030,2010\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP05(2010)030\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
