 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We consider the AdS_4 x CP^3 IIA superstring \
sigma-model in the background of\\nthe \\\"spinning string\\\" classical \
solution, which possesses two Noether spins. In\\nthe limit when one of the \
spins is infinite there are massless excitations,\\nwhich govern the infrared \
worldsheet properties of the model. We obtain a\\nsigma-model of CP^3 with \
fermions, which describes the dynamics of these\\nmassless modes.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
