In the context of the two-dimensional sigma models we\nanalyze the \
large-order behavior of the asymptotic perturbative expansion.\nObtained \
experience with the functional representation of the integral\nequations \
allowed us also to solve explicitly the crossing equations that\nappear in \
the AdS/CFT spectral problem.\n", 
