                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Constraints of the osp(6|4) symmetry on tree-level \
scattering amplitudes in\\nN=6 superconformal Chern-Simons theory are \
derived. Supplemented by Feynman\\ndiagram calculations, solutions to these \
constraints, namely the four- and\\nsix-point superamplitudes, are presented \
and shown to be invariant under\\nYangian symmetry. This introduces \
integrability into the amplitude sector of\\nthe theory.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
