solutions for\\n  CP^n, SU(n) and S^n\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"34 pages. v2: typos corrected, references updated, \
clarifications\\n  added; to appear in JHEP\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 1007:068,2010\""}]}, {
               
