                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  Many Ramond-Ramond backgrounds which arise in the \
AdS/CFT correspondence are\\ndescribed by integrable sigma-models. The \
equations of motion for classical\\nspinning strings in these backgrounds are \
exactly solvable by finite-gap\\nintegration techniques. We review the \
finite-gap integral equations and\\nalgebraic curves for coset sigma-models, \
and then apply the results to the\\nAdS(d+1) backgrounds with \
d=4,3,2,1.\\n\""}]}, {
