 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We review the general procedure for the \
field-theoretical computation of\\nwrapping effects in standard and \
beta-deformed N=4 super Yang-Mills by means of\\nN=1 superspace techniques. \
In the undeformed theory, these methods allowed to\\nfind explicit results at \
four and five loops for two-impurity operators. In the\\ndeformed case, a \
general expression for the finite-size correction to the\\nanomalous \
dimension of single-impurity operators at the critical order \
was\\nobtained.\\n\""}]}, {
