               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"1006.3494\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Valentina Giangreco M. Puletti Mrs\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Valentina Giangreco M. Puletti\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"On string integrability. A journey through the \
two-dimensional hidden\\n  symmetries in the AdS/CFT dualities\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"116 pages, 11 figures, to be published in Advances in \
High Energy\\n  Physics, Special Issue on ''Gauge/String Duality''\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Adv.High Energy Phys.2010:471238,2010\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1155/2010/471238\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"NORDITA-2010-41\""}]}, {
              
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  One of the main topics in the modern String Theory are \
the AdS/CFT dualities.\\nProving such conjectures is extremely difficult \
since the gauge and string\\ntheory perturbative regimes do not overlap. In \
this perspective, the discovery\\nof infinitely many conserved charges, i.e. \
the integrability, in the planar\\nAdS/CFT has allowed us to reach immense \
progresses in understanding and\\nconfirming the duality. We review the \
fundamental concepts and properties of\\nintegrability in two-dimensional \
sigma-models and in the AdS/CFT context. The\\nfirst part is focused on the \
AdS_5/CFT_4 duality, especially the classical and\\nquantum integrability of \
the type IIB superstring on AdS_5 x S^5 are discussed\\nin both pure spinor \
and Green-Schwarz formulations. The second part is\\ndedicated to the \
AdS_4/CFT_3 duality with particular attention to the type IIA\\nsuperstring \
on AdS_4 x CP^3 and its integrability. This review is based on a\\nshortened \
and revised version of the author's PhD thesis, discussed at \
Uppsala\\nUniversity in September 2009.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Thu, 17 Jun 2010 15:30:07 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2014-11-21\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"Puletti\"", ",", "\"Valentina Giangreco M.\"", ",", 
                    "\"\""}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}}, RowSpacings -> 1, 
