            "On string integrability. A journey through the two-dimensional \
hidden\n  symmetries in the AdS/CFT dualities", "comments" -> 
            "116 pages, 11 figures, to be published in Advances in High \
Energy\n  Physics, Special Issue on ''Gauge/String Duality''", "journal-ref" -> 
            "Adv.High Energy Phys.2010:471238,2010", "doi" -> 
