            "  We show how the perturbation theory results recently obtained \
by F.Fiamberti,\nA.Santambrogio, C.Sieg and D.Zanon for operator anomalous \
dimensions of\nbeta-deformed Super-Yang-Mills theory can be reproduced from \
the AdS5/CFT4\nY-system proposed by N.G., V.Kazakov and P.Vieira. To do this, \
we obtain the\ngeneral twisted asymptotic solution of this Y-system of \
functional equations.\nWe show that existence of an additional parameter beta \
in the deformed theory\nallows to extract rich information about the \
perturbation theory integrals\ndirectly from Y-system. Using this method we \
