               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"1006.5589\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Sungjay Lee\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Ki-Myeong Lee, and Sungjay Lee\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"1/2-BPS Wilson Loops and Vortices in ABJM Model\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"22 pages\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 1009:004,2010\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP09(2010)004\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"KIAS-P10018\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We explore the low-energy dynamics of 1/2-BPS heavy \
particles coupled to the\\nABJM model via the Higgsing of M2-branes, with \
focus on physical understanding\\nof the recently discovered 1/2-BPS Wilson \
loop operators. The low-energy theory\\nof 1/2-BPS heavy particles turns out \
to have the U(N|N) supergauge symmetry,\\nwhich explains the novel structure \
of the 1/2-BPS Wilson loop operator as a\\nholonomy of a U(N|N) \
superconnection. We show that the supersymmetric\\ntransformation of the \
Wilson loop operator can be identified as a fermionic\\nsupergauge \
transformation, which leads to their invariance under half of \
the\\nsupersymmetry. We also argue that 1/2-BPS Wilson loop operators appear \
as\\n1/2-BPS vortices with vorticity 1/k. Such a vortex can be naturally \
interpreted\\nas a membrane wrapping the Z_k cycle once, or type IIA \
fundamental string.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Tue, 29 Jun 2010 12:22:06 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2011-03-28\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Lee\"", ",", "\"Ki-Myeong\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Lee\"", ",", "\"Sungjay\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}]}], "}"}]}]}}, RowSpacings -> 1, ColumnAlignments -> 
