 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We compute quantum corrections to finite-size effects \
for various dyonic\\ngiant magnons in the AdS_4 x CP^3 in two different \
approaches. The off-shell\\nalgebraic curve method is used to quantize the \
classical string configurations\\nin semi-classical way and to compute the \
corrections to the string energies.\\nThese results are compared with the \
F-term L\\\\\\\"uscher formula based on the\\nS-matrix of the AdS_4 / CFT_3. \
The fact that the two results match exactly\\nprovides another stringent test \
for the all-loop integrability conjecture and\\nthe exact S-matrix based on \
it.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
