 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the class of pulsating strings in AdS_5 x \
Y^{p,q} and AdS_5 x\\nL^{p,q,r}. Using a generalized ansatz for pulsating \
string configurations, we\\nfind new solutions for this class in terms of \
Heun functions, and derive the\\nparticular case of AdS_5 x T^{1,1}, which \
was analyzed in arXiv:1006.1539\\n[hep-th]. Unfortunately, Heun functions are \
still little studied, and we are\\nnot able to quantize the theory \
quasi-classically and obtain the first\\ncorrections to the energy. The \
latter, due to AdS/CFT correspondence, is\\nsupposed to give the anomalous \
dimensions of operators of the gauge theory dual\\nN=1 superconformal field \
theory.\\n\""}]}, {
