                 "\"Wilson Loops in N=2 Superconformal Yang-Mills \
Theory\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"16 pages. v2 minor changes, to appear in JHEP. v3 \
corrected\\n  references\""}]}, {
               
