                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We demonstrate that the four and six-point tree-level \
amplitudes of N=6\\nsuperconformal Chern-Simons theory (ABJM) enjoy OSp(6|4) \
dual superconformal\\nsymmetry if one enlarges the dual superspace to include \
three additional\\nGrassmann-even coordinates which correspond to an abelian \
isometry of CP3. The\\ninclusion of these coordinates enables us to match the \
nontrivial dual\\nsuperconformal generators with level-one Yangian generators \
when acting on\\non-shell amplitudes. We also discuss some implications of \
dual conformal\\nsymmetry for loop-level amplitudes.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
