in su(1,1)\\n  Landau-Lifshitz model\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"27 pages; misprints corrected, references added\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"J. Math. Phys. 51: 123501,2010\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1063/1.3509374\""}]}, {
