            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"1008.4921\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Radu Roiban\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"R. Roiban, A.A. Tseytlin\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"On semiclassical computation of 3-point functions of \
closed string\\n  vertex operators in AdS_5 x S^5\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"24 pages, Latex v2: typos corrected, clarifying remarks \
and\\n  references added v3: minor corrections, fixed normalization of \
dilaton vertex\\n  operator\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Phys.Rev.D82:106011,2010\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1103/PhysRevD.82.106011\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We consider the leading large string tension correction \
to correlation\\nfunctions of three vertex operators of particular massive \
string states in\\nAdS_5 x S^5 string theory. We assume that two of these \
states are \\\"heavy\\\"\\ncarrying large spins (of order string tension) and \
thus can be treated\\nsemiclassically while the third state is \\\"light\\\" \
having fixed quantum numbers.\\nWe study several examples. In the case when \
the \\\"heavy\\\" states are described by\\na folded string with large spin \
in AdS_5 the 3-point function scales as a\\nsemiclassical spin parameter of \
the \\\"heavy\\\" state in power of the string level\\nof the \\\"light\\\" \
massive string state. We observe similar behavior in the case \
of\\n\\\"heavy\\\" states which admit a small angular momentum limit which \
may thus\\nrepresent correlators of three quantum massive string \
states.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
