Tseytlin", "title" -> 
            "Exact computation of one-loop correction to energy of pulsating \
strings\n  in AdS_5 x S^5", "comments" -> 
            "49 pages; v2: appendix F and note about antiperiodic fermions \
added,\n  typos corrected, references added", "journal-ref" -> 
