            "  We construct a zero-curvature Lax connection in a sub-sector \
of the\nsuperstring theory on AdS(4) x CP(3) which is not described by the\n\
OSp(6|4)/U(3) x SO(1,3) supercoset sigma-model. In this sub-sector worldsheet\
\nfermions associated to eight broken supersymmetries of the type IIA \
background\nare physical fields. As such, the prescription for the \
construction of the Lax\nconnection based on the Z_4-automorphism of the \
isometry superalgebra OSp(6|4)\ndoes not do the job. So, to construct the Lax \
connection we have used an\nalternative method which nevertheless relies on \
the isometry of the target\nsuperspace and kappa-symmetry of the \
Green-Schwarz superstring.\n", 
