 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We derive an exact analytical expression for the \
one-loop partition function\\nof a string in AdS_5xS^5 background with \
world-surface ending on two\\nanti-parallel lines. All quantum fluctuations \
are shown to be governed by\\nintegrable, single-gap Lame' operators. The \
first strong coupling correction to\\nthe quark-antiquark potential, as \
defined in N=4 SYM, is derived as the sum of\\nknown mathematical constants \
and a one-dimensional integral representation. Its\\nfull numerical value can \
be given with arbitrary precision and confirms a\\nprevious result.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
