            "categories" -> "hep-th math-ph math.MP", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  The N=4, d=4 Yang-Mills conformal supersymmetry exhibits a \
very simple\nsub-sector described by four differential operators. The \
invariance under this\nsubalgebra is big enough to determine the N=4 theory. \
Some attempts are done to\ninterpret these differential operators.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Thu, 30 Sep 2010 16:03:55 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2011-03-07", "authors_parsed" -> {{"Baulieu", "Laurent", ""}}}], 
          "Tooltip"]& ], 
        TagBox[
         TooltipBox[DiskBox[{13.110109807984431`, -0.9909319709365878}, 0.],
          TagBox[
