while the third\noperator corresponds to a light state with fixed charges, \
the correlator can be\ncomputed in the large string tension limit by means of \
a semiclassical\napproximation. We study the case when the heavy string \
states are circular\nstring solutions with one AdS_5 spin and three different \
angular momenta along\nS^5, for several choices of the light string state.\n",
