 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We discuss the integrability of 2d non-linear sigma \
models with target space\\nbeing the squashed three-sphere, warped anti-de \
Sitter space and the\\nSchroedinger spacetime. These models can be obtained \
via T-duality from\\nintegrable models. We construct an infinite family of \
non-local conserved\\ncharges from the T-dual Lax currents, enhancing the \
symmetry of warped anti-de\\nSitter space and the Schroedinger spacetime to \
sl2(R)+sl2(R).\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
