 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Recently there has been progress on the computation of \
two- and three-point\\ncorrelation functions with two \\\"heavy\\\" states \
via semiclassical methods. We\\nextend this analysis to the case of AdS_4 x \
CP^3, and examine the suggested\\nprocedure for the case of several simple \
string solutions. By making use of\\nAdS/CFT duality, we derive the relevant \
correlation functions of operators\\nbelonging to the dual N=6 Chern-Simons \
gauge theory.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
