               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Non-chiral current algebras for deformed supergroup WZW \
models\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"43 pages, Latex, one eps figure; v.2: minor corrections, \
a reference\\n  added\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 1103:124,2011\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP03(2011)124\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"hep-th cond-mat.dis-nn cond-mat.other\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study deformed WZW models on supergroups with \
vanishing Killing form. The\\ndeformation is generated by the isotropic \
current-current perturbation which is\\nexactly marginal under these \
assumptions. It breaks half of the global\\nisometries of the original \
supergroup. The current corresponding to the\\nremaining symmetry is \
conserved but its components are neither holomorphic nor\\nanti-holomorphic. \
We obtain the exact two- and three-point functions of this\\ncurrent and a \
four-point function in the first two leading orders of a 1/k\\nexpansion but \
to all orders in the deformation parameter. We further study the\\noperator \
product algebra of the currents, the equal time commutators and the\\nquantum \
equations of motion. The form of the equations of motion suggests \
the\\nexistence of non-local charges which generate a Yangian. Possible \
applications\\nto string theory on Anti-de Sitter spaces and to condensed \
matter problems are\\nbriefly discussed.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Mon, 22 Nov 2010 13:55:17 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v2\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Thu, 23 Dec 2010 13:56:07 GMT\""}]}], "}"}]}], 
                   "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2011-04-04\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
