 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  After considering a solitonic string moving in the \
Poincare $AdS$ and\\ntwo-dimensional sphere, we calculate the two-point \
correlation function of\\nmagnon and spike in the semi-classical limit \
without any explicit solution. We\\nalso calculate the three-point \
correlation functions between two heavy and one\\nlight operators. We find \
that the coupling between two heavy and one light\\noperators in the string \
side is the exactly same as one obtained from the gauge\\ntheory by using the \
RG analysis.\\n\""}]}, {
