 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We review the semiclassical analysis of strings in \
AdS5xS5 with a focus on\\nthe relationship to the underlying integrable \
structures. We discuss the\\nperturbative calculation of energies for strings \
with large charges, using the\\nfolded string spinning in an AdS3 subset of \
AdS5 as our main example.\\nFurthermore, we review the perturbative \
light-cone quantization of the string\\ntheory and the calculation of the \
worldsheet S-matrix.\\n\""}]}, {
