               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  This review is devoted to the classical integrability \
of the AdS5xS5\\nsuperstring theory. It starts with a reminder of the \
corresponding action as a\\ncoset model. The symmetries of this action are \
then reviewed. The classical\\nintegrability is then considered from the \
lagrangian and hamiltonian points of\\nview. The second part of this review \
deals with the gauge fixing of this\\ntheory. Finally, some aspects of the \
pure spinor formulation are also briefly\\nreviewed.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
