               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"1012.3989\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Sakura Schafer-Nameki\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Sakura Schafer-Nameki\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Review of AdS/CFT Integrability, Chapter II.4: The \
Spectral Curve\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"20 pages, see also overview article arXiv:1012.3982, v3: \
published\\n  version\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/s11005-011-0525-6\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"kcl-mth-10-18\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We review the spectral curve for the classical string \
in AdS5xS5. Classical\\nintegrability of the AdS5xS5 string implies the \
existence of a flat connection,\\nwhose monodromies generate an infinite set \
of conserved charges. The spectral\\ncurve is constructed out of the \
quasi-momenta, which are eigenvalues of the\\nmonodromy matrix, and each \
finite-gap classical solution can be characterized\\nin terms of such a \
curve. This provides a concise and powerful description of\\nthe classical \
solution space. In addition, semi-classical quantization of the\\nstring can \
be performed in terms of the quasi-momenta. We review the \
general\\nframe-work of the semi-classical quantization in this context and \
exemplify it\\nwith the circular string solution which is supported on RxS3 \
in AdS5xS5.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Fri, 17 Dec 2010 20:58:08 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v2\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
