 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We review recent applications of the integrable \
discrete Hirota dynamics\\n(Y-system) in the context of calculation of the \
planar AdS/CFT spectrum. We\\nstart from the description of solution of \
Hirota equations by the Backlund\\nmethod where the requirement of \
analyticity results in the nested Bethe ansatz\\nequations. Then we discuss \
applications of the Hirota dynamics for the analysis\\nof the asymptotic \
limit of long operators in the AdS/CFT Y-system.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
