               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We review the duality and integrability of N=6 \
superconformal Chern-Simons\\ntheory in three dimensions and IIA superstring \
theory on the background\\nAdS4xCP3. We introduce both of these models and \
describe how their degrees of\\nfreedom are mapped to excitations of a \
long-range integrable spin-chain.\\nFinally, we discuss the properties of the \
Bethe equations, the S-matrix and the\\nalgebraic curve that are special to \
this correspondence and differ from the\\ncase of N=4 SYM theory and strings \
on AdS5xS5.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
