           "id" -> "1012.3999", "submitter" -> "Thomas Klose", "authors" -> 
            "Thomas Klose", "title" -> 
            "Review of AdS/CFT Integrability, Chapter IV.3: N=6 Chern-Simons \
and\n  Strings on AdS4xCP3", "comments" -> 
            "22 pages, see also overview article arXiv:1012.3982, v2: \
references\n  to other chapters updated, v3: references added, v4: brief \
discussion of\n  giant magnons added, further minor changes, published \
version, v5: union of\n  v3 and v4 because changes made in v3 were \
accidentally lost in v4", "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> 
            "10.1007/s11005-011-0520-y", "report-no" -> "UUITP-37/10", 
            "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  We review the duality and integrability of N=6 superconformal \
Chern-Simons\ntheory in three dimensions and IIA superstring theory on the \
background\nAdS4xCP3. We introduce both of these models and describe how \
their degrees of\nfreedom are mapped to excitations of a long-range \
integrable spin-chain.\nFinally, we discuss the properties of the Bethe \
equations, the S-matrix and the\nalgebraic curve that are special to this \
correspondence and differ from the\ncase of N=4 SYM theory and strings on \
AdS5xS5.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Fri, 17 Dec 2010 20:58:18 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Mon, 20 Dec 2010 19:27:39 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v3", "created" -> 
               "Sun, 16 Jan 2011 09:25:16 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v4", "created" -> 
               "Fri, 6 Jan 2012 07:58:18 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v5", "created" -> 
               "Tue, 27 Mar 2012 19:14:54 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2015-05-20", "authors_parsed" -> {{"Klose", "Thomas", ""}}}], 
