Grignani,\\n  Troels Harmark, Marta Orselli\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Finite-size corrections for quantum strings on AdS_4 x \
CP^3\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Published version, references added. A discussion on \
single\\n  oscillator states included\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
