 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We obtain the quasi-normal mode frequencies of scalar \
perturbation on new\\ntype black holes in three dimensional new massive \
gravity. In some special\\ncases, the exact quasi-normal mode frequencies are \
obtained by solving scalar\\nfield equations exactly. On some parameter \
regions, the highly damped\\nquasi-normal mode frequencies are obtained in an \
analytic form by the so-called\\nStokes line method. This study on \
quasi-normal modes shed some light on the\\nmysterious nature of these black \
holes. We also comment about AdS/CFT\\ncorrespondence and the entropy/area \
spectrum for new type black holes.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
