 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Working within the AdS/CFT correspondence we calculate \
the three-point\\nfunction of two giant gravitons and one pointlike graviton \
using methods of\\nsemiclassical string theory and considering both the case \
where the giant\\ngravitons wrap an S^3 in S^5 and the case where the giant \
gravitons wrap an S^3\\nin AdS_5. We likewise calculate the correlation \
function in N=4 SYM using two\\nSchur polynomials and a single trace chiral \
primary. We find that the gauge and\\nstring theory results have structural \
similarities but do not match perfectly,\\nand interpret this in terms of the \
Schur polynomials' inability to interpolate\\nbetween dual giant and \
pointlike gravitons.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
