            "  Working within the AdS/CFT correspondence we calculate the \
three-point\nfunction of two giant gravitons and one pointlike graviton using \
methods of\nsemiclassical string theory and considering both the case where \
the giant\ngravitons wrap an S^3 in S^5 and the case where the giant \
