 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We introduce a deformation of the \
Wess-Zumino-Novikov-Witten model with\\nthree-dimensional squashed sphere \
target space. We show how with an appropriate\\nchoice of Wess--Zumino and \
boundary terms it is possible to construct an\\ninfinite family of conserved \
charges realizing an SU(2) Yangian. Finally we\\ndiscuss the running of the \
squashing parameter under renormalization group\\nflow.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
