Imperial-TP-AT-2011-2\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]}\
, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  We consider the type IIB Green-Schwarz superstring \
theory on AdS(2)xS(2)xT(6)\\nsupported by homogeneous Ramond-Ramond 5-form \
flux and its type IIA T-duals.\\nOne motivation is to understand the solution \
of this theory based on\\nintegrability. This background is a limit of a 1/4 \
supersymmetric supergravity\\nsolution describing four intersecting D3-branes \
and represents a consistent\\nembedding of AdS(2)xS(2) into critical \
superstring theory. Its AdS(2)xS(2) part\\nwith corresponding fermions can be \
described by a classically integrable\\nPSU(1,1|2)/SO(1,1)xU(1) supercoset \
sigma-model.\\n  We point out that since the RR 5-form field has non-zero \
components along the\\n6-torus directions one cannot, in general, factorize \
the 10d superstring theory\\ninto the supercoset part plus 6 bosons and 6 \
additional massless fermions.\\nStill, we demonstrate that the full \
superstring model (i) is classically\\nintegrable, at least to quadratic \
order in fermions, and (ii) admits a\\nconsistent classical truncation to the \
supercoset part. Following the analogy\\nwith other integrable backgrounds \
and starting with the finite-gap equations of\\nthe PSU(1,1|2)/SO(1,1)xU(1) \
supercoset we propose a set of asymptotic Bethe\\nansatz equations for a \
subset of the quantum string states.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Sun, 10 Apr 2011 18:39:28 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v2\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Thu, 19 May 2011 14:26:50 GMT\""}]}], "}"}]}], 
                    "}"}]}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2015-05-27\""}]}, {
