          Annotation[#, 
           
           TableForm[{
            "id" -> "1104.1793", "submitter" -> "Konstantin Zarembo", 
             "authors" -> "D. Sorokin, A. Tseytlin, L. Wulff and K. Zarembo", 
             "title" -> "Superstrings in AdS(2)xS(2)xT(6)", "comments" -> 
             "49 pages, 1 figure; v2: misprints corrected, references added", 
             "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> "10.1088/1751-8113/44/27/275401",
              "report-no" -> 
             "MIFPA-11-11, NORDITA-2011-30, Imperial-TP-AT-2011-2", 
             "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> 
             "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", 
             "abstract" -> 
             "  We consider the type IIB Green-Schwarz superstring theory on \
AdS(2)xS(2)xT(6)\nsupported by homogeneous Ramond-Ramond 5-form flux and its \
type IIA T-duals.\nOne motivation is to understand the solution of this \
theory based on\nintegrability. This background is a limit of a 1/4 \
supersymmetric supergravity\nsolution describing four intersecting D3-branes \
and represents a consistent\nembedding of AdS(2)xS(2) into critical \
superstring theory. Its AdS(2)xS(2) part\nwith corresponding fermions can be \
described by a classically integrable\nPSU(1,1|2)/SO(1,1)xU(1) supercoset \
sigma-model.\n  We point out that since the RR 5-form field has non-zero \
components along the\n6-torus directions one cannot, in general, factorize \
the 10d superstring theory\ninto the supercoset part plus 6 bosons and 6 \
additional massless fermions.\nStill, we demonstrate that the full \
superstring model (i) is classically\nintegrable, at least to quadratic order \
in fermions, and (ii) admits a\nconsistent classical truncation to the \
supercoset part. Following the analogy\nwith other integrable backgrounds and \
starting with the finite-gap equations of\nthe PSU(1,1|2)/SO(1,1)xU(1) \
supercoset we propose a set of asymptotic Bethe\nansatz equations for a \
subset of the quantum string states.\n", 
             "versions" -> {{
               "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
                "Sun, 10 Apr 2011 18:39:28 GMT"}, {
               "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
                "Thu, 19 May 2011 14:26:50 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
             "2015-05-27", 
             "authors_parsed" -> {{"Sorokin", "D.", ""}, {
               "Tseytlin", "A.", ""}, {"Wulff", "L.", ""}, {
               "Zarembo", "K.", ""}}}], "Tooltip"]& ]}, 
