 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We investigate the two- and three-point correlation \
functions of the dyonic\\nmagnon and spike, which correspond to the solitonic \
string moving in the\\nPoincare AdS and three-dimensional sphere. We show \
that the coupling between\\ntwo dyonic magnons or spikes together with a \
marginal scalar operator in the\\nstring theory is exactly the same as one \
obtained by the RG analysis in the\\ngauge theory.\\n\""}]}, {
