 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  This is a comprehensive review of the worldsheet \
techniques for the\\nquantization of type IIB superstring theory on the AdS_5 \
x S^5 background,\\nusing the pure spinor formalism. Particular emphasis is \
devoted to AdS/CFT\\napplications, with several examples worked out in \
details. The review is\\nself-contained and pedagogical. Table of contents: \
1) Introduction; 2)\\nGeneralities; 3) Supercoset sigma models; 4) Quantum \
effective action and\\nconformal invariance; 5) String spectrum; 6) \
Integrability.\\n\""}]}, {
