 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We present a new, two-parameter family of string \
solutions corresponding to\\nthe holographic duals of specific 1/8-BPS Wilson \
loops on S^2 in N = 4\\nsupersymmetric Yang-Mills theory. The solutions are \
obtained using the dressing\\nmethod on the known longitude solution in the \
context of the auxiliary\\nsigma-model on S^3 put forth in \
arXiv:0905.0665[hep-th]. We verify that the\\nregularized area of the \
worldsheets are consistent with expectations.\\n\""}]}, {
