            "  We study analytical properties of the five-loop anomalous \
dimension of\ntwist-2 operators at negative even values of Lorentz spin. \
Following L. N.\nLipatov and A. I. Onishchenko, we have found two possible \
generalizations of\ndouble-logarithmic equation, which allow to predict a lot \
of poles of anomalous\ndimension of twist-2 operators at all orders of \
perturbative theory from the\nknown results. Second generalization is related \
with the reciprocity-respecting\nfunction, which is a single-logarithmic \
