 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We consider pulsating strings in Lunin-Maldacena \
backgrounds, specifically in\\ndeformed Minkowski spacetime and deformed \
AdS_5xS^5. We find the relation\\nbetween the energy and the oscillation \
number of the pulsating string when the\\ndeformation is small. Since the \
oscillation number is an adiabatic invariant it\\ncan be used to explore the \
regime of highly excited string states. We then\\nquantize the string and \
look for such a sector. For the deformed Minkowski\\nbackground we find a \
precise match with the classical results if the\\noscillation number is \
quantized as an even number. For the deformed AdS_5xS^5\\nwe find a \
contribution which depends on the deformation parameter.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
