               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We investigate the quantum integrability of the \
Alday-Arutyunov-Frolov (AAF)\\nmodel by calculating the three-particle \
scattering amplitude at the first\\nnon-trivial order and showing that the \
S-matrix is factorizable at this order.\\nWe consider a more general \
fermionic model and find a necessary constraint to\\nensure its integrability \
at quantum level. We then show that the quantum\\nintegrability of the AAF \
model follows from this constraint. In the process, we\\nalso correct some \
missed points in earlier works.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
