 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We develop N=4 d=4 bi-harmonic superspace and use it to \
derive a novel form\\nfor the low-energy effective action in N=4 super \
Yang-Mills theory. We solve\\nthe N=4 supergauge constraints in this \
superspace in terms of analytic\\nsuperfields. Using these superfields, we \
construct a simple functional that\\nrespects N=4 supersymmetry and scale \
invariance. In components, it reproduces\\nall on-shell terms in the \
four-derivative part of the N=4 SYM effective action;\\nin particular, the \
F^4/X^4 and Wess-Zumino terms. The latter comes out in a\\nnovel SO(3) x \
SO(3)-invariant form.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
