Operators in\n  the AdS/CFT Correspondence", "comments" -> 
            "40 pages, 6 figures, 6 appendices. Minor corrections", 
            "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> "10.1007/JHEP08(2011)133", 
            "report-no" -> "Imperial/TP/2011/LIU/01", "categories" -> 
            "hep-th", "license" -> 
