 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Following the recent progress on the calculation of \
three-point correlators\\nwith two \\\"heavy\\\" (with large quantum numbers) \
and one \\\"light\\\" states at strong\\ncoupling, we compute the logarithmic \
divergent terms of leading bosonic quantum\\ncorrections to correlation \
functions with \\\"heavy\\\" operators corresponding to\\nsimple string \
solutions in AdS_5 x S^5. The \\\"light\\\" operator is chosen to be\\nthe \
dilaton. An important relation connecting the corrections to both \
the\\ndimensions of \\\"heavy\\\" states, and the structure constants is \
recovered.\\n\""}]}, {
