 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We construct integrability preserving boundary \
conditions for Green-Schwarz\\nsigma-models on semi-symmetric spaces. The \
boundary conditions are expressed as\\ngluing conditions of the \
flat-connection, using an involutive metric preserving\\nautomorphism. We \
show that the boundary conditions preserve half of the\\nspace-time \
supersymmetry and an infinite set of conserved charges. We find\\nintegrable \
D-brane configurations for AdS_5 x S^5 and AdS_4 x CP^3 \
backgrounds.\\n\""}]}, {
