               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Recently there has been progress on the calculation of \
three-point functions\\nwith two \\\"heavy\\\" operators via semiclassical \
methods. We extend this analysis\\nto the case of the Lunin-Maldacena \
background, and examine the suggested\\nprocedure for several simple string \
solutions. By making use of AdS/CFT\\nduality, we derive the relevant \
correlation functions of operators belonging to\\nthe dual N=1 superconformal \
gauge theory, and recover an important relation\\nconnecting the dimensions \
