               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"1106.4978\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Alexander Krikun\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"P. N. Kopnin, A. Krikun\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Wilson loops in holographic models with a gluon \
condensate\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"24 pages, 6 figures\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1103/PhysRevD.84.066002\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"ITEP-TH-19/11\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th hep-ph\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The aim of this work is to study the holographic dual \
to the gauge theory\\nwith a nonzero gluon condensate. We check for \
consistency the holographic way\\nof describing the condensate and calculate \
the expectation value of a small\\nWilson loop in the presence of the gluon \
condensate, thus obtaining the\\nrelevant coefficient in the operator product \
expansion of the small loop in\\ndifferent holographic models. We also study \
the effect of the condensate on the\\nGross-Ooguri phase transition in the \
correlator of two circular Wilson loops in\\nparallel and concentric \
configurations. In the numerical study of the\\nconcentric case, we find that \
the phase transition changes its order when the\\nsize of the loops is of \
order of the gluon condensate. We report this change of\\nthe phase \
transition order to be a new effect in Wilson loop correlators.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Fri, 24 Jun 2011 14:30:25 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2013-05-29\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
