 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We compute semiclassical three-point correlation \
function, or structure\\nconstant, of two finite-size (dyonic) giant magnon \
string states and a light\\ndilaton mode in the Lunin-Maldacena background, \
which is the \\\\gamma-deformed,\\nor TsT-transformed AdS_5 x \
S_{\\\\gamma}^5, dual to N = 1 super Yang-Mills theory.\\nWe also prove that \
an important relation between the structure constant and the\\nconformal \
dimension, checked for the N = 4 super Yang-Mills case, still holds\\nfor the \
\\\\gamma-deformed string background.\\n\""}]}, {
