 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We construct the operator product expansions (OPE) of \
the chiral primary\\noperators in the worldsheet theory for strings on AdS_3 \
x S^3 x T^4. As an\\ninteresting application, we will use the worldsheet OPEs \
to derive a recursion\\nrelation for a particular class of extremal p-point \
correlators on the sphere.\\nWe compare our result with the corresponding \
recursion relation previously\\nfound in the symmetric orbifold theory on the \
boundary of AdS_3.\\n\""}]}, {
