               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We evaluate three-point correlation functions of single \
trace operators in\\nN=4 SYM at both weak and strong coupling. We focus on \
the case where two of the\\noperators belong in a SL(2) sub-sector, and are \
dual to string solutions in a\\nbroad class of solutions with large S and J \
charges, while the third operator\\nis a BPS state. Perfect agreement between \
the structure constants at weak and\\nstrong coupling is found. Finally, \
comments on this matching, as well as on the\\nspace-time structure of the \
correlators, are given.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
