 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Using integrability techniques, we compute four-point \
functions of single\\ntrace gauge-invariant operators in N=4 SYM to leading \
order at weak coupling.\\nOur results are valid for operators of arbitrary \
size. In particular, we study\\nthe limit in which two of the four operators \
are taken to be much smaller than\\nthe others. We show that in this limit \
our weak coupling result matches with\\nthe strong coupling result in the \
Frolov-Tseytlin limit.\\n\""}]}, {
