 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Recently there has been progress on the computation of \
two- and three-point\\ncorrelation functions with two \\\"heavy\\\" states \
via semiclassical methods. We\\nextend this analysis to the case of AdS_5 \
\\\\times T^(1,1), and examine the\\nsuggested procedure for the case of \
several simple string solutions. By making\\nuse of AdS/CFT duality, we \
derive the relevant correlation functions of\\noperators belonging to the \
dual gauge theory.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
