             "abstract" -> 
             "  We study tunneling pair creation of W-Bosons by an external \
electric field on\nthe Coulomb branch of N=4 supersymmetric Yang-Mills \
theory. We use AdS/CFT\nholography to find a generalization of Schwinger's \
formula for the pair\nproduction rate to the strong coupling, planar limit \
which includes the\nexchange of virtual massless particles to all orders. We \
find that the pair\ncreation formula has an upper critical electric field \
beyond which the process\nis no longer exponentially suppressed. The value of \
the critical field is\nidentical to that which occurs in the Born-Infeld \
action of probe D3-branes in\nthe AdS5XS5 background.\n", 
