 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study a three-point correlator of the three heavy \
vertex operators\\nrepresenting the circular winding string states which are \
point-like in AdS_5\\nand rotating with two spins and two winding numbers in \
S^5. We restrict\\nourselves to the case that two of the three vertex \
operators are located at the\\nsame point. We evaluate semiclassically the \
specific three-point correlator on\\na stationary splitting string trajectory \
which is mapped to the complex plane\\nwith three punctures. It becomes an \
extremal and 4d conformal invariant\\nthree-point correlator on the boundary. \
The marginality condition of the vertex\\noperator is discussed.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
