 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In [Z.Tsuboi, Nucl. Phys. B 826 (2010) 399 \
[arXiv:0906.2039]], we proposed\\nWronskian-like solutions of the T-system \
for [M,N]-hook of the general linear\\nsuperalgebra gl(M|N). We have \
generalized these Wronskian-like solutions to the\\nones for the general \
T-hook, which is a union of [M1,N1]-hook and [M2,N2]-hook\\n(M=M1+M1, \
N=N1+N2). These solutions are related to Weyl-type supercharacter\\nformulas \
of infinite dimensional unitarizable modules of gl(M|N). Our solutions\\nalso \
include a Wronskian-like solution discussed in [N.Gromov, \
V.Kazakov,\\nS.Leurent, Z.Tsuboi, JHEP 1101 (2011) 155 [arXiv:1010.2720]] in \
relation to the\\nAdS5/CFT4 spectral problem.\\n\""}]}, {
