               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Using a recent conjecture of Basso we compute three \
leading nontrivial\\ncoefficients in the strong coupling expansion of the \
anomalous dimensions of\\nshort operators in the sl2 sector of AdS/CFT. We \
show that our results are\\nconsistent with the numerical results obtained \
using the Y-system and TBA\\napproach earlier thus providing further support \
to the Y-system conjecture.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
