 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Using integrability and analyticity properties of the \
AdS5/CFT4 Y-system we\\nreduce it to a finite set of nonlinear integral \
equations. The Z4 symmetry of\\nthe underlying coset sigma model, in its \
quantum version, allows for a deeper\\ninsight into the analyticity structure \
of the underlying Y-functions and\\nT-functions, as well as for their \
analyticity friendly parameterization in\\nterms of Wronskian determinants of \
Q-functions. As a check for the new\\nequations, we reproduce the numerical \
results for the Konishi operator\\npreviously obtained from the original \
infinite Y-system.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
