 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We discuss and extend recent conjectures relating \
partial null limits of\\ncorrelation functions of local gauge invariant \
operators and the expectation\\nvalue of null polygonal Wilson loops and \
local gauge invariant operators. We\\npoint out that a particular partial \
null limit provides a strategy for the\\ncalculation of the anomalous \
dimension of short twist-two operators at weak and\\nstrong \
coupling.\\n\""}]}, {
