               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"62 pages;v2 Typos and equation (3.7) corrected. \
Clarifying remarks\\n  added in Section 4.1. Published version;v3 Minor \
errors found in version 2\\n  are corrected. For explanation of the revision, \
see Erratum published in\\n  \
http://www.springerlink.com/content/m67055235407vx67/?MUD=MP\""}]}, {
               
