                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  The spectrum of an infinite spinning string in AdS(5) \
does not precisely\\nmatch the spectrum of dual gauge theory operators, \
interpolated to the strong\\ncoupling regime with the help of Bethe-ansatz \
equations. We show that the\\nmismatch is due to interactions in the string \
sigma-model which cannot be\\nneglected even at asymptotically large 't Hooft \
coupling.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
