                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study operators in the sl(2) sector of N=4 SYM in \
the generalised scaling\\nlimit, where the spin is large and the length of \
the operator scales with the\\nlogarithm of the spin. At leading order in the \
large spin expansion the scaling\\ndimension at strong coupling is given in \
terms of the free energy of the O(6)\\nmodel. We investigate the first \
subleading corrections to the scaling dimension\\nand find that these too can \
be derived from the O(6) model in the strong\\ncoupling limit.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
