and\n  AdS(2) x S(2) x T(6) superbackgrounds", "comments" -> 
            "28 pages; v2: References added", "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> 
            "10.1007/JHEP01(2012)004", "report-no" -> "MIFPA-11-50", 
