 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  This (rather subjective) review sums up few years of \
work devoted to explain\\nvarious aspects of high energy heavy ion collisions \
using the AdS/CFT\\ncorrespondence. The central issue of is is formation of \
the trapped surface\\n(black hole) phenomenon, seen by a distant observer as \
the entropy production.\\nWe end up discussing an issue of classical \
gravitational radiation by an\\nultrarelativistic falling body and the so \
called breaking self-force related to\\nit.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
