               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"1112.5182\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"S. Prem Kumar\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Benedict Fraser and S. Prem Kumar\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Large rank Wilson loops in N=2 superconformal QCD at \
strong coupling\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Typos corrected, reference added, replaced with version \
to appear in\\n  JHEP (25 pages, 2 figures)\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP03(2012)077\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We compute the expectation values of circular Wilson \
loops in large\\nrepresentations at strong coupling, in the large-N limit of \
the N=2\\nsuperconformal theory with SU(N) gauge group and 2N \
hypermultiplets. Employing\\nPestun's matrix integral, we focus attention on \
symmetric and antisymmetric\\nrepresentations with ranks of order N. We find \
that large rank antisymmetric\\nloops are independent of the coupling at \
strong 't Hooft coupling while\\nsymmetric Wilson loops grow exponentially \
with it. Symmetric loops display a\\nnon-analyticity as a function of the \
rank, characterized by the splitting of a\\nsingle matrix model eigenvalue \
from the continuum, bearing close resemblance to\\nBose-Einstein condensation \
in an ideal gas. We discuss implications of these\\nfor a putative large-N \
string dual. The method of calculation we adopt makes\\nexplicit the \
connection to Fermi and Bose gas descriptions and also suggests \
a\\ntantalizing connection of the above system to a multichannel Kondo model.\
\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Wed, 21 Dec 2011 21:35:40 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
