Tseytlin\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Leading quantum correction to energy of \\\"short\\\" \
spiky strings\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"20 pages, LaTeX, JHEP style\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1088/1751-8113/45/15/155401\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Imperial-TP-AAT-2012-01\""}]}, {
