 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this talk we present a family of Wilson loop \
operators which continuously\\ninterpolates between the 1/2 BPS line and the \
antiparallel lines, and can be\\nthought of as calculating a generalization \
of the quark--antiquark potential\\nfor the gauge theory on S^3 x R. We \
evaluate the first two orders of these\\nloops perturbatively both in the \
gauge and string theory. We obtain analytical\\nexpressions in a systematic \
expansion around the 1/2 BPS configuration, and\\ncomment on possible \
all-loop patterns for these Wilson loops.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
