 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Quantum corrections to three-point functions of scalar \
single trace operators\\nin planar N=4 Super-Yang-Mills theory are studied \
using integrability. At one\\nloop, we find new algebraic structures that not \
only govern all two loop\\ncorrections to the mixing of the operators but \
also automatically incorporate\\nall one loop diagrams correcting the tree \
level Wick contractions. Speculations\\nabout possible extensions of our \
construction to all loop orders are given. We\\nalso match our results with \
the strong coupling predictions in the classical\\n(Frolov-Tseytlin) \
limit.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
