 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this work (which supersedes our previous preprint \
arXiv:1112.2345) we\\ndetermine the expectation value of the N=4$ SU(N) SYM \
Lagrangian density\\noperator in the presence of an infinitely heavy static \
particle in the\\nsymmetric representation of SU(N), by means of a D3-brane \
probe computation.\\nThe result that we obtain coincides with two previous \
computations of different\\nobservables, up to kinematical factors. We argue \
that these agreements go\\nbeyond the D-brane probe approximation, which \
leads us to propose an exact\\nformula for the expectation value of various \
operators. In particular, we\\nprovide an expression for the total energy \
loss by radiation of a heavy\\nparticle in the fundamental representation.\\n\
\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
