 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We consider the operator product expansion of local \
single-trace operators\\ncomposed of the self-dual components of the field \
strength tensor in planar\\nQCD. Using the integrability of the one-loop \
matrix of anomalous dimensions of\\nsuch operators, we obtain a determinant \
expression for certain tree-level\\nstructure constants in the OPE.\\n\""}]}, {
