OSp(4|6)/(SO(1,3)\\n  x U(3)) sigma-model\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"LaTeX, 22 pages; v2: minor improvements in the text, \
typos corrected,\\n  references added\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Int. J. Mod. Phys. A v.27 (2012) 1250118\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1142/S0217751X12501187\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
