Firenze) and Domenico\\n  Seminara (Florence Un. and INFN Firenze)\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Correlators of Hopf Wilson loops in the AdS/CFT \
correspondence\""}]}, {
               
