               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We discuss special quantum group (secret) symmetries of \
the integrable system\\nassociated to the AdS/CFT correspondence. These \
symmetries have by now been\\nobserved in a variety of forms, including the \
spectral problem, the boundary\\nscattering problem, n-point amplitudes, the \
pure-spinor formulation and quantum\\naffine deformations.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
