 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We consider an exremal three-point correlator of three \
heavy vertex operators\\nfor the circular winding string state with one large \
spin and one windining\\nnumber in AdS5 and one large spin and one winding \
number in S5. We use a\\nSchwarz-Christoffel transformation to compute \
semiclassically the extremal\\nthree-point correlator on a stationary string \
trajectory which is mapped to the\\ncomplex plane with three punctures. It \
becomes a 4d conformal invariant\\nthree-point correlator on the boundary. We \
discuss the marginality condition of\\nvertex operator.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
