                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We find a simple parametrization of the anti-symmetric \
giant graviton in\\nAdS_4 x CP^3, first constructed in arXiv:1108.3084 \
[hep-th], dual to the\\nanti-symmetric Schur polynomial involving two \
bi-fundamental complex scalar\\nfields of ABJM theory. Using this \
parametrization we evaluate in a\\nsemi-classical approach the three-point \
function of two such giant gravitons\\nand one point-like graviton \
considering both extremal and non-extremal\\nconfigurations. We likewise \
discuss the case of the symmetric giant graviton in\\nAdS_4 x CP^3. Finally, \
we provide an expression for the planar three-point\\nfunction of chiral \
primary operators in ABJM at strong coupling and find that\\nthe results for \
the giant graviton three-point functions reduce to this\\nexpression in the \
point-like limit.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
