           "id" -> "1205.2060", "submitter" -> "Zoltan Bajnok", "authors" -> 
            "Zoltan Bajnok, Rafael I. Nepomechie, Laszlo Palla, Ryo Suzuki", 
            "title" -> "Y-system for Y=0 brane in planar AdS/CFT", "comments" -> 
            "25 pages, minor corrections, references added", "journal-ref" -> 
            Null, "doi" -> "10.1007/JHEP08(2012)149", "report-no" -> 
            "UMTG-274; ITP-UU-12/15; SPIN-12/13; ITP-Budapest Report 660", 
            "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  The spectrum of open strings with integrable Y=0 brane \
boundary conditions is\nanalyzed in planar AdS/CFT. We give evidence that it \
can be described by the\nsame Y-system that governs the spectrum of closed \
strings in AdS_5xS^5, except\nwith different asymptotic and analytical \
properties. We determine the\nasymptotic solution of the Y-system that is \
consistent both with boundary\nasymptotic Bethe ansatz and boundary Luscher \
corrections.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Wed, 9 May 2012 18:36:57 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
