 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In a previous paper, arXiv:1204.3096, we have shown \
that the fully dynamical\\nthree-point correlation functions of BMN operators \
are identical at the tree\\nlevel in the planar limit of perturbative field \
theory and, on the string\\ntheory side, calculated by means of the \
Dobashi-Yoneya three string vertex in\\nthe Penrose limit. Here we present a \
one-loop calculation of the same quantity\\nboth on the field-theory and \
string-theory side, where a complete identity\\nbetween the two results is \
demonstrated.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
