            "D. V. Uvarov", "title" -> 
            "Lagrangian mechanics of massless superparticle on AdS_4 x CP^3\n \
 superbackground", "comments" -> 
            "LaTeX, 16 pages. v2: minor improvements in the text, typos \
corrected,\n  reference added. Version accepted to Nucl. Phys. B", 
            "journal-ref" -> "Nuclear Physics B v.867 (2013) 354-369", "doi" -> 
            "10.1016/j.nuclphysb.2012.10.008", "report-no" -> Null, 
            "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  Massless superparticle model is considered on the \
OSp(4|6)/(SO(1,3) x U(3))\nsupercoset manifold and in the AdS_4 x CP^3 \
superspace. In the former case\nintegrability of the equations of motion is \
rather obvious, while for the AdS_4\nx CP^3 superparticle we prove \
integrability in the partial kappa-symmetry gauge\nfor which 4 anticommuting \
coordinates related to the broken conformal\nsupersymmetry are set to zero. \
This allows us to propose expression for the Lax\npair that may encode \
complete equations of motion for the AdS_4 x CP^3\nsuperparticle.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Thu, 24 May 2012 10:08:21 GMT"}, {
