 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study rigidly rotating strings in the near horizon \
geometry of the 1+1\\ndimensional intersection of two orthogonal stacks of \
NS5-branes, the so called\\nI-brane background. We solve the equations of \
motion of the fundamental string\\naction in the presence of two form NS-NS \
fluxes that the I-brane background\\nsupports and write down general form of \
conserved quantities. We further find\\nout two limiting cases corresponding \
to giant magnon and single spike like\\nstrings in various parameter space of \
solutions.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
