 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study rigidly rotating strings in AdS5 X S5 \
background with one spin along\\nAdS5 and three angular momenta along S5. We \
find dispersion relations among\\nvarious charges and interpret them as giant \
magnon and spiky string solutions\\nin various limits. Further we present an \
example of oscillating string which\\noscillates in the radial direction of \
the AdS5 and at the same time rotates in\\nS5.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
