 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We review the background field method for \
three-dimensional Yang-Mills and\\nChern-Simons models in N=2 superspace. \
Superfield proper time (heat kernel)\\ntechniques are developed and exact \
expressions of heat kernels for constant\\nbackgrounds are presented. The \
background field method and heat kernel\\ntechniques are applied for \
evaluating the low-energy effective actions in N=2\\nsupersymmetric \
Yang-Mills and Chern-Simons models as well as in N=4 and N=8 \
SYM\\ntheories.\\n\""}]}, {
