, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  We set up a general scheme to resum ladder diagrams \
for the quark-anti-quark\\npotential in N=4 super-Yang-Mills theory, and do \
explicit calculations at the\\nnext-to-leading order. The results perfectly \
agree with string theory in\\nAdS(5)xS(5) when continued to strong coupling, \
in spite of a potential\\norder-of-limits problem.\\n\""}]}, {
