 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We show that the WZNW model on the Lie supergroup \
GL(1|1) has super\\nPoisson-Lie symmetry with the dual Lie supergroup B + A + \
A1;1|.i. Then, we\\ndiscuss about D-branes and worldsheet boundary conditions \
on supermanifolds, in\\ngeneral, and obtain the algebraic relations on the \
gluing supermatrix for the\\nLie supergroup case. Finally, using the \
supercanonical transformation\\ndescription of the super Poisson-Lie \
T-duality transformation, we obtain\\nformula for the description of the dual \
gluing supermatrix, then, we find the\\ngluing supermatrix for the WZNW model \
on GL(1|1) and its dual model. We also\\ndiscuss about different boundary \
conditions.\\n\""}]}, {
