, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  We study N=2 Yang-Mills theory on S^4 in the large-N \
limit. We find that on a\\nlarge sphere Wilson loops obey a perimeter law and \
that the free energy grows\\nquadratically with the radius of the sphere. We \
also comment on the large-N\\nlimit of the N=2* theory, and on the free \
energy in N=2 and N=4 superconformal\\ntheories.\\n\""}]}, {
