                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In the hybrid formulation of string theory on AdS_3 x \
S^3, the\\ncompactification-independent physical spectrum at the first \
massive level is\\ndetermined. We find that these states transform in \
representations of the Lie\\nsuperalgebra psl(2|2) and present a \
cohomological characterisation of them\\nwithin the context of the PSL(2|2) \
WZW model. We conjecture that a similar\\ncohomological description of the \
physical states also exists at higher mass\\nlevels and give partial evidence \
for this by comparing our results to the RNS\\nstring spectrum.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
