                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this note we study type II superstring theory on the \
direct product of\\nAdS3, the squashed three-sphere and a four-torus (AdS3 \\\
\\times SqS3 \\\\times T4).\\nWe derive explicitly the Green-Schwarz action \
and discuss in detail the hidden\\nintegrable structure corresponding to \
local and non-local currents. We find\\nthat the model is classically \
integrable and that the currents generate a full\\npsu(1, 1|2) superalgebra, \
even though the corresponding spacetime isometries\\nare broken by the \
squashing.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
