 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We construct the action for the pure spinor superstring \
in the coset\\ndescription of AdS_4 x CP^3 superspace, using the variables \
which solve the\\npure spinor condition. As a test of the consistency of the \
approach, we use the\\nbackground field method to verify the absence of \
central charge at the second\\norder in the expansion and to show the \
one-loop finiteness of the effective\\naction.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
