(Parma Un.\\n  and INFN Parma), G. Martelloni (Florence Un. and INFN Firenze) \
and D.\\n  Seminara (Florence Un. and INFN Firenze)\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"New supersymmetric Wilson loops in ABJ(M) theories\""}]}, {
               
