               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We investigate the classical integrability of the \
Alday-Arutyunov-Frolov\\nmodel, and show that the Lax connection can be \
reduced to a simpler 2 x 2\\nrepresentation. Based on this result, we \
calculate the algebra between the\\nL-operators and find that it has a highly \
non-ultralocal form. We then employ\\nand make a suitable generalization of \
the regularization technique proposed by\\nMaillet for a simpler class of \
non-ultralocal models, and find the\\ncorresponding r- and s-matrices. We \
also make a connection between the\\noperator-regularization method proposed \
earlier for the quantum case, and the\\nMaillet's symmetric limit \
regularization prescription used for non-ultralocal\\nalgebras in the \
classical theory.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
