 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We calculate non-extremal correlators of Schur \
polynomials and single trace\\noperators. We analyse their dual descriptions \
from the approach of the\\nvariation of DBI and WZ actions of the giant \
gravitons. We show a\\nregularization procedure under which the extremal \
correlators of Schur\\npolynomials and single trace operators match exactly \
with string theory\\ncomputation. Other aspects of the extremal and \
non-extremal correlators are\\nalso discussed.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
