            "20 pages, 1 figure. v2: minor changes, JHEP version", 
            "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> "10.1007/JHEP08(2013)015", 
            "report-no" -> "YITP-SB-12-38", "categories" -> "hep-th", 
            "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  We study the integrability properties of planar N=2 \
superconformal field\ntheories in four dimensions. We show that the spin \
chain associated to the\nplanar dilation operator of N=2 superconformal QCD \
fails to be integrable at\ntwo loops. In our analysis we focus on a closed \
SU(2|1) sector, whose two-loop\nspin chain we fix by symmetry arguments (up \
to a few undetermined\ncoefficients). It turns out that the Yang-Baxter \
equation for magnon scattering\nis not satisfied in this sector. On the other \
hand, we suggest that the closed\nSU(2,1|2) sector, which exists in any N=2 \
superconformal gauge theory, may be\nintegrable to all loops.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Thu, 1 Nov 2012 19:58:38 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Mon, 8 Jul 2013 16:50:52 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2015-06-12", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"Gadde", "Abhijit", ""}, {
              "Liendo", "Pedro", ""}, {"Rastelli", "Leonardo", ""}, {
              "Yan", "Wenbin", ""}}}], "Tooltip"]& ], 
