                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Semiclassical equivalence of Green-Schwarz and \
Pure-Spinor/Hybrid\\n  formulations of superstrings in AdS(5) x S(5) and \
AdS(2) x S(2) x T(6)\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"28 pages; v2: minor corrections, references \
updated\""}]}, {
