                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We compute perturbative worldsheet S-matrix of \
beta-deformed AdS/CFT in the\\nstrong and weak `t Hooft coupling limit to \
compare with exact S-matrix. For the\\npurpose we take near BMN limit of \
TsT-transformed AdS_5 x S^5 with the twisted\\nboundary condition and compute \
the S-matrix on worldsheet using light-cone\\ngauge fixed Lagrangian. For the \
weak coupling side, we compute the S-matrix in\\nthe SU(3) sector by applying \
coordinate Bethe ansatz method to the one-loop\\ndilatation operator obtained \
from the deformed super Yang-Mills theory. These\\nanalysis support the \
conjectured exact S-matrix in the leading order for both\\nsides of \
beta-deformed AdS/CFT along with appropriate twisted \
boundary\\nconditions.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
