 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We propose exact $S$-matrices for the AdS_3/CFT_2 \
duality between Type IIB\\nstrings on AdS_3 x S^3 x M_4 with M_4=S^3 x S^1 or \
T^4 and the corresponding\\ntwo-dimensional conformal field theories. We fix \
the complete two-particle\\nS-matrices for both those cases of AdS_3/CFT_2, \
on the basis of the symmetries\\nsu(1|1) and su(1|1) x su(1|1), respectively \
preserved by their vacua. A crucial\\njustification comes from the derivation \
of the all-loop Bethe ansatz matching\\nexactly the recent conjecture \
proposed by [1] and [2].\\n\""}]}, {
