               RowBox[{
                "\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Daniele Marmiroli\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Daniele Marmiroli\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Resumming planar diagrams for the N=6 ABJM cusped Wilson \
loop in\\n  light-cone gauge\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"41 pages\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We analyse a light-like cusped Wilson loop in N=6 \
superconformal Chern-Simons\\ntheory at both weak and strong coupling in \
light-cone gauge. At the second\\norder in the 't Hooft coupling $\\\\lambda$ \
the correct cusp anomalous dimension\\n$\\\\Gamma_{\\\\rm cusp}=-\\\\phi / 2 \
\\\\lambda^2$ is recovered through a deformation of\\nthe contour that takes \
both rays of the cusp slightly off of the light-cone.\\nThe strong coupling \
behaviour is addressed by means of the Bethe-Salpeter\\nequation for ladders \
of tree-level gauge propagators and ladders of one-loop\\ncorrected gauge \
propagators. It turns out that, as might be expected, the\\ncontribution of \
Chern-Simons tree-level propagators is insensitive of the cusp\\nangle \
$\\\\phi$. On the other hand, corrected propagators lead to an \
exponential\\nlarge $\\\\lambda$ behaviour $\\\\Gamma_{\\\\rm cusp} \\\\sim \
\\\\exp\\\\sqrt{\\\\lambda\\\\phi}$\\nwhich, though, disagrees with the \
AdS/CFT predictions in the power of $\\\\phi$.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Tue, 20 Nov 2012 20:54:27 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2012-11-21\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"Marmiroli\"", ",", "\"Daniele\"", ",", "\"\""}], "}"}],
                    "}"}]}]}}, RowSpacings -> 1, ColumnAlignments -> Left, 
