               RowBox[{
                "\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Ville Ker\\\\\\\"anen\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Ville Keranen\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Non-equilibrium Wilson loops in N=4 SYM\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"24 pages, 7 figures. Parts of the text rewritten. Section \
5 has been\\n  expanded. Agrees with the published version\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Phys. Rev. D 88, 105022 (2013)\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1103/PhysRevD.88.105022\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Nordita-2012-92; RH-11-2012\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We consider rectangular Wilson loops in certain \
non-equilibrium quantum\\nstates in N=4 SYM at weak coupling, prepared with a \
quantum quench. We find\\nthat in the ladder approximation, the \
Bethe-Salpeter equation can be reduced to\\nsolving a massive 1+1 dimensional \
wave-equation with a leaking boundary\\ncondition leading to a quasinormal \
behavior analogous to what is found in\\nstudying dynamics of fields in black \
hole backrounds. Furthermore, we find that\\nthe Wilson loops with size L \
approach a thermal form after time T=L/2. The\\nthermal form found in the \
current paper follows from the particular initial\\nstate chosen.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
