                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"41 pages, 4 figures. v2: corrected a misprint in appendix \
E, updated\\n  references, corrected some typos. v3: added a new appendix F \
with comparison\\n  to the literature, changed notation for the crossing \
equations, added\\n  references. Published version\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 1304 (2013) 113\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP04(2013)113\""}]}, {
               
