Tseytlin\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Quantum corrections to spinning superstrings in AdS_3 x \
S^3 x M^4:\\n  determining the dressing phase\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"34 pages; v2: typos fixed, references added, minor \
corrections; v3:\\n  some explanations and sect.4.4 are added; references \
added\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 1304 (2013) 006\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP04(2013)006\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Imperial-TP-AAT-2012-07, ITEP/TH-56/12\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the leading quantum string correction to the \
dressing phase in the\\nasymptotic Bethe Ansatz system for superstring in \
AdS_3 x S^3 x T^4 supported\\nby RR flux. We find that the phase should be \
different from the BES phase\\nappearing in the AdS_5 x S^5 case. We use the \
simplest example of a rigid\\ncircular string with two equal spins in S^3 and \
also consider the general\\napproach based on the algebraic curve \
description. We also discuss the case of\\nthe AdS_3 x S^3 x S^3 x S^1 theory \
and find the dependence of the 1-loop\\ncorrection to the effective string \
tension function h(\\\\lambda) (expected to\\nenter the magnon dispersion \
relation) on the parameters alpha related to the\\nratio of the two 3-sphere \
radii. This correction vanishes in the AdS_3 x S^3 x\\nT^4 case.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
