 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In the framework of the semiclassical approach, we find \
the leading\\nfinite-size effects on the normalized structure constants in \
some three-point\\ncorrelation functions in AdS_5 x S^5, expressed in terms \
of the conserved\\nstring angular momenta J_1, J_2, and the worldsheet \
momentum p_w, identified\\nwith the momentum p of the magnon excitations in \
the dual spin-chain arising in\\nN=4 SYM in four dimensions.\\n\""}]}, {
