 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  For the homogeneous configuration given by the long \
string limit of the\\nfolded string with a spin in AdS3 and a spin and a \
winding number in S1, we\\nsolve the auxiliary linear problem in the \
finite-gap method and construct the\\nLax operator to obtain an algebraic \
curve. We show that the long spiky string\\nin AdS_3 has the same algebraic \
curve as the null cusp Wilson loop. The\\nalgebraic curve for the circular \
winding string in AdS3xS1 is evaluated. The\\nVirasoro constraint is \
discussed to characterize the branch points of each\\ncurve.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
