                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the planar asymptotic dilatation operator of \
ABJM theory in the\\nSU(2) x SU(2) sector up to eight loops. Combining Bethe \
Ansatz techniques and N\\n= 2 superspace methods, we are able to fix all the \
coefficients appearing in\\nthe maximal-reshuffling terms. In particular, we \
can directly compute from\\nFeynman diagrams the leading order coefficient of \
the dressing phase and find\\nan agreement with the relation conjectured by \
Gromov and Vieira between the\\nABJM and N = 4 SYM phase factor.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
