                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this paper we study the three-point correlation \
functions of two scalar\\noperators with large conformal dimensions and the \
R-current or stress-energy\\ntensor at strong coupling with the help of the \
AdS_4/CFT_3 correspondence. The\\nscalar operators are dual to semiclassical \
strings in AdS_4 x CP^3, which are\\npoint-like in AdS. We establish thorough \
concordance between string theory\\nresults at large coupling constant and \
general predictions coming from Ward\\nidentities in the dual \
three-dimensional superconformal gauge theory.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
