 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We bootstrap the all-loop dynamic S-matrix for the \
homogeneous psu(1,1|2)^2\\nspin-chain believed to correspond to the \
discretization of the massive modes of\\nstring theory on AdS_3 x S^3 x T^4. \
The S-matrix is the tensor product of two\\ncopies of the su(1|1)^2 invariant \
S-matrix constructed recently for the\\nd(2,1;alpha)^2 chain, and depends on \
two antisymmetric dressing phases. We\\nwrite down the crossing equations \
that these phases have to satisfy.\\nFurthermore, we present the \
corresponding Bethe Ansatz, which differs from the\\none previously \
conjectured, and discuss how our construction matches several\\nrecent \
perturbative calculations.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
