                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  This study analyzes the geometrical relationship \
between a classical string\\nand its semi-classical quantum model. From an \
arbitrary $(2+1)-$dimensional\\ngeometry, a specific ansatz for a classical \
string is used to generate a\\nsemi-classical quantum model. In this \
framework, examples of quantum\\noscillations and quantum free particles are \
presented that uniquely determine a\\nclassical string and the space-time \
geometry where its motion takes place.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
