Wallet\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Noncommutative gauge theories on \
$\\\\mathbb{R}^2_\\\\theta$ as matrix models\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"22 pages. References and subsections added. Discussion in \
Section 4\\n  improved\""}]}, {
               
