generalized\nunitarity we construct the terms with logarithmic dependence on \
external\nmomenta at one- and two-loop order in the worldsheet S matrix for \
strings in a\ngeneral integrable worldsheet theory. We also discuss aspects \
of calculations\nat higher orders. The S-matrix elements are expressed as \
sums of integrals with\ncoefficients given in terms of tree-level worldsheet \
