 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this article we exhibit explicitly the matrix model \
($\\\\theta=\\\\infty$)\\nfixed point of phi-four theory on noncommutative \
spacetime with only two\\nnoncommuting directions using the Wilson \
renormalization group recursion\\nformula and the 1/N expansion of the zero \
dimensional reduction and then\\ncalculate the mass critical exponent \
$\\\\nu$ and the anomalous dimension $\\\\eta$\\nin various dimensions \
.\\n\""}]}, {
