                 "\"Supersymmetric Wilson loops with general contours in ABJM \
theory\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"v2: 17 pages, no figure. The result of arXiv:1209.4032 is \
cited more\\n  appropriately\""}]}, {
