added; v3:\\n  typos fixed, references updated; v4: typos fixed\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 1310 (2013) 036\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP10(2013)036\""}]}, {
