                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this article the quantum fluctuation of a rigid and \
static string is\\nreported to be identical to a free quantum particle. \
Solutions similar to this\\nstatic string have already been found in the \
semi-classical quantizaton of\\npulsating strings, and our results show that \
the semi-classical quantization of\\npulsating strings is, in some cases, a \
perturbation of static strings. We also\\ninterpret the energy of the static \
string as a lower bound for the pulsating\\nstring and speculate about a \
description of quantum mechanics in terms of\\nsemi-classical string \
theory.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
