 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We derive the energy of pulsating string, as function \
of oscillation number\\nand angular momenta, which oscillates in AdS3 with an \
extra angular momentum\\nalong S1. We find similar solutions for the strings \
oscillating in S3 in\\naddition to extra angular momentum. Further we \
generalize the result of the\\noscillating strings in Anti de-Sitter space in \
the presence of both spin and\\nangular momentum in AdS5 x S1.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
