                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We determine the all-loop dressing phases of the \
AdS3/CFT2 integrable system\\nrelated to type IIB string theory on AdS3 x S3 \
x T4 by solving the recently\\nfound crossing relations and studying their \
singularity structure. The two\\nresulting phases present a novel structure \
with respect to the ones appearing\\nin AdS5/CFT4 and AdS4/CFT3. In the \
strongly-coupled regime, their leading order\\nreduces to the universal \
Arutyunov-Frolov-Staudacher phase as expected. We also\\ncompute their \
sub-leading order and compare it with recent one-loop\\nperturbative results, \
and comment on their weak-coupling expansion.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
