  Derivation", "comments" -> 
            "17 pages. v2 has new sections 3.2 and 3.3, fixes typos, adds\n  \
references", "journal-ref" -> "J.Phys. A46 (2013) 445401", "doi" -> 
            "10.1088/1751-8113/46/44/445401", "report-no" -> Null, 
            "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> 
