            "  We derive the low-energy effective action for the spinning \
(GKP) string in\nAdS(3) x S(3) x M(4) where M(4) = S(3) x S(1) or T(4). In \
the first case the\naction consists of two O(4) non-linear sigma models which \
are coupled through\ntheir interaction with four massless Majorana fermions \
(plus one free decoupled\nscalar). While in the second case it consists of \
one O(4) sigma model coupled\nto four Majorana fermions together with four \
free scalars from the T(4). We\nshow that these models are classically \
integrable by constructing their Lax\nconnections.\n", 
