Domenico Seminara\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Perturbative evaluation of circular 1/2 BPS Wilson loops \
in N = 6 Super\\n  Chern-Simons theories\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"32 pages, 5 figures, Referemces added\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP09(2013)157\""}]}, {
