Yoshinori Matsuo\\n  and Shotaro Shiba\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"A new look at instantons and large-N limit\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10 pages\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP05(2014)008\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"YITP-13-50, KEK-TH-1638\""}]}, {
