                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"17 pages, 7 figures, sign error in (20) corrected, \
comment on smooth\\n  space-like contours added, version to appear in \
JHEP\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP11(2013)063\""}]}, {
