            "Exceptional conformal anomaly of null polygonal Wilson loops", 
            "comments" -> 
            "17 pages, 7 figures, sign error in (20) corrected, comment on \
smooth\n  space-like contours added, version to appear in JHEP", 
            "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> "10.1007/JHEP11(2013)063", 
            "report-no" -> "HU-EP-13/32", "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> 
