            "  We analyse the breaking of conformal invariance for null \
polygonal Wilson\nloops in ${\\cal N}=4$ SYM beyond that induced by the UV \
divergences due to the\ncusps. It only shows up in exceptional \
configurations, where the polygon\nintersects the critical light cone of an \
inversion or a special conformal\ntransformation. In comparison with the \
