Daniel\n  Ricci Pacifici", "title" -> "Exact results in N=2 gauge theories", 
            "comments" -> 
            "30 pages, 4 figures. reference added, typos corrected. version\n \
 accepted for publication on JHEP", "journal-ref" -> "JHEP10(2013)178", "doi" -> 
