 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Conformal sigma models and WZW models on coset \
superspaces provide important\\nexamples of logarithmic conformal field \
theories. They possess many\\napplications to problems in string and \
condensed matter theory. We review\\nrecent results and developments, \
including the general construction of WZW\\nmodels on type I supergroups, the \
classification of conformal sigma models and\\ntheir embedding into string \
theory.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
