                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"LaTeX, feynmp, 25 pages, 1 figure; v2: formulations \
improved,\\n  references added, typos corrected, 27 pages; v3: typos \
corrected, one\\n  reference added, matches published version\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
