                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the generation of baryon inhomogeneities in \
regions of the quark\\ngluon plasma which have a charge imbalance. We find \
that the overdensity in the\\nbaryon lumps for positively charged particles \
is different from the overdensity\\ndue to the negatively charged particles. \
Since quarks are charged particles,\\nthe probability of forming neutrons or \
protons in the lumps would thus be\\nchanged. The probability of forming \
hadrons having quarks of the same charges\\nwould be enhanced. This might \
have interesting consequences for the\\ninhomogeneous nucleosynthesis \
calculations.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
