          TableForm[{
           "id" -> "1309.1236", "submitter" -> "Soma Sanyal Dr", "authors" -> 
            "Avijeet Ray and Soma Sanyal", "title" -> 
            "Baryon inhomogeneities in a charged quark gluon plasma", 
            "comments" -> 
            "13 pages, 2 figures, Accepted for publication in Physics Letters \
B", "journal-ref" -> "Physics Letters B 726 (2013) 83", "doi" -> 
            "10.1016/j.physletb.2013.09.007", "report-no" -> Null, 
            "categories" -> "hep-ph astro-ph.CO", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  We study the generation of baryon inhomogeneities in regions \
of the quark\ngluon plasma which have a charge imbalance. We find that the \
overdensity in the\nbaryon lumps for positively charged particles is \
different from the overdensity\ndue to the negatively charged particles. \
Since quarks are charged particles,\nthe probability of forming neutrons or \
protons in the lumps would thus be\nchanged. The probability of forming \
hadrons having quarks of the same charges\nwould be enhanced. This might have \
interesting consequences for the\ninhomogeneous nucleosynthesis calculations.\
\n", "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Thu, 5 Sep 2013 05:48:32 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2015-06-17", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"Ray", "Avijeet", ""}, {
              "Sanyal", "Soma", ""}}}], "Tooltip"]& ], 
