            "  We use the string sigma model action in AdS_5 \\times S^5 to \
reconstruct the\nopen string solution ending on the Wilson loop in S^3\\times \
R parametrized by a\ngeometric angle in S^3 and an angle in flavor space. \
Under the interchange of\nthe world sheet space and time coordinates and the \
T-duality transformation\nwith the radial inversion, the static open string \
configuration associated with\nthe BPS Wilson loop with two equal angle \
parameters becomes a long open\nspinning string configuration which is \
produced by taking the equal limit of\ntwo frequencies for the folded \
spinning closed string with two spins in AdS_5\n\\times S^5.\n", 
