           "id" -> "1310.3752", "submitter" -> "Evgeny Sobko", "authors" -> 
            "Ian Balitsky (Jefferson Lab & Old Dominion U.), Vladimir Kazakov\
\n  (Ecole Normale Superieure & Paris U., VI-VII), Evgeny Sobko (Ecole \
Normale\n  Superieure)", "title" -> 
            "Two-point correlator of twist-2 light-ray operators in N=4 SYM \
in BFKL\n  approximation", "comments" -> "32 pages, 9 figures", "journal-ref" -> 
            Null, "doi" -> Null, "report-no" -> "LPT ENS-13/20", "categories" -> 
            "hep-th", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  We generalize local operators of the leading twist-2 of N=4 \
SYM theory to the\ncase of complex Lorentz spin j using principal series \
representation of\nsl(2,R). We give the direct computation of correlation \
function of two such\nnon-local operators in the BFKL regime when j -> 1. The \
correlator appears to\nhave the expected conformal coordinate dependence \
governed by the anomalous\ndimension of twist-2 operator in NLO BFKL \
approximation predicted by Kotikov\nand Lipatov.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Mon, 14 Oct 2013 17:19:49 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2013-10-15", 
