 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We find the gravity dual of $\\\\mathcal{N}=2^*$ \
super-Yang-Mills theory on\\n$S^4$ and use holography to calculate the \
universal contribution to the\\ncorresponding $S^4$ free energy at large $N$ \
and large 't Hooft coupling. Our\\nresult matches the expression previously \
computed using supersymmetric\\nlocalization in the field theory. This match \
represents a non-trivial precision\\ntest of holography in a non-conformal, \
Euclidean signature setting.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
