           "id" -> "1311.6114", "submitter" -> "Dimo Arnaudov", "authors" -> 
            "D. Arnaudov, R. C. Rashkov, T. Vetsov", "title" -> 
            "On the algebraic curves for circular and folded strings in\n  \
$\\textrm{AdS}_5\\times S^5$", "comments" -> 
            "19 pages, no figures, references added", "journal-ref" -> 
            "Fortschr. Phys. 63, 633 (2015)", "doi" -> Null, "report-no" -> 
            "TUW-13-17", "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  There have been recent advances in the construction of \
algebraic curves for\ncertain classes of string solutions in the context of \
the AdS/CFT\ncorrespondence. In this paper we obtain the Lax operators and \
associated\nspectral curves for circular and folded string solutions in\n$\\,\
\\textrm{AdS}_5\\times S^5$. In addition, we provide an original approach for\
\nthe reconstruction of string solutions in $\\,S^3$ from their corresponding\
\ncurves.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
