 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Using known all-loop results from the BFKL and \
generalized double-logarithmic\\nequations and large spin limit we have \
recomputed the five-loop planar\\nanomalous dimension of twist-2 operators \
without consideration of any wrapping\\neffects. One part of the anomalous \
dimension was calculated in an usual way\\nwith the help of Asymptotic Bethe \
Ansatz. The rest part, related with the\\nwrapping effects, was reconstructed \
from a known constraints with the help of\\nmethods from the numbers \
theory.\\n\""}]}, {
