 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We compute the three-point structure constants for \
short primary operators of\\nN=4 super Yang-Mills theory to leading order in \
the inverse coupling by mapping\\nthe problem to a flat-space string theory \
calculation. We check the validity of\\nour procedure by comparing to known \
results for three chiral primaries. We then\\ncompute the three-point \
functions for any combination of chiral and non-chiral\\nprimaries, with the \
non-chiral primaries all dual to string states at the first\\nmassive level. \
Along the way we find many cancellations that leave us with\\nsimple \
expressions, suggesting that integrability is playing an important \
role.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
