and conformal\\n  window in large-N QCD\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"68 pages, latex; some comments on Veneziano limit \
changed, some typos\\n  fixed\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
