Sommese\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Singular solutions, repeated roots and completeness for \
higher-spin\\n  chains\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"17 pages; many tables provided as supplemental material; \
v2: minor\\n  changes\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
