 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We present a semi-classical description of BPS \
monopoles interacting with\\nWilson lines. The Wilson lines are represented \
as non-Abelian spin impurities.\\nThese spins interact with the monopole \
degrees of freedom through a natural\\nconnection on the moduli space. We \
employ this technology in N = 2 SU(2) gauge\\ntheory to count the number of \
framed BPS states of a single monopole bound to\\nWilson lines in different \
representations.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
