 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this paper, we study the spin chain and string \
excitation in the rotating\\nRindler-$AdS_3$ proposed in [12]. We obtain a \
one-parameter deformed $SL(2)$\\nspin chain at the fast spin limit. Two-spin \
GKP-like solutions are studied at\\nshort and long string limits. General \
ansatz for the giant magnons and the\\nspiky strings are analyzed in detail \
for various $\\\\beta$. At last, we explore\\nits counterpart in analytic \
continuation and pp-wave limit.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
