                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"23 pages. 1 Figure. v2 and v3: coupling corrected, typo \
fixed,\\n  references added. v4: version to appear in JHEP. v5: corrected \
number of\\n  chiral fermions at the intersection\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
