                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We construct the two dimensional N=(0,4) gauge theory \
that lives on the world\\nvolume of D1-branes and intersecting D5-branes. We \
conjecture that this theory\\nflows in the infra-red to a fixed point with \
large N=(4,4) superconformal\\nsymmetry. The central charge of the conformal \
field theory is shown to coincide\\nwith the holographic dual of string \
theory compactified on AdS3 x S3 x S3 x S1.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
