 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In these notes we review the field-theoretical approach \
to the computation of\\nthe scalar product of multi-magnon states in the \
Sutherland limit where the\\nmagnon rapidities condense into one or several \
macroscopic arrays. We formulate\\na systematic procedure for computing the \
1/M expansion of the\\non-shell/off-shell scalar product of M-magnon states \
in the generalised\\nintegrable model with SU(2)-invariant rational R-matrix. \
The coefficients of\\nthe expansion are obtained as multiple contour \
integrals in the rapidity plane.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
