superstring with classical\\nr-matrices. The corresponding classical \
r-matrices are 1) solutions of the\\nclassical Yang-Baxter equation (CYBE), \
2) skew-symmetric, 3) nilpotent and 4)\\nabelian. Hence these should be \
called abelian Jordanian deformations. As a\\nresult, the gravity duals are \
shown to be integrable deformations of AdS_5xS^5.\\nThen, abelian twists of \
