                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We compute the non-planar contribution to the anomalous \
dimension of the\\neight moment of the twist-2 operators in N=4 \
supersymmetric Yang-Mills theory\\nat four loops. This result was obtained \
from the calculations of some elements\\nof the anomalous dimension matrix \
for twist-2 operators with the help of a\\nrelations between its elements and \
eigenvalues. The properties of the obtained\\nresult and a possible relations \
with a planar results are discussed.\\n\""}]}, {
