Alexander\\n  Krikun, Larus Thorlacius, Konstantin Zarembo\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Classical and quantum temperature fluctuations via \
holography\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"LaTeX: 31 pages, 7 figures; V2: reference added; V3: \
added/updated\\n  charged case\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 1501:011,2015\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
