            "  We study giant magnon solutions for strings moving on a \
deformed AdS(3)xS(3)\nbackground. We impose a conformal gauge on the Polyakov \
action and proceed with\nsolving the Virasoro constraints. The expressions of \
the conserved charge J and\nthe energy of a single magnon excitation are then \
computed. Then we determine\nthe dispersion relation in the infinite J limit \
configuration and we find that\nit reduces to celebrated Hofman-Maldacena \
dispersion relation when the\ndeformation parameter goes to zero.\n", 
