 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study rigidly rotating strings in the background of \
AdS3 x S3 with\\nNeveu-Schwarz (NS) fluxes. We find two interesting limiting \
cases corresponding\\nto the known giant magnon and the new single spike \
solution of strings in the\\nabove background and write down the dispersion \
relations among various\\nconserved charges. We use proper regularization to \
find the correct relations\\namong them. We further study the circular and \
infinite spiky strings on AdS and\\nstudy their properties.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
