                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this paper, we study the M5-brane configurations in \
AdS$_4 \\\\times\\nQ^{1,1,1}$ spacetime. We consider the configurations with \
an AdS$_2$ factor\\nembedding into AdS$_4$, and manage to construct two \
solutions, which could be\\ndual to line defects in the boundary gauge \
theory. Moreover we discuss their\\nBPS nature and find that neither of them \
is supersymmetric. We show that the\\nM5-brane with a R$_t$ or an AdS$_3$ \
factor found before is half-BPS.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
