 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study oscillating string solutions in the \
Klebanov-Witten and its\\nnon-Abelian T-dual background dualised along an \
SU(2) isometry. We find the\\nstring energy as the function of oscillation \
number and angular momentum. We\\nshow that for a particular set of T-dual \
co-ordinates both the background have\\nequal string states. We also study \
the string states where the strings are\\nexpanding and contracting in the \
T-dual co-ordinate direction. We expect the\\npresence of the superconformal \
field theory dual operators whose anomalous\\ndimensions depend on T-dual \
co-ordinate.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
