, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  When mass-deformed ABJM theory is considered on S(3), \
the partition function\\nof the theory localises and is given by a matrix \
model. We solve this model at\\nlarge-N in the decompactification limit, \
where the radius of the three-sphere\\nis taken to infinity. In this limit, \
the theory exhibits a rich phase structure\\nwith an infinite number of \
third-order quantum phase transitions accumulating\\nat strong \
coupling.\\n\""}]}, {
