 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  A general class of deformations of integrable \
sigma-models with symmetric\\nspace F/G target-spaces are found. These \
deformations involve defining the\\nnon-abelian T dual of the sigma-model and \
then replacing the coupling of the\\nLagrange multiplier imposing flatness \
with a gauged F/F WZW model. The original\\nsigma-model is obtained in the \
limit of large level. The resulting deformed\\ntheories are shown to preserve \
both integrability and the equations-of-motion,\\nbut involve a deformation \
of the symplectic structure. It is shown that this\\ndeformed symplectic \
structure involves a linear combination of the original\\nPoisson bracket and \
a generalization of the Faddeev-Reshetikhin Poisson bracket\\nwhich we show \
can be re-expressed as two decoupled F current algebras. It is\\nthen shown \
that the deformation can be incorporated into the classical model \
of\\nstrings on R x F/G via a generalization of the Pohlmeyer reduction. In \
this\\ncase, in the limit of large sigma-model coupling it is shown that the \
theory\\nbecomes the relativistic symmetric space sine-Gordon theory. These \
results\\npoint to the existence of a deformation of this kind for the full \
Green-Schwarz\\nsuperstring on AdS5 x S5.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Thu, 10 Jul 2014 16:02:55 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v2\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Wed, 16 Jul 2014 11:14:13 GMT\""}]}], "}"}]}], 
                   "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2015-06-22\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"Hollowood\"", ",", "\"Timothy J.\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"Miramontes\"", ",", "\"J. Luis\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    
