                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The AdS/CFT correspondence enables us to probe M-theory \
on various\\nbackgrounds from the corresponding dual gauge theories. Here we \
investigate in\\ndetail a three-dimensional U(N) N=4 super Yang-Mills theory \
coupled to one\\nadjoint hypermultiplet and Nf fundamental hypermultiplets, \
which is large N\\ndual to M-theory on AdS_4xS^7/Z_Nf. Using the localization \
and the Fermi-gas\\nformulation, we explore non-perturbative corrections to \
the partition function.\\nAs in the ABJM theory, we find that there exists a \
non-trivial pole\\ncancellation mechanism, which guarantees the theory to be \
well-defined, between\\nworldsheet instantons and membrane instantons for all \
rational (in particular,\\nphysical or integral) values of Nf.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
