various\nbackgrounds from the corresponding dual gauge theories. Here we \
investigate in\ndetail a three-dimensional U(N) N=4 super Yang-Mills theory \
coupled to one\nadjoint hypermultiplet and Nf fundamental hypermultiplets, \
which is large N\ndual to M-theory on AdS_4xS^7/Z_Nf. Using the localization \
and the Fermi-gas\nformulation, we explore non-perturbative corrections to \
