BMN expansion up to\none-loop order in inverse string tension. We show that, \
after taking into\naccount the wave function renormalization, the one-loop \
S-matrix is UV finite.\nIn an appropriate regularization scheme the S-matrix \
is consistent with the\nunderlying symmetries of the superstring theory, i.e. \
for the n=3,5 cases it\ncoincides with the one implied by the light-cone \
gauge symmetries with the\ndressing phases determined from the crossing \
