their Gravity Duals\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"30+1 pages, 1 table; minor corrections, references added; \
matches\\n  published version (JHEP)\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
