 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The Bethe equations for the periodic XXX and XXZ spin \
chains admit singular\\nsolutions, for which the corresponding eigenvalues \
and eigenvectors are\\nill-defined. We use a twist regularization to derive \
conditions for such\\nsingular solutions to be physical, in which case they \
correspond to genuine\\neigenvalues and eigenvectors of the \
Hamiltonian.\\n\""}]}, {
