realization of the isometry group generators. The scheme is then applied to\n\
spinning string solutions characterized by one winding number in AdS_3 and \
two\nwinding numbers in S^3. We find a two-parameter family of orbits, where\n\
quantization again provides the Holstein-Primakoff realization of the \
symmetry\ngenerators with an oscillator type energy spectrum. Analyzing the \
minimal\nenergy at strong coupling we verify the spectrum of short strings at \
special\nvalues of winding numbers.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Mon, 13 Oct 2014 18:40:21 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Wed, 1 Jul 2015 18:47:44 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2015-07-02", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"Heinze", "Martin", ""}, {
              "Jorjadze", "George", ""}, {"Megrelidze", "Luka", ""}}}], 
