            "  This paper has two parts. We first compute the leading \
contribution to the\nstrong-coupling mixing between the Konishi operator and \
a double-trace operator\ncomposed of chiral primaries by using flat-space \
vertex operators for the\nstring-duals of the operators. We then compute the \
