            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"1411.4662\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Linus Wulff\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Per Sundin and Linus Wulff\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"One- and two-loop checks for the AdS(3) x S(3) x T(4) \
superstring with\\n  mixed flux\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"22 pages; v2: Minor clarifications and references added. \
Matches\\n  published version\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1088/1751-8113/48/10/105402\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Imperial-TP-LW-2014-03\""}]}, {
              
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We compute the one-loop worldsheet S-matrix for the \
superstring in AdS(3) x\\nS(3) x T(4) supported by a combination of RR and \
NSNS flux in the massive\\nsector. In the appropriate regularization scheme \
it agrees with the S-matrix\\nfound from symmetry considerations including \
the proposed dressing phases. As\\npreviously observed in other cases the \
massless modes decouple from the\\ncalculation of one-loop massive mode \
scattering. We also calculate the\\ncorrection to the dispersion relation at \
two loops in the Near-Flat-Space limit\\nand find agreement with a proposal \
for the form of the exact dispersion\\nrelation for the massive modes. \
Somewhat surprisingly the massless modes again\\ndecouple from the \
calculation (in a suitable regularization scheme). We also\\ncompute the \
correction to the dispersion relation for the massless modes and\\ncompare to \
a suggestion for the exact dispersion relation, finding a \
small\\ndiscrepancy. The corresponding calculations for AdS(5) x S(5) and \
AdS(2) x S(2)\\nx T(6) are used for comparison.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
