AdS/CFT\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"41 pages, 13 figures; v2: added section 6.5 & \
references\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 1504 (2015) 119\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP04(2015)119\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
