                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We compute the general form of the six-loop anomalous \
dimension of twist-two\\noperators with arbitrary spin in planar N=4 SYM \
theory. First we find the\\ncontribution from the asymptotic Bethe ansatz. \
Then we reconstruct the wrapping\\nterms from the first 35 even spin values \
of the full six-loop anomalous\\ndimension computed using the quantum \
spectral curve approach. The obtained\\nanomalous dimension satisfies all \
known constraints coming from the BFKL\\nequation, the generalised \
double-logarithmic equation, and the small spin\\nexpansion.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
