elaborated\n  discussion on minor points, content matches published version, \
28 pages, 3\n  figures", "journal-ref" -> "JHEP 1505 (2015) 027", "doi" -> 
            "10.1007/JHEP05(2015)027", "report-no" -> Null, "categories" -> 
