                 "\"Oluf Tang Engelund and Radu Roiban\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"On the asymptotic states and the quantum S matrix of the \
$\\\\eta$-deformed\\n  $AdS_5\\\\times S^5$ superstring\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"30 pages, 7 figures; typos corrected, unused reference \
removed,\\n  clarified sentence at the end of section 3.3\""}]}, {
