 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We propose a number of modifications to the classical \
term in the dressing\\nphase for integrable strings in AdS3 x S3 x S3 x S1, \
and check these against\\nexisting perturbative calculations, crossing \
symmetry, and the semiclassical\\nlimit of the Bethe equations. The principal \
change is that the phase for\\ndifferent masses should start with a term Q_1 \
Q_2, like the one-loop AdS3\\ndressing phase, rather than Q_2 Q_3 as for the \
original AdS5 AFS phase.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
