 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We probe the open fundamental strings in Dp-brane (p=1, \
3, 5) backgrounds and\\nfind new classes of rotating and orbiting string \
solutions. We show that for\\nvarious worldsheet embedding ansatz we get \
solutions of the string equations of\\nmotion that correspond to the well \
known giant magnon and single spikes, in\\naddition to few new solutions \
corresponding to the orbiting strings. We make a\\nsystematic study of both \
rigidly rotating and orbiting strings in D1, D3 and\\nD5-brane \
backgrounds.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
