Heisenberg\\n  Model\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"27 pages, final version. Another example of non \
self-conjugate\\n  strings is analyzed at page 11, some editorial \
modifications. Along with the\\n  main article, I upload a supplementary \
table in PDF format which will not\\n  appear in the journal version\""}]}, {
               
