            "Holographic Calculations of Euclidean Wilson Loop Correlator in\n\
  Euclidean anti-de Sitter Space", "comments" -> "30 pages, 10 figures", 
            "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> "10.1007/JHEP04(2015)020", 
