            "  We study Euclidean Wilson loops at strong coupling using the \
AdS/CFT\ncorrespondence, where the problem is mapped to finding the area of \
minimal\nsurfaces in Hyperbolic space. We use a formalism introduced recently \
by\nKruczenski to perturbatively compute the area corresponding to boundary\n\
