 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We propose a framework for computing the (light cone) \
string field theory\\nvertex in the case when the string worldsheet QFT is a \
generic integrable\\ntheory. The prime example and ultimate goal would be the \
$AdS_5 \\\\times S^5$\\nsuperstring theory cubic string vertex and the chief \
application will be to use\\nthis framework as a formulation for ${ \\\\cal \
N}=4$ SYM theory OPE coefficients\\nvalid at any coupling up to wrapping \
corrections. In this paper we propose\\nintegrability axioms for the vertex, \
illustrate them on the example of the\\npp-wave string field theory and also \
uncover similar structures in weak\\ncoupling computations of OPE \
coefficients.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
