                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We consider a six dimensional (1,0) hypermultiplet \
model coupled to an\\nexternal field of vector/tensor system and study the \
structure of the\\nlow-energy effective action of this model. Manifestly a \
(1,0) supersymmetric\\nprocedure of computing the effective action is \
developed in the framework of\\nthe superfield proper-time technique. The \
leading low-energy contribution to\\nthe effective action is \
calculated.\\n\""}]}, {
