 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We show how generalised unitarity can be used to \
determine the one-loop\\ndilatation operator in N=4 super Yang-Mills. Our \
analysis focuses on two\\nsectors, namely the bosonic SO(6) sector and the \
SU(2|3) sector. The\\ncalculation is performed on shell, with no off-shell \
information introduced at\\nany stage. In this way, we establish a direct \
connection between scattering\\namplitudes and the dilatation operator of the \
N=4 theory.\\n\""}]}, {
