                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We construct highest-weight modules and a Yangian \
extension of the centrally\\nextended sl(1|1)^2 superalgebra, that is a \
symmetry of the worldsheet\\nscattering associated with the AdS3/CFT3 \
duality. We demonstrate that the\\nR-matrix intertwining atypical modules is \
of a trigonometric type. We also\\nconsider a quantum deformation of this \
superalgebra, its modules, and obtain a\\nquantum affine extension of the \
Drinfeld-Jimbo type that describes a deformed\\nworldsheet \
scattering.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
