 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this note we compute the expectation value of a \
circular BPS Wilson loop\\nin the higher rank totally symmetric and \
antisymmetric representations of SU(N)\\nin the $\\\\hat{A}_1$ quiver \
$\\\\mathcal{N} = 2$ SCFT, using a matrix model. We\\ndiscuss the connection \
with a recent conjecture stating that expectation values\\nof observables in \
this sector are obtained from $\\\\mathcal{N = 4}$ SYM by a\\nuniversal \
renormalization of the `t Hooft coupling.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
