               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study rigidly rotating strings in \
$\\\\varkappa$-deformed $AdS$ background.\\nWe probe this classically \
integrable background with `spiky' strings and\\nanalyze the string profiles \
in the large charge limit systematically. We also\\ndiscuss the dispersion \
relation among the conserved charges for these solutions\\nin long string \
limit.\\n\""}]}, {
