Megrelidze\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Orbit method quantization of the AdS$_2$ \
superparticle\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"19 pages; v2: typos corrected, references added, matches \
published\\n  version\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"J.Phys. A48 (2015) no.31, 315403\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1088/1751-8113/48/31/315403\""}]}, {
               
