Zoupanos\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Higher-Dimensional Unification with continuous and fuzzy \
coset spaces as\\n  extra dimensions\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1002/prop.201500022\""}]}, {
