 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We first review the Coset Space Dimensional Reduction \
(CSDR) programme and\\npresent the best model constructed so far based on the \
$\\\\mathcal{N} = 1$,\\n$10$-dimensional $E_8$ gauge theory reduced over the \
nearly-K\\\\\\\"ahler manifold\\n$SU(3)/U(1)\\\\times U(1)$ with the \
additional use of the Wilson flux mechanism.\\nThen we present the \
corresponding programme in the case that the extra\\ndimensions are \
considered to be fuzzy coset spaces and the best model that has\\nbeen \
constructed in this framework too. In both cases the best model appears \
to\\nbe the trinification GUT $SU(3)^3$.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
