Morita\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Instanton dynamics in finite temperature QCD via \
holography\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"25 pages, 4 figures; v2: references added, minor \
corrections\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
