 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this paper, we investigate the 1/4 BPS Wilson-'t \
Hooft loops in\\n$\\\\mathcal{N}$=4 supersymmetric Yang-Mills theory. We use \
the bulk D3-brane\\nsolutions with both electric and magnetic charges on its \
world-volume to\\ndescribe some of 1/4 BPS Wilson-'t Hooft loops. The \
D3-brane supersymmetric\\nsolutions are derived form requiring \
$\\\\kappa$-symmetry. We find the two\\nconsistent constraints for Killing \
spinors and calculate the conserved charges\\nof straight 1/4 BPS Wilson-'t \
Hooft loops and expectation values of circular\\n1/4 BPS Wilson-'t Hooft \
loops separately.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
