 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study integrable open boundary conditions for d(2,1;\
\\\\alpha)^2 and\\npsu(1,1|2)^2 spin-chains. Magnon excitations of these open \
spin-chains are\\nmapped to massive excitations of type IIB open superstrings \
ending on D-branes\\nin the AdS_3 x S^3 x S^3 x S^1 and AdS_3 x S^3 x T^4 \
supergravity geometries\\nwith pure R-R flux. We derive reflection matrix \
solutions of the boundary\\nYang-Baxter equation which intertwine \
representations of a variety of boundary\\ncoideal subalgebras of the bulk \
Hopf superalgebra. Many of these integrable\\nboundaries are matched to D1- \
and D5-brane maximal giant gravitons.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
