            "  We study integrable open boundary conditions for \
d(2,1;\\alpha)^2 and\npsu(1,1|2)^2 spin-chains. Magnon excitations of these \
open spin-chains are\nmapped to massive excitations of type IIB open \
superstrings ending on D-branes\nin the AdS_3 x S^3 x S^3 x S^1 and AdS_3 x \
S^3 x T^4 supergravity geometries\nwith pure R-R flux. We derive reflection \
