 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the conjectured duality between the \
$\\\\mathcal{N}=6$ Vasiliev higher\\nspin theory on $AdS_4$ and 3d \
$\\\\mathcal{N}=6$ superconformal Chern-Simons\\nmatter theory known as the \
ABJ theory. We discuss how the parameters in the ABJ\\ntheory should be \
related to the bulk coupling constant in the Vasiliev theory.\\nFor this \
purpose, we compute two-point function of stress tensor in the ABJ\\ntheory \
by using supersymmmetry localization. Our result justifies the proposal\\nby \
arXiv:1504.00365 and determine the unknown coefficient in the previous \
work.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
