                 "\"Flowing to Higher Dimensions: A New Strongly-Coupled \
Phase on M2 Branes\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"28 pages, 2 figures. Version 2 contains a discussion of \
new\\n  non-supersymmetric flows\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
