Philippe\\n  Sabella-Garnier and Ken Huai-Che Yeh\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Emergent geometry of membranes\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"34 pages, 7 figures. v2: added references\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
