               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"1506.06512\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Yang Zhou\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Yang Zhou\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Universal Features of Four-Dimensional Superconformal \
Field Theory on\\n  Conic Space\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"1+32 pages\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 1508:052,2015\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP08(2015)052\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"TAUP-2996/15\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Following the set up in arXiv:1408.3393, we study 4d \
N=1 superconformal field\\ntheories in conic spaces. We show that the \
universal part of supersymmetric\\nR\\\\'enyi entropy S_q across a spherical \
entangling surface in the limit q goes\\nto 0 is proportional to a linear \
combination of central charges, 3c-2a. This is\\nequivalent to a similar \
statement about the free energy of SCFTs on conic space\\nor hyperbolic space \
S^1_q*H^3 in the corresponding limit. We first derive the\\nasymptotic \
formula by the free field computation in the presence of a U(1)\\nR-symmetry \
background and then provide an independent derivation by studying\\nN=1 \
theories on a primary Hopf surface S^1_\\\\beta*S^3_b with a \
particular\\nscaling \\\\beta~1/\\\\sqrt{q} and b=\\\\sqrt{q}, which thus \
confirms the validity of\\nthe formula for general interacting N=1 SCFTs. \
Finally we revisit the\\nsupersymmetric R\\\\'enyi entropy of general N=2 \
SCFTs and find a simple formula\\nfor it in terms of central charges a and c.\
\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Mon, 22 Jun 2015 09:07:19 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2015-08-14\""}]}, {
