, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  We calculate planar tree level one-point functions of \
non-protected operators\\nin the defect conformal field theory dual to the \
D3-D5 brane system with k\\nunits of the world volume flux. Working in the \
operator basis of Bethe\\neigenstates of the Heisenberg XXX_{1/2} spin chain \
we express the one-point\\nfunctions as overlaps of these eigenstates with a \
matrix product state. For k=2\\nwe obtain a closed expression of determinant \
form for any number of\\nexcitations, and in the case of half-filling we find \
a relation with the N\\\\'eel\\nstate. In addition, we present a number of \
results for the limiting case of\\ninfinite k.\\n\""}]}, {
