 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We continue the analysis of building open strings \
stretched between giant\\ngravitons from $\\\\mathcal{N}=4$ SYM by going to \
second order in perturbation\\ntheory using the three-loop dilatation \
generator from the field theory. In the\\nprocess we build a Fock-like space \
of states using Cuntz oscillators which can\\nbe used to access the excited \
open string states. We find a remarkable\\ncancellation among the excited \
states that shows the ground state energy is\\nconsistent with a fully \
relativistic dispersion relation.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
