 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We present a detailed study of the pulsating string \
solutions in AdS3 x S3\\nsupported by both RR and NS-NS fluxes. This \
background has recently been proved\\nto be integrable. We find the \
dispersion relation between the energy,\\noscillation number and other \
conserved charges when the NS-NS flux turned on is\\nsmall. We further \
discuss the fate of the string solutions in pure RR and \
NS-NS\\ncases.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
