           "id" -> "1508.03430", "submitter" -> "Kamal Lochan Panigrahi", 
            "authors" -> 
            "Aritra Banerjee, Kamal L. Panigrahi and Manoranjan Samal", 
            "title" -> 
            "A note on oscillating strings in $AdS_3 \\times S^3$ with mixed\n\
  three-form fluxes", "comments" -> "26 pages, version to appear in JHEP", 
            "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> "10.1007/JHEP11(2015)133", 
            "report-no" -> Null, "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  We present a detailed study of the pulsating string solutions \
in AdS3 x S3\nsupported by both RR and NS-NS fluxes. This background has \
recently been proved\nto be integrable. We find the dispersion relation \
between the energy,\noscillation number and other conserved charges when the \
NS-NS flux turned on is\nsmall. We further discuss the fate of the string \
solutions in pure RR and NS-NS\ncases.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
