of faces each of which\nis a region bounded by null geodesics in an $AdS_2$ \
subspace of $AdS_3$. The\ntime evolution can be described by specifying the \
null geodesic motion of kinks\nin the string at which two segments are \
joined. The outcome of collisions of\nkinks on the worldsheet can be worked \
