 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We propose a method to determine the quantum numbers, \
which we call the\\nrigged configurations, for the solutions to the Bethe \
ansatz equations for the\\nspin-1/2 isotropic Heisenberg model under the \
periodic boundary condition. Our\\nmethod is based on the observation that \
the sums of Bethe's quantum numbers\\nwithin each string behave particularly \
nicely. We confirm our procedure for all\\nsolutions for length 12 chain \
(totally 923 solutions).\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
