operators. In this paper we\\nprovide explicit examples of correlators with \
two scalar operators in $\\\\,{\\\\cal\\nN}=4$ super-Yang--Mills theory at \
large $N$, corresponding to pulsating\\nsemiclassical strings in \
AdS$_5\\\\times S^5$, and an operator with small quantum\\nnumbers at strong \
coupling.\\n\""}]}, {
