               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Ben Hoare, Antonio Pittelli and Alessandro \
Torrielli\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"The S-matrix algebra of the AdS2 X S2 superstring\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"27 pages, no figures; Version to appear in Phys. Rev. \
D\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Phys. Rev. D 93, 066006 (2016)\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1103/PhysRevD.93.066006\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"HU-EP-42, DMUS-MP-15/12\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this paper we find the Yangian algebra responsible \
for the integrability\\nof the AdS2 X S2 X T^6 superstring in the planar \
limit. We demonstrate the\\nsymmetry of the corresponding exact S-matrix in \
the massive sector, including\\nthe presence of the secret symmetry. We give \
two alternative presentations of\\nthe Hopf algebra, along with related \
discussions on the issue of evaluation\\nrepresentations. We study the \
classical r-matrix, and re-discover the need for\\na secret symmetry also in \
this context. Finally, taking the simplifying\\nzero-coupling limit of the \
S-matrix as a generating R-matrix for the Algebraic\\nBethe Ansatz, we obtain \
an effective model of free fermions on a periodic\\nspin-chain. This limit \
should provide hints to the one-loop anomalous dimension\\nof the mysterious \
superconformal quantum mechanics dual to the superstring\\ntheory in this \
geometry.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Fri, 25 Sep 2015 05:22:31 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
