            "  We verify the self-duality of Green-Schwarz supercoset sigma \
models on AdS$_d\n\\times S^d $ backgrounds (d=2,3,5) under combined bosonic \
and fermionic\nT-dualities without gauge fixing kappa symmetry. We also prove \
this property\nfor superstrings on AdS$_d \\times S^d \\times S^d$ (d=2,3) \
described by\nsupercoset sigma models with the isometries governed by the \
exceptional Lie\nsupergroups $D(2,1;\\alpha)$ (d=2) and \
