                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Fermionic T-Duality of $AdS_n \\\\times S^n (\\\\times \
S^n) \\\\times T^m$ using\\n  IIA Supergravity\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
