            "  We show that the string backgrounds AdS2 x S2 x T6 and AdSd x \
Sd x Sd x T{10\n- 3d} (d = 2, 3) are self-dual under a series of bosonic and \
fermionic\nT-dualities. We do this using the fermionic Buscher rules derived \
