that is applied to a number of\nscalar models -- among them the \
Grosse-Wulkenhaar model. As a byproduct we find\nan expression for the small \
propertime expansion of general nonlocal operators'\nHeat Kernel. As an \
introduction, basic notions of spectral functions, Quantum\nField Theories \
--path integrals and renormalization by means of spectral\nfunctions-- and \
the Worldline Formalism for commutative theories are given.\n", 
