 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We exactly compute the partition function for $U(2)_k\\\
\\times U(2)_{-k}$ ABJM\\ntheory on $\\\\mathbb S^3$ deformed by mass $m$ and \
Fayet-Iliopoulos parameter\\n$\\\\zeta $. For $k=1,2$, the partition function \
has an infinite number of\\nLee-Yang zeros. For general $k$, in the \
decompactification limit the theory\\nexhibits a quantum (first-order) phase \
transition at $m=2\\\\zeta $.\\n\""}]}, {
