Wilson loop in\\n  $AdS_5 \\\\times S^5$ superstring\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"16 pages\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
