 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We compute the one-loop world-sheet correction to \
partition function of\\n$AdS_5 \\\\times S^5$ superstring that should be \
representing $k$-fundamental\\ncircular Wilson loop in planar limit. The 2d \
metric of the minimal surface\\nending on $k$-wound circle at the boundary is \
that of a cone of $AdS_2$ with\\ndeficit $2\\\\pi (1-k)$. We compute \
determinants of 2d fluctuation operators by\\nfirst constructing heat kernels \
of scalar and spinor Laplacians on the cone\\nusing the Sommerfeld formula. \
The final expression for the k-dependent part of\\nthe one-loop correction \
has simple integral representation but is different\\nfrom earlier \
results.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
