added; v3:\\n  supersymmetric analysis and pp-wave limits added, published \
version\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Fortschr. Phys. 64, 657-673 (2016)\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1002/prop.201600032\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
