            "  We present calculation of the correlation function of three \
twist-2 operators\nin the BFKL limit. The calculation is performed in N = 4 \
SYM but the result is\nvalid in other gauge theories such as QCD. The \
obtained leading order structure\nconstant is exact for any number of colors.\
\n", "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Wed, 11 Nov 2015 19:45:31 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2015-11-13", 
