                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this paper, using the localization technique we \
analyze the large N limit\\nof the mass deformed \
Aharony-Bergman-Jafferis-Maldacena (ABJM) theory on the\\nthree sphere with a \
finite mass parameter and finite Chern-Simons levels. We\\nfind two different \
solutions of the saddle point equations in the large N\\nlimit. With these \
solutions we compute the free energy and find that there is a\\nfirst order \
phase transition. Our results may predict a phase transition in the\\ndual \
gravity theory.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
