AdS3 Asymptotic\\n  Bethe Ansatz\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"15 pages, 1 figure; v2:references, typos and \
clarifications\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
