 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We consider the leading finite-size effects on some \
structure constants for\\nthe $\\\\eta$ - deformed $AdS_5\\\\times S^5$ \
background in the framework of the\\nsemiclassical approach. The leading \
finite-size corrections are derived for the\\ncases when we have two heavy \
string states represented by giant magnons and for\\ntwo different choices of \
the light states corresponding to dilaton operator\\nwith nonzero momentum \
and primary scalar operators. Since the dual field theory\\nis still unknown, \
the results obtained here must be considered as conjectures\\nor as \
predictions from the string theory side.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
