         Annotation[#, 
          
          TableForm[{
           "id" -> "1601.04708", "submitter" -> "Diego Trancanelli", 
            "authors" -> 
            "Alberto Faraggi, Leopoldo A. Pando Zayas, Guillermo A. Silva, \
Diego\n  Trancanelli", "title" -> 
            "Toward precision holography with supersymmetric Wilson loops", 
            "comments" -> 
            "5 pages; v2: 43 pages, long version fixing a mistake and \
altering the\n  conclusions", "journal-ref" -> "JHEP 1604:053,2016", "doi" -> 
            "10.1007/JHEP04(2016)053", "report-no" -> "MCTP-16-03", 
            "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  We consider certain 1/4 BPS Wilson loop operators in SU(N) \
${\\cal N}=4$\nsupersymmetric Yang-Mills theory, whose expectation value can \
be computed\nexactly via supersymmetric localization. Holographically, these \
operators are\nmapped to fundamental strings in AdS5 x S5. The string \
on-shell action\nreproduces the large N and large coupling limit of the gauge \
theory expectation\nvalue and, according to the AdS/CFT correspondence, there \
should also be a\nprecise match between subleading corrections to these \
limits. We perform a test\nof such match at next-to-leading order in string \
theory, by deriving the\nspectrum of quantum fluctuations around the \
classical string solution and by\ncomputing the corresponding 1-loop \
effective action. We discuss in detail the\nsupermultiplet structure of the \
fluctuations. To remove a possible source of\nambiguity in the ghost zero \
mode measure, we compare the 1/4 BPS configuration\nwith the 1/2 BPS one, \
dual to a circular Wilson loop. We find a discrepancy\nbetween the string \
theory result and the gauge theory prediction, confirming a\nprevious result \
in the literature. We are able to track the modes from which\nthis \
discrepancy originates, as well as the modes that by themselves would give\n\
the expected result.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Mon, 18 Jan 2016 21:00:04 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Wed, 10 Feb 2016 20:25:00 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2016-04-12", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"Faraggi", "Alberto", ""}, {
              "Zayas", "Leopoldo A. Pando", ""}, {
              "Silva", "Guillermo A.", ""}, {"Trancanelli", "Diego", ""}}}], 
          "Tooltip"]& ], 
