 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study various rotating and oscillating D-string \
configurations in some\\ngeneral backgrounds with fluxes. In particular, we \
look for solutions to the\\nequations of motion of various rigidly rotating \
D-strings in $AdS_3$ background\\nwith mixed flux, and in the intersecting \
D-brane geometries. We find out\\nrelations among various conserved charges \
corresponding to the breathing and\\nrotating D-string \
configurations.\\n\""}]}, {
