one-parameter\ngeneralization of the non-abelian T-dual of the AdS_n x S^n \
superstring sigma\nmodel with respect to the whole supergroup F. Here we \
consider the case of n=2\nand find the explicit form of the 4d target space \
background for the\nlambda-model for the PSU(1,1|2)/[SO(1,1) x SO(2)] \
