 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The subject of matrix field theory involves matrix \
models, noncommutative\\ngeometry, fuzzy physics and noncommutative field \
theory and their interplay. In\\nthese lectures, a lot of emphasis is placed \
on the matrix formulation of\\nnoncommutative and fuzzy spaces, and on the \
non-perturbative treatment of the\\ncorresponding field theories. In \
particular, the phase structure of\\nnoncommutative $\\\\phi^4$ theory is \
treated in great detail, and an introduction\\nto noncommutative gauge theory \
is given.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
