                 "\"talk delivered at the conference \\\"Interactions between \
Geometry and\\n  Physics\\\", Guaraja, Sao Paulo, August 17-22, 2015\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
