                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1016/j.geomphys.2016.09.004\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  After a very brief recollection of how my scientific \
collaboration with Ugo\\nstarted, in this talk I will present some recent \
results obtained with\\nlocalization: the deformed gauge theory partition \
function $Z(\\\\vec\\\\tau|q)$ and\\nthe expectation value of circular Wilson \
loops $W$ on a squashed four-sphere\\nwill be computed. The partition \
function is deformed by turning on $\\\\tau_J\\n\\\\,{\\\\rm tr} \\\\, \
\\\\Phi^J$ interactions with $\\\\Phi$ the ${\\\\cal N}=2$ superfield.\\n  \
For the ${\\\\cal N}=4$ theory SUSY gauge theory exact formulae for $Z$ and \
$W$\\nin terms of an underlying $U(N)$ interacting matrix model can be \
derived thus\\nreplacing the free Gaussian model describing the undeformed ${\
\\\\cal N}=4$\\ntheory. These results will be then compared with those \
obtained with the dual\\nCFT according to the AGT correspondence. The \
interactions introduced previously\\nare in fact related to the insertions of \
commuting integrals of motion in the\\nfour-point CFT correlator and the \
chiral correlators are expressed as\\n$\\\\tau$-derivatives of the gauge \
theory partition function on a finite\\n$\\\\Omega$-background.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Tue, 8 Mar 2016 16:54:51 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
              
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2017-06-28\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Fucito\"", ",", "\"Francesco\"", ",", "\"\""}],
                     "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"Morale\"", ",", "\"Jose Francisco\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Poghossian\"", ",", "\"Rubik\"", ",", "\"\""}],
                     "}"}]}], "}"}]}]}}, RowSpacings -> 1, ColumnAlignments -> 
