            "  In this paper we study segmented strings in AdS$_3$ coupled to \
a background\ntwo-form whose field strength is proportional to the volume \
form. By changing\nthe coupling, the theory interpolates between the \
Nambu-Goto string and the\n$SL(2)$ Wess-Zumino-Witten model. In terms of the \
kink momentum vectors, the\naction is independent of the coupling and the \
classical theory reduces to a\nsingle discrete-time Toda-type theory. The WZW \
model is a singular point in\ncoupling space where the map into Toda \
variables degenerates.\n", 
