            "Closed star product on noncommutative $\\mathbb{R}^3$ and scalar \
field\n  dynamics", "comments" -> "19 pages", "journal-ref" -> 
            "JHEP 05 (2016) 146", "doi" -> "10.1007/JHEP05(2016)146", 
            "report-no" -> Null, "categories" -> "hep-th math-ph math.MP", 
