                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We analyze the spectrum of perturbative closed strings \
on AdS3 x S3 x T4 with\\nRamond-Ramond flux using integrable methods. By \
solving the crossing equations\\nwe determine the massless and mixed-mass \
dressing factors of the worldsheet S\\nmatrix and derive the Bethe equations. \
Using these, we construct the underlying\\nintegrable spin chain and show \
that it reproduces the reducible spin chain\\nconjectured at weak coupling in \
arXiv:1211.1952. We find that the string-theory\\nmassless modes are \
described by gapless excitations of the spin chain. The\\nresulting \
degeneracy of vacua matches precisely the protected supergravity\\nspectrum \
found by de Boer.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
