            "On the spectrum of AdS3 x S3 x T4 strings with Ramond-Ramond \
flux", "comments" -> "6 pages, 4 figures", "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> 
            "10.1088/1751-8113/49/41/41LT03", "report-no" -> 
