and Silviu S.\\n  Pufu\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Holography for $\\\\mathcal{N}=1^*$ on $S^4$\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"40 pages + appendices, 4 figures\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 1610 (2016) 095\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP10(2016)095\""}]}, {
               
