 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We compute the full one-loop 2-particle S-matrix for \
excitations of the type\\nIIB AdS(3) x S(3) x T(4) BMN string. The S-matrix \
is found to respect the\\nexpected symmetries and the phases are consistent \
with the crossing equations.\\nBy analyzing how the relevant integrals scale \
with the IR regulator we show\\nthat scattering of massless bosons is trivial \
at two loops. Based on our\\nresults we argue that the additional su(2) \
S-matrix appearing in the massless\\nsector in the exact solution should \
trivialize.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
