 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We construct the solution of type IIB supergravity \
describing the integrable\\nlambda-deformation of the AdS_3 x S^3 supercoset. \
While the geometry\\ncorresponding to the deformation of the bosonic coset \
has been found in the\\npast, our background is more natural for studying \
superstrings, and several\\ninteresting features distinguish our solution \
from its bosonic counterpart. We\\nalso report progress towards constructing \
the lambda-deformation of the AdS_5 x\\nS^5 supercoset.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
