                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We introduce a series of articles reviewing various \
aspects of integrable\\nmodels relevant to the AdS/CFT correspondence. Topics \
covered in these reviews\\nare: classical integrability, Yangian symmetry, \
factorized scattering, the\\nBethe ansatz, the thermodynamic Bethe ansatz, \
and integrable structures in\\n(conformal) quantum field theory. In the \
present article we highlight how these\\nconcepts have found application in \
AdS/CFT, and provide a brief overview of the\\nmaterial contained in this \
series.\\n\""}]}, {
