 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The so called one-parameter (often called \
$\\\\varkappa$) deformed $AdS$ string\\nsigma models have attracted a lot of \
attention lately in the study of\\nintegrability in string theory. We \
construct various circular string solutions\\nin the $(AdS_3 \\\\times S^3)_{\
\\\\varkappa}$ background and describe the\\ncharacteristics of such \
solutions qualitatively. We study the Bohr-Sommerfeld\\nlike quantization for \
these string states to characterise the motion. Further\\nwe find a `long' \
string limit of such circular strings in the\\n$\\\\varkappa$-deformed \
$AdS_3$ and find a novel dependence of the oscillation\\nnumber on the energy \
in the next to leading order expansion.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
