            "  This is an introductory review to localization techniques in \
supersymmetric\ntwo-dimensional gauge theories. In particular we describe how \
to construct\nLagrangians of N=(2,2) theories on curved spaces, and how to \
compute their\npartition functions and certain correlators on the sphere, the \
