               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"This is a contribution to the review volume `Localization \
techniques\\n  in quantum field theories' (eds. V. Pestun and M. Zabzine) \
which contains 17\\n  Chapters. The complete volume is summarized in \
arXiv:1608.02952 and it can be\\n  downloaded at \
https://arxiv.org/src/1608.02952/anc/LocQFT.pdf or\\n  \
