supersymmetric gauge\ntheory on 5d toric Sasaki-Einstein manifolds. We \
construct the cohomological\ncomplex resulting from supersymmetry and \
consider its natural toric\ndeformations with all equivariant parameters \
turned on. We also give detailed\ndiscussion on how the Sasaki-Einstein \
geometry permeates every aspect of the\ncalculation, from Killing spinor, \
vanishing theorems to the index theorems.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Tue, 9 Aug 2016 20:01:51 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Sun, 14 Aug 2016 14:22:50 GMT"}, {
