 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We perform further tests of the correspondence between \
spectral theory and\\ntopological strings, focusing on mirror curves of genus \
greater than one with\\nnontrivial mass parameters. In particular, we analyze \
the geometry relevant to\\nthe SU(3) relativistic Toda lattice, and the \
resolved C^3/Z_6 orbifold.\\nFurthermore, we give evidence that the \
correspondence holds for arbitrary\\nvalues of the mass parameters, where the \
quantization problem leads to resonant\\nstates. We also explore the relation \
between this correspondence and cluster\\nintegrable systems.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
