 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We discuss models with no dynamical vector fields in \
various dimensions which\\nwe claim might have exceptional symmetry on some \
loci of their parameter space.\\nIn particular we construct theories with \
four supercharges flowing to theories\\nwith global symmetry enhancing to \
$F_4$, $E_6$, and $E_7$. The main evidence\\nfor these claims is based on \
extracting information about the symmetry\\nproperties of the theories from \
their supersymmetric partition functions.\\n\""}]}, {
