 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We compute the vacuum expectation values of $1/6$ \
supersymmetric Wilson loops\\nin higher dimensional representations of the \
gauge group in ABJM theory. We\\npresent results for the $m$-symmetric and \
$m$-antisymmetric representations by\\nexploiting standard matrix model \
techniques. At leading order, in the saddle\\npoint approximation, our \
expressions reproduce holographic results from both D6\\nand D2 branes \
corresponding to the antisymmetric and symmetric \
representations,\\nrespectively. We also compute 1/N corrections to the \
leading saddle point\\nresults.\\n\""}]}, {
