 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study 1/2 BPS Wilson loops in 3d $\\\\mathcal{N}=4$ \
$U(N)$ Yang-Mills theory\\nwith one adjoint and $N_f$ fundamental \
hypermultiplets from the Fermi gas\\napproach. By numerical fitting, we find \
the first few worldsheet instanton\\ncorrections to the Wilson loops with \
winding numbers 1, 2 and 3. We verify that\\nour Fermi gas results are \
consistent with the matrix model results in the\\nplanar limit.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
