 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the circular Wilson loop in the symmetric \
representation of U(N) in\\n$\\\\mathcal{N} = 4$ super-Yang-Mills (SYM). In \
the large N limit, we computed the\\nexponentially-suppressed corrections for \
strong coupling, which suggests\\nnon-perturbative physics in the dual \
holographic theory. We also computed the\\nnext-to-leading order term in 1/N, \
and the result matches with the exact result\\nfrom the k-fundamental \
representation.\\n\""}]}, {
