 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study rigidly rotating and pulsating $(m,n)$ strings \
in $AdS_3 \\\\times S^3$\\nwith mixed three form flux. The $AdS_3 \\\\times \
S^3$ background with mixed three\\nform flux is obtained in the near horizon \
limit of $SL(2,Z)$-transformed\\nsolution, corresponding to the bound state \
of NS5-branes and fundamental\\nstrings. We study the probe $(m,n)-$string in \
this background by solving the\\nmanifest $SL(2,Z)-$covariant form of the \
action. We find out the dyonic giant\\nmagnon and single spike solutions \
corresponding to the equations of motion of a\\nprobe string in this \
background and find out various relationships among the\\nconserved charges. \
We further study a class of pulsating $(m,n)$ string in\\n$AdS_3$ with mixed \
three form flux.\\n\""}]}, {
