            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"1610.05659\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Dario Rosa\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Dario Rosa\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"The coupling of Poisson sigma models to topological \
backgrounds\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"31 pages; v2: typos fixed, references added, version to \
appear in\\n  JHEP\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP12(2016)043\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"hep-th math-ph math.MP math.SG\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We extend the coupling to the topological backgrounds, \
recently worked out\\nfor the 2-dimensional BF-model, to the most general \
Poisson sigma models. The\\ncoupling involves the choice of a Casimir \
function on the target manifold and\\nmodifies the BRST transformations. This \
in turn induces a change in the BRST\\ncohomology of the resulting theory. \
The observables of the coupled theory are\\nanalyzed and their geometrical \
interpretation is given. We finally couple the\\ntheory to 2-dimensional \
topological gravity: this is the first step to study a\\ntopological string \
theory in propagation on a Poisson manifold. As an\\napplication, we show \
that the gauge-fixed vectorial supersymmetry of the\\nPoisson sigma models \
has a natural explanation in terms of the theory coupled\\nto topological \
gravity.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Mon, 17 Oct 2016 02:09:21 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
