 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study dual conformal transformations of minimal area \
surfaces in $AdS_5\\n\\\\times S^5$ corresponding to holographic smooth \
Wilson loops and some other\\nrelated observables. To act with dual conformal \
transformations we map the\\nstring solutions to the dual space by means of \
T-duality, then we apply a\\nconformal transformation and finally T-dualize \
back to the original space. The\\ntransformation maps between string \
solutions with different boundary contours.\\nThe boundary contours of the \
minimal surfaces are not mapped back to the AdS\\nboundary, and the \
regularized area of the surface changes.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
