 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We investigate the integrable aspects of the planar $\\\
\\gamma$-deformed ABJM\\ntheory and propose the twisted asymptotic Bethe \
ansatz equations. A more\\ngeneral method through a twisted generating \
functional is discussed, based on\\nwhich, the asymptotic large L solution of \
Y-system is modified in order to\\nmatch the asymptotic Bethe ansatz \
equations. Several applications of our method\\nwere made in the $sl(2)$-like \
sector and some important examples in\\n$\\\\beta$-deformed ABJM are \
presented as well.\\n\""}]}, {
