         Annotation[#, 
          
          TableForm[{
           "id" -> "1611.03831", "submitter" -> "Frederic Br\\\"unner", 
            "authors" -> 
            "Frederic Br\\\"unner, Diego Regalado, and Vyacheslav P. \
Spiridonov", "title" -> 
            "Supersymmetric Casimir Energy and $\\mathrm{SL(3,\\mathbb{Z})}$\n\
  Transformations", "comments" -> 
            "20 pages, more explicit examples added, published in JHEP", 
            "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> "10.1007/JHEP07(2017)041", 
            "report-no" -> Null, "categories" -> "hep-th math-ph math.MP", 
            "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  We provide a recipe to extract the supersymmetric Casimir \
energy of theories\ndefined on primary Hopf surfaces directly from the \
superconformal index. It\ninvolves an $\\mathrm{SL(3,\\mathbb{Z})}$ \
transformation acting on the complex\nstructure moduli of the background \
geometry. In particular, the known relation\nbetween Casimir energy, index \
and partition function emerges naturally from\nthis framework, allowing \
rewriting of the latter as a modified elliptic\nhypergeometric integral. We \
show this explicitly for $\\mathcal{N}=1$ SQCD and\n$\\mathcal{N}=4$ \
supersymmetric Yang-Mills theory for all classical gauge\ngroups, and \
conjecture that it holds more generally. We also use our method to\nderive an \
expression for the Casimir energy of the nonlagrangian\n$\\mathcal{N}=2$ SCFT \
with $\\mathrm{E_6}$ flavour symmetry. Furthermore, we\npredict an expression \
for Casimir energy of the $\\mathcal{N}=1$\n$\\mathrm{SP(2N)}$ theory with \
$\\mathrm{SU(8)\\times U(1)}$ flavour symmetry that\nis part of a multiple \
duality network, and for the doubled $\\mathcal{N}=1$\ntheory with enhanced $\
\\mathrm{E}_7$ flavour symmetry.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Fri, 11 Nov 2016 19:45:47 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Thu, 3 Aug 2017 10:24:09 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2017-08-04", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"Br\[UDoubleDot]nner", "Frederic", ""}, {
              "Regalado", "Diego", ""}, {
              "Spiridonov", "Vyacheslav P.", ""}}}], "Tooltip"]& ], 
        TagBox[
         TooltipBox[DiskBox[{10.628016664626088`, -7.090319311076434}, 0.],
