               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"1611.04189\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Edgar Shaghoulian\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Edgar Shaghoulian\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Emergent gravity from Eguchi-Kawai reduction\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"29 pages plus appendices, v2-v3: references added and \
typos corrected\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP03(2017)011\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th hep-lat\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Holographic theories with a local gravitational dual \
have a number of\\nstriking features. Here I argue that many of these \
features are controlled by\\nthe Eguchi-Kawai mechanism, which is proposed to \
be a hallmark of such\\nholographic theories. Higher-spin holographic duality \
is presented as a failure\\nof the Eguchi-Kawai mechanism, and its \
restoration illustrates the deformation\\nof higher-spin theory into a proper \
string theory with a local gravitational\\nlimit. AdS/CFT is used to provide \
a calculable extension of the Eguchi-Kawai\\nmechanism to field theories on \
curved manifolds and thereby introduce\\n\\\"topological volume independence.\
\\\" Finally, I discuss implications for a\\ngeneral understanding of the \
extensivity of the Bekenstein-Hawking-Wald\\nentropy.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
