                 "\"Holography for $\\\\mathcal{N}=1^*$ on $S^4$ and \
Supergravity\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"45 pages\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
