 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  I shall recall in historical perspective some results \
from nineties and show\\nfurther how $\\\\kappa$-deformed symmetries and \
$\\\\kappa$-Minkowski space inspired\\nDSR (Doubly of Deformed Special \
Relativity) approach proposed after 2000. As\\nvery recent development I \
shall show how to describe quantum-covariant\\n$\\\\kappa$-deformed phase \
spaces by passing from Hopf algebras to Hopf algebroids\\n(arXiv:1507.02612) \
and I will briefly describe the $\\\\kappa$-deformations of\\n$AdS_5 \
\\\\times S^5$ superstring target spaces (arXiv:1510.030.83).\\n\""}]}, {
