 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We quantize the moduli space of supersymmetric \
microstates describing\\nfour-dimensional black holes with \
AdS$_2$$\\\\times$S$^2$ asymptotics. To acquire\\nthe commutation relations \
of quantization, we find the symplectic form that is\\nimposed in the Type \
IIB SUGRA and defined in the space of solutions\\nparameterized by one \
complex harmonic function in ${R}^3$ with sources\\ndistributed along closed \
curves.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
