 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  I show that a very simple model in the context of \
Newtonian physics promoted\\nto a first approximation of general relativity \
can mimic Dark matter and\\nexplain most of its intriguing properties. \
Namely: i) Dark matter is a halo\\nassociated to ordinary matter; ii) Dark \
matter does not interact with ordinary\\nmatter nor with itself; iii) Its \
influence grows with the size of the aggregate\\nof ordinary matter that is \
considered, and iv) Dark matter influences the\\npropagation of \
light.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
