corrected\\n  typos, version to appear in Journal of Physics A Special Issue \
dedicated to\\n  Professor Petr Kulish\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Journal of Physics A: Mathematical and Theoretical (2017) \
Volume\\n  50, Number 29, 294003\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1088/1751-8121/aa7605\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
