 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We use holographic correspondence to argue that \
Euclidean (Bunch-Davies)\\nvacuum is a late-time attractor of the dynamical \
evolution of quantum gauge\\ntheories at strong coupling. The Bunch-Davies \
vacuum is not an adiabatic state,\\nif the gauge theory is non-conformal --- \
the comoving entropy production rate\\nis nonzero. Using the N=2* gauge \
theory holography, we explore prospects of\\nexplaining current accelerated \
expansion of the Universe as due to the vacuum\\nenergy of a strongly coupled \
QFT.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
