               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The isomorphism $SU(4) \\\\simeq O(6)$ is used to \
construct the form factors of\\nthe O(6) Gross-Neveu model as bound state \
form factors of the SU(4) chiral\\nGross-Neveu model. This technique is \
generalized and is then applied to use the\\nO(6) as the starting point of \
the nesting procedure to obtain the O(N) form\\nfactors for general even \
N.\\n\""}]}, {
