 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We show that a recently conjectured form for \
perturbative supersymmetric\\npartition functions on spheres of general \
dimension $d$ is consistent with the\\nflat space limit of 6-dimensional \
$\\\\mathcal{N}=1$ super Yang-Mills. We also\\nshow that the partition \
functions for $\\\\mathcal{N}=1$ 8- and 9-dimensional\\ntheories are \
consistent with their known flat space limits.\\n\""}]}, {
