                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"15 pages, 3 figures. v2: typos and a sign in Eq.(5) are \
corrected, a\\n  figure is revised correspondingly; v3: texts are improved, \
and references are\\n  added\""}]}, {
               
