 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We review the algebraic Bethe ansatz for the Heisenberg \
model. The exposition\\nincludes some of recent advancements with emphasis on \
a relation with the\\nrigged configurations.\\n  We also provide somewhat \
thorough review of the crystal bases and the rigged\\nconfigurations. In \
particular, we provide the inverse scattering transform for\\nthe type \
$D^{(1)}_n$ box-ball systems. We also provide a reformulation of a\\nresult \
of arXiv:0711.4185.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
