 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In the so-called (2,2) theory, which is the U(N)^4 \
circular quiver\\nsuperconformal Chern-Simons theory with levels (k,0,-k,0), \
it was known that\\nthe instanton effects are described by the free energy of \
topological strings\\nwhose Gopakumar-Vafa invariants coincide with those of \
the local D_5 del Pezzo\\ngeometry. By considering two types of one-parameter \
rank deformations U(N) x\\nU(N+M) x U(N+2M) x U(N+M) and U(N+M) x U(N) x \
U(N+M) x U(N), we classify the\\nknown diagonal BPS indices by degrees. \
Together with other two types of\\none-parameter deformations, we further \
propose the topological string\\nexpression when both of the above two \
deformations are turned on.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
