 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We give a survey of elliptic hypergeometric functions \
associated with root\\nsystems, comprised of three main parts. The first two \
form in essence an\\nannotated table of the main evaluation and \
transformation formulas for elliptic\\nhypergeometric integeral and series on \
root systems. The third and final part\\ngives an introduction to Rains' \
elliptic Macdonald-Koornwinder theory (in part\\nalso developed by Coskun and \
Gustafson).\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
