 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We elaborate the Chern-Simons (CS) matrix models at \
large $N$. The saddle\\npoint equations of these matrix models have a curious \
structure which cannot be\\nseen in the ordinary one matrix models. Thanks to \
this structure, an infinite\\nnumber of multi-cut solutions exist in the CS \
matrix models. Particularly we\\nexactly derive the two-cut solutions at \
finite 't\\\\,Hooft coupling in the pure\\nCS matrix model. In the ABJM \
matrix model, we argue that some of multi-cut\\nsolutions might be \
interpreted as a condensation of the D2-brane instantons.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
