structure, an infinite\nnumber of multi-cut solutions exist in the CS matrix \
models. Particularly we\nexactly derive the two-cut solutions at finite \
't\\,Hooft coupling in the pure\nCS matrix model. In the ABJM matrix model, \
we argue that some of multi-cut\nsolutions might be interpreted as a \
condensation of the D2-brane instantons.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Thu, 27 Apr 2017 17:39:27 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Thu, 7 Jun 2018 14:48:53 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
