                 "\"Constrains of Charge-to-Mass Ratios on Noncommutative \
Phase Space\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"6pages; v2: text are improved and several references are \
added. v3:\\n  match to the published version\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Adv.High Energy Phys. 2017 (2017) 1945156\""}]}, {
