 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Based on recent measurements on the charge-to-mass \
ratios of proton and\\nanti-proton, we study constraints on the parameters of \
noncommutative phase\\nspace. We find that while the limit on the parameter \
of coordinate\\nnoncommutativity is weak, it is very strong on the parameter \
of momentum\\nnoncommutativity, $\\\\sqrt{\\\\xi} \\\\lesssim {\\\\rm 1\\\\mu \
eV}$. Therefore, the\\ncharge-to-mass ratio experiment has a strong \
sensitivity on the momentum\\nnoncommutativity, and enhancement of future \
experimental achievement can\\nfurther pin down the momentum \
noncommutativity.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
