            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"1705.09250\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Andrea Galliani\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Andrea Galliani, Stefano Giusto, Rodolfo Russo\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Holographic 4-point correlators with heavy states\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"31 pages; v3: citations added, typos corrected\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP10(2017)040\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The AdS/CFT duality maps supersymmetric heavy operators \
with conformal\\ndimension of the order of the central charge to \
asymptotically AdS supergravity\\nsolutions. We show that by studying the \
quadratic fluctuations around such\\nbackgrounds it is possible to derive the \
4-point correlators of two light and\\ntwo heavy states in the supergravity \
approximation. We provide an explicit\\nexample in the AdS$_3$ setup relevant \
for the duality with the D1-D5 CFT.\\nContrary to previously studied \
examples, the supergravity correlator derived in\\nthis work differs from the \
result obtained at the CFT orbifold point. Our\\nmethod bypasses the \
difficulties of applying the standard Witten's diagrams\\napproach to \
correlators with operators of large conformal dimension and also\\navoids \
some technical steps that have made the computation of dynamical \
4-point\\ncorrelators in the AdS$_3$/CFT$_2$ context unfeasible until now.\\n\
\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
