Laszlo Palla\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"On integrable boundaries in the 2 dimensional $O(N)$ \
$\\\\sigma$-models\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Dedicated to the memory of Petr Kulish, 31 pages, 1 \
figure, v2:\\n  conformality and integrability of the boundary conditions are \
distinguished\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1088/1751-8121/aa8205\""}]}, {
