 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Cohen and Glashow introduced the notion of very special \
relativity as viable\\nspace-time symmetry of elementary particle physics. As \
a natural generalization\\nof their idea, we study the subgroup of the \
conformal group, dubbed very\\nspecial conformal symmetry, which is an \
extension of the very special\\nrelativity. We classify all of them and \
construct field theory examples as well\\nas holographic realization of the \
very special conformal field theories.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
