                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We discuss non-linear instantons in supersymmetric \
field theories on curved\\nspaces arising from D-branes. Focusing on \
D3-branes and four-dimensional field\\ntheories, we derive the supersymmetry \
conditions and show the intimate relation\\nbetween the instanton solutions \
and the non-linearly realized supersymmetries\\nof the field theory. We \
demonstrate that field theories with non-linearly\\nrealized supersymmetries \
are coupled to supergravity backgrounds in a similar\\nfashion as those with \
linearly realized supersymmetries, and provide details on\\nhow to derive \
such couplings from a type II perspective.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
