           "id" -> "1707.08108", "submitter" -> "Michelangelo Preti", 
            "authors" -> "Michelangelo Preti", "title" -> 
            "WiLE: a Mathematica package for weak coupling expansion of \
Wilson loops\n  in ABJ(M) theory", "comments" -> 
            "35 pages, 4 figures and 1 table, comments added. To appear in \
Comput.\n  Phys. Commun", "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> 
            "10.1016/j.cpc.2017.12.011", "report-no" -> Null, "categories" -> 
            "hep-th", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  We present WiLE, a Mathematica package designed to perform the \
weak coupling\nexpansion of any Wilson loop in ABJ(M) theory at arbitrary \
perturbative order.\nFor a given set of fields on the loop and internal \
vertices, the package\ndisplays all the possible Feynman diagrams and their \
integral representations.\nThe user can also choose to exclude non planar \
diagrams, tadpoles and\nself-energies. Through the use of interactive input \
windows, the package should\nbe easily accessible to users with little or no \
previous experience. The\npackage manual provides some pedagogical examples \
and the computation of all\nladder diagrams at three-loop relevant for the \
cusp anomalous dimension in\nABJ(M). The latter application gives also \
support to some recent results\ncomputed in different contexts.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Tue, 25 Jul 2017 17:58:06 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Mon, 4 Dec 2017 15:19:05 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2018-04-04", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"Preti", "Michelangelo", ""}}}], 
