 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We discuss semiclassical quantization of circular \
pulsating strings in AdS3 x\\nS3 background with and without the \
Neveu-Schwarz- Neveu-Schwarz (NS-NS) flux.\\nWe find the equations of motion \
corresponding to the quadratic action in\\nbosonic sector in terms of scalar \
quantities and invariants of the geometry.\\nThe general equations for \
studying physical perturbations along the string in\\nan arbitrary curved \
spacetime are written down using covariant formalism. We\\ndiscuss the \
stability of these string configurations by studying the solutions\\nof the \
linearized perturbed equations of motion.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
