(gravity) matrix model related\nto type IIB matrix models/string theory which \
have a well defined classical\nlimit, and which is compatible with higher \
spin gravity in $AdS$ space. As it\nhas been suggested that higher spin \
gravity should be related to string theory\nin a high energy (tensionless) \
regime, and therefore to M-Theory, we expect\nthat our construction will be \
useful to explore concrete connections.\n", 
