            "ABJM $\\theta$-Bremsstrahlung at four loops and beyond: \
non-planar\n  corrections", "comments" -> "22 pages", "journal-ref" -> Null, 
            "doi" -> "10.1007/JHEP11(2017)166", "report-no" -> Null, 
