Muteeb,\\n  Alessandro Tanzini\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"$\\\\mathcal{N}=2$ gauge theories on unoriented/open \
four-manifolds and\\n  their AGT counterparts\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
