            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"1711.02468\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Antonio Pittelli\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Antonio Pittelli\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Yangian Symmetry of String Theory on $AdS_3 \\\\times S^3 \
\\\\times S^3 \\\\times\\n  S^1$ with Mixed 3-form Flux\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"24 pages; added references\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1016/j.nuclphysb.2018.08.013\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"UUITP - 40/17\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We find the Yangian symmetry underlying the \
integrability of type IIB\\nsuperstrings on $AdS_3 \\\\times S^3 \\\\times \
S^3 \\\\times S^1$ with mixed\\nRamond-Ramond and Neveu-Schwarz-Neveu-Schwarz \
flux. The abstract commutation\\nrelations of the Yangian are formulated via \
RTT realisation, while its matrix\\nrealisation is in an evaluation \
representation depending on the quantised\\ncoefficient of the Wess-Zumino \
term. The construction naturally encodes a\\nsecret symmetry of the \
worldsheet scattering matrix whose generators map\\ndifferent Yangian levels \
to each other. We show that in the large effective\\nstring tension limit the \
Yangian becomes a deformation of a unitary loop\\nalgebra and we derive its \
universal classical r-matrix.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
