 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this paper we have found a classical giant \
magnon-like solution with both\\ninfinite and finite angular momentum moving \
in Sch_5 x S^5 with B-field, which\\nis believed to be dual to \
dipole-deformed N=4 super Yang-Mills theory. This\\nstring state propagates \
as a point particle in non-trivial subspace of the\\nSch_5 space but shows a \
giant magnon-like property in the S^2 subspace. We\\nderive the \
energy-momentum dispersion relations and their finite-size\\ncorrection for \
the case of finite but large angular momentum.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
