 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We construct semi-classical string solutions of the \
Schr\\\\\\\"odinger $Sch_5\\n\\\\times S^5$ spacetime, which is conjectured \
to be the gravity dual of a\\nnon-local dipole-deformed CFT. They are the \
counterparts of the giant magnon\\nand spiky string solutions of the \
undeformed $AdS_5 \\\\times S^5$ to which they\\nflow when the deformation \
parameter is turned off. They live in an $S^3$\\nsubspace of the five-sphere \
along the directions of which the $B$-field has\\nnon-zero components having \
also extent in the $Sch_5$ part of the metric.\\nFinally, we speculate on the \
form of the dual field theory operators.\\n\""}]}, {
