 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We compute structure constants in three-point functions \
of three string\\nstates in AdS_4 x CP^3 in the framework of the \
semiclassical approach. We\\nconsider HHL correlation functions where two of \
the states are \\\"heavy\\\" string\\nstates of finite-size giant magnons \
carrying one or two angular momenta and the\\nother one corresponds to such \
\\\"light\\\" states as dilaton operators with non-zero\\nmomentum, primary \
scalar operators, and singlet scalar operators with higher\\nstring \
levels.\\n\""}]}, {
