                 "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]}\
, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  We study string quantum corrections to the ratio of \
latitude and circular\\nWilson loops in N=4 super-Yang-Mills theory at strong \
coupling. Conformal gauge\\nfor the corresponding minimal surface in \
AdS(5)xS(5) is singular and we show\\nthat an IR anomaly associated with the \
divergence in the conformal factor\\nremoves previously reported discrepancy \
with the exact field-theory result. We\\nalso carefully check conformal \
anomaly cancellation and recalculate fluctuation\\ndeterminants by directly \
evaluating phaseshifts for all the fluctuation modes.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Wed, 20 Dec 2017 22:17:25 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
