                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this paper we compute the vacuum expectation value \
of the Wilson loop and\\nits correlators with chiral primary operators in $\\\
\\mathcal{N}=2, 4$\\nsuperconformal $U(N)$ gauge theories at large $N$. After \
localization these\\nquantities can be computed in terms of a deformed $U(N)$ \
matrix model. The\\nWilson loops we deal with are in the fundamental and \
symmetric representations.\\n\""}]}, {
