 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this short review (to appear as a contribution to an \
edited volume) we\\ndiscuss perturbative and non-perturbative approaches to \
the quantization of the\\nGreen-Schwarz string in AdS backgrounds with \
RR-fluxes, where the guiding\\nthread is the use of genuine field theory \
methods, the search for a good\\nregularization scheme associated to them and \
the generality of the analysis\\ncarried out. We touch upon various \
computational setups, both analytical and\\nnumerical, and on the role of \
their outcomes in understanding the detailed\\nstructure of the AdS/CFT \
correspondence.\\n\""}]}, {
