           "id" -> "1801.02822", "submitter" -> "Robert de Mello Koch", 
            "authors" -> 
            "Shaun de Carvalho, Robert de Mello Koch and Augustine Larweh \
Mahu", "title" -> "Anomalous dimensions from boson lattice models", 
            "comments" -> "26+1 pages", "journal-ref" -> 
            "Phys. Rev. D 97, 126004 (2018)", "doi" -> 
            "10.1103/PhysRevD.97.126004", "report-no" -> Null, "categories" -> 
            "hep-th", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  Operators dual to strings attached to giant graviton branes in\
\nAdS$_5\\times$S$^5$ can be described rather explicitly in the dual ${\\cal \
N} =\n4$ super Yang-Mills theory. They have a bare dimension of order $N$ so \
that for\nthese operators the large $N$ limit and the planar limit are \
distinct: summing\nonly the planar diagrams will not capture the large $N$ \
dynamics. Focusing on\nthe one-loop $SU(3)$ sector of the theory, we consider \
operators that are a\nsmall deformation of a ${1\\over 2}-$BPS multi-giant \
graviton state. The\ndiagonalization of the dilatation operator at one loop \
has been carried out,\nbut explicit formulas for the operators of a good \
scaling dimension are only\nknown when certain terms which were argued to be \
small, are neglected. In this\narticle we include the terms which were \
neglected. The diagonalization is\nachieved by a novel mapping which replaces \
the problem of diagonalizing the\ndilatation operator with a system of bosons \
hopping on a lattice. The giant\ngravitons define the sites of this lattice \
and the open strings stretching\nbetween distinct giant gravitons define the \
hopping terms of the Hamiltonian.\nUsing the lattice boson model, we argue \
that the lowest energy giant graviton\nstates are obtained by distributing \
the momenta carried by the $X$ and $Y$\nfields evenly between the giants with \
the condition that any particular giant\ncarries only $X$ or $Y$ momenta, but \
not both.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Tue, 9 Jan 2018 07:03:26 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2018-06-20", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"de Carvalho", "Shaun", ""}, {
              "Koch", "Robert de Mello", ""}, {
              "Mahu", "Augustine Larweh", ""}}}], "Tooltip"]& ], 
