         Annotation[#, 
          
          TableForm[{
           "id" -> "1801.03135", "submitter" -> "Nikolay Bobev", "authors" -> 
            "Nikolay Bobev, Vincent S. Min, and Krzysztof Pilch", "title" -> 
            "Mass-deformed ABJM and Black Holes in AdS$_4$", "comments" -> 
            "67 pages, 7 figures", "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> 
            "10.1007/JHEP03(2018)050", "report-no" -> Null, "categories" -> 
            "hep-th", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  We find a class of new supersymmetric dyonic black holes in \
four-dimensional\nmaximal gauged supergravity which are asymptotic to the \
${\\rm SU(3)}\\times {\\rm\nU(1)}$ invariant AdS$_4$ Warner vacuum. These \
black holes can be embedded in\neleven-dimensional supergravity where they \
describe the backreaction of\nM2-branes wrapped on a Riemann surface. The \
holographic dual description of\nthese supergravity backgrounds is given by a \
partial topological twist on a\nRiemann surface of a three-dimensional \
$\\mathcal{N}=2$ SCFT that is obtained by\na mass-deformation of the ABJM \
theory. We compute explicitly the topologically\ntwisted index of this SCFT \
and show that it accounts for the entropy of the\nblack holes.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Tue, 9 Jan 2018 20:41:22 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2018-04-04", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"Bobev", "Nikolay", ""}, {
              "Min", "Vincent S.", ""}, {"Pilch", "Krzysztof", ""}}}], 
