 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study a general class of spinning pulsating strings \
in $(AdS_5 \\\\times\\nS^5)_{\\\\varkappa}$ background. For these family of \
solitons, we examine the\\nscaling relation between the energy, spin or \
angular momentum. We verify that\\nin $\\\\varkappa \\\\rightarrow 0 $ limit \
these relations reduce to the undeformed\\n$AdS_5 \\\\times S^5$ case. We \
further study an example of a string which is\\nspinning in the \
$\\\\varkappa$-deformed AdS$_5$ and S$^5$ simultaneously and find\\nout the \
scaling relation among various conserved charges.\\n\""}]}, {
