                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the correlator of concentric circular Wilson \
loops for arbitrary\\nradii, spatial and internal space separations. For real \
values of the\\nparameters specifying the dual string configuration, a \
typical Gross-Ooguri\\nphase transition is observed. In addition, we explore \
some analytic\\ncontinuation of a parameter $\\\\gamma$ that characterizes \
the internal space\\nseparation. This enables a ladder limit in which ladder \
resummation and string\\ntheory computations precisely agree in the strong \
coupling limit. Finally, we\\nfind a critical value of $\\\\gamma$ for which \
the correlator is supersymmetric\\nand ladder diagrams can be exactly \
resummed for any value of the coupling\\nconstant.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
