the\ndeconstruction limit, it reproduces the zero-winding contributions to \
the BPS\npartition function of (1,1) Little String Theory wrapping an \
emergent torus. We\ntherefore successfully test both the expressions for the \
$\\mathcal N=1$\npartition functions, as well as the relationship between the \
toroidal-quiver\ntheory and Little String Theory through dimensional \
deconstruction.\n", 
