Zamaklar\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Holographic meson decays via worldsheet instantons\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"26 pages, 17 figures\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP06(2018)083\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"DCPT-18/07\""}]}, {
