moduli. We investigate\nhow the perturbative closed string spectrum changes \
as we move around this\nmoduli space in both the RR and NSNS flux \
backgrounds. We find that, at weak\nstring coupling, only four of the moduli \
affect the energies. In the RR\nbackground the only effect of these moduli is \
