                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We discuss homogeneous Yang-Baxter deformations of \
integrable sigma models in\\nterms of twist operators. We show that the twist \
operators behave as the\\nclassical analogue of a Drinfeld twist, for all \
abelian and almost abelian\\ndeformations. We also use twist operators to \
rederive the well-known\\ninterpretation of TsT transformations -- equivalent \
to abelian deformations --\\nin terms of twisted boundary conditions. We \
discuss complications in extending\\nthis boundary condition picture to \
non-abelian deformations.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
