                  "\"Precision matching of circular Wilson loops and strings \
in AdS(5)xS(5)\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"21 pages\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
