A. Pando Zayas,\\n  Vimal Rathee and Guillermo A. Silva\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Toward Precision Holography in Type IIA with Wilson Loops\
\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"48 pages. v2: references added\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
