            "  The problem of separation of variables (SoV) in supersymmetric \
spin chains is\nclosely related to the calculation of correlation functions \
in N=4 SYM theory\nwhich is integrable in the planar limit. To address this \
question we find a\ncompact formula for the spin chain eigenstates, which \
