                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Nikolay Bobev, Pieter Bomans and Fridrik Freyr \
Gautason\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"title\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Spherical Branes\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"57 pages, 4 figures; v2: minor corrections, appendix \
added\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP08(2018)029\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We construct new solutions of ten-dimensional \
supergravity with sixteen\\nsupercharges which describe the backreaction of \
D$p$-branes with spherical\\nworldvolume. These solutions are holographically \
dual to the\\n$(p+1)$-dimensional maximally supersymmetric Yang-Mills theory \
on $S^{p+1}$.\\nThe finite size of the sphere provides an IR cut-off for the \
gauge theory which\\nis manifested in the supergravity solution as a smooth \
cap-off of the geometry.\\nIn the UV the size of the sphere plays no role and \
the backgrounds asymptote to\\nthe well-known supergravity solutions that \
describe the near-horizon limit of\\nflat D$p$-branes. We compute the \
on-shell action of our spherical brane\\nsolutions and show that it is in \
agreement with recent supersymmetric\\nlocalization results for the free \
energy of maximal SYM theory on $S^{p+1}$.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Mon, 14 May 2018 18:00:01 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v2\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
