               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Semiclassical SL(2) Strings on LLM backgrounds\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10+3 pages\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1016/j.physletb.2018.07.031\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study semiclassical string solutions that live on \
white regions of the LLM\\nplane for a generic LLM geometry. These string \
excitations are labelled by\\nconserved charges E, J and S and are thus \
holographically dual to operators in\\nthe SL(2) sector of N = 4 super-Yang \
Mills made up of covariant derivatives\\nacting on complex scalar fields Z. \
On the other hand, the LLM geometry itself\\nis dual to an operator \
consisting of O(N^2) Z-fields so that the operators dual\\nto our solutions, \
containing both the stringy excitation and background, are\\nnon-planar. In \
an appropriate short string limit we argue that the string\\nsolution we find \
should be dual to a localised SL(2) excitation in the gauge\\ntheory \
language. This allows us to perform a non-trivial check of the \
recent\\nproposal that the dynamics of localised excitations should be \
identical, up to\\na rescaling of the 't Hooft coupling, to the dynamics of \
those same excitations\\nin the AdS5xS5 background\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Thu, 31 May 2018 13:32:46 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
