 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Building on arXiv:1804.01998 we investigate the \
integrable structure of the\\nWess-Zumino-Witten (WZW) model describing \
closed strings on $AdS_3\\\\times\\nS^3\\\\times T^4$. Using the \
recently-proposed integrable S matrix we show\\nanalytically that all \
wrapping corrections cancel and that the theory has a\\nnatural spin-chain \
interpretation. We construct the integrable spin chain and\\ndiscuss its \
relation with the WZW description. Finally we compute the\\nspin-chain \
spectrum in closed form and show that it matches the WZW prediction\\non the \
nose.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
