structure of the\nWess-Zumino-Witten (WZW) model describing closed strings on \
$AdS_3\\times\nS^3\\times T^4$. Using the recently-proposed integrable S \
matrix we show\nanalytically that all wrapping corrections cancel and that \
the theory has a\nnatural spin-chain interpretation. We construct the \
