                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We compute the topological partition function (twisted \
index) of\\n$\\\\mathcal{N}=2$ $U(N)$ Chern-Simons theory with an adjoint \
chiral multiplet on\\n$\\\\Sigma_g \\\\times S^1$. The localization technique \
shows that the underlying\\nFrobenius algebra is the equivariant Verlinde \
algebra which is obtained from\\nthe canonical quantization of the complex \
Chern-Simons theory regularized by\\n$U(1)$ equivariant parameter $t$. Our \
computation relies on a Bethe/Gauge\\ncorrespondence which allows us to \
represent the equivariant Verlinde algebra in\\nterms of the Hall-Littlewood \
polynomials $P_\\\\lambda(x_B, t)$ with a\\nspecialization by Bethe roots \
$x_B$ of the $q$-boson model. We confirm a\\nproposed duality to the Coulomb \
branch limit of the lens space superconformal\\nindex of four dimensional $\\\
\\mathcal{N}=2$ theories for $SU(2)$ and $SU(3)$ with\\nlower levels. In \
$SU(2)$ case we also present more direct computation based \
on\\nJeffrey-Kirwan residue operation.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Fri, 8 Jun 2018 09:27:20 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v2\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Mon, 11 Jun 2018 15:05:46 GMT\""}]}], "}"}]}], 
