           "id" -> "1806.03690", "submitter" -> "Valentin Reys", "authors" -> 
            "Bernard de Wit, Sameer Murthy, Valentin Reys", "title" -> 
            "BRST quantization and equivariant cohomology: localization with\n\
  asymptotic boundaries", "comments" -> "26 pages", "journal-ref" -> Null, 
