                 "\"Holographic three-point correlators in the \
Schrodinger/dipole CFT\\n  correspondence\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"26 pages, 1 figure\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
