, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  In this paper we study the distribution of level \
crossings for the spectra of\\nlinear families A+lambda B, where A and B are \
square matrices independently\\nchosen from some given Gaussian ensemble and \
lambda is a complex-valued\\nparameter. We formulate a number of theoretical \
and numerical results for the\\nclassical Gaussian ensembles and some \
