$\\\\mathrm{AdS}_2 \\\\times\\n  \\\\mathrm{S}^2 \\\\times \\\\mathrm{T}^6$ \
superstring\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"37 pages, published version\""}]}, {
