 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We investigate how a lepton asymmetry impacts the \
cosmic trajectory in the\\nQCD phase diagram. We study the evolution of \
chemical potentials during the QCD\\nepoch of the early Universe using \
susceptibilities from lattice QCD to\\ninterpolate between an ideal quark gas \
and an ideal hadron resonance gas. The\\nlepton asymmetry affects the \
evolution of all chemical potentials. The standard\\ncosmic trajectory is \
obtained assuming tiny lepton and baryon asymmetries. For\\nlarger lepton \
asymmetry, the charge chemical potential exceeds the baryon\\nchemical \
potential before pion annihilation.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
