expression is\nclosely related to the function determining the possible AdS \
vacua of the bulk\ntheory in question, which we argue to act as a generating \
functional from which\ncorrelation functions of the boundary stress tensor \
can be easily\ncharacterized. Finally, based on holographic results and \
free-field numerical\ncalculations, we conjecture that the subleading term in \
the squashing-parameter\nfree-energy expansion is universally controlled by \
the stress-tensor\nthree-point function charge $t_4$ for general \
$(2+1)$-dimensional CFTs.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Mon, 6 Aug 2018 18:08:27 GMT"}, {
