Korchemsky\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Exact Correlation Functions in Conformal Fishnet \
Theory\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"58 pages, some results in Mathematica format available in\
\\n  CodeForArxiv.m file attached\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP08(2019)123\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
