 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this paper we study 7D maximally supersymmetric \
Yang-Mills on a specific\\n3-Sasakian manifold that is the total space of an \
$SO(3)$-bundle over\\n$\\\\mathbb{C}P^2$. The novelty of this example is that \
the manifold is not a\\ntoric Sasaki-Einstein manifold. The \
hyperk\\\\\\\"ahler cone of this manifold is a\\nSwann bundle with hypertoric \
symmetry and this allows us to calculate the\\nperturbative part of the \
partition function of the theory. The result is also\\nverified by an index \
calculation. We also discuss a factorisation of this\\nresult and compare it \
with analogous results for $S^7$.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
