          TableForm[{
           "id" -> "1808.06917", "submitter" -> "Andreas Roc\\'en", "authors" -> 
            "Andreas Roc\\'en", "title" -> 
            "7D supersymmetric Yang-Mills on a 3-Sasakian manifold", 
            "comments" -> "39 pages, 9 figures, published version", 
            "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> "10.1007/JHEP11(2018)024", 
            "report-no" -> Null, "categories" -> "hep-th math.SG", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  In this paper we study 7D maximally supersymmetric Yang-Mills \
on a specific\n3-Sasakian manifold that is the total space of an \
$SO(3)$-bundle over\n$\\mathbb{C}P^2$. The novelty of this example is that \
the manifold is not a\ntoric Sasaki-Einstein manifold. The hyperk\\\"ahler \
cone of this manifold is a\nSwann bundle with hypertoric symmetry and this \
allows us to calculate the\nperturbative part of the partition function of \
the theory. The result is also\nverified by an index calculation. We also \
discuss a factorisation of this\nresult and compare it with analogous results \
for $S^7$.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
