 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The gravity dual of $\\\\beta$-deformed ABJM theory can \
be obtained by a TsT\\ntransformation of $AdS_4\\\\times\\\\mathbb{CP}^3$. We \
present a supercoset\\nconstruction of $\\\\mathbb{CP}^3$ to obtain this \
gravity dual theory as a\\nYang-Baxter deformation. This is done by selecting \
a convenient combination of\\nCartan generators in order to get an Abelian \
$r$-matrix satisfying the\\nclassical Yang-Baxter equation. Our results \
provide another illustration of the\\nrelation between Abelian $r$-matrices \
and TsT transformations.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
