 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We consider several anisotropic extensions of the \
Belavin model, and show\\nthat integrability holds also for the massive case \
for some specific relations\\nbetween the coupling constants. This is done by \
relating the S-matrix\\nfactorization property to the exceptional solutions \
of the eight-vertex model.\\nThe relation of exceptional solutions to the XXZ \
and six-vertex models is also\\nshown.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
