        TagBox[
         TooltipBox[DiskBox[{14.815184815078643`, -2.8229186275442215`}, 0.],
          TagBox[
           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"1809.05705\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Dinh-Long Vu\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Ivan Kostov, Didina Serban and Dinh-Long Vu\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Boundary TBA, trees and loops\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"26 pages, 7 figures version 2: comments about \
non-diagonal scattering\\n  added version 3: comments on excited state \
g-function added, goal of section\\n  6 changed\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1016/j.nuclphysb.2019.114817\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"hep-th cond-mat.stat-mech\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We derive a graph expansion for the thermal partition \
function of solvable\\ntwo-dimensional models with boundaries. This expansion \
of the integration\\nmeasure over the virtual particles winding around the \
time cycle is obtained\\nwith the help of the matrix-tree theorem. The free \
energy is a sum over all\\nconnected graphs, which can be either trees or \
trees with one loop. The\\ngenerating function for the connected trees \
satisfies a non-linear integral\\nequation, which is equivalent to the TBA \
equation. The sum over connected\\ngraphs gives the bulk free energy as well \
as the exact g-functions for the two\\nboundaries. We reproduced the integral \
formula conjectured by Dorey,\\nFioravanti, Rim and Tateo, and proved \
subsequently by Pozsgay. The method is\\neasily extended to the case of \
non-diagonal bulk scattering and diagonal\\nreflection matrices. Our method \
can be extended to the case of non-diagonal\\nbulk scattering and diagonal \
reflection matrices with proper regularization.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Sat, 15 Sep 2018 12:03:31 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
