               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"1809.09453\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Jins de Jong\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Jins de Jong, Raimar Wulkenhaar\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Nonperturbative evaluation of the partition function for \
the real scalar\\n  quartic QFT on the Moyal plane at weak coupling\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1063/1.5063293\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"math-ph math.MP\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The remarkable properties of the real scalar quartic \
quantum field theory on\\nthe Moyal plane in combination with its similarity \
to the Kontsevich model make\\nthe model's partition function an interesting \
object to study. However, direct\\nevalua- tions is obstructed by the \
intertwining of the field's various modes. A\\nfactorization procedure to \
circumvent this problem is proposed and discussed\\nhere in the context of \
the real scalar quartic qft on the Moyal plane. This\\nfactorization consists \
of integrating against the asymptotic volume of the\\ndiagonal subpolytope of \
symmet- ric stochastic matrices. This volume has been\\ndetermined to this \
end. Using this method the partition function for regime of\\nweak coupling \
is computed. Using the same method it is as well possible to\\ndetermine the \
partition function and free energy density for other regimes.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Tue, 25 Sep 2018 13:08:16 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2019-09-04\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"de Jong\"", ",", "\"Jins\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"Wulkenhaar\"", ",", "\"Raimar\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}]}], "}"}]}]}}, RowSpacings -> 1, ColumnAlignments -> 
