            "Jins de Jong, Raimar Wulkenhaar", "title" -> 
            "Nonperturbative evaluation of the partition function for the \
real scalar\n  quartic QFT on the Moyal plane at weak coupling", "comments" -> 
            Null, "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> "10.1063/1.5063293", 
            "report-no" -> Null, "categories" -> "math-ph math.MP", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  The remarkable properties of the real scalar quartic quantum \
field theory on\nthe Moyal plane in combination with its similarity to the \
Kontsevich model make\nthe model's partition function an interesting object \
to study. However, direct\nevalua- tions is obstructed by the intertwining of \
the field's various modes. A\nfactorization procedure to circumvent this \
problem is proposed and discussed\nhere in the context of the real scalar \
quartic qft on the Moyal plane. This\nfactorization consists of integrating \
against the asymptotic volume of the\ndiagonal subpolytope of symmet- ric \
stochastic matrices. This volume has been\ndetermined to this end. Using this \
method the partition function for regime of\nweak coupling is computed. Using \
the same method it is as well possible to\ndetermine the partition function \
and free energy density for other regimes.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Tue, 25 Sep 2018 13:08:16 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2019-09-04", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"de Jong", "Jins", ""}, {
              "Wulkenhaar", "Raimar", ""}}}], "Tooltip"]& ], 
