                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this work several techniques to treat the partition \
function of the real\\nscalar quartic quantum field theory on the Moyal plane \
is discussed. A\\nfactorisation approach requires the polytope volume for the \
diagonal\\nsubpolytope of symmetric stochastic matrices. This is \
determined\\nasymptotically. The applicability of this method is tested for \
regime of weak\\ncoupling. Here the asymptotic character of the polytope \
volume alters the\\nmatrix structure of the original model leading to \
fictitious divergences.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
