                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  By considering a Gaussian truncation of ${\\\\cal \
N}=4$ super Yang-Mills, we\\nderive a set of Dyson equations that account for \
the ladder diagram\\ncontribution to connected correlators of circular Wilson \
loops. We consider\\ndifferent numbers of loops, with different relative \
orientations. We show that\\nthe Dyson equations admit a spectral \
representation in terms of eigenfunctions\\nof a Schr\\\\\\\"odinger problem, \
whose classical limit describes the strong coupling\\nlimit of the ladder \
resummation. We also verify that in supersymmetric cases\\nthe exact solution \
to the Dyson equations reproduces known matrix model\\nresults.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
