 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We construct a gauged linear sigma-model representation \
and develop a\\n1/N-expansion for flag manifold sigma-models previously \
proposed by the author.\\nClassically there exists a zero-curvature \
representation for the equations of\\nmotion of these models, which leads in \
particular to the existence of a\\nconserved non-local charge. We show that \
at the quantum level this charge is no\\nlonger conserved and calculate \
explicitly the anomaly in its conservation law.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
