minor\\n  modifications and corrections; v3: Slightly modified text \
corresponding to\\n  published version\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Phys. Rev. D 100, 046007 (2019)\""}]}, {
               
