non-perturbatively from the conformal\npartial wave expansion. Due to the \
extreme simplicity of our model, it could\nprovide an ideal playground for \
holography with no super-symmetry. Furthermore,\nsince the fishnet model and \
${\\cal N}=4$ SYM theory are continuously linked our\nconsideration could \
shed light on the derivation of AdS/CFT for the latter.\n", 
