$\\\\bar{\\\\mathcal{M}}_{g,n}$\\n  and correlation functions in NCQFT\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"39 pages, LaTeX. v2: references added, appendix \
suppressed (still\\n  contained in *.tex). A Mathematica implementation to \
compute all intersection\\n  numbers up to genus 10 (but easily extended) is \
provided as ancillary file.\\n  v3: relation to kappa classes added, a larger \
gap in proof of Prop 5.2\\n  filled, minor change of conventions, typos \
corrected\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
