            "39 pages, LaTeX. v2: references added, appendix suppressed \
(still\n  contained in *.tex). A Mathematica implementation to compute all \
intersection\n  numbers up to genus 10 (but easily extended) is provided as \
ancillary file.\n  v3: relation to kappa classes added, a larger gap in proof \
of Prop 5.2\n  filled, minor change of conventions, typos corrected", 
            "journal-ref" -> 
            "Communications in Mathematical Physics 399,481-517 (2023)", 
