               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We apply the recently proposed perturbative technique \
to solve the\\nsupergravity BPS equations of ${\\\\cal N}=1^*$ theories put \
on $S^4$. In\\nparticular, we have calculated the coefficients of the leading \
quartic terms\\nexactly, in the expression of the universal part for the \
holographic free\\nenergy as a function of the mass parameters. We also \
report on the coefficients\\nof higher order terms upto 10th order, which are \
computed numerically.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
