          TableForm[{
           "id" -> "1904.02038", "submitter" -> "Sejin Kim", "authors" -> 
            "Nakwoo Kim and Se-Jin Kim", "title" -> 
            "Perturbative solutions of ${\\cal N}=1^*$ holography on $S^4$", 
            "comments" -> 
            "v2: 15 pages, 2 figures, added references and discussion on \
gaugino\n  condensate etc, v3: typos corrected and comments added", 
            "journal-ref" -> "JHEP 07 (2019) 169", "doi" -> 
            "10.1007/JHEP07(2019)169", "report-no" -> Null, "categories" -> 
            "hep-th", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            
            "  We apply the recently proposed perturbative technique to solve \
the\nsupergravity BPS equations of ${\\cal N}=1^*$ theories put on $S^4$. In\n\
particular, we have calculated the coefficients of the leading quartic terms\n\
exactly, in the expression of the universal part for the holographic free\n\
energy as a function of the mass parameters. We also report on the \
coefficients\nof higher order terms upto 10th order, which are computed \
numerically.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
