            "Entanglement entropy of ${\\cal N}=2^*$ de Sitter vacuum", 
            "comments" -> "38 pages, 8 figures; v2: published version", 
            "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> "10.1016/j.nuclphysb.2019.114769",
             "report-no" -> Null, "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> 
