                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We use relativistic invariance to investigate two \
aspects of integrable\\nAdS${}_3$ string theory. Firstly, we write down the \
all-loop TBA equations for\\nthe massless sector of the theory with R-R flux, \
using the recently discovered\\nhidden relativistic symmetry. Secondly, for \
the low-energy relativistic limit\\nof the theory with NS-NS flux we write \
down the S matrix, dressing factors and\\nTBA. We find that the integrable \
system coincides with a restriction to\\nAdS${}_3$ of the relativistic \
q-deformed AdS${}_5$ theory. We also comment on\\nthe relativistic limit of \
the the small-$k$ NS-NS theory.\\n\""}]}, {
