 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the super instanton solution in the gauge \
theory with U$(n_{+}|\\nn_{-})$ gauge group. Based on the ADHM construction \
generalized to the\\nsupergroup theory, we derive the instanton partition \
function from the super\\ninstanton moduli space through the equivariant \
localization. We derive the\\nSeiberg-Witten geometry and its quantization \
for the supergroup gauge theory\\nfrom the instanton partition function, and \
study the connection with classical\\nand quantum integrable systems. We also \
argue the brane realization of the\\nsupergroup quiver gauge theory, and \
possible connection to the non-supergroup\\nquiver gauge theories.\\n\""}]}, {
              
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
