            "  We study string theory on the pp-wave geometry obtained by \
taking the Penrose\nlimit around a certain null geodesic of the \
non-supersymmetric Schrodinger\nbackground. We solve for the spectrum of \
bosonic excitations and find\ncompelling agreement with the dispersion \
