                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We derive a simple formula for the action of any \
supersymmetric solution to\\nminimal gauged supergravity in the \
AdS$_4$/CFT$_3$ correspondence. Such\\nsolutions are equipped with a \
supersymmetric Killing vector, and we show that\\nthe holographically \
renormalized action may be expressed entirely in terms of\\nthe weights of \
this vector field at its fixed points, together with certain\\ntopological \
data. In this sense, the classical gravitational partition \
function\\nlocalizes in the bulk. We illustrate our general formula with a \
number of\\nexplicit examples, in which exact dual field theory computations \
are also\\navailable, which include supersymmetric Taub-NUT and Taub-bolt \
type spacetimes,\\nas well as black hole solutions. Our simple topological \
formula also allows us\\nto write down the action of any solution, provided \
it exists.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
