Theories\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"39+21 pages\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP09(2019)025\""}]}, {
               
