 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study confining strings in massive adjoint \
two-dimensional chromodynamics.\\nOff-shell, as a consequence of zigzag \
formation, the resulting worldsheet\\ntheory provides a non-trivial dynamical \
realization of infinite quon\\nstatistics. Taking the high energy limit we \
identify a remarkably simple and\\nnovel integrable relativistic $N$-body \
system. Its symmetry algebra contains an\\nadditional \\\"shadow\\\" \
Poincar\\\\'e subalgebra. This model describes the\\n$N$-particle subsector \
of a $T\\\\bar T$-deformed massless fermion.\\n\""}]}, {
