            "  We study confining strings in massive adjoint two-dimensional \
chromodynamics.\nOff-shell, as a consequence of zigzag formation, the \
resulting worldsheet\ntheory provides a non-trivial dynamical realization of \
infinite quon\nstatistics. Taking the high energy limit we identify a \
