Faraggi, Leopoldo A.\\n  Pando Zayas and Guillermo A. Silva\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"One-loop Holography with Strings in \
$AdS_4\\\\times\\\\mathbb {CP}^3$\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"14 pages; v2: references added, comment about boundary \
conditions\\n  added\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP10(2019)070\""}]}, {
