Olaf Nackenhorst\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"From the Bottom to the Top -- Reconstruction of \
$t\\\\bar{t}$ Events with\\n  Deep Learning\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"28 pages, 17 figures, 5 tables, accepted for publication \
in JINST\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
