Hilburn\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Mirror symmetry and line operators\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"117 pages + appendices; v2 added references, corrected \
typo in\\n  (C.31); v3 references and many small clarifications added; typos \
fixed; v4\\n  minor edits to appendix C; v5 minor typos fixed, references \
clarified\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP02(2020)075\""}]}, {
