                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Gauge Theory And Integrability, III\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"108 pages, 19 figures\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"IPMU19-0110\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"hep-th cond-mat.stat-mech math-ph math.MP nlin.SI\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study two-dimensional integrable field theories from \
the viewpoint of the\\nfour-dimensional Chern-Simons-type gauge theory \
introduced recently. The\\nintegrable field theories are realized as \
effective theories for the\\nfour-dimensional theory coupled with \
two-dimensional surface defects, and we\\ncan systematically compute their \
Lagrangians and the Lax operators satisfying\\nthe zero-curvature condition. \
Our construction includes many known integrable\\nfield theories, such as \
Gross-Neveu models, principal chiral models with\\nWess-Zumino terms and \
symmetric-space coset sigma models. Moreover we obtain\\nvarious \
generalization these models in a number of different directions, such\\nas \
trigonometric/elliptic deformations, multi-defect generalizations and \
models\\nassociated with higher-genus spectral curves, many of which seem to \
be new.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Tue, 6 Aug 2019 18:00:00 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
              
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2019-08-08\""}]}, {
