23 (2019)\\n  1930011\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1142/S0217751X19300114\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
