                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The classical spectral curve for the worldsheet theory \
of the AdS_5 x S^5\\nlambda superstring is constructed. The lambda string is \
interpreted as a\\nregularized, non-abelian T dual of the AdS_5 x S^5 \
superstring with respect to\\nfull PSU(2,2|4) symmetry. The form of the curve \
is identified as the\\nsemi-classical limit of a set of Bethe ansatz \
equations for an XXZ type spin\\nchain for the supergroup PSU(2,2|4) in \
contrast to the string in AdS_5 x S^5\\nwhich is XXX type.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
