Alessandro\\n  Tanzini\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Circular quiver gauge theories, isomonodromic \
deformations and $W_N$\\n  fermions on the torus\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"35 pages, 7 figures\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
