Zabzine\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Exact SUSY Wilson loops on $S^3$ from $q$-Virasoro \
constraints\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"30 pages, 1 figure; v2: typos fixed, JHEP version\""}]}, {
              
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
