 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We compute the dilatation operator for local \\\"open \
string\\\" operators situated\\nat the interface of a certain supersymmetric \
defect version of $\\\\mathcal{N}=4$\\nsuper-Yang-Mills theory. This field \
theory is dual to a probe D5-brane\\nintersecting a stack of D3-branes where \
the number of D3-branes can change\\nbetween the two sides the interface. \
DeWolfe and Mann obtained the dilation\\noperator in the special case of an \
equal number of D3-branes. Using a\\ncombination explicit field theory \
calculations and integrability considerations\\nwe are able to extend this \
result to the general case.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
