               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Neumann-Rosochatius system for strings in ABJ \
Model\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"20 pages, several typos corrected. Better presented. \
Added\\n  references. To appear in JHEP\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP12(2019)024\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Neumann-Rosochatius system is a well known one \
dimensional integrable system.\\nWe study the rotating and pulsating string \
in $AdS_4 \\\\times \\\\mathbb{CP}^3$ with\\na $B_{\\\\rm{NS}}$ holonomy \
turned on over $\\\\mathbb{CP}^1 \\\\subset \\\\mathbb{CP}^3$,\\nor the so \
called Aharony-Bergman-Jafferis (ABJ) background. We observe that \
the\\nstring equations of motion in both cases are integrable and the \
Lagrangians\\nreduce to a form similar to that of deformed Neuman-Rosochatius \
system. We find\\nout the scaling relations among various conserved charges \
and comment on the\\nfinite size effect for the dyonic giant magnons on \
$R_{t}\\\\times\\n\\\\mathbb{CP}^{3}$ with two angular momenta. For the \
pulsating string we derive\\nthe energy as function of oscillation number and \
angular momenta along\\n$\\\\mathbb{CP}^{3}$.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Fri, 27 Sep 2019 11:38:24 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v2\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Tue, 1 Oct 2019 13:15:29 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
