 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this work we provide a localization formulae for odd \
holomorphic super\\nvector fields on compact complex supermanifolds with \
fermionic dimension equal\\nto the bosonic dimension. We prove a residue \
theorem for holomorphic super\\nvector fields with non-degenerated and \
isolated singularities and we determine\\nthe residues under certain generic \
local conditions.\\n\""}]}, {
