 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We discuss finite-size corrections to the spiky strings \
in $AdS$ space which\\nis dual to the long $\\\\mathcal{N}=4$ SYM operators \
of the form Tr($\\\\Delta_+\\n^{J_1}\\\\phi_1\\\\Delta_+ ^{J_2}\\\\phi_2...\\\
\\Delta_+ ^{J_n}\\\\phi_n$). We express the\\nfinite-size dispersion relation \
in terms of Lambert $\\\\mathbf{W}$-function. We\\nfurther establish the \
finite-size scaling relation between energy and angular\\nmomentum of the \
spiky string in presence of mixed fluxes in terms \
of\\n$\\\\mathbf{W}$-function. We comment on the solution in pure NS-NS \
background as\\nwell.\\n\""}]}, {
