                 "\"  We explore \\\\emph{folded} spinning string \
configurations over torsional Newton\\nCartan (TNC) geometry with $ \
R\\\\times S^2 $ topology within the semiclassical\\napproximation. We \
consider the large $ c $ and/or nonrelativistic (NR) limit\\nassociated with \
the world-sheet d.o.f. and compute the one loop stringy\\ncorrections to the \
energy spectrum in the dual Spin Matrix Theory (SMT) theory\\nin the limit of \
strong ($ \\\\mathtt{g}\\\\gg 1 $) coupling.\\n\""}]}, {
