 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Compact expressions in terms of the Q-functions of the \
Quantum Spectral Curve\\nare given for 3-cusped fundamental Wilson loops in \
the ladders limit of\\n$\\\\mathcal{N}=4$ Super Yang-Mills with additional \
scalars inserted at a cusp\\nbetween uncoupled arcs. This gives some further \
credence to the already natural\\nand evidenced view that the Quantum \
Spectral Curve in fact pertains to a wide\\nclass of observables beyond the \
spectrum, as well as providing additional\\nnonperturbative ladders limit \
results.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
