 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We investigate the analytic properties of the exact \
magnon S matrix of string\\ntheory on AdS_3 x S^3 x T^4 with R-R flux. We \
show that the previously proposed\\ndressing factors have the exact \
double-pole/zero structure expected from Landau\\nbox diagrams. This \
constitutes a strong consistency check of our dressing\\nfactors, much as the \
Dorey-Hofman-Maldacena poles do for the all-loop dressing\\nfactor in AdS_5 x \
S^5.\\n\""}]}, {
