and Giovanni\\n  Ramirez\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Gravitational realization of magnons in a ferromagnetic \
spin chain\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"9 pages. Heavy editing, conceptual issues \
corrected\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
