 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The mean-square width of the energy profile of bosonic \
string is calculated\\nconsidering two boundary terms in the effective \
action. The perturbative\\nexpansion of the Lorentz-invariant boundary terms \
at the second and the fourth\\norder in the effective action is taken around \
the free Nambu-Goto string. The\\ncalculation are presented for open strings \
with Dirichlet boundary condition on\\ncylinder.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
