Perturbative Construction\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"26 pages, 3 figures\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Chin. Phys. C 44 (2020) 7, 073104\""}]}, {
