 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this paper we discuss correlation function \
computations in massive\\ntopological Landau-Ginzburg orbifolds, extending \
old results of Vafa. We then\\napply these computations to provide further \
tests of the nonabelian mirrors\\nproposal and two-dimensional Hori-Seiberg \
dualities with $(S)O_{\\\\pm}$ gauge\\ngroups and their mirrors.\\n\""}]}, {
