 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We present the first known integrable relativistic \
field theories with\\ninteracting massive and massless sectors. And we \
demonstrate that knowledge of\\nthe massless sector is essential for \
understanding of the spectrum of the\\nmassive sector. Terms in this spectrum \
polynomial in the spatial volume (the\\naccuracy for which the Bethe ansatz \
would suffice in a massive theory) require\\nnot just L\\\\\\\"uscher-like \
corrections (usually exponentially small) but the full\\nTBA integral \
equations. We are motivated by the implications of these ideas for\\nAdS/CFT, \
but present here only field-theory results.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
