                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study supersymmetric Wilson loops from a geometrical \
perspective. To this\\nend, we propose a new formulation of these operators \
in terms of an integral\\nform associated to the immersion of the loop into a \
supermanifold. This\\napproach provides a unifying description of Wilson \
loops preserving different\\nsets of supercharges, and clarifies the flow \
between them. Moreover, it allows\\nto exploit the powerful techniques of \
super-differential calculus for\\ninvestigating their symmetries. As \
remarkable examples, we discuss\\nsupersymmetry and kappa-symmetry \
invariance.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
