 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In the paper arXiv:2002.12065, the authors developed a \
new method to compute\\nthe exact overlap formulas between integrable \
boundary states and on-shell\\nBethe states in integrable spin chains. This \
method utilizes the coordinate\\nBethe ansatz representation of wave \
functions and singularity property of the\\noff-shell overlaps. In this \
paper, we use this new method to derive the formula\\nfor overlaps between \
the Lieb-Liniger Bethe states and the Bose-Einstein\\ncondensate (BEC) state. \
As a simple application this method, we obtained the\\noverlaps between the \
Lieb-Liniger eigenstates and the free particle states with\\npair \
structure.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
