            "  When the $SU(N)$ ${\\cal N} = 4$ super-Yang-Mills (SYM) theory \
with\ncomplexified gauge coupling $\\tau$ is placed on a round four-sphere \
and\ndeformed by an ${\\cal N} = 2$-preserving mass parameter $m$, its free \
