 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We use Dirac-Born-Infeld action to study the spinning \
D-string in $AdS_3 $\\nbackground in the presence of both NS-NS and RR \
fluxes. We compute the scaling\\nrelation between the energy (E) and spin (S) \
in the `long string limit'. The\\nenergy of these spiky string is found to be \
a function of spin with the leading\\nlogarithmic behaviour and the scaling \
relation appears to be independent of the\\namount of flux present. We \
further discuss folded D-string solutions in $AdS_3$\\nbackground with pure \
NS-NS and R-R fluxes.\\n\""}]}, {
