 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We present a two-loop calculation of the supersymmetric \
circular Wilson loop\\nin the N=2* super Yang-Mills theory on the \
four-sphere. We develop an efficient\\nframework for computing contributing \
Feynman graphs that relies on using the\\nembedding coordinates combined with \
the Mellin-Barnes techniques for\\npropagator-like integrals on the sphere. \
Our results exactly match predictions\\nof supersymmetric localization \
providing a nontrivial consistency check for the\\nlatter in non-conformal \
settings.\\n\""}]}, {
