 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We consider the expectation value of Wilson lines in \
two defect versions of N\\n= 4 SYM, both with supersymmetry completely \
broken, where one is described in\\nterms of an integrable boundary state, \
the other one not. For both cases,\\nimposing a certain double scaling limit, \
we find agreement to two leading\\norders between the expectation values \
calculated from respectively the field\\ntheory and the string theory side of \
the AdS/dCFT correspondence.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
