                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"26 pages, no figures; v2: added references, minor \
typographical\\n  improvements; v3: incorporated referee's suggestions, \
version to appear in\\n  JHEP; v4: corrected typo in (3.8) - (3.9)\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
