         Annotation[#, 
          
          TableForm[{
           "id" -> "2004.11329", "submitter" -> "Tamas Gombor", "authors" -> 
            "Tamas Gombor, Zoltan Bajnok", "title" -> 
            "Boundary states, overlaps, nesting and bootstrapping AdS/dCFT", 
            "comments" -> "minor corrections", "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> 
            "10.1007/JHEP10(2020)123", "report-no" -> Null, "categories" -> 
            "hep-th", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  Integrable boundary states can be built up from pair \
annihilation amplitudes\ncalled $K$-matrices. These amplitudes are related to \
mirror reflections and\nthey both satisfy Yang Baxter equations, which can be \
twisted or untwisted. We\nrelate these two notions to each other and show how \
they are fixed by the\nunbroken symmetries, which, together with the full \
symmetry, must form\nsymmetric pairs. We show that the twisted nature of the \
$K$-matrix implies\nspecific selection rules for the overlaps. If the Bethe \
roots of the same type\nare paired the overlap is called chiral, otherwise it \
is achiral and they\ncorrespond to untwisted and twisted $K$-matrices, \
respectively. We use these\nfindings to develop a nesting procedure for \
$K$-matrices, which provides the\nfactorizing overlaps for higher rank \
algebras automatically. We apply these\nmethods for the calculation of the \
simplest asymptotic all-loop 1-point\nfunctions in AdS/dCFT. In doing so we \
classify the solutions of the YBE for the\n$K$-matrices with centrally \
extended $\\mathfrak{su}(2|2)_{c}$ symmetry and\ncalculate the generic \
overlaps in terms of Bethe roots and ratio of Gaudin\ndeterminants.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Thu, 23 Apr 2020 17:25:17 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Mon, 27 Apr 2020 15:45:29 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v3", "created" -> 
               "Fri, 3 Jul 2020 09:11:28 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2020-12-02", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"Gombor", "Tamas", ""}, {
              "Bajnok", "Zoltan", ""}}}], "Tooltip"]& ], 
