 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  An overview of matter-coupled ${\\\\cal N}=2$ \
supergravity theories with 8 real\\nsupercharges, in 4,5 and 6 dimensions is \
given. The construction of the\\ntheories by superconformal methods is \
explained from basic principles. Special\\ngeometry is obtained and \
characterized. The relation between the theories in\\nthose dimensions is \
discussed. This leads to the concepts of very special\\ngeometry and \
quaternionic-K\\\\\\\"ahler manifolds, whose structures are \
explained.\\n\""}]}, {
