                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"From $\\\\mathcal{N}=4$ Super-Yang-Mills on \
$\\\\mathbb{RP}^4$ to bosonic\\n  Yang-Mills on $\\\\mathbb{RP}^2$\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"28 pages\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
