 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  A new supersymmetric D7-brane embedding in the \
Pilch-Warner gravitational\\nbackground is found exactly, by solving the \
supersymmetric condition. In the\\ndual holographic picture, our setting \
corresponds to adding a quenched\\nfundamental matter sector to N=2* super \
Yang-Mills theory, at zero temperature.\\nWe show that previous results in \
the same setting are missing the Wess-Zumino\\nterm in the D-brane action, \
and how our results complete the picture.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
