            "Exact D7-brane embedding in the Pilch-Warner background", 
            "comments" -> 
            "JHEP accepted version, with holo-rg significantly expanded and \
other\n  improvements", "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> 
            "10.1007/JHEP09(2020)087", "report-no" -> Null, "categories" -> 
            "hep-th", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  A new supersymmetric D7-brane embedding in the Pilch-Warner \
gravitational\nbackground is found exactly, by solving the supersymmetric \
condition. In the\ndual holographic picture, our setting corresponds to \
adding a quenched\nfundamental matter sector to N=2* super Yang-Mills theory, \
at zero temperature.\nWe show that previous results in the same setting are \
missing the Wess-Zumino\nterm in the D-brane action, and how our results \
complete the picture.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Thu, 4 Jun 2020 17:18:19 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Mon, 17 Aug 2020 17:07:43 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2020-10-28", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"Chen-Lin", "Xinyi", ""}, {
              "Dekel", "Amit", ""}}}], "Tooltip"]& ], 
