 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We obtain explicit formulas for the eight bosonic and \
eight fermionic\\nfluctuations around the mixed-flux generalization of the \
Hofman-Maldacena giant\\nmagnon on AdS$_3 \\\\times$S$^3 \\\\times$T$^4$ and \
AdS$_3 \\\\times$S$^3 \\\\times$S$^3\\n\\\\times$S$^1$. As a check of our \
results, we confirm that the semiclassical\\nquantization of these \
fluctuations leads to a vanishing one-loop correction to\\nthe magnon energy, \
as expected from symmetry based arguments.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
