Ricci flow\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"41 pages, 6 figures\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Commun. Math. Phys. 401, 1-32 (2023)\""}]}, {
               
