Zimmermann\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"The twisted story of worldsheet scattering in \
$\\\\eta$-deformed $AdS_5\\n  \\\\times S^5$\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"40 pages, published in JHEP, v4: minor \
clarifications\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP12(2020)043\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the worldsheet scattering theory of the \
$\\\\eta$ deformation of the\\nAdS$_\\\\mathsf{5} \\\\times \
$S$^\\\\mathsf{5}$ superstring corresponding to the purely\\nfermionic Dynkin \
diagram. This theory is a Weyl-invariant integrable\\ndeformation of the \
AdS$_\\\\mathsf{5} \\\\times $S$^\\\\mathsf{5}$ superstring, \
with\\ntrigonometric quantum-deformed symmetry. We compute the two-body \
worldsheet S\\nmatrix of this string in the light-cone gauge at tree level to \
quadratic order\\nin fermions. The result factorizes into two elementary \
blocks, and solves the\\nclassical Yang-Baxter equation. We also determine \
the corresponding exact\\nfactorized S matrix, and show that its perturbative \
expansion matches our\\ntree-level results, once we correctly identify the \
deformed light-cone symmetry\\nalgebra of the string. Finally, we briefly \
revisit the computation of the\\ncorresponding S matrix for the $\\\\eta$ \
deformation based on the distinguished\\nDynkin diagram, finding a tree-level \
S matrix that factorizes and solves the\\nclassical Yang-Baxter equation, in \
contrast to previous results.\\n\""}]}, {
