            "authors" -> "Leonardo Santilli and Miguel Tierz", "title" -> 
            "Exact results and Schur expansions in quiver Chern-Simons-matter\
\n  theories", "comments" -> 
            "i+65 pages, 21 figures, v2: minor typos corrected", 
