Loop\n  equations and conjectures", "comments" -> 
            "53 pages, 13 figures. v2: proofs in appendix E considerably\n  \
simplified, typos corrected. v3: added reference arXiv:2103.13271, where we\n \
 have proved the main conjecture for $g=0$. v4: rearrangements to improve\n  \
readability, graphical interpretation of loop equations added, analogies to\n \
 the 2-matrix model emphasised", "journal-ref" -> 
