            "Analytic Bootstrap for Perturbative Conformal Field Theories", 
            "comments" -> 
            "DPhil thesis. 221 pages, 11 figures. Sections 6.3 and 6.4 \
contain\n  some previously unpublished results. v2: typos corrected", 
