plus Wess-Zumino\\n  term\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"45 pages; v2: 46 pages, comments added, matches published \
version\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1088/1751-8121/abc43d\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"ZMP-HH/20-17\""}]}, {
