${\\\\cal N} = 4$ Gauge\\n  Theories\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"73 pages; 12 figures; v2: corrected various typos in text \
and\\n  figures, updated presentation removes introduction of Wilson loops \
for\\n  clarity\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
