               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We present an exact solution to the asymptotic Bethe \
equation of weakly\\nanisotropic Heisenberg spin chain, which is a set of \
non-linear algebraic\\nequations. The solution describes the low-energy \
excitations above\\nferromagnetic ground state with fixed magnetisation, and \
it has a close\\nrelation to generalised Jacobi polynomial. It is equivalent \
to a generalised\\nStieltjes problem and in the continuous limit, it becomes \
a Riemann-Hilbert\\nproblem closely related to the finite-gap solutions of \
classical\\nLandau-Lifshitz field theory.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
