 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We provide a universal microscopic counting for the \
microstates of the\\nasymptotically AdS black holes and black strings that \
arise as solutions of the\\nhalf-maximal gauged supergravity in four and five \
dimensions. These solutions\\ncan be embedded in all M-theory and type II \
string backgrounds with an AdS\\nvacuum and sixteen supercharges and provide \
an infinite set of examples dual to\\n$\\\\mathcal{N}=2$ and \
$\\\\mathcal{N}=4$ conformal field theories in four and three\\ndimensions, \
respectively. The counting is universal and it is performed by\\neither \
studying the large $N$ limit of the relevant supersymmetric index of \
the\\ndual field theory or by using the charged Cardy formula.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
