KK5-branes\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"33 pages, multi-centered case corrected, appendix F \
added, typos\\n  corrected, matching version to be published in PTEP\""}]}, {
               
