         Annotation[#, 
          
          TableForm[{
           "id" -> "2012.04664", "submitter" -> "Wei Gu", "authors" -> 
            "Wei Gu, Jirui Guo, Yaoxiong Wen", "title" -> 
            "Nonabelian mirrors and Gromov-Witten invariants", "comments" -> 
            "71 pages", "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> Null, "report-no" -> 
            Null, "categories" -> "hep-th math.AG", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  We propose Picard-Fuchs equations for periods of nonabelian \
mirrors in this\npaper. The number of parameters in our Picard-Fuchs \
equations is the rank of\nthe gauge group of the nonabelian GLSM, which is \
eventually reduced to the\nactual number of K\\\"{a}hler parameters. These \
Picard-Fuchs equations are\nconcise and novel. We justify our proposal by \
reproducing existing mathematical\nresults, namely Picard-Fuchs equations of \
Grassmannians and Calabi-Yau\nmanifolds as complete intersections in \
Grassmannians. Furthermore, our approach\ncan be applied to other nonabelian \
GLSMs, so we compute Picard-Fuchs equations\nof some other Fano-spaces, which \
were not calculated in the literature before.\nFinally, the cohomology-valued \
generating functions of mirrors can be read off\nfrom our Picard-Fuchs \
equations. Using these generating functions, we compute\nGromov-Witten \
invariants of various Calabi-Yau manifolds, including complete\nintersection \
Calabi-Yau manifolds in Grassmannians and non-complete\nintersection \
Calabi-Yau examples such as Pfaffian Calabi-Yau threefold and\nGulliksen-Neg{\
\\aa}rd Calabi-Yau threefold, and find agreement with existing\nresults in \
the literature. The generating functions we propose for non-complete\n\
intersection Calabi-Yau manifolds are genuinely new.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Tue, 8 Dec 2020 19:00:02 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2020-12-10", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"Gu", "Wei", ""}, {"Guo", "Jirui", ""}, {
              "Wen", "Yaoxiong", ""}}}], "Tooltip"]& ], 
