                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We derive the Faddeev-Reshetikhin (FR) model from a \
four-dimensional Chern-\\nSimons theory with two order surface defects by \
following the work by Costello\\nand Yamazaki [arXiv:1908.02289]. Then we \
present a trigonometric deformation of\\nthe FR model by employing a boundary \
condition with an R-operator of\\nDrinfeld-Jimbo type. This is a \
generalization of the work by Delduc, Lacroix,\\nMagro and Vicedo \
[arXiv:1909.13824] from the disorder surface defect case to\\nthe order \
one.\\n\""}]}, {
