               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Habilitation memoir. 308 pages; v2. minor updates, typos \
corrected;\\n  v3. reference updated, typos corrected. This is a preprint of \
the following\\n  work: Taro Kimura, Instanton Counting, Quantum Geometry and \
Algebra, 2021,\\n  Springer, reproduced with permission of Springer Nature \
