            "Flag manifold sigma models: spin chains and integrable theories",
             "comments" -> "146 pages, 22 figures", "journal-ref" -> 
            "Phys.Rept. 953 (2022) 1-93", "doi" -> 
            "10.1016/j.physrep.2021.09.004", "report-no" -> Null, 
