               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We review the construction of almost contact metric \
(three-) structures,\\nabbreviated ACM(3)S, on manifolds with a $G_2$ \
structure. These are of interest\\nfor certain supersymmetric configurations \
in string and M-theory. We compute\\nthe torsion of the $SU(3)$ structure \
associated to an ACMS and apply these\\ncomputations to heterotic $G_2$ \
systems and supersymmetry enhancement. We\\ninitiate the study of the space \
of ACM3Ss, which is an infinite dimensional\\nspace with a local product \
structure and interesting topological features.\\nTantalising links between \
ACM3Ss and associative and coassociative submanifolds\\nare \
observed.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
