               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this article we construct the effective field theory \
associated to the\\n$\\\\mathbb{R}\\\\times S^3$ sector of the \
three-parameter deformation of $AdS_3\\n\\\\times S^3 \\\\times T^4$ in the \
Landau-Lifshitz approximation. We use this action\\nto compute the dispersion \
relation of excitations around the BMN vacuum and the\\nperturbative \
$S$-matrix associated to them. We are able to compute and sum all\\nthe \
different loop contributions to the $S$-matrix in this limit.\\n\""}]}, {
