Jr., Alessandro\\n  Torrielli\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Protected states in $\\\\mbox{AdS}_3$ backgrounds from \
integrability\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"35 pages; v2 typos fixed, references added\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1088/1751-8121/ac21e5\""}]}, {
               
