            "  We propose an interesting BPS/CFT correspondence playground: \
the correlation\nfunction of two intersecting half-BPS surface defects in \
four-dimensional\n$\\mathcal{N}=2$ supersymmetric $SU(N)$ gauge theory with \
$2N$ fundamental\nhypermultiplets. We show it satisfies a difference \
