                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The trigonometric six-vertex model with domain wall \
boundary conditions and\\none partially reflecting end on a lattice of size \
$2n\\\\times m$, $m\\\\leq n$, is\\nconsidered. The partition function is \
computed using the Izergin-Korepin\\nmethod, generalizing the result of Foda \
and Zarembo from the rational to the\\ntrigonometric case. Thereafter we \
specify the parameters in Kuperberg's way to\\nget a formula for the number \
of states as a determinant of Wilson polynomials.\\nWe relate this to a type \
of ASM-like matrices.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
