            "  We consider the expectation value $\\langle \\cal W \\rangle$ \
of the circular\nBPS Wilson loop in ${\\cal N}=2$ superconformal $SU(N)$ \
gauge theory containing\na vector multiplet coupled to two hypermultiplets in \
rank-2 symmetric and\nantisymmetric representations. This model admits a \
regular large $N$ expansion,\nis planar-equivalent to ${\\cal N}=4$ SYM \
theory and is expected to be dual to a\ncertain orbifold/orientifold \
projection of AdS$_5\\times S^5$ superstring\ntheory. On the string theory \
