 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We compute, to the lowest perturbative order in $SU(N)$ \
Yang-Mills theory,\\n$n$-point correlators in the coordinate and momentum \
representation of the\\ngauge-invariant twist-$2$ operators with maximal spin \
along the $p_+$\\ndirection, both in Minkowskian and -- by analytic \
continuation -- Euclidean\\nspace-time. We also construct the corresponding \
generating functionals.\\nRemarkably, they have the structure of the \
logarithm of a functional\\ndeterminant of the identity plus a term involving \
the effective propagators\\nthat act on the appropriate source \
fields.\\n\""}]}, {
