               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We complete the program of 2012.15792 about \
perturbative approaches for\\n$\\\\mathcal{N}=2$ superconformal quiver \
theories in four dimensions. We consider\\nseveral classes of observables in \
presence of Wilson loops, and we evaluate\\nthem with the help of \
supersymmetric localization. We compute Wilson loop\\nvacuum expectation \
values, correlators of multiple coincident Wilson loops and\\none-point \
functions of chiral operators in presence of them acting as\\nsuperconformal \
defects. We extend this analysis to the most general case\\nconsidering \
chiral operators and multiple Wilson loops scattered in all the\\npossible \
ways among the vector multiplets of the quiver. Finally, we \
identify\\ntwisted and untwisted observables which probe the orbifold of \
$AdS_5\\\\times S^5$\\nwith the aim of testing possible holographic \
perspectives of quiver theories in\\n$\\\\mathcal{N}=2$.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
