            "authors" -> "Francesco Galvagno, Michelangelo Preti", "title" -> 
            "Wilson loop correlators in $\\mathcal{N}=2$ superconformal \
quivers", "comments" -> "44 pages, 5 figures", "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> 
            "10.1007/JHEP11(2021)023", "report-no" -> Null, "categories" -> 
            "hep-th", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  We complete the program of 2012.15792 about perturbative \
approaches for\n$\\mathcal{N}=2$ superconformal quiver theories in four \
dimensions. We consider\nseveral classes of observables in presence of Wilson \
loops, and we evaluate\nthem with the help of supersymmetric localization. We \
compute Wilson loop\nvacuum expectation values, correlators of multiple \
coincident Wilson loops and\none-point functions of chiral operators in \
presence of them acting as\nsuperconformal defects. We extend this analysis \
to the most general case\nconsidering chiral operators and multiple Wilson \
loops scattered in all the\npossible ways among the vector multiplets of the \
quiver. Finally, we identify\ntwisted and untwisted observables which probe \
the orbifold of $AdS_5\\times S^5$\nwith the aim of testing possible \
holographic perspectives of quiver theories in\n$\\mathcal{N}=2$.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Sat, 1 May 2021 14:20:12 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
