harmonic superspace\napproaches to construct the full set of the maximally \
supersymmetric on-shell\ninvariants of the canonical dimension ${\\bf d=12}$ \
in $6D, \\,{\\cal N}=(1,1)$\nsupersymmetric Yang-Mills (SYM) theory. Both \
single- and double-trace\ninvariants are derived. Only four single-trace and \
two double-trace invariants\nprove to be independent. The invariants \
