Alexandre\\n  Krajenbrink and De-liang Zhong\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Fishnet four-point integrals: integrable representations \
and\\n  thermodynamic limits\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"44 pages, 8 figures\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP07(2021)168\""}]}, {
