            "A study of integrable form factors in massless relativistic \
AdS_3", "comments" -> 
            "PDFLaTeX, 51 pages, 10 figures; v2: minor changes, version to \
appear\n  in J Phys A; v3: more typos spotted", "journal-ref" -> 
