Konstantin Zarembo\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Duality Relations for Overlaps of Integrable Boundary \
States in AdS/dCFT\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"28 pages, 3 figures; v2: minor changes\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP09(2021)004\""}]}, {
                
