           "id" -> "2107.12398", "submitter" -> "Kiril Hristov", "authors" -> 
            "Kiril Hristov, Valentin Reys", "title" -> 
            "Factorization of log-corrections in AdS$_4$/CFT$_3$ from \
supergravity\n  localization", "comments" -> 
            "35 pages; v2 minor corrections, references added", "journal-ref" -> 
            Null, "doi" -> "10.1007/JHEP12(2021)031", "report-no" -> Null, 
            "categories" -> "hep-th math.DG", "license" -> 
            "http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  We use the Atiyah-Singer index theorem to derive the general \
form of the\none-loop corrections to observables in asymptotically anti-de \
Sitter (AdS$_4$)\nsupersymmetric backgrounds of abelian gauged supergravity. \
Using the method of\nsupergravity localization combined with the \
factorization of the supergravity\naction on fixed points (NUTs) and fixed \
two-manifolds (Bolts) we show that an\nanalogous factorization takes place \
for the one-loop determinants of\nsupergravity fields. This allows us to \
propose a general fixed-point formula\nfor the logarithmic corrections to a \
large class of supersymmetric partition\nfunctions in the large $N$ expansion \
of a given 3d dual theory. The corrections\nare uniquely fixed by some simple \
topological data pertaining to a particular\nbackground in the form of its \
regularized Euler characteristic $\\chi$, together\nwith a single dynamical \
coefficient that counts the underlying degrees of\nfreedom of the theory.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Mon, 26 Jul 2021 18:00:08 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Wed, 4 Aug 2021 12:07:02 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2022-01-05", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"Hristov", "Kiril", ""}, {
              "Reys", "Valentin", ""}}}], "Tooltip"]& ], 
        TagBox[
         TooltipBox[DiskBox[{19.509662730914837`, -4.408151365418445}, 0.],
