operators in the\npresence of a supersymmetric Wilson line in \
$\\mathcal{N}=4$ SYM. We use\ninversion formula technology in order to \
reconstruct the CFT data starting from\na single discontinuity of the \
correlator. In the planar strong coupling limit\nonly a finite number of \
conformal blocks contributes to the discontinuity,\nwhich allows us to obtain \
elegant closed-form expressions for two-point\nfunctions of single-trace \
operators $\\mathcal{O}_J$ of weight $J=2,3,4$. Our\nfinal result passes a \
