it satisfies the superconformal Ward identities, it has\na sensible expansion \
in both defect and bulk OPEs, and is consistent with\navailable results \
coming from localization. The method is completely\nalgorithmic and can be \
implemented to calculate correlators of arbitrary\nweight.\n", 
