                 "\"On quantum corrections to BPS Wilson loops in superstring \
theory on\\n  $\\\\mathbf{AdS_3\\\\times S^3 \\\\times T^4}$ with mixed \
flux\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Corrected typos in equation 2.8\""}]}, {
