statement\\n  about fluctuations around the geodesic at the end of Sec. 4, \
and presented\\n  explicit calculations in Appendix A. Conclusion of the \
paper is unchanged\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Prog Theor Exp Phys (2022)\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1093/ptep/ptac041\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"RUP-21-18, WUCG-21-11\""}]}, {
