                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We find classical closed string solutions to the \
non-relativistic\\nAdS$_5\\\\times$S$^5$ string theory which are the analogue \
of the BMN and GKP\\nsolutions for the relativistic theory. We show that \
non-relativistic\\nAdS$_5\\\\times$S$^5$ string theory admits a \
$\\\\mathbb{Z}_2$ orbifold symmetry\\nwhich allows us to impose twisted \
boundary conditions. Among the solutions in\\nthe twisted sector, we find the \
one around which the semiclassical expansion in\\narXiv:2102.00008 takes \
place.\\n\""}]}, {
