               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2109.14699\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Richard Szabo\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Lotte Hollands, Philipp R\\\\\\\"uter, Richard J. \
Szabo\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"A geometric recipe for twisted superpotentials\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"102 pages, 42 figures; v2: references added\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP12(2021)164\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"EMPG-20-02\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"hep-th math-ph math.AG math.DG math.MP\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We give a pedagogical introduction to spectral networks \
and abelianization,\\nas well as their relevance to $\\\\mathcal{N}=2$ \
supersymmetric field theories in\\nfour dimensions. Motivated by a conjecture \
of Nekrasov-Rosly-Shatashvili, we\\ndetail a geometric recipe for computing \
the effective twisted superpotential\\nfor $\\\\mathcal{N}=2$ field theories \
of class $\\\\mathcal{S}$ as a generating\\nfunction of the brane of opers, \
with respect to the spectral coordinates found\\nfrom abelianization. We \
present two new examples, the simplest Argyres-Douglas\\ntheory and the pure \
$SU(2)$ gauge theory, while we conjecture the\\n$\\\\epsilon$-expansion of \
the effective twisted superpotential for the $E_6$\\nMinahan-Nemeschansky \
theory.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
