 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We construct 3D $\\\\mathcal{N}=2$ abelian gauge \
theories on $\\\\mathbb{S}^2\\n\\\\times \\\\mathbb{S}^1$ labeled by knot \
diagrams whose K-theoretic vortex\\npartition functions, each of which is a \
building block of twisted indices, give\\nthe colored Jones polynomials of \
knots in $\\\\mathbb{S}^3$. The colored Jones\\npolynomials are obtained as \
the Wilson loop expectation values along knots in\\n$SU(2)$ Chern-Simons \
gauge theories on $\\\\mathbb{S}^3$, and then our\\nconstruction provides an \
explicit correspondence between 3D $\\\\mathcal{N}=2$\\nabelian gauge \
theories and 3D $SU(2)$ Chern-Simons gauge theories. We verify,\\nin \
particular, the applicability of our constructions to a class of \
tangle\\ndiagrams of 2-bridge knots with certain specific twists.\\n\""}]}, {
