            "  We give a precise definition of BPS vortex loops in 3D \
non-abelian gauge\ntheories with ${\\cal N}=2$ SUSY by the path integral over \
fields with a\nprescribed singular behavior. We compute the expectation value \
of a BPS vortex\nloop on an ellipsoid. Using the result we revisit the known \
equivalence between\nWilson and vortex loops in pure Chern-Simons theory. \
Naive computations of\nexpectation values in ${\\cal N}=2$ theory leads to an \
unwanted shift of\nparameters in the rule of correspondence. We resolve the \
