 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We present a family of new M2-brane solutions in $AdS_7\
\\\\times S^4$ that\\ncalculate toroidal BPS surface operators in the \
$\\\\mathcal{N}=(2,0)$ theory.\\nThese observables are conformally invariant \
and not subject to anomalies so we\\nare able to evaluate their finite \
expectation values at leading order at large\\n$N$. In the limit of a thin \
torus we find a cylinder, which is a natural\\nsurface generalization of both \
the circular and parallel lines Wilson loop. We\\nstudy and comment on this \
limit in some detail.\\n\""}]}, {
