            "  We present a family of new M2-brane solutions in $AdS_7\\times \
S^4$ that\ncalculate toroidal BPS surface operators in the \
$\\mathcal{N}=(2,0)$ theory.\nThese observables are conformally invariant and \
not subject to anomalies so we\nare able to evaluate their finite expectation \
