            "  We study the $3d$ $\\mathcal{N}=2$ theories resulting from the\
\ncompactification of a family of $5d$ SCFTs on a torus with flux in the \
global\nsymmetry. The family of $5d$ SCFTs used in the analysis is the one \
that UV\ncompletes the $5d$ $SU(N+1)$ gauge theories with Chern--Simons level \
$k$ and\n$N_f$ fundamental hypermultiplets, generalizing the previous \
