Puletti\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Precision Holography for 5D Super Yang-Mills\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"33 pages. v2,v3: Minor corrections\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
