 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the mass-deformed sphere free energy of \
three-dimensional\\n$\\\\mathcal{N} = 2$ superconformal field theories with \
holographic duals.\\nBuilding on previous observations, we conjecture a \
proportionality relation\\nbetween the sphere free energy on the boundary and \
the prepotential of the\\nfour-dimensional $\\\\mathcal{N} = 2$ supergravity \
theory in the bulk. We verify\\nthis formula by explicit computation in \
several examples of supergravity\\ntheories with vector multiplets and \
hypermultiplets.\\n\""}]}, {
