 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The worldsheet S matrix of strings on the \
$AdS_3\\\\times S^3\\\\times T^4$\\nbackground is almost entirely fixed by \
symmetries, up to five functions -- the\\ndressing factors. These must \
satisfy several consistency conditions, in\\nparticular a set of crossing \
equations. We find that the existing proposal for\\nthe dressing factors, \
while crossing invariant, violates some of these\\nconsistency conditions. We \
put forward a new set of dressing factors and\\ndiscuss in detail their \
analytic properties in the string and mirror region, as\\nwell as under \
bound-state fusion.\\n\""}]}, {
