\n  Nakanishi", "title" -> "Duality Cascades and Affine Weyl Groups", 
            "comments" -> "51 pages, 12 eps figures; v3: published version", 
            "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> "10.1007/JHEP05(2022)132", 
