 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We work out the algebraic Bethe ansatz for the \
worldsheet theory of the\\n$AdS_3\\\\times S^3\\\\times T^4$ superstring, and \
use it to derive the transfer\\nmatrices for fundamental particles and bound \
states of the string and mirror\\nmodel. We also show how the Bethe equations \
and transfer matrices are modified\\nin the presence of an Abelian twist. \
These will be an important ingredient in\\nthe exploration of the mirror \
thermodynamic Bethe ansatz equations recently\\nproposed by Frolov and \
Sfondrini, and their generalisation to twisted and\\ndeformed \
models.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
