               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We formulate the stringy nonrelativistic limits of the \
flat space and\\nAdS$_5\\\\times$S$^5$ string as coset models, based on the \
string Bargmann and\\nextended string Newton-Hooke algebras respectively. Our \
construction mimics the\\ntypical relativistic one, but differs in several \
interesting ways. Using our\\ncoset formulation we give a Lax representation \
of the equations of motion of\\nboth models.\\n\""}]}, {
