Gabriele\\n  Tartaglino-Mazzucchelli\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Hyper-Dilaton Weyl Multiplet of 4D, ${\\\\mathcal{N}}=2$ \
Conformal\\n  Supergravity\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"v2: 36 pages, version published in JHEP\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 09 (2022), 016\""}]}, {
               
