            "Hyper-Dilaton Weyl Multiplet of 4D, ${\\mathcal{N}}=2$ Conformal\
\n  Supergravity", "comments" -> "v2: 36 pages, version published in JHEP", 
            "journal-ref" -> "JHEP 09 (2022), 016", "doi" -> 
