            "  We report a perturbative calculation of the expectation value \
of the infinite\nstraight line Maldacena-Wilson loop in $\\mathcal{N}=4$ \
supersymmetric\nYang-Mills theory to order $g^6$. Thus, we extend the \
previous perturbative\nresult by one order. The vacuum expectation value is \
reformulated in terms of a\nnon-linear and non-local transformation, the \
