are by no means trivial and seem to\nresemble those of the circular \
Maldacena-Wilson loop at order $g^4$.\nFurthermore, we argue that our \
approach to computing quantum correlation\nfunctions is competitive with more \
standard diagrammatic techniques.\n", 
