            "  We derive exact formulas for circular Wilson loops in the \
$\\mathcal{N}=4$ and\n$\\mathcal{N}=2^{* }$ theories with gauge groups $U(N)$ \
and $SU(N)$ in the\n$k$-fold symmetrized product representation. The formulas \
apply in the limit of\nlarge $k$ and small Yang-Mills coupling $g$, with \
fixed effective coupling\n$\\kappa\\equiv g^2k$, and for any finite $N$. In \
the $SU(2)$ and $U(2)$ cases,\nclosed analytic formulas are obtained for any \
$k$, while the $1/k$ series\nexpansions are asymptotic. In the $N\\gg 1$ \
limit, with $N\\ll k$, there is an\noverlapping regime where the formulas can \
be confronted with results from\nholography. Simple formulas for correlation \
functions between the $k$-symmetric\nWilson loops and chiral primary \
operators are also given.\n", 
