renormalisation such as asymptotically safe theories.\nFinally, the \
application of the Lorentz invariant spectral functional\nrenormalisation \
group is briefly discussed for theories ranging from real\nscalar and Yukawa \
theories to gauge theories and quantum gravity.\n", 
