 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We find a closed formula for the overlap of Bethe \
eigenstates of an\\nalternating $SU(4)$ spin chain, describing the scalar \
sector of ABJM theory,\\nand matrix product states of any bond dimension \
representing 1/2 BPS\\nco-dimension one domain walls in the field theory. One \
point functions of the\\ndefect CFTs involved, being directly expressible in \
terms of these overlaps,\\nare hence completely determined.\\n\""}]}, {
