                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the integrable crosscap states of the \
integrable quantum spin chains\\nand we classify them for the \
$\\\\mathfrak{gl}(N)$ symmetric models. We also give\\na derivation for the \
exact overlaps between the integrable crosscap states and\\nthe Bethe states. \
The first part of the derivation is to calculate sum formula\\nfor the \
off-shell overlap. Using this formula we prove that the normalized\\noverlaps \
of the multi-particle states are ratios of the Gaudin-like\\ndeterminants. \
Furthermore we collect the integrable crosscap states which can\\nbe relevant \
in the AdS/CFT correspondence.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
