               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2208.05839\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{
                "\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Jahmall Matteo Bersini\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Oleg Antipin, Jahmall Bersini, Pantelis Panopoulos\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Yukawa interactions at Large Charge\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"36 pages\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP10(2022)183\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"RBI-ThPhys-2022-30\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"hep-th cond-mat.stat-mech hep-ph\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We extend the fixed-charge semiclassical method by \
computing anomalous\\ndimensions of fixed-charge scalar operators in models \
with Yukawa interactions.\\nIn particular, we discuss the \
Nambu-Jona-Lasinio-Yukawa theory as well as an\\nasymptotically safe \
gauge-Yukawa model in four dimensions. In the weakly\\ncoupled regime, we \
cross-check our results to the respective maximum known\\norders of \
perturbation theory in these models and predict higher order terms\\nfor \
future comparisons with other computational methods. In the \
strongly\\ncoupled regime, we match our results to the predictions of the \
large-charge\\neffective field theory which can be compared to future Monte \
Carlo and lattice\\nstudies.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
