$\\\\text{AdS}_{4}\\\\times\\n  \\\\text{CP}^{3}$ superstrings\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"v3, improved presentation, Accepted for publication in \
EPJC\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
