 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We investigate the integrability of the boundary state \
arising from the\\nsubdeterminant operators in the alternating SU(4) spin \
chain in ABJM theory.\\nOur findings show that the resulting matrix product \
states are only integrable\\nfor two special giant gravitons, including the \
maximal giant graviton.\\nFurthermore, we extend our analysis to more general \
boundary states.\\n\""}]}, {
