operators in\\n  SU($N$) Yang-Mills theory\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"latex, 36 pages; introduction and section 7 expanded, \
section 4\\n  simplified, minor changes and a few typos corrected\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Physical Review D 108, 054023 (2023)\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1103/PhysRevD.108.054023\""}]}, {
