Kamal L.\\n  Panigrahi\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Neumann-Rosochatius system for strings on I-brane\""}]}, {
              
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"18 pages\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP12(2022)022\""}]}, {
