 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the integrable boundaries and crosscaps of \
classical sigma models.\\nWe show that there exists a classical analog of the \
integrability condition and\\nKT-relation of the boundary and crosscap states \
of quantum spin chains. We also\\nclassify the integrable crosscaps for \
various sigma models including examples\\nwhich are relevant in the AdS/CFT \
correspondence at strong coupling.\\n\""}]}, {
