 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We review the present status of gauge theories built on \
various quantum\\nspace-times described by noncommutative space-times. The \
mathematical tools and\\nnotions underlying their construction are given. \
Different formulations of\\ngauge theory models on Moyal spaces as well as on \
quantum spaces whose\\ncoordinates form a Lie algebra are covered, with \
particular emphasis on some\\nexplored quantum properties. Recent attempts \
aiming to include gravity dynamics\\nwithin a noncommutative framework are \
also considered.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
