               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Julius Julius\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Andrea Cavagli\\\\`a and Nikolay Gromov and Julius Julius \
and\\n  Michelangelo Preti\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Integrated correlators from integrability: \
Maldacena-Wilson line in\\n  $\\\\mathcal{N}=4$ SYM\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"45 pages, 6 figures, ancillary Mathematica notebook; 1 \
figure added\\n  and minor changes in Appendix C\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/JHEP04(2023)026\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We present a systematic method for the derivation of a \
relation which\\nconnects the correlation function of operators on the \
straight Maldacena-Wilson\\nline with the integrability data for the cusp \
anomalous dimension. As we show,\\nthe derivation requires very careful \
treatment of the UV divergences. Our\\nmethod opens a way to derive \
infinitely many constraints on integrals of\\nmulti-point correlation \
functions, relating them with the integrability data\\nfor the generalised \
cusp anomalous dimension governed by the Quantum Spectral\\nCurve. Such \
constraints have been shown recently to be very powerful in\\ncombination \
with the numerical conformal bootstrap, leading to very \
narrow\\nnon-perturbative bounds on conformal data beyond the \
spectrum.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
