            "  We study correlation functions of two AdS giant gravitons in \
AdS$_5\\times\nS^5$ and a BPS supergravity mode using holography. In the \
gauge theory these\nare described by BPS correlators of Schur polynomials of \
fully-symmetric\nrepresentations and a single trace operator. We find full \
