               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2211.06943\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Wei Cui\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Jin Chen, Zhuo Chen, Wei Cui and Babak Haghighat\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"MSW-type compactifications of 6d $(1,0)$ SCFTs on \
4-manifolds\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"45 pages, 7 figures and 2 tables v2: typos corrected, \
references\\n  added\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this work, we study compactifications of 6d $(1,0)$ \
SCFTs, in particular\\nthose of conformal matter type, on K\\\\\\\"ahler \
4-manifolds. We show how this can\\nbe realized via wrapping M5 branes on \
4-cycles of non-compact Calabi-Yau\\nfourfolds with ADE singularity in the \
fiber. Such compactifications lead to\\ndomain walls in 3d $\\\\mathcal{N}=2$ \
theories which flow to 2d\\n$\\\\mathcal{N}=(0,2)$ SCFTs. We compute the \
central charges of such 2d CFTs via\\n6d anomaly polynomials by employing a \
particular topological twist along the\\n4-manifold. Moreover, we study \
compactifications on non-compact 4-manifolds\\nleading to coupled 3d-2d \
systems. We show how these can be glued together\\nconsistently to reproduce \
the central charge and anomaly polynomial obtained in\\nthe compact case. \
Lastly, we study concrete CFT proposals for some special\\ncases.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
