show how this can\nbe realized via wrapping M5 branes on 4-cycles of \
non-compact Calabi-Yau\nfourfolds with ADE singularity in the fiber. Such \
compactifications lead to\ndomain walls in 3d $\\mathcal{N}=2$ theories which \
flow to 2d\n$\\mathcal{N}=(0,2)$ SCFTs. We compute the central charges of \
such 2d CFTs via\n6d anomaly polynomials by employing a particular \
