            "  We address a longstanding question of whether ABJM theory has \
Wilson loop\noperators preserving eight supercharges (so 1/3 BPS). We present \
such Wilson\nloops made of a large supermatrix combining two 1/2 BPS Wilson \
loops. We study\nthe spectrum of operator insertions into them including the \
displacement\noperator and several others and study their correlation \
functions. Another\nnatural construction arising in this context are Wilson \
loops with alternating\nsuperconnections. This amounts to including \"defect \
changing operators\" along\nthe loop, similar to a discrete cusp. This \
