                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We provide a survey of recent studies of supergroup \
gauge theory. We first\\ndiscuss supermatrix model as a zero-dimensional toy \
model of supergroup gauge\\ntheory and its geometric and algebraic \
characterization. We then focus on\\nfour-dimensional Yang--Mills theory with \
supergroup gauge symmetry and explore\\nits non-perturbative properties, \
including instanton calculus, Seiberg-Witten\\ngeometry, Bethe/gauge \
correspondence, and its realization with intersecting\\ndefects.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
