 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  This review is a collection of various methods and \
observations relevant to\\nstructures in three-dimensional systems similar to \
those responsible for\\nintegrability of two-dimensional systems. Particular \
focus is given to Nambu\\nstructures and loop variables naturally appearing \
in membrane dynamics. While\\nreviewing each topic in more details we \
emphasize connections between them and\\nspeculate on possible relations to \
membrane integrability.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
