            "  We study the correlation function between one single-trace \
scalar operator\nand a circular Wilson loop in the $4d$ $\\mathcal{N}=2$ \
superconformal field\ntheory with gauge group $SU(N)$ and matter transforming \
in the symmetric and\nanti-symmetric representations. By exploiting \
