           "id" -> "2303.13225", "submitter" -> "Jun-Bao Wu", "authors" -> 
            "Hong-Zhe Zhang, Wan-Zhe Feng, Jun-Bao Wu", "title" -> 
            "Holographic Operator Product Expansion of Loop Operators in\n  $\
\\mathcal{N}=4$ $SO(N)$ Super Yang-Mills Theory", "comments" -> 
            "v2, 22 pages, no figures, comparing with results in the case of \
gauge\n  group SU(N) added, other minor reversion performed; v1, 20 pages, no \
figures", "journal-ref" -> "Chin.Phys.C 47 (2023) 8, 083101", "doi" -> 
            "10.1088/1674-1137/acd364", "report-no" -> Null, "categories" -> 
            "hep-th", "license" -> 
            "http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  In this paper, we compute the correlation functions of \
Wilson(-'t~Hooft)\nloops with chiral primary operators in $\\mathcal{N}=4$ \
supersymmetric\nYang-Mills theory with $SO(N)$ gauge symmetry, which has a \
holographic dual\ndescription of Type IIB superstring theory on the\n$AdS_{5}\
\\times\\mathbf{RP}^{5}$ background. Specifically, we compute the\n\
coefficients of the chiral primary operators in the operator product \
expansion\nof Wilson loops in the fundamental representation, Wilson-'t Hooft \
loops in the\nsymmetric representation, Wilson loops in the anti-fundamental \
representation\nand the spinor representation. We also compare these results \
to the\n$\\mathcal{N}=4$ $SU(N)$ super Yang-Mills theory.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Thu, 23 Mar 2023 12:43:35 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Fri, 28 Jul 2023 00:32:39 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
