               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We compute non-perturbative spectral functions in a \
scalar $\\\\phi^4$-theory in\\nthree spacetime dimensions via the spectral \
functional renormalisation group.\\nThis approach allows for the direct, \
manifestly Lorentz covariant computation\\nof correlation functions in \
Minkowski spacetime, including a physical on-shell\\nrenormalisation. We \
present numerical results for the spectral functions of the\\ntwo- and \
four-point correlation functions for different values of the \
coupling\\nparameter. These results agree very well with those obtained from \
another\\nfunctional real-time approach, the spectral Dyson-Schwinger \
equation.\\n\""}]}, {
