 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the $S^1\\\\times\\\\Sigma_{\\\\mathfrak g}$ \
topologically twisted index and\\nthe squashed sphere partition function of \
various 3d $\\\\mathcal N\\\\geq2$\\nholographic superconformal field \
theories arising from M2-branes. Employing\\nnumerical techniques in \
combination with well-motivated conjectures we provide\\ncompact closed-form \
expressions valid to all orders in the perturbative $1/N$\\nexpansion for \
these observables. We also discuss the holographic implications\\nof our \
results for the topologically twisted index for the dual M-theory\\nEuclidean \
path integral around asymptotically AdS$_4$ solutions of 11d\\nsupergravity. \
In Lorentzian signature this leads to a prediction for the\\ncorrections to \
the Bekenstein-Hawking entropy of a class of static\\nasymptotically AdS$_4$ \
BPS black holes.\\n\""}]}, {
