                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We construct actions for four dimensional \
noncommutative Yang-Mills theory\\nwith star-gauge symmetry, with \
non-constant noncommutativity, to all orders in\\nthe noncommutativity. Our \
construction covers all noncommutative spaces\\ncorresponding to Drinfel'd \
twists based on the Poincar\\\\'e algebra, including\\nnonabelian ones, whose \
$r$ matrices are unimodular. This includes particular\\nLie-algebraic and \
quadratic noncommutative structures. We prove a planar\\nequivalence theorem \
for all such noncommutative field theories, and discuss how\\nour actions \
realize twisted Poincar\\\\'e symmetry, as well as twisted conformal\\nand \
twisted supersymmetry, when applicable. Finally, we consider \
noncommutative\\nversions of maximally supersymmetric Yang-Mills theory, \
conjectured to be\\nAdS/CFT dual to certain integrable deformations of the \
AdS$_5\\\\times$S$^5$\\nsuperstring.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Wed, 24 May 2023 18:00:02 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
