 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We show that sigma models with orthogonal and \
symplectic Grassmannian target\\nspaces admit chiral Gross-Neveu model \
formulations, thus extending earlier\\nresults on unitary Grassmannians. As a \
first application, we calculate the\\none-loop $\\\\beta$-functions in this \
formalism, showing that they are\\nproportional to the dual Coxeter numbers \
of the respective symmetry algebras.\\n\""}]}, {
