                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study pulsating strings both on a single stack of \
NS5-branes and two\\northogonal stacks of NS5-branes (the so called I-brane) \
by using the Polyakov\\nform of the fundamental string action. For the \
I-brane background, by using a\\nsymmetry that decouples the two spheres from \
the flat geometry, we study\\npulsating solutions of the string when it \
pulsates on both the spheres\\nindependently and simultaneously. We finally \
derive the energy of pulsating\\nstrings as a function of adiabatic invariant \
oscillation number in these cases\\nand studied some limiting cases in \
detail.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
