                 "\"Integrability and non-integrability for marginal \
deformations of 4d\\n  $\\\\mathcal N = 2$ SCFTs\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"1+22 pages; 27 Figs; Reference added; Appendices added; \
v2; Accepted\\n  to JHEP\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 10 (2023) 173\""}]}, {
               
