               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We construct supersymmetric fermionic Wilson loops \
along general curves in\\nfour-dimensional $\\\\mathcal{N}=4$ super \
Yang-Mills theory and along general\\nplanar curves in $\\\\mathcal{N}=2$ \
superconformal $SU(N)\\\\times SU(N)$ quiver\\ntheory. These loops are \
generalizations of the Zarembo loops and are\\ncohomologically equivalent to \
them. In $\\\\mathcal{N}=4$ super Yang-Mills theory,\\nwe compute their \
expectation values and verify the cohomological equivalence\\nrelation up to \
the order $g^4$ in perturbation theory.\\n\""}]}, {
