               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We consider a rational six vertex model on a \
rectangular lattice with\\nboundary conditions that generalize the usual \
domain wall type. We find that\\nthe partition function of the inhomogeneous \
version of this model is given by a\\nmodified Izergin determinant. The \
proofs are based on the quantum inverse\\nscattering method and its \
representation theory together with elementary linear\\nalgebra.\\n\""}]}, {
