Coulomb-branch operators and two\nmoment-map operators using localization. In \
the corresponding matrix model we\nidentify the operator associated with the \
integrated insertions of moment-map\noperators and provide for it an exact \
expression valid for all values of the\ncoupling constant in the planar \
limit. This allows us to study the integrated\ncorrelators at strong-coupling \
where we show that they behave as the 2-point\nfunctions of the \
