via Integrability,\\n  Holography, and the Bootstrap\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"42 pages, 13 figures\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
