Trancanelli", "title" -> "Interpolating Bremsstrahlung function in ABJM", 
            "comments" -> 
            "27 pages + appendices, 5 figures; v2: some changes, added \
references,\n  published version", "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> 
