                 "\"Simple Representations of BPS Algebras: the case of\\n  \
$Y(\\\\widehat{\\\\mathfrak{gl}}_2)$\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
