Korchemsky\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Tracy-Widom distribution in four-dimensional \
super-Yang-Mills theories\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"6 pages; v2: minor corrections and additions\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
