               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Various observables in different four-dimensional \
superconformal Yang-Mills\\ntheories can be computed exactly as Fredholm \
determinants of truncated Bessel\\noperators. We exploit this relation to \
determine their dependence on the 't\\nHooft coupling constant. Unlike the \
weak coupling expansion, which has a finite\\nradius of convergence, the \
strong coupling expansion is factorially divergent,\\nnecessitating the \
inclusion of nonperturbative, exponentially small\\ncorrections. We develop a \
method to systematically compute these corrections\\nand discuss the \
resurgent properties of the resulting transseries.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
