        TagBox[
         TooltipBox[DiskBox[{13.35367407047538, -8.56983398205188}, 0.],
          TagBox[
           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2403.19228\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Naotaka Kubo\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Naotaka Kubo\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Duality between $U\\\\times U$ and $O\\\\times USp$ \
theories from\\n  $A_{3}=D_{3}$\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"49 pages, 4 figures\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]},\
 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the duality between the ABJ(M) theory at \
Chern-Simons level $k=4$\\nand the orientifold ABJ theory at Chern-Simons \
level $k=1$ by using the $S^{3}$\\npartition function. The partition function \
can be computed using the\\nsupersymmetric localization in terms of a matrix \
model, and we derive an ideal\\nFermi gas system by applying the Fermi gas \
formalism to the matrix model. By\\nusing this formalism, we show that the \
matrix model can be embedded in the\\npartition function of $\\\\hat{A}_{3}$ \
or $\\\\hat{D}_{3}$ quiver theories, and the\\nequality of these quiver \
theories, which comes from $\\\\hat{A}_{3}=\\\\hat{D}_{3}$,\\nleads to exact \
relations of the matrix models. These exact relations can be\\nused to check \
the identification of the flavor symmetries. The perfect\\nagreement between \
the matrix models also implies that no decoupled sector \
is\\nneeded.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
