 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We consider the $4d$ $\\\\mathcal{N}=2$ superconformal \
quiver gauge theory\\nobtained by a $\\\\mathbb{Z}_2$ orbifold of \
$\\\\mathcal{N}=4$ super Yang-Mills\\n(SYM). By exploiting supersymmetric \
localization, we study the integrated\\ncorrelator of two Coulomb branch and \
two moment map operators and the\\nintegrated correlator of four moment map \
operators, determining exact\\nexpressions valid for any value of the 't \
Hooft coupling in the planar limit.\\nAdditionally, for the second \
correlator, we obtain an exact expression also for\\nthe next-to-planar \
contribution. Then, we derive the leading terms of their\\nstrong-coupling \
expansions and outline the differences with respect to \
the\\n$\\\\mathcal{N}=4$ SYM theory.\\n\""}]}, {
