Peter Weck\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Conformal to confining SQFTs from holography\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"19 pages. Two figures. Some additions to the text. \
References\\n  updated. Version to appear in JHEP\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
