 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We construct the probe D5-brane solution in \
$AdS_5\\\\times S^5$ dual to the\\n$\\\\frac{1}{4}$-BPS latitude Wilson loop \
in $\\\\mathcal{N}=4$ super Yang-Mills\\ntheory in the $k$-antisymmetric \
representation of $SU(N)$. The solution is\\nexact in the latitude parameter \
$\\\\theta_0$ and correctly reproduces the\\n$\\\\frac{1}{2}$-BPS limit. We \
compute the string charge $k$ and the renormalized\\non-shell action \
perturbatively to order \
$\\\\mathcal{O}\\\\left(\\\\theta_0^{10}\\\\right)$\\nand find full agreement \
with the expectation value of the Wilson loop predicted\\nby the Gaussian \
matrix model in the limit $N\\\\sim \
k\\\\to\\\\infty$,\\n$\\\\lambda\\\\to\\\\infty$.\\n\""}]}, {
