                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We compute correlation functions of local operator \
insertions on the 1/2 BPS\\nWilson lines of N=4 Chern-Simons-matter theories \
in 3 dimensions. We study the\\nalgebra preserved by the defect CFT supported \
on the line, identify the\\nsuperdisplacement multiplet and discuss some of \
its weak-coupling realizations.\\nBy employing a superspace description, we \
present the 4-point functions of the\\nsuperdisplacement and show how they \
are determined by functions of\\ncross-ratios. Within an analytic bootstrap \
approach, we derive these functions\\nat leading and next-to-leading order at \
strong coupling, obtaining a result in\\nagreement with appropriate orbifolds \
of the ABJM case considered in\\narXiv:2004.07849.\\n\""}]}, {
