 {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We utilize physics arguments, and the \
nonabelian/abelian correspondence, to\\nrelate the Givental and Lee's quantum \
K theory ring of Grassmannians to a\\ntwisted variant of the quantum \
cohomology ring. Furthermore, the quantum K\\npairing is related to \
correlators arising from supersymmetric localization. We\\nstate some \
mathematical conjectures, which we illustrate in several examples.\\n\""}]}, {
              
