        TagBox[
         TooltipBox[DiskBox[{5.450029116727432, -1.406669798928906}, 0.],
          TagBox[
           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2408.04000\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Yuhma Asano\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Yuhma Asano\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Quantisation of type IIB superstring theory and the \
matrix model\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"28 pages; v2: improvement in explanations and in section \
4.3 merged\\n  with an appendix\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"UTHEP-791\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We discuss the path-integral quantisation of \
perturbative string theory and\\nshow equivalence between the Polyakov-type, \
Schild-type and Nambu-Goto-type\\nformulations of critical type II \
superstring theory. Remarkably, we also find\\nthat the Minkowskian path \
integral realises causality in the sense that a\\nstring does not propagate \
between points at space-like separation, by giving\\ncareful consideration to \
the measure of the world-sheet metric. We also discuss\\nmatrix \
regularisation of the path integral for type IIB perturbative\\nsuperstring \
theory. The obtained matrix models are the Euclidean IKKT matrix\\nmodel and \
a modified Minkowskian IKKT model, depending on how the \
matrix\\nregularisation is applied.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Wed, 7 Aug 2024 18:00:03 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
