         Annotation[#, 
          
          TableForm[{
           "id" -> "2408.04000", "submitter" -> "Yuhma Asano", "authors" -> 
            "Yuhma Asano", "title" -> 
            "Quantisation of type IIB superstring theory and the matrix \
model", "comments" -> 
            "28 pages; v2: improvement in explanations and in section 4.3 \
merged\n  with an appendix", "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> Null, 
            "report-no" -> "UTHEP-791", "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> 
            "http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "abstract" -> 
            "  We discuss the path-integral quantisation of perturbative \
string theory and\nshow equivalence between the Polyakov-type, Schild-type \
and Nambu-Goto-type\nformulations of critical type II superstring theory. \
Remarkably, we also find\nthat the Minkowskian path integral realises \
causality in the sense that a\nstring does not propagate between points at \
space-like separation, by giving\ncareful consideration to the measure of the \
world-sheet metric. We also discuss\nmatrix regularisation of the path \
integral for type IIB perturbative\nsuperstring theory. The obtained matrix \
models are the Euclidean IKKT matrix\nmodel and a modified Minkowskian IKKT \
model, depending on how the matrix\nregularisation is applied.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Wed, 7 Aug 2024 18:00:03 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Sun, 1 Sep 2024 14:37:55 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2024-09-04", "authors_parsed" -> {{"Asano", "Yuhma", ""}}}], 
