           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2408.14056\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Balbeer Singh\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Pinaki Dutta, Kamal L. Panigrahi and Balbeer Singh\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Chaos Bound and its violation in Black p-brane\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"23 pages, 26 figures\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this work, we have extensively investigated the \
dynamics of circular\\ngeodesic (chargeless massive particle) followed by the \
investigation of the\\npulsating classical string in the p-brane background. \
This study is a\\ncontinuation of our previous work (arXiv:2307.12350v3), in \
which we numerically\\nidentified the presence of chaos for a classical \
string hovering near generic\\np-branes ($p < 7$). Here, for a particle \
probe, we have found evidence of chaos\\nin the vicinity of the horizon. \
Furthermore, we observed a violation of the\\nwell-known MSS bound in \
specific extremal p-branes; however, no such violation\\nis seen in the \
non-extremal cases. Similar observations were made for the\\nclassical \
string, where the violation of the bound is significant near the\\nhorizon. \
Thus, our semi-analytical arguments demonstrate that chaotic dynamics\\nin \
black p-branes exhibit the (generalized) universal bound with \
notable\\nviolations, regardless of whether a particle or classical string is \
used as a\\nprobe.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
