within the stack-engineered\nheterostructure. Extreme sensitivity of Te to \
sample temperature and applied\nvoltages reveals anomalously efficient \
hot-carrier quenching, which we identify\nas an essential feature of the \
strongly interacting hot Dirac excited state.\n", 
