               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We extend Zirnbauer's color-flavor transformation in \
the fermionic sector to\\nthe case of the special unitary group. The \
transformation allows a certain\\nintegral over SU(N_c) color matrices to be \
transformed into an integral over\\nflavor matrices which parameterize the \
coset space U(2N_f)/U(N_f)xU(N_f).\\nIntegrals of the type considered appear, \
for example, in the partition function\\nof lattice gauge theory.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
