               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the spectrum of screening masses in the \
deconfined phase of (3+1)D\\nSU(2) pure gauge theory near criticality and \
compare it with the spectrum of\\nbound states in the broken symmetry phase \
of the 3D Ising model, which is\\nrelated to the gauge theory by \
universality.\\n\""}]}, {
