            "  The Zirnbauer's color-flavor transformation is applied to the \
$U(N_c)$\nlattice gauge model, in which the gauge theory is induced by a \
heavy chiral\nscalar field sitting on lattice sites. The flavor degrees of \
freedom can\nencompass several `generations' of the auxiliary field, and for \
