                RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  The lepton asymmetry of order one is not excluded \
experimentally and, if\\npresent, can lead to interesting phenomena in the \
early Universe. It is shown\\nthat, when the temperature is above the \
quark-hadron transition, the lepton\\nasymmetry induces chemical potentials \
for electric charge and for baryon\\nnumber, and makes the quark-gluon plasma \
electrically charged.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
