               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the asymmetry between the vector current and \
axial-vector current\\ncorrelators in the colour-flavour locking (CFL) phase \
of QCD at finite density.\\nUsing Weinberg's sum rules, we compute the decay \
constant $f_\\\\pi$ of the\\nGoldstone modes and find agreement with previous \
derivations. Using Das's sum\\nrule, we also estimate the contribution of \
electromagnetic interactions to the\\nmass of the charged modes. Finally, we \
comment on low temperature corrections\\nto the effective field theory \
describing the Goldstone bosons.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
