            "  We evaluate several quantities appearing in the effective \
lagrangian for the\ncolor-flavor locked phase of high density QCD using a \
formalism which exploits\nthe approximate decoupling of fermions with energy \
negative with respect to the\nFermi energy. The effective theory is \
