modified; v4:\\n  minor changes; v5: a misprint corrected\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"JETP Lett. 75 (2002) 59-62; Pisma Zh.Eksp.Teor.Fiz. 75 \
(2002)\\n  67-70\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1134/1.1466476\""}]}, {
