               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-ph/0312227\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Edward Shuryak\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Edward Shuryak\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Why does the Quark-Gluon Plasma at RHIC behave as a \
nearly ideal fluid ?\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"25 pages, lectures in Erice School on Nulcear Physics, \
Sept.2003.\\n  Version 2 corrects several typos and adds a couple of \
references\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Prog.Part.Nucl.Phys. 53 (2004) 273-303\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1016/j.ppnp.2004.02.025\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-ph nucl-th\""}]}, {
              
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The lecture is a brief review of the following topics: \
(i) collective flow\\nphenomena in heavy ion collisions. The data from RHIC \
indicate robust\\ncollective flows, well described by hydrodynamics with \
expected Equation of\\nState. The transport properties turned out to be \
unexpected, with very small\\nviscosity;\\n  (ii) physics of highly excited \
matter produced in heavy ion collisions at\\nT_c<T<4T_c is different from \
weakly coupled quark-gluon plasma because of\\nrelatively strong coupling \
generating bound states of quasiparticles;\\n  (iii) wider discussion of \
other ``strongly coupled systems'' including\\nstrongly coupled \
supersymmetric theories studied via Maldacena duality, as well\\nas recent \
progress in trapped atoms with very large scattering length.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
