               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Quark Spectrum near Chiral Transition Points\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"9 pages, 20 eps figures. To appear in the proceedings \
of\\n  \\\"International Workshop on Dynamical Symmetry Breaking\\\" (DSB \
2004), Nagoya\\n  University, December 21-22, 2004\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-ph nucl-th\""}]}, {
              
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Near the critical temperature of the chiral phase \
transition, a collective\\nexcitation due to fluctuation of the chiral order \
parameter appears. We\\ninvestigate how it affects the quark spectrum near \
but above the critical\\ntemperature. The calculated spectral function has \
many peaks. We show this\\nbehavior can be understood in terms of resonance \
scatterings of a quark off the\\ncollective mode.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
