            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-ph/0510167\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Yukio Nemoto\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Masakiyo Kitazawa, Teiji Kunihiro, Yukio Nemoto\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Quark Spectrum above but near Critical Temperature of \
Chiral Transition\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"6 pages, 12 eps figures, typos corrected and references \
updated,\\n  version to appear in Phys. Lett. B\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Phys.Lett. B633 (2006) 269-274\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1016/j.physletb.2005.11.076\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-ph nucl-th\""}]}, {
              
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We explore the quark properties at finite temperature \
near but above the\\ncritical temperature of the chiral phase transition. We \
investigate the effects\\nof the precursory soft mode of the phase transition \
on the quark dispersion\\nrelation and the spectral function. It is found \
that there appear novel\\nexcitation spectra of quasi-quarks and \
quasi-antiquarks with a three-peak\\nstructure, which are not attributed to \
the hard-thermal-loop approximation. We\\nshow that the new spectra originate \
from the mixing between a quark\\n(anti-quark) and an anti-quark hole (quark \
hole) caused by a ``resonant\\nscattering'' of the quasi-fermions with the \
thermally-excited soft mode which\\nhas a small but finite excitation energy.\
\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
