            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-ph/0512054\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Cristina Manuel\""}]}, {
              
               RowBox[{"\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Cristina Manuel\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Low energy properties of color-flavor locked \
superconductors\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"13 pages, 1 figure; talk given at the 29th Johns Hopkins \
Workshop on\\n  current problems in particle theory; August 2005, \
Budapest\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-ph\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We discuss some low energy properties of color-flavor \
locked (CFL)\\nsuperconductors. First, we study how an external magnetic \
field affects their\\nGoldstone physics in the chiral limit, stressing that \
there is a long-range\\ncomponent of the field that penetrates the \
superconductor. We note that the\\nmost remarkable effect of the applied \
field is giving a mass to the charged\\npions and kaons. By estimating this \
effect, we see that for values $e B \\\\sim 2\\nf_\\\\pi \\\\Delta$, where \
$\\\\Delta$ is the quark gap, and $f_\\\\pi$ the pion decay\\nconstant, the \
charged Goldstone bosons become so heavy, that they turn out to\\nbe \
unstable. The symmetry breaking pattern is then changed, agreeing with \
that\\nof the magnetic color-flavor locked (MCFL) phase, recently proposed in\
\\nhep-ph/0503162. Finally, we discuss the physics of the superfluid phonon \
of the\\nCFL phase, compare it with that of the phonon of a Bose-Einstein \
condensate,\\nand discuss transport phenomena at low temperature. \
Astrophysical implications\\nof all the above low energy properties are also \
commented.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Mon, 5 Dec 2005 17:24:33 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
              
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2007-05-23\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Manuel\"", ",", "\"Cristina\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}], "}"}]}]}}, RowSpacings -> 1, ColumnAlignments -> 
