models\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"8 pages, 2 figures; some points clarified, references \
added, appendix\\n  removed; to appear in Phys.Lett.B\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Phys.Lett. B642 (2006) 93-99\""}]}, {
               
