               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We note that the energy loss in ${\\\\cal N}=4$ SYM \
measures directly the\\nspatial string tension $\\\\sigma_S=\\\\pi\\\\sqrt{\\\
\\lambda}T^2/2$ which is at the origin\\nof the area law for large spatial \
Wilson loops. We show that the latter\\nreflects on the nonperturbative \
nature of Ampere's law in ${\\\\cal N}=4$ SYM both\\nin vacuum and at finite \
temperature.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
