            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-ph/0608177\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Edward Shuryak\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"E. V. Shuryak\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Strongly Coupled Quark-Gluon Plasma: The Status \
Report\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"It is brief review of the field, in 14 pages, written for \
proceedings\\n  of Continuous Advances in QCD, April 2006. As the progress is \
very rapid, it\\n  includes several new papers which appeared between April \
and August. The\\n  version 2 has more references and few statements get \
clarified better\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1142/9789812708267_0001\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-ph\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  RHIC data have shown robust collective flows, strong \
jet and charm quenching,\\nand charm flow.\\n  Recently ``conical flows'' \
from damped jets were seen. Non-Abelian classical\\nstrongly coupled plasmas \
were introduced and studied via molecular dynamics,\\nwith first results for \
its transport (diffusion and viscosity) reported.\\n  Quantum-mechanical \
studies reveal the survival for $T>T_c$ of the lowest\\nbinary states, \
including colored ones, and also of some manybody ones such as\\nbaryons. \
``Polymeric chains'' $\\\\bar q.g.g... q$ are also bound in some range \
of\\n$T$, perhaps the progenitors of the QCD strings.\\n  AdS/CFT \
applications advanced to a completely new level of detail: they now\\ninclude \
studies of thermal heavy quark motion, jet quenching and even conical\\nflow. \
Confinement is however still beyond simply strong coupling: its \
de-facto\\ninclusion the so called AdS/QCD approach is so far added as a \
model, while true\\nunderstanding may probably only come from further \
insights into the monopole\\ndynamics.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Wed, 16 Aug 2006 14:31:55 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v2\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Wed, 23 Aug 2006 16:55:08 GMT\""}]}], "}"}]}], 
                   "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2017-08-23\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Shuryak\"", ",", "\"E. V.\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}], "}"}]}]}}, RowSpacings -> 1, ColumnAlignments -> 
