                RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  The AdS/CFT correspondence establishes a string \
representation for Wilson\\nloops in N=4 SYM theory at large N and large 't \
Hooft coupling. One of the\\nclearest manifestations of the stringy behaviour \
in Wilson loop correlators is\\nthe string-breaking phase transition. It is \
shown that resummation of planar\\ndiagrams without internal vertices \
predicts the strong-coupling phase transtion\\nin exactly the same setting in \
which it arises from the string representation.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
