        TagBox[
         TooltipBox[DiskBox[{12.316938354547842`, -3.7311586169320954`}, 0.],
          TagBox[
           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0105039\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"DaeKil Park\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"D. K. Park\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Hidden functional relation in Large-N Quark-Monopole \
system at finite\\n  temperature\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"22 pages, 3 figures, v1 one more reference added v2 \
version to appear\\n  in NPB\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Nucl.Phys. B618 (2001) 157-170\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1016/S0550-3213(01)00484-9\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"MCTP-01-19\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The quark-monopole potential is computed at finite \
temperature in the context\\nof $AdS/CFT$ correspondence. It is found that \
the potential is invariant under\\n$g \\\\to 1/g$ and $U_T \\\\to U_T / g$. \
As in the quark-quark case there exists a\\nmaximum separation between quark \
and monopole, and $L$-dependence of the\\npotential exhibits a bifurcation \
behavior. We find a functional relation\\n$dE_{QM}^{Reg} / dL = \
[(1/E_{(1,0)}^{Reg}(U_0))^2 +\\n(1/E_{(0,1)}^{Reg}(U_0))^2]^{-1/2}$ which is \
responsible for the bifurcation.\\nThe remarkable property of this relation \
is that it makes a relation between\\nphysical quantities defined at the \
$AdS$ boundary through a quantity defined at\\nthe bulk. The physical \
implication of this relation for the existence of the\\nextra dimension is \
speculated.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
