         Annotation[#, 
          
          TableForm[{
           "id" -> "hep-th/0107251", "submitter" -> Null, "authors" -> 
            "A. Konechny, A. Schwarz", "title" -> 
            "Introduction to M(atrix) theory and noncommutative geometry, \
Part II", "comments" -> "34 pages, Latex", "journal-ref" -> 
            "Phys.Rept. 360 (2002) 353-465", "doi" -> 
            "10.1016/S0370-1573(01)00096-5", "report-no" -> Null, 
            "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> Null, "abstract" -> 
            "  This review paper is a continuation of hep-th/0012145 and it \
deals primarily\nwith noncommutative ${\\mathbb R}^{d}$ spaces. We start with \
a discussion of\nvarious algebras of smooth functions on noncommutative \
${\\mathbb R}^{d}$ that\nhave different asymptotic behavior at infinity. We \
pay particular attention to\nthe differences arising when working with \
nonunital algebras and the unitized\nones obtained by adjoining the unit \
element. After introducing main objects of\nnoncommutative geometry over \
those algebras such as inner products, modules,\nconnections, etc., we \
continue with a study of soliton and instanton solutions\nin field theories \
defined on these spaces. The discussion of solitons includes\nthe basic facts \
regarding the exact soliton solutions in the Yang-Mills-Higgs\nsystems as \
well as an elementary discussion of approximate solitons in scalar\ntheories \
in the $\\theta \\to \\infty$ limit. We concentrate on the module\nstructure \
and topological numbers characterizing the solitons. The section on\n\
instantons contains a thorough description of noncommutative ADHM \
construction,\na discussion of gauge triviality conditions at infinity and \
the structure of a\nmodule underlying the ADHM instanton solution. Although \
some familiarity with\ngeneral ideas of noncommutative geometry reviewed in \
the first part is expected\nfrom the reader, this part is largely independent \
from the first one.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Sun, 29 Jul 2001 07:32:10 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2009-11-07", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"Konechny", "A.", ""}, {
              "Schwarz", "A.", ""}}}], "Tooltip"]& ], 
        TagBox[
         TooltipBox[DiskBox[{12.911606252036517`, -1.178994595794471}, 0.],
