            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0112195\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Marotta Raffaele\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"M. Bertolini, P. Di Vecchia and R. Marotta\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"N=2 four-dimensional gauge theories from fractional \
branes\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"44 pages, AMS-LaTeX, no figures\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1142/9789812777065_0040\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"NORDITA-2001/94 HE, DSF-41/2001\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  This is a pedagogical and extended version of the \
results published in Refs.\\n[1,2] and presented by the authors in various \
talks during the last year. We\\ndiscuss the type II D-branes (both regular \
and fractional) of the orbifold\\nR^{1,5}*R^4/Z_2, we determine their \
corresponding supergravity solution and\\nshow how this can be used to study \
the properties of N=2 super Yang-Mills.\\nSupergravity is able to reproduce \
the perturbative moduli space of the gauge\\ntheory, while it does not encode \
the non-perturbative corrections. The short\\ndistance region of space-time, \
which corresponds to the infrared region of the\\ngauge theory, is excised by \
an enhancon mechanism, and more states should be\\nincluded in the low energy \
effective action in order to enter inside the\\nenhancon and recover the \
instanton corrections. (To be published on a Memorial\\nVolume commemorating \
Michael Marinov)\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Thu, 20 Dec 2001 14:30:02 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2013-02-27\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
