               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  This is a new version of the paper, which uses the same \
methods as in the\\nprevious version, but the model is now different. We \
study two complex scalar\\nfields coupled through a quadratic interaction in \
2+1 dimensions. We use the\\nmethod of bilinears as suggested by Rajeev. The \
resulting classical theory is\\nstudied within the linear approximation and \
we show that there is a possible\\nbound state for the composite type \
particles for a range of coupling constant\\nstrengths.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
