           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0204182\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Carlos Castro\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Carlos Castro\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"On Wilson Loops and Confinement without Supersymmetry \
from Composite\\n  Antisymmeric Tensor Field theories\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"8 pages, plain Tex\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  A novel approach that does not rely on supersymmetry, \
nor in the AdS/CFT\\ncorrespondence, to evaluate the Wilson loops asociated \
with a gauge theory of\\narea-preserving diffeomorphisms in terms of pure \
string degrees of freedoms is\\npresented. It is based on the \
Guendelman-Nissimov-Pacheva formulation of\\ncomposite antisymmetric tensor \
field theories of volume-preserving\\ndiffeomorphisms. Such theories admit \
p-brane solutions. The quantum effects are\\ndiscussed and we evaluate \
exactly the vev of the Wilson loops, in the large N\\nlimit of \
quenched-reduced SU(N) QCD, in terms of a path integral involving \
pure\\nstring degrees of freedom. It is consistent with the recent results \
based on\\nthe AdS/CFT correspondence and dual QCD models (dual Higgs model \
with dual\\nDirac strings). More general Loop wave equations in C-spaces \
(Clifford\\nmanifolds) are proposed in terms of holographic variables that \
contain the\\ndynamics of an aggregate of closed branes (p-loops) of \
various\\ndimensionalities.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Mon, 22 Apr 2002 15:28:43 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2007-05-23\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Castro\"", ",", "\"Carlos\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}], "}"}]}]}}, RowSpacings -> 1, ColumnAlignments -> 
             Left, ColumnAlignments -> Left], Column], 
