               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We show that the $E-S \\\\sim \\\\log S$ behaviour \
found for long strings rotating\\non $AdS_5\\\\times S^5$ may be reproduced \
by membranes rotating on $AdS_4\\\\times\\nS^7$ and on a warped $AdS_5$ \
M-theory solution. We go on to obtain rotating\\nmembrane configurations with \
the same $E-K \\\\sim \\\\log K$ relation on $G_2$\\nholonomy backgrounds \
that are dual to ${\\\\mathcal{N}}=1$ gauge theories in four\\ndimensions. We \
study membrane configurations on $G_2$ holonomy backgrounds\\nsystematically, \
finding various other Energy-Charge relations. We end with some\\ncomments \
about strings rotating on warped backgrounds.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
