         Annotation[#, 
          
          TableForm[{
           "id" -> "hep-th/0301055", "submitter" -> "Yusuke Kimura", 
            "authors" -> "Yusuke Kimura (RIKEN)", "title" -> 
            "On Higher Dimensional Fuzzy Spherical Branes", "comments" -> 
            "20 pages", "journal-ref" -> "Nucl.Phys. B664 (2003) 512-530", 
            "doi" -> "10.1016/S0550-3213(03)00462-0", "report-no" -> Null, 
            "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> Null, "abstract" -> 
            "  Matrix descriptions of higher dimensional spherical branes are \
investigated.\nIt is known that a fuzzy 2k-sphere is described by the coset \
space\nSO(2k+1)/U(k) and has some extra dimensions. It is shown that a fuzzy \
2k-sphere\nis comprised of n^{\\frac{k(k-1)}{2}} spherical D(2k-1)-branes and \
has a fuzzy\n2(k-1)-sphere at each point. We can understand the relationship \
between these\ntwo viewpoints by the dielectric effect. Contraction of the \
algebra is also\ndiscussed.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Thu, 9 Jan 2003 14:27:46 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Wed, 22 Jan 2003 11:31:54 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v3", "created" -> 
               "Tue, 17 Jun 2003 11:33:27 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2010-04-05", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"Kimura", "Yusuke", "", "RIKEN"}}}], 
          "Tooltip"]& ], 
        TagBox[
         TooltipBox[DiskBox[{13.345540674221786`, -0.78565652555179}, 0.],
