          TagBox[
           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0304062\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Gautam Mandal\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Avinash Dhar, Gautam Mandal and Spenta R. Wadia\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"String bits in small radius AdS and weakly coupled N=4 \
Super Yang-Mills\\n  Theory: I\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"35 pages; (v2)problems in taking the continuum limit \
highlighted, the\\n  section on AdS/CFT matching rewritten in the light of \
these problems, typos\\n  corrected and references added; the main conclusion \
about finiteness of the\\n  small radius expansion unchanged\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"TIFR/TH/03-09\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study light-cone gauge quantization of IIB strings \
in AdS_5 \\\\times S^5 for\\nsmall radius in Poincare coordinates. A picture \
of strings made up of\\nnoninteracting bits emerges in the zero radius limit. \
In this limit, each bit\\nbehaves like a superparticle moving in the AdS_5 \\\
\\times S^5 background,\\ncarrying appropriate representations of the super \
conformal group PSU(2,2|4).\\nThe standard Hamiltonian operator which causes \
evolution in the light-cone time\\nhas continuous eigenvalues and provides a \
basis of states which is not suitable\\nfor comparing with the dual super \
Yang-Mills theory. However, there exist\\noperators in the light-cone gauge \
which have discrete spectra and can be used\\nto label the states. We obtain \
the spectrum of single bit states and construct\\nmulti-bit states in this \
basis. There are difficulties in the construction of\\nstring states from the \
multi-bit states, which we discuss. A non-zero value of\\nthe radius \
introduces interactions between the bits and the spectrum of\\nmulti-bit \
states gets modified. We compute the leading perturbative corrections\\nat \
small radius for a few simple cases. Potential divergences in \
the\\nperturbative corrections, arising from strings near the boundary, \
cancel. This\\nencourages us to believe that our perturbative treatment could \
provide a\\nframework for a rigorous and detailed testing of the AdS/CFT \
conjecture, once\\nthe difficulties in the construction of string states are \
resolved.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Mon, 7 Apr 2003 15:00:35 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v2\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Tue, 7 Oct 2003 07:21:16 GMT\""}]}], "}"}]}], 
                   "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2007-05-23\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Dhar\"", ",", "\"Avinash\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Mandal\"", ",", "\"Gautam\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Wadia\"", ",", "\"Spenta R.\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}]}], "}"}]}]}}, RowSpacings -> 1, ColumnAlignments -> 
             Left, ColumnAlignments -> Left], Column], 
