        TagBox[
         TooltipBox[DiskBox[{17.218132551195684`, -2.0519829429534493`}, 0.],
          TagBox[
           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0305116\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Radu Roiban\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Iosif Bena, Joseph Polchinski, Radu Roiban\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Hidden Symmetries of the AdS_5 x S^5 Superstring\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"16 pages, Latex; v2: References added\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Phys.Rev.D69:046002,2004\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1103/PhysRevD.69.046002\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Attempts to solve Yang-Mills theory must eventually \
face the problem of\\nanalyzing the theory at intermediate values of the \
coupling constant. In this\\nregime neither perturbation theory nor the \
gravity dual are adequate, and one\\nmust consider the full string theory in \
the appropriate background. We suggest\\nthat in some nontrivial cases the \
world sheet theory may be exactly solvable.\\nFor the Green-Schwarz \
superstring on AdS_5 x S^5 we find an infinite set of\\nnonlocal classically \
conserved charges, of the type that exist in integrable\\nfield \
theories.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
