        TagBox[
         TooltipBox[DiskBox[{18.486975774099925`, -2.4959181426219113`}, 0.],
          TagBox[
           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0306143\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Sergey Frolov\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"S. Frolov, A.A. Tseytlin\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Rotating string solutions: AdS/CFT duality in \
non-supersymmetric sectors\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"11 pages, harvmac. v2: refs added\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Phys.Lett.B570:96-104,2003\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1016/j.physletb.2003.07.022\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We find the minimal energy solution describing a folded \
closed string located\\nat the center of AdS_5 and rotating simultaneously in \
two planes in S^5 with\\ntwo arbitrary SO(6) angular momenta J_1 and J_2. In \
the case when J_1=J_2=J' we\\nobserve the precise agreement between the \
leading coefficient in the large J'\\nexpansion of the energy of this \
solution and the minimal eigen-value of the\\n1-loop anomalous dimension \
matrix of the corresponding [J',0,J'] SYM operators\\nobtained by Beisert, \
Minahan, Staudacher and Zarembo in hep-th/0306139. We find\\nalso perfect \
agreement between string and SYM results in cases of states with\\nunequal \
spins J_1 and J_2 dual to [J_2,J_1-J_2,J_2] operators. This represents\\na \
remarkable quantitative test of the AdS/CFT duality in a \
non-supersymmetric\\n(and non-near-BPS) sector.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Mon, 16 Jun 2003 19:37:44 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
