references\n  added, v4: minor corrections, accepted for publication in Nucl. \
Phys. B, v5:\n  intermediate results (B.16/B.18) in Appendix B corrected, \
thanks to Pedro\n  Liendo for pointing out my mistake", "journal-ref" -> 
