               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We make contact between the infinite-dimensional \
non-local symmetry of the\\ntypeIIB superstring on AdS5xS5 worldsheet theory \
and a non-abelian\\ninfinite-dimensional symmetry algebra for the weakly \
coupled superconformal\\ngauge theory. We explain why the planar limit of the \
one-loop dilatation\\noperator is the Hamiltonian of a spin chain, and show \
that it commutes with the\\ng*2 N = 0 limit of the non-abelian \
charges.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
