and new\\n  references added, discussion section and acknowledgements \
modified, abstract\\n  rephrashed\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 0312 (2003) 017\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1088/1126-6708/2003/12/017\""}]}, {
