               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We show the existence of an infinite set of non-local \
classically conserved\\ncharges on the Green-Schwarz closed superstring in a \
pp-wave background. We\\nfind that these charges agree with the Penrose limit \
of non-local classically\\nconserved charges recently found for the $AdS_5 \\\
\\times S^5$ Green-Schwarz\\nsuperstring. The charges constructed in this \
paper could help to understand the\\nrole played by these on the full $AdS_5 \
\\\\times S^5$ background.\\n\""}]}, {
