            "abstract" -> 
            "  We demonstrate that the recently found agreement between \
one-loop scaling\ndimensions of large dimension operators in N=4 gauge theory \
and energies of\nspinning strings on AdS_5 x S^5 extends to the eigenvalues \
of an infinite\nnumber of hidden higher commuting charges. This dynamical \
agreement is of a\nmathematically highly intricate and non-trivial nature. In \
particular, on the\ngauge side the generating function for the commuting \
charges is obtained by\nintegrable quantum spin chain techniques from the \
thermodynamic density\ndistribution function of Bethe roots. On the string \
side the generating\nfunction, containing information to arbitrary loop \
