Yang-Mills theory are\nstudied in the one-instanton sector. Independent sets \
of scalar operators of\nbare dimension 2, 3, 4 and 5 are constructed in all \
the allowed representations\nof the SU(4) R-symmetry group and their \
two-point functions are computed in the\nsemiclassical approximation. \
