            "Spin chains and string theory", "comments" -> 
            "16 pages. LaTeX. v2: References and some comments added. v3:\n  \
References to more recent work added", "journal-ref" -> 
            "Phys.Rev.Lett.93:161602,2004", "doi" -> 
