               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We find classical open string solutions in the $AdS_5\\\
\\times S^5/\\\\Zop_2$\\norientifold with angular momenta along the \
five-sphere. The energy of these\\nsolutions has an expansion in integral \
powers of $\\\\lambda$ with sigma-model\\ncorrections suppressed by inverse \
powers of $J$ - the total angular momentum.\\nThis gives a prediction for the \
exact anomalous dimensions of operators in the\\nlarge $N$ limit of an \
${\\\\cal N}=2$ $Sp(N)$ Super-Yang-Mills theory with matter.\\nWe also find a \
simple map between open and closed string solutions. This gives\\na \
prediction for an all-loop planar relationship between the \
anomalous\\ndimensions of single-trace and two-quark operators in the dual \
gauge theory.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
