            "  The aim of this report is to give an overview of the duality \
between type IIB\nstring theory on the maximally supersymmetric PP-wave and \
the BMN sector of N=4\nSuper Yang-Mills theory. The general features of the \
string and the field\ntheory descriptions are reviewed, but the main focus of \
this report is on the\ncomparison between the two sides of the duality. In \
particular, it is first\nexplained how free IIB strings emerge on the gauge \
theory side and then the\ngeneralizations of this relation to the full \
interacting theory are considered.\nAn ``historical'' approach is taken and \
the various proposals presented in the\nliterature are described.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
