               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0402007\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Amir Esmaeil Mosaffa\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Mohsen Alishahiha, Amir E. Mosaffa and Hossein Yavartanoo\
\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Multi-spin string solutions in AdS Black Hole and \
confining backgrounds\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"26 pages, LaTeX, references added\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Nucl.Phys. B686 (2004) 53-74\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1016/j.nuclphysb.2004.03.015\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"IPM/P-2004/001\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study semi-classical multi-spin strings in the \
non-supersymmetric\\nbackgrounds of $AdS$ Black Hole and Witten's confining \
model. We consider\\nconstant radius strings with rotations along the \
isometries of the backgrounds.\\nIn the $AdS$ Black Hole, solutions exist \
only if there is a non-zero spin in\\nthe Black Hole part. In contrast with \
the $AdS$ background, we find solutions\\nwhich although have no rotation in \
the $S^5$ part, have a regular $\\\\lambda$\\nexpansion in the expression for \
large energy. In the near-extremal $D_3$ and\\n$D_4$ backgrounds, we find \
that strings have to be located on the confining\\nwall. We also discuss the \
stability of solutions by considering the \
fluctuation\\nLagrangians.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
