            "  In this letter, we study the open spinning strings and their \
SYM duals. A new\nclass of folded open spinning strings is found. At planar \
one-loop level in\nSYM, by solving the thermodynamic limit of the Bethe \
ansatz equations for an\nintegrable open spin chain, we find good agreement \
with string theory\npredictions for energies of both circular and folded \
two-spin solutions. A\nuniversal relation between the open and closed \
spinning strings is verified in\nthe spin chain approach.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
