               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0403139\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Rafael Hernandez\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Rafael Hernandez, Esperanza Lopez\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"The SU(3) spin chain sigma model and string theory\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"14 pages. Latex.v2: Misprints corrected. v3: Minor \
changes and\\n  improved details from journal version\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 0404 (2004) 052\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1088/1126-6708/2004/04/052\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The ferromagnetic integrable SU(3) spin chain provides \
the one loop anomalous\\ndimension of single trace operators involving the \
three complex scalars of N=4\\nsupersymmetric Yang-Mills. We construct the \
non-linear sigma model describing\\nthe continuum limit of the SU(3) spin \
chain. We find that this sigma model\\ncorresponds to a string moving with \
large angular momentum in the five-sphere\\nin AdS_5xS^5. The energy and \
spectrum of fluctuations for rotating circular\\nstrings with angular momenta \
along three orthogonal directions of the\\nfive-sphere is reproduced as a \
particular case from the spin chain sigma model.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
