            "  We construct a spinning closed string solution in AdS_5 x S^5 \
which is folded\nin the radial direction and has two equal spins in AdS_5 and \
a spin in S^5. The\nenergy expression of the three-spin solution specified by \
the folding and\nwinding numbers for the small S^5 spin shows a logarithmic \
behavior and a\none-third power behavior of the large total AdS_5 spin, in \
the long string and\nin the short string located near the boundary of AdS_5 \
respectively. It\nexhibits the non-regular expansion in the 't Hooft coupling \
constant, while it\ntakes the regular one when the S^5 spin becomes large.\n",
             "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Thu, 18 Mar 2004 04:39:36 GMT"}, {
