               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this paper we consider new solutions for pulsating \
strings. For this\\npurpose we use tha idea of the generalized ansatz for \
folded and circular\\nstrings in hep-th/0311004. We find the solutions to the \
resulting\\nNeumann-Rosochatius integrable system and the corrections to the \
energy. To do\\nthat we use the approach developed by Minahan in \
hep-th/0209047 and find that\\nthe corrections are quite different from those \
obtained in that paper and\\nhep-th/0310188. We conclude with comments on our \
solutions and obtained\\ncorrections to the energy, expanded to the leading \
order in lambda.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
