               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0405107\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Gordon Semenoff\""}]}, {
              
               RowBox[{"\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Gordon W. Semenoff\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Matrix Model Thermodynamics\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Presented at ``Circumnavigating Theoretical Physics'', in \
Memory of\\n  Ian Kogan, Oxford, U.K., January 2004. Plenary lecture at \
``Quantum Theory\\n  and Symmetries'', Cincinnati, Ohio, October 2003\""}]}, {
              
               RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1142/9789812702340_0071\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Some recent work on the thermodynamic behavior of the \
matrix model of\\nM-theory on a pp-wave background is reviewed. We examine a \
weak coupling limit\\nwhere computations can be done explicitly. In the large \
N limit, we find a\\nphase transition between two distinct phases which \
resembles a\\n``confinement-deconfinement'' transition in gauge theory and \
which we speculate\\nmust be related to a geometric transition in M-theory. \
We review arguments that\\nthe phase transition is also related to the \
Hagedorn transition of little\\nstring theory in a certain limit of the \
5-brane geometry.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Wed, 12 May 2004 04:47:38 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2017-08-23\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"Semenoff\"", ",", "\"Gordon W.\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}], "}"}]}]}}, RowSpacings -> 1, ColumnAlignments -> 
             Left, ColumnAlignments -> Left], Column], 
