            "  Some recent work on the thermodynamic behavior of the matrix \
model of\nM-theory on a pp-wave background is reviewed. We examine a weak \
coupling limit\nwhere computations can be done explicitly. In the large N \
limit, we find a\nphase transition between two distinct phases which \
