            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0405127\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Stefano Kovacs\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Zachary Guralnik, Stefano Kovacs and Bogdan Kulik\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Holography and the Higgs branch of N=2 SYM \
theories\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"LaTeX, 29 pages, 1 figure; v2: minor corrections, one \
reference added\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP0503:063,2005\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1088/1126-6708/2005/03/063\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"HU-EP-04/09, AEI-2004-21\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We present a proposal for the description of the Higgs \
branch of\\nfour-dimensional N=2 supersymmetric Yang-Mills theories in the \
context of the\\nAdS/CFT correspondence. We focus on a finite Sp(N) N=2 \
theory arising as dual\\nof a configuration of N D3-branes in the vicinity of \
four D7-branes and an\\norientifold 7-plane in type I' string theory. The \
field theory contains\\nhypermultiplets in the second rank anti-symmetric and \
in the fundamental\\nrepresentations. The Higgs branch has a dual description \
in terms of gauge\\nfield configurations with non-zero instanton number on \
the world-volume of the\\nD7-branes. In this setting the non-renormalisation \
of the metric on the Higgs\\nbranch implies constraints on the alpha' \
corrections to the D7-brane effective\\naction, including couplings to the \
curvature and five-form field strength. In\\nthe second part of the paper we \
discuss non-renormalisation properties of BPS\\nWilson lines, which are \
closely related to the physics of the Higgs branch.\\nUsing a formulation of \
the four-dimensional N=2 theory in terms of a\\nthree-dimensional N=2 \
superspace we show that the expectation value of certain\\nWilson-line \
operators with hypermultiplets at the end points is independent of\\nthe \
length and thus coincides with the expectation value of the local \
operators\\nparametrising the Higgs branch.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Fri, 14 May 2004 18:59:20 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v2\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Tue, 5 Oct 2004 21:49:02 GMT\""}]}], "}"}]}], 
                   "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2008-11-26\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Guralnik\"", ",", "\"Zachary\"", ",", "\"\""}],
                     "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Kovacs\"", ",", "\"Stefano\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Kulik\"", ",", "\"Bogdan\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}]}], "}"}]}]}}, RowSpacings -> 1, ColumnAlignments -> 
