         Annotation[#, 
          
          TableForm[{
           "id" -> "hep-th/0405127", "submitter" -> "Stefano Kovacs", 
            "authors" -> "Zachary Guralnik, Stefano Kovacs and Bogdan Kulik", 
            "title" -> "Holography and the Higgs branch of N=2 SYM theories", 
            "comments" -> 
            "LaTeX, 29 pages, 1 figure; v2: minor corrections, one reference \
added", "journal-ref" -> "JHEP0503:063,2005", "doi" -> 
            "10.1088/1126-6708/2005/03/063", "report-no" -> 
            "HU-EP-04/09, AEI-2004-21", "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> 
            Null, "abstract" -> 
            "  We present a proposal for the description of the Higgs branch \
of\nfour-dimensional N=2 supersymmetric Yang-Mills theories in the context of \
the\nAdS/CFT correspondence. We focus on a finite Sp(N) N=2 theory arising as \
dual\nof a configuration of N D3-branes in the vicinity of four D7-branes and \
an\norientifold 7-plane in type I' string theory. The field theory contains\n\
hypermultiplets in the second rank anti-symmetric and in the fundamental\n\
representations. The Higgs branch has a dual description in terms of gauge\n\
field configurations with non-zero instanton number on the world-volume of \
the\nD7-branes. In this setting the non-renormalisation of the metric on the \
Higgs\nbranch implies constraints on the alpha' corrections to the D7-brane \
effective\naction, including couplings to the curvature and five-form field \
strength. In\nthe second part of the paper we discuss non-renormalisation \
properties of BPS\nWilson lines, which are closely related to the physics of \
the Higgs branch.\nUsing a formulation of the four-dimensional N=2 theory in \
terms of a\nthree-dimensional N=2 superspace we show that the expectation \
value of certain\nWilson-line operators with hypermultiplets at the end \
points is independent of\nthe length and thus coincides with the expectation \
value of the local operators\nparametrising the Higgs branch.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Fri, 14 May 2004 18:59:20 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Tue, 5 Oct 2004 21:49:02 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2008-11-26", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"Guralnik", "Zachary", ""}, {
              "Kovacs", "Stefano", ""}, {"Kulik", "Bogdan", ""}}}], 
