           "id" -> "hep-th/0405167", "submitter" -> "Lisa Freyhult", 
            "authors" -> "Lisa Freyhult", "title" -> 
            "Bethe ansatz and fluctuations in SU(3) Yang-Mills operators", 
            "comments" -> 
            "17 pages, 4 figures v2: typos corrected and references added", 
            "journal-ref" -> "JHEP 0406 (2004) 010", "doi" -> 
            "10.1088/1126-6708/2004/06/010", "report-no" -> "UUITP-15/04", 
            "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> Null, "abstract" -> 
            "  We consider the scalar operators corresponding to \
semiclassical string states\nin AdS_5xS^5 with the three angular momenta in \
S^5 non-trivial. The string\nstates recieve quantum corrections and we study \
the corresponding process on\nthe gauge theory side. The anomalous dimension \
of the scalar operators is\ncomputed using the Bethe ansatz and we find the \
correction that corresponds to\nthe energy of the quantized string. We \
restrict for simplicity to the case\nwhere two of the angular momenta in S^5 \
are equal.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
