           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0405262\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Alessandro Tanzini\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"P. Di Vecchia, A. Tanzini\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"N=2 Super Yang-Mills and the XXZ spin chain\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"16 pages, 2 figures; v2: references added, misprints \
corrected\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"J.Geom.Phys. 54 (2005) 116-130\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1016/j.geomphys.2004.09.001\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We analyse the renormalisation properties of composite \
operators of scalar\\nfields in the N=2 Super Yang-Mills theory. We compute \
the matrix of anomalous\\ndimensions in the planar limit at one-loop order in \
the 't Hooft coupling, and\\nshow that it corresponds to the Hamiltonian of \
an integrable XXZ spin chain\\nwith an anisotropy parameter Delta>1. We \
suggest that this parameter could be\\nrelated to the presence of non-trivial \
two-form fluxes in the dual supergravity\\nbackground. We find that the \
running of the gauge coupling does not affect the\\nrenormalization group \
equations for these composite operators at one-loop\\norder, and argue that \
this is a general property of gauge theories which is not\\nrelated to \
supersymmetry.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Fri, 28 May 2004 16:03:30 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v2\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Wed, 30 Jun 2004 13:58:15 GMT\""}]}], "}"}]}], 
                   "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2015-06-26\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
