               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We review recent progress in checking AdS/CFT duality \
in the sector of\\n''semiclassical'' string states dual to ''long'' scalar \
operators of N=4 super\\nYang-Mills theory. In particular, we discuss the \
effective action approach, in\\nwhich the same sigma model type action \
describing coherent states is shown to\\nemerge from the AdS_5 x S^5 string \
action and from the spin chain Hamiltonian\\nrepresenting the SYM dilatation \
operator.\\n\""}]}, {
