               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0407232\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Vladimir Braun M.\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"A.V. Belitsky, V.M. Braun, A.S. Gorsky and G.P. \
Korchemsky\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Integrability in QCD and beyond\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"87 pages, 4 figures; minor stylistic changes, references \
added. To be\\n  published in the memorial volume 'From Fields to Strings: \
Circumnavigating\\n  Theoretical Phyiscs', World Scientific, 2004. Dedicated \
to the memory of Ian\\n  Kogan\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Int.J.Mod.Phys.A19:4715-4788,2004\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1142/S0217751X04019895\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th hep-ph\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Yang--Mills theories in four space-time dimensions \
possess a hidden symmetry\\nwhich does not exhibit itself as a symmetry of \
classical Lagrangians but is\\nonly revealed on the quantum level. It turns \
out that the effective Yang--Mills\\ndynamics in several important limits is \
described by completely integrable\\nsystems that prove to be related to the \
celebrated Heisenberg spin chain and\\nits generalizations. In this review we \
explain the general phenomenon of\\ncomplete integrability and its \
realization in several different situations. As\\na prime example, we \
consider in some detail the scale dependence of composite\\n(Wilson) \
operators in QCD and super-Yang--Mills (SYM) theories. High-energy\\n(Regge) \
behavior of scattering amplitudes in QCD is also discussed and provides\\none \
with another realization of the same phenomenon that differs, however, \
from\\nthe first example in essential details. As the third example, we \
address the\\nlow-energy effective action in a N=2 SYM theory which, contrary \
to the previous\\ntwo cases, corresponds to a classical integrable model. \
Finally, we include a\\nshort overview of recent attempts to use gauge/string \
duality in order to\\nrelate integrability of Yang--Mills dynamics with the \
hidden symmetry of a\\nstring theory on a curved background.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Tue, 27 Jul 2004 13:35:05 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v2\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Thu, 2 Sep 2004 09:09:35 GMT\""}]}], "}"}]}], 
                   "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2011-05-05\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Belitsky\"", ",", "\"A. V.\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
