            "report-no" -> "UT-04-21", "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> 
            Null, "abstract" -> 
            "  We show agreements, at one-loop level of field theory, between \
energies of\nsemiclassical string states on AdS_5 x S^5/Z_M and anomalous \
dimensions of\noperators in N=0,1,2 orbifold field theories originating from \
N=4 SYM. On field\ntheory side, one-loop anomalous dimension matrices can be \
regarded as\nHamiltonians of spin chains with twisted boundary conditions. \
These are\nsolvable by Bethe ansatz. On string side, twisted sectors emerge \
and we obtain\nsome string configurations in twisted sectors. In SU(2) \
subsectors, we compare\nanomalous dimensions with string energies and see \
agreements. We also see\nagreements between sigma models of both sides in \
SU(2) and SU(3) subsectors.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Mon, 2 Aug 2004 19:14:21 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Fri, 13 Aug 2004 16:04:58 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v3", "created" -> 
               "Thu, 30 Sep 2004 14:24:36 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2008-11-26", "authors_parsed" -> {{"Ideguchi", "Kota", ""}}}], 
          "Tooltip"]& ], 
