               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the anomalies of a charge $Q_2$ self-dual \
string solution in the\\nCoulomb branch of $Q_5$ M5-branes. Cancellation of \
these anomalies allows us to\\ndetermine the anomaly of the zero-modes on the \
self-dual string and their\\nscaling with $Q_2$ and $Q_5$. The dimensional \
reduction of the five-brane\\nanomalous couplings then lead to certain \
anomalous couplings for D-branes.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
