               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We review and compare the integrable structures in N=4 \
gauge theory and\\nstring theory on AdS5xS5. Recently, Bethe ansaetze for \
gauge theory/weak\\ncoupling and string theory/strong coupling were proposed \
to describe scaling\\ndimensions in the su(2) subsector. Here we investigate \
the Bethe equations for\\nquantum string theory, naively extrapolated to weak \
coupling. Excitingly, we\\nfind a spin chain Hamiltonian similar, but not \
equal, to the gauge theory\\ndilatation operator.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
