               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We discuss a new class of non-renormalization theorems \
in N=4 and N=2\\nSuper-Yang-Mills theory, obtained by using a superspace \
which makes a lower\\ndimensional subgroup of the full supersymmetry \
manifest. Certain Wilson loops\\n(and Wilson lines) belong to the chiral ring \
of the lower dimensional\\nsupersymmetry algebra, and their expectation \
values can be computed exactly.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
