               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The complete one-loop planar dilatation operator of N=4 \
supersymmetric\\nYang-Mills is isomorphic to the hamiltonian of an integrable \
PSU(2,2|4) quantum\\nspin chain. We construct the non-linear sigma models \
describing the continuum\\nlimit of the SU(1|3) and SU(2|3) sectors of the \
complete N=4 chain. We\\nexplicitely identify the spin chain sigma model with \
the one for a superstring\\nmoving in AdS_5xS^5 with large angular momentum \
along the five-sphere.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
