                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  We discuss non-compact SL(2,R) sectors in N=4 SYM and \
in AdS string theory\\nand compare their integrable structures. We formulate \
and solve the\\nRiemann-Hilbert problem for the finite gap solutions of the \
classical sigma\\nmodel and show that at one loop it is identical to the \
classical limit of Bethe\\nequations of the spin (-1/2) chain for the \
dilatation operator of SYM.\\n\""}]}, {
