            "  We study the semiclassical decay of macroscopic spinning \
strings in AdS_5 x\nS^5 through spontaneous splitting of the folded string \
worldsheet. Based on\nsimilar considerations in flat space this decay channel \
is expected to dominate\nthe full quantum computation. The outgoing strings \
are uniquely specified by an\ninfinite set of conserved (local) charges with \
a regular expansion in inverse\npowers of the initial angular momentum. We \
compute these charges and determine\nfunctional relations between them. \
Finally, a preliminary discussion of the\ncorresponding calculation in the \
non-planar sector of the dual gauge theory is\npresented.\n", 
