theory which\nstress the role of the Yangian algebra. We compute the first \
two Casimirs of\nthe Yangian, which are identified with the first two local \
abelian Hamiltonians\nwith periodic boundary conditions, and show that they \
annihilate the chiral\nprimary states. We streamline the derivation of the \
