               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We consider integrability properties of the superstring \
on $AdS_{5}\\\\times\\nS^{5}$ background and construct a new one parameter \
family of currents which\\nsatisfies the vanishing curvature condition. We \
present the Hamiltonian\\nanalysis for the sigma model action and determine \
the Poisson algebra of the\\ntransition matrices. We reveal the \
generalization of the $\\\\mathbb{Z}_{4}$\\nautomorphism analogous to the \
sigma models defined on a symmetric space coset.\\nA possible regularization \
scheme for the ambiguities present, which respects\\nthe generalized \
automorphism, is also discussed.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
