               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We consider the Super Yang--Mills/spin system map to \
construct the SU(2) spin\\nbit model at the level of two loops in Yang--Mills \
perturbation theory. The\\nmodel describes a spin system with chaining \
interaction. In the large $N$ limit\\nthe model is shown to be reduced to the \
two loop planar integrable spin chain.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
