            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0411277\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Richard Szabo\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Luca Griguolo, Domenico Seminara and Richard J. \
Szabo\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Instantons, Fluxons and Open Gauge String Theory\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"70 pages, 6 figures\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Adv.Theor.Math.Phys.9:775-860,2005\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"HWM-04-22, EMPG-04-11\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We use the exact instanton expansion to illustrate \
various string\\ncharacteristics of noncommutative gauge theory in two \
dimensions. We analyse\\nthe spectrum of the model and present some evidence \
in favour of Hagedorn and\\nfractal behaviours. The decompactification limit \
of noncommutative torus\\ninstantons is shown to map in a very precise way, \
at both the classical and\\nquantum level, onto fluxon solutions on the \
noncommutative plane. The\\nweak-coupling singularities of the usual \
Gross-Taylor string partition function\\nfor QCD on the torus are studied in \
the instanton representation and its double\\nscaling limit, appropriate for \
the mapping onto noncommutative gauge theory, is\\nshown to be a generating \
function for the volumes of the principal moduli\\nspaces of holomorphic \
differentials. The noncommutative deformation of this\\nmoduli space geometry \
is described and appropriate open string interpretations\\nare proposed in \
terms of the fluxon expansion.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Tue, 30 Nov 2004 17:53:45 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2014-11-18\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Griguolo\"", ",", "\"Luca\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"Seminara\"", ",", "\"Domenico\"", ",", "\"\""}], "}"}],
