fermionic roots\\n  expanded, figure and references added\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Nucl.Phys. B714 (2005) 3-29\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
