               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The algebraic curve for the psu (2,2|4) quantum spin \
chain is determined from\\nthe thermodynamic limit of the algebraic Bethe \
ansatz. The Hamiltonian of this\\nspin chain has been identified with the \
planar 1-loop dilatation operator of\\nN=4 SYM. In the dual AdS_5 x S^5 \
string theory, various properties of the data\\ndefining the curve for the \
gauge theory are compared to the ones obtained from\\nsemiclassical \
spinning-string configurations, in particular for the case of\\nstrings on \
AdS_5 x S^1 and the su(2,2) spin chain agreement of the curves is\\nshown.\\n\
\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
