               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this note, we determine the representation content \
of the free, large N,\\nSU(N) Yang Mills theory on a sphere by decomposing \
its thermal partition\\nfunction into characters of the irreducible \
representations of the conformal\\ngroup SO(4,2). We also discuss the \
generalization of this procedure to finding\\nthe representation content of \
N=4 Super Yang Mills.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
