               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We present results for the three-loop universal \
anomalous dimension of Wilson\\ntwist-2 operators in the N=4 Supersymmetric \
Yang-Mills theory. These\\nexpressions are obtained by extracting the most \
complicated contributions from\\nthe three-loop anomalous dimensions in QCD. \
This result is in an agreement with\\nthe hypothesis of the integrability of \
N=4 Supersymmetric Yang-Mills theory in\\nthe context of \
AdS/CFT-correspondence.\\n\""}]}, {
