               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the plane wave limit of the Backlund \
transformations for the\\nclassical string in AdS space times a sphere and \
obtain an explicit expression\\nfor the local conserved charges. We show that \
the Pohlmeyer charges become in\\nthe plane wave limit the local integrals of \
motion of the free massive field.\\nThis fixes the coefficients in the \
expansion of the anomalous dimension as the\\nsum of the Pohlmeyer \
charges.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
