                RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  We compare quantum corrections to semiclassical \
spinning strings in\\nAdS(5)xS(5) to one-loop anomalous dimensions in N=4 \
supersymmetric gauge\\ntheory. The latter are computed using the reduced \
(Landau-Lifshitz) sigma model\\nand with the help of the Bethe ansatz. The \
results of all three approaches are\\nin remarkable agreement with each \
other. As a byproduct we establish the\\nrelationship between linear \
instabilities in the Landau-Lifshitz model and\\nanalyticity properties of \
the Bethe ansatz.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
