               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  N=4 supersymmetric Yang-Mills operators carrying large \
charges are dual to\\nsemiclassical strings in AdS_5xS^5. The spectrum of \
anomalous dimensions of\\nvery large operators has been calculated solving \
the Bethe ansatz equations in\\nthe thermodynamic limit, and matched to \
energies of string solitons. We have\\nconsidered finite size corrections to \
the Bethe equations, that should\\ncorrespond to quantum effects on the \
string side.\\n\""}]}, {
