               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We explore integrability properties of superstring \
equations of motion in\\nAdS_5 x S^5. We impose light-cone kappa-symmetry and \
reparametrization gauges\\nand construct a Lax representation for the \
corresponding Hamiltonian dynamics\\non subspace of physical superstring \
degrees of freedom. We present some\\nexplicit results for the corresponding \
conserved charges by consistently\\nreducing the dynamics to AdS_3 x S^3 and \
AdS_3 x S^1 subsectors containing both\\nbosonic and fermionic \
fields.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
