               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  The construction of flat currents, and hence conserved \
non-local charges, for\\nthe superstring on AdS_5 x S^5 is generalised. It is \
shown that such currents\\nexist for sigma-model type actions on all coset \
(super-)spaces G/H in which, at\\nthe level of the Lie algebras, h is the \
grade-zero subspace of a Zm grading of\\ng. This is true for an essentially \
unique choice of the Wess-Zumino term, which\\nis determined.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
