                RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  We construct the complete spectral curve for an \
arbitrary local operator,\\nincluding fermions and covariant derivatives, of \
one-loop N=4 gauge theory in\\nthe thermodynamic limit. This curve perfectly \
reproduces the Frolov-Tseytlin\\nlimit of the full spectral curve of \
classical strings on AdS_5xS^5 derived in\\nhep-th/0502226. To complete the \
comparison we introduce stacks, novel bound\\nstates of roots of different \
flavors which arise in the thermodynamic limit of\\nthe corresponding Bethe \
ansatz equations. We furthermore show the equivalence\\nof various types of \
Bethe equations for the underlying su(2,2|4) superalgebra,\\nin particular of \
the type \\\"Beauty\\\" and \\\"Beast\\\".\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
