            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0503239\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Shijong Ryang\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Shijong Ryang\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Wound and Rotating Strings in AdS_5 x S^5\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"17 pages, LaTeX, no figures\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 0508 (2005) 047\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1088/1126-6708/2005/08/047\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  By using the non-diagonal uniform gauge for the \
Nambu-Goto string action we\\nderive a gauge-fixed Hamiltonian of a \
square-root form for the closed string in\\nAdS_5 x S^5 which is wound and \
rotating in an angular direction in S^5. From\\nthe Nambu-Goto string action \
using a non-diagonal gauge we construct a solution\\ndescribing a wound \
string which rotates in the same angular direction as the\\nwinding \
direction. The relation between energy and angular momentum of the\\nstring \
solution is characterized by the winding number and the bending number,\\nand \
becomes linear in the large angular momentum limit. The small \
angular\\nmomentum limit is compared with the strong coupling limit of the \
gauge-fixed\\nHamiltonian. We analyze a wound string solution which is \
rotating in the\\ndifferent angular direction from the winding \
direction.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Thu, 31 Mar 2005 02:16:04 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2009-11-11\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Ryang\"", ",", "\"Shijong\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}], "}"}]}]}}, RowSpacings -> 1, ColumnAlignments -> 
