            "abstract" -> 
            "  By using the non-diagonal uniform gauge for the Nambu-Goto \
string action we\nderive a gauge-fixed Hamiltonian of a square-root form for \
the closed string in\nAdS_5 x S^5 which is wound and rotating in an angular \
direction in S^5. From\nthe Nambu-Goto string action using a non-diagonal \
gauge we construct a solution\ndescribing a wound string which rotates in the \
same angular direction as the\nwinding direction. The relation between energy \
and angular momentum of the\nstring solution is characterized by the winding \
number and the bending number,\nand becomes linear in the large angular \
momentum limit. The small angular\nmomentum limit is compared with the strong \
coupling limit of the gauge-fixed\nHamiltonian. We analyze a wound string \
solution which is rotating in the\ndifferent angular direction from the \
winding direction.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
