               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We explore the plane-wave limit of homogeneous \
spacetimes. For plane-wave\\nlimits along homogeneous geodesics the limit is \
known to be homogeneous and we\\nexhibit the limiting metric in terms of Lie \
algebraic data. This simplifies\\nmany calculations and we illustrate this \
with several examples. We also\\ninvestigate the behaviour of (reductive) \
homogeneous structures under the\\nplane-wave limit.\\n\""}]}, {
