UTHEP-502\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We discuss quantum fluctuations of a class of rotating \
strings in AdS_5 x\\nS^5. In particular, we develop a systematic method to \
compute the one-loop\\nsigma-model effective actions in closed forms as \
expansions for large spins. As\\nexamples, we explicitly evaluate the leading \
terms for the constant radii\\nstrings in the SO(6) sector with two equal \
spins, the SU(2) sector, and the\\nSL(2) sector. We also obtain the leading \
quantum corrections to the space-time\\nenergy for these sectors.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
