               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Semiclassical strings in Lunin-Maldacena \
background\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"16 pages, references added\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Bulg.J.Phys. 35 (2008) 274-285\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this paper we investigate semiclassical rotating \
string configurations in\\nthe recently found Lunin-Maldacena background. \
This background is conjectured\\nto be dual to the Leigh-Strassler \
beta-deformation of N=4 SYM and therefore a\\ngood laboratory for tests of \
the AdS/CFT correspondence beyond the well\\nexplored AdS(5)x S(5) case. We \
consider different multispin configurations of\\nrotating strings by allowing \
the strings to move in both the AdS(5) and the\\ndeformed S(5) part of the \
Lunin-Maldacena background. For all of these\\nconfigurations we compute the \
string energy in terms of the angular momenta and\\nthe string winding \
numbers and thus provide the possibility of comparing our\\nresults to the \
anomalous dimension of the corresponding dilatation operator.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
