                 "\"Sugawara form for AdS superstring\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"16 pages, references added, version to appear in Nucl. \
Phys. B\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Nucl.Phys. B730 (2005) 364-376\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1016/j.nuclphysb.2005.10.001\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We show that the stress-energy tensor for a superstring \
in the AdS5xS5\\nbackground is written in a supersymmetric generalized \
\\\"Sugawara\\\" form. It is\\nthe \\\"supertrace\\\" of the square of the \
right-invariant current which is the\\nNoether current satisfying the \
flatness condition. The Wess-Zumino term is\\ntaken into account through the \
supersymmetric gauge connection in the\\nright-invariant currents, therefore \
the obtained stress-energy tensor is kappa\\ninvariant. The integrability of \
the AdS superstring provides an infinite number\\nof the conserved \
\\\"local\\\" currents which are supertraces of the n-th power of\\nthe \
right-invariant current. For even n the \\\"local\\\" current reduces to \
terms\\nproportional to the Virasoro constraint and the kappa symmetry \
constraint,\\nwhile for odd n it reduces to a term proportional to the kappa \
symmetry\\nconstraint .\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
