Zarembo\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Quantum corrections to spinning strings in AdS(5)xS(5) \
and Bethe ansatz:\\n  a comparative study\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"33 pages, 9 figures\""}]}, {
                
