            "hep-th nlin.SI", "license" -> Null, "abstract" -> 
            "  We discuss basic properties of the Baecklund transformations \
for the\nclassical string in AdS space in the context of the null-surface \
perturbation\ntheory. We explain the relation between the Baecklund \
transformations and the\nenergy shift of the dual field theory state. We show \
that the Baecklund\ntransformations can be represented as a finite-time \
