         Annotation[#, 
          
          TableForm[{
           "id" -> "hep-th/0509067", "submitter" -> "Jian-Huang She", 
            "authors" -> "Jian-Huang She", "title" -> 
            "A Matrix Model for Misner Universe and Closed String Tachyons", 
            "comments" -> 
            "15 pages, no figures, harvmac; added discussion on space-time\n  \
noncommutativity and consequences in cosmology; some conclusions better\n  \
clarified, added comparison with McGreevy & Silverstein's work, added\n  \
footnotes and references", "journal-ref" -> "JHEP0601:002,2006", "doi" -> 
            "10.1088/1126-6708/2006/01/002", "report-no" -> Null, 
            "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> Null, "abstract" -> 
            "  We use D-instantons to probe the geometry of Misner universe, \
and calculate\nthe world volume field theory action, which is of the 1+0 \
dimensional form and\nhighly non-local. Turning on closed string tachyons, we \
see from the deformed\nmoduli space of the D-instantons that the spacelike \
singularity is removed and\nthe region near the singularity becomes a fuzzy \
cone, where space and time do\nnot commute. When realized cosmologically \
there can be controllable\ntrans-planckian effects. And the infinite past is \
now causally connected with\nthe infinite future, thus also providing a model \
for big crunch/big bang\ntransition. In the spirit of IKKT matrix theory, we \
propose that the\nD-instanton action here provides a holographic description \
for Misner universe\nand time is generated dynamically. In addition we show \
that winding string\nproduction from the vacua and instability of D-branes \
have simple uniform\ninterpretations in this second quantized formalism.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Fri, 9 Sep 2005 16:23:32 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Fri, 9 Sep 2005 22:56:53 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v3", "created" -> 
               "Tue, 13 Sep 2005 08:18:37 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v4", "created" -> 
               "Mon, 5 Dec 2005 05:43:50 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v5", "created" -> 
               "Tue, 13 Dec 2005 02:46:07 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2009-11-11", "authors_parsed" -> {{"She", "Jian-Huang", ""}}}], 
