         Annotation[#, 
          
          TableForm[{
           "id" -> "hep-th/0509132", "submitter" -> "Radu Roiban", "authors" -> 
            "A. Dymarsky, I.R. Klebanov and R. Roiban", "title" -> 
            "Perturbative Gauge Theory and Closed String Tachyons", 
            "comments" -> 
            "25 pages, Latex; V2: Clarifications and references added", 
            "journal-ref" -> "JHEP0511:038,2005", "doi" -> 
            "10.1088/1126-6708/2005/11/038", "report-no" -> Null, 
            "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> Null, "abstract" -> 
            "  We find an interesting connection between perturbative large N \
gauge theory\nand closed superstrings. The gauge theory in question is found \
on N D3-branes\nplaced at the tip of the cone R^6/Gamma. In our previous work \
we showed that,\nwhen the orbifold group Gamma breaks all supersymmetry, then \
typically the\ngauge theory is not conformal because of double-trace \
couplings whose one-loop\nbeta functions do not possess real zeros. In this \
paper we observe a precise\ncorrespondence between the instabilities caused \
by the flow of these\ndouble-trace couplings and the presence of tachyons in \
the twisted sectors of\ntype IIB theory on orbifolds R^{3,1}x R^6/Gamma. For \
each twisted sectors that\ndoes not contain tachyons, we show that the \
corresponding double-trace coupling\nflows to a fixed point and does not \
cause an instability. However, whenever a\ntwisted sector is tachyonic, we \
find that the corresponding one-loop beta\nfunction does not have a real \
zero, hence an instability is likely to exist in\nthe gauge theory. We \
demonstrate explicitly the one-to-one correspondence\nbetween the regions of \
stability/instability in the space of charges under\nGamma that arise in the \
perturbative gauge theory and in the free string\ntheory. Possible \
implications of this remarkably simple gauge/string\ncorrespondence are \
discussed.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Fri, 16 Sep 2005 18:59:04 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Mon, 24 Oct 2005 13:29:22 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2009-11-11", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"Dymarsky", "A.", ""}, {
              "Klebanov", "I. R.", ""}, {"Roiban", "R.", ""}}}], 
          "Tooltip"]& ], 
        TagBox[
         TooltipBox[DiskBox[{17.662420945019022`, -3.202972589150262}, 0.],
          TagBox[
