           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0510194\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Nikolay Gromov\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Nikolay Gromov, Vladimir Kazakov\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Double Scaling and Finite Size Corrections in sl(2) Spin \
Chain\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"23 pages\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Nucl.Phys. B736 (2006) 199-224\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1016/j.nuclphysb.2005.12.006\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"LPTENS-05/33\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"hep-th math-ph math.MP nlin.SI\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We find explicit expressions for two first finite size \
corrections to the\\ndistribution of Bethe roots, the asymptotics of energy \
and high conserved\\ncharges in the sl(2) quantum Heisenberg spin chain of \
length J in the\\nthermodynamical limit J->\\\\infty for low energies \
E\\\\sim 1/J. This limit was\\nrecently studied in the context of \
integrability in perturbative N=4\\nsuper-Yang-Mills theory. We applied the \
double scaling technique to Baxter\\nequation, similarly to the one used for \
large random matrices near the edge of\\nthe eigenvalue distribution. The \
positions of Bethe roots are described near\\nthe edge by zeros of Airy \
function. Our method can be generalized to any order\\nin 1/J. It should also \
work for other quantum integrable models.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
