            "authors" -> "Nikolay Gromov, Vladimir Kazakov", "title" -> 
            "Double Scaling and Finite Size Corrections in sl(2) Spin Chain", 
            "comments" -> "23 pages", "journal-ref" -> 
            "Nucl.Phys. B736 (2006) 199-224", "doi" -> 
