               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Worldsheet techniques can be used to argue for the \
integrability of string\\ntheory on AdS_5xS^5/Z_S, which is dual to the \
strongly coupled Z_S-orbifold of\\nN=4 SYM. We analyze the integrability of \
these field theories in the\\nperturbative regime and construct the relevant \
Bethe equations.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
