            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0511109\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Benjamin Zwiebel\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Benjamin I. Zwiebel\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"N=4 SYM to Two Loops: Compact Expressions for the \
Non-Compact Symmetry\\n  Algebra of the su(1,1|2) Sector\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"28 pages, v2: additional checks against direct field \
theory\\n  calculations, references added, minor corrections, v3: additional \
minor\\n  corrections\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP0602:055,2006\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1088/1126-6708/2006/02/055\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"PUTP-2182\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We begin a study of higher-loop corrections to the \
dilatation generator of\\nN=4 SYM in non-compact sectors. In these sectors, \
the dilatation generator\\ncontains infinitely many interactions, and \
therefore one expects very\\ncomplicated higher-loop corrections. Remarkably, \
we find a short and simple\\nexpression for the two-loop dilatation \
generator. Our solution for the\\nnon-compact su(1,1|2) sector consists of \
nested commutators of four O(g)\\ngenerators and one simple auxiliary \
generator. Moreover, the solution does not\\nrequire the planar limit; we \
conjecture that it is valid for any gauge group.\\nTo obtain the two-loop \
dilatation generator, we find the complete O(g^3)\\nsymmetry algebra for this \
sector, which is also given by concise expressions.\\nWe check our solution \
using published results of direct field theory\\ncalculations. By applying \
the expression for the two-loop dilatation generator\\nto compute selected \
anomalous dimensions and the bosonic sl(2) sector internal\\nS-matrix, we \
confirm recent conjectures of the higher-loop Bethe ansatz \
of\\nhep-th/0412188.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
