          TagBox[
           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0511164\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Heng-Yu Chen HYC\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Heng-Yu Chen (DAMTP) and S. Prem Kumar (Swansea)\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Precision Test of AdS/CFT in Lunin-Maldacena \
Background\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Latex 1+28 pages, No figure. Discussion on the field \
theory operators\\n  modified, references added, minor typos corrected\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 0603:051,2006\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1088/1126-6708/2006/03/051\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"DAMTP-2005-103\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We obtain the solutions and explicitly calculate the \
energy for a class of\\ntwo-spin semiclassical string states in the \
Lunin-Maldacena background. These\\nconfigurations are \\\\beta-deformed \
versions of the folded string solutions in\\nAdS_{5}\\\\times S^{5} \
background. They correspond to certain single trace\\noperators in the \
\\\\mathcal{N}=1 superconformal \\\\beta deformation of\\n\\\\mathcal{N}=4 \
Yang-Mills. We calculate the one loop anomalous dimension for the\\ndual \
single trace operator from the associated twisted spin chain with a\\ngeneral \
two-cut distribution of Bethe roots. Our results show a striking \
match\\nbetween the two calculations. We demonstrate the natural \
identification of\\nparameters on the two sides of the analysis, and explain \
the significance of\\nthe Virasoro constraint associated with the winding \
motion of semiclassical\\nstrings from the perspective of the spin chain \
solution.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
