            "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> Null, "abstract" -> 
            "  Generators of the super-Poincar\\'e algebra in the \
non-(anti)commutative\nsuperspace are represented using appropriate \
higher-derivative operators\ndefined in this quantum superspace. Also \
discussed are the analogous\nrepresentations of the conformal and \
superconformal symmetry generators in the\ndeformed spaces. This construction \
is obtained by generalizing the recent work\nof Wess et al on the Poincar\\'e \
generators in the $\\theta$-deformed Minkowski\nspace, or by using the \
substitution rules we derived on the basis of the\nphase-space structures of \
non-(anti)commutative-space variables. Even with the\nnonzero deformation \
parameters the algebras remain unchanged although the\ncomultiplication rules \
are deformed. The transformation of the fields under\ndeformed symmetry is \
also discussed. Our construction can be used for\nsystematic developments of \
field theories in the deformed spaces.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
