           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0511216\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Radoslav Rashkov\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"N.P. Bobev, H. Dimov and R.C. Rashkov\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Semiclassical Strings, Dipole Deformations of N=1 SYM and \
Decoupling of\\n  KK Modes\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"31 pages, references added, new solutions in Section 7 \
presented, an\\n  appendix added, to appear in JHEP\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP0602:064,2006\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1088/1126-6708/2006/02/064\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this paper we investigate the recently found \
$\\\\gamma$-deformed\\nMaldacena-Nunez background by studying the behavior of \
different semiclassical\\nstring configurations. This background is \
conjectured to be dual to dipole\\ndeformations of $\\\\N=1$ SYM. We compare \
our results to those in the pure\\nMaldacena-Nunez background and show that \
the energies of our string\\nconfigurations are higher than in the undeformed \
background. Thinking in the\\nlines of (hep-th/0505100) we argue that this is \
an evidence for better\\ndecoupling of the Kaluza-Klein modes from the pure \
SYM theory excitations.\\nMoreover we are able to find a limit of the \
background in which the string\\nenergy is independent of $\\\\gamma$, these \
strings are interpreted as\\ncorresponding to pure gauge theory \
effects.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
