               RowBox[{
                "\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th math-ph math.MP\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this paper we provide a new proof that the \
Grosse-Wulkenhaar\\nnon-commutative scalar Phi^4_4 theory is renormalizable \
to all orders in\\nperturbation theory, and extend it to more general models \
with covariant\\nderivatives. Our proof relies solely on a multiscale \
analysis in x space. We\\nthink this proof is simpler and could be more \
adapted to the future study of\\nthese theories (in particular at the \
non-perturbative or constructive level).\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
