         Annotation[#, 
          
          TableForm[{
           "id" -> "hep-th/0602255", "submitter" -> "Igor Klebanov", 
            "authors" -> "I. R. Klebanov, J. Maldacena and C. B. Thorn", 
            "title" -> "Dynamics of Flux Tubes in Large N Gauge Theories", 
            "comments" -> 
            "22 pages, 4 figures; v2: clarifications in section 5, 1 \
reference\n  added; v3: the final version (minor changes, 1 more reference \
added)", "journal-ref" -> "JHEP0604:024,2006", "doi" -> 
            "10.1088/1126-6708/2006/04/024", "report-no" -> 
            "PUPT-2193, UFIFT-HEP-06-5", "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> 
            Null, "abstract" -> 
            "  The gluonic field created by a static quark anti-quark pair is \
described via\nthe AdS/CFT correspondence by a string connecting the pair \
which is located on\nthe boundary of AdS. Thus the gluonic field in a \
strongly coupled large N CFT\nhas a stringy spectrum of excitations. We trace \
the stability of these\nexcitations to a combination of large N suppressions \
and energy conservation.\nComparison of the physics of the N=infinity flux \
tube in the {\\cal N}=4 SYM\ntheory at weak and strong coupling shows that \
the excitations are present only\nabove a certain critical coupling. The \
density of states of a highly excited\nstring with a fold reaching towards \
the horizon of AdS is in exact agreement at\nstrong coupling with that of the \
near-threshold states found in a ladder\ndiagram model of the weak-strong \
coupling transition. We also study large\ndistance correlations of local \
operators with a Wilson loop, and show that the\nfall off at weak coupling \
and N=infinity (i.e. strictly planar diagrams)\nmatches the strong coupling \
predictions given by the AdS/CFT correspondence,\nrather than those of a \
weakly coupled U(1) gauge theory.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Fri, 24 Feb 2006 20:30:10 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Thu, 23 Mar 2006 21:19:08 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v3", "created" -> 
               "Fri, 9 Jun 2006 18:27:06 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2009-11-11", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"Klebanov", "I. R.", ""}, {
              "Maldacena", "J.", ""}, {"Thorn", "C. B.", ""}}}], 
          "Tooltip"]& ], 
        TagBox[
         TooltipBox[DiskBox[{18.388120903542283`, -3.783079837797631}, 0.],
