            Null, "abstract" -> 
            "  We use the uniform light-cone gauge to derive an exact \
gauge-fixed Lagrangian\nand light-cone Hamiltonian for the Green-Schwarz \
superstring in AdS5xS5. We\nthen quantize the theory perturbatively in the \
near plane-wave limit, and\ncompute the leading 1/J correction to a generic \
string state from the rank-1\nsubsectors. These investigations enable us to \
propose a new set of light-cone\nBethe equations for the quantum string. The \
equations have a simple form and\nyield the correct spinning string and flat \
space limits. Finally, we clarify\nthe notion of closed sectors in string \
theory by proving the existence of\nperturbative effective string \
Hamiltonians which are direct analogues of (all\nloop) dilatation operators \
in the dual N=4 gauge theory.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
