               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Nikolay Gromov, Vladimir Kazakov, Kazuhiro Sakai and \
Pedro Vieira\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Strings as Multi-Particle States of Quantum \
Sigma-Models\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"52 pages, 10 figures, LaTeX\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Nucl.Phys.B764:15-61,2007\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1016/j.nuclphysb.2006.11.018\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"LPTENS-06/05\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the quantum Bethe ansatz equations in the \
O(2n) sigma-model for\\nhysical particles on a circle, with the interaction \
given by the\\nZamolodchikovs' S-matrix, in view of its application to \
quantization of the\\nstring on the S^{2n-1} x R_t space. For a finite number \
of particles, the\\nsystem looks like an inhomogeneous integrable O(2n) spin \
chain. Similarly to\\nOSp(2m+n|2m) conformal sigma-model considered by Mann \
and Polchinski, we\\nreproduce in the limit of large density of particles the \
finite gap\\nKazakov-Marshakov-Minahan-Zarembo solution for the classical \
string and its\\ngeneralization to the S^5 x R_t sector of the \
Green-Schwarz-Metsaev-Tseytlin\\nsuperstring. We also reproduce some quantum \
effects: the BMN limit and the\\nquantum homogeneous spin chain similar to \
the one describing the bosonic sector\\nof the one-loop N=4 super Yang-Mills \
theory. We discuss the prospects of\\ngeneralization of these Bethe equations \
to the full superstring sigma-model.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
