            "abstract" -> 
            "  We show that all half-BPS Wilson loop operators in N=4 SYM -- \
which are\nlabeled by Young tableaus -- have a gravitational dual description \
in terms of\nD5-branes or alternatively in terms of D3-branes in AdS_5xS^5. \
We prove that\nthe insertion of a half-BPS Wilson loop operator in the cal \
N=4 SYM path\nintegral is achieved by integrating out the degrees of freedom \
on a\nconfiguration of bulk D5-branes or alternatively on a configuration of \
bulk\nD3-branes. The bulk D5-brane and D3-brane descriptions are related by\n\
bosonization.\n", 
