            "report-no" -> Null, "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> Null, 
            "abstract" -> 
            "  For the \\kappa-symmetry gauge fixed superstring action in \
AdS_5 x S^5 we\nconsider the fermionic fluctuations over a circular bosonic \
string background\nwith two angular momenta and two winding numbers in S^5. \
The SU(2)-type\nredefinitions of fermionic fields and the first-string limit \
generate a\ntruncated fermionic action for the SU(1|2) sector. It is \
expressed in a\ntwo-dimensional Lorentz-invariant form of a massive Dirac \
fermion and the\nplane-wave spectrum for the fermionic excitations is \
derived. The fermionic\nspectrum for the SU(2|2) sector is also analyzed.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
