            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0604043\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Arutyunov Gleb E\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"G. Arutyunov and S. Frolov\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"On AdS_5 x S^5 String S-matrix\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10 pages, version2: misprints are corrected\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Phys.Lett.B639:378-382,2006\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1016/j.physletb.2006.06.064\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"AEI-2006-022, ITP-UU-06-15, SPIN-06-13\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Recently two interesting conjectures about the string \
S-matrix on AdS_5 x S^5\\nhave been made. First, assuming the existence of a \
Hopf algebra symmetry Janik\\nderived a functional equation for the dressing \
factor of the quantum string\\nBethe ansatz. Second, Hernandez and Lopez \
proposed an explicit form of\\n1/\\\\sqrt\\\\lambda correction to the \
dressing factor. In this note we show that in\\nthe strong coupling expansion \
Janik's equation is solved by the dressing factor\\nup to the order of its \
validity. This observation provides a strong evidence in\\nfavor of a \
conjectured Hopf algebra symmetry for strings in AdS_5 x S^5 as well\\nas the \
perturbative string S-matrix.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Thu, 6 Apr 2006 13:49:41 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v2\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Fri, 9 Jun 2006 14:01:53 GMT\""}]}], "}"}]}], 
                   "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2008-11-26\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Arutyunov\"", ",", "\"G.\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Frolov\"", ",", "\"S.\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}]}], "}"}]}]}}, RowSpacings -> 1, ColumnAlignments -> 
             Left, ColumnAlignments -> Left], Column], 
