            "  We briefly review the spin-bit formalism, describing the \
non-planar dynamics\nof the $\\mathcal{N}=4,d=4$ Super Yang-Mills SU(N) gauge \
theory. After\nconsidering its foundations, we apply such a formalism to the \
$su(2)$ sector of\npurely scalar operators. In particular, we report an \
