            "hep-th", "license" -> Null, "abstract" -> 
            "  We study the spectrum of asymptotic states in the spin-chain \
description of\nplanar N=4 SUSY Yang-Mills. In addition to elementary \
magnons, the asymptotic\nspectrum includes an infinite tower of multi-magnon \
bound states with exact\ndispersion relation, Delta-J_{1} = \
sqrt{Q^{2}+(lambda/pi^2)sin^2(p/2)}, where\nthe positive integer Q is the \
number of constituent magnons. These states\naccount precisely for the known \
poles in the exact S-matrix. Like the\nelementary magnon, they transform in \
small representations of supersymmetry and\nare present for all values of the \
't Hooft coupling. At strong coupling we\nidentify the dual states in \
semiclassical string theory.\n", 
