          TagBox[
           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0604193\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Xinkai Wu\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Tristan McLoughlin and Xinkai Wu\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Kinky Strings in AdS_5 x S^5\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"35 pages, 6 figures; Version 2 references added\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP0608:063,2006\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1088/1126-6708/2006/08/063\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We construct a family of closed string solutions with \
kinks in a subspace of\\nAdS_5 x S^5 and study their properties. In certain \
limits these solutions\\nbecome folded pulsating strings, although in general \
they are made of multiple\\npulsating rectangles. One unusual feature of \
these solutions is that their\\nmonodromy matrices are trivial, leading to \
vanishing quasi-momenta. Exact\\nBacklund transformations of these solutions \
are found, again giving vanishing\\nhigher conserved charges. We also \
consider the fluctuation modes around these\\nsolutions as well as the \
semiclassical splitting of these strings.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Wed, 26 Apr 2006 02:44:00 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
