            "Tristan McLoughlin and Xinkai Wu", "title" -> 
            "Kinky Strings in AdS_5 x S^5", "comments" -> 
            "35 pages, 6 figures; Version 2 references added", "journal-ref" -> 
            "JHEP0608:063,2006", "doi" -> "10.1088/1126-6708/2006/08/063", 
            "report-no" -> Null, "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> Null, 
            "abstract" -> 
            "  We construct a family of closed string solutions with kinks in \
a subspace of\nAdS_5 x S^5 and study their properties. In certain limits \
these solutions\nbecome folded pulsating strings, although in general they \
are made of multiple\npulsating rectangles. One unusual feature of these \
solutions is that their\nmonodromy matrices are trivial, leading to vanishing \
quasi-momenta. Exact\nBacklund transformations of these solutions are found, \
again giving vanishing\nhigher conserved charges. We also consider the \
fluctuation modes around these\nsolutions as well as the semiclassical \
splitting of these strings.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
