               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We derive the asymptotic Bethe ansatz (AFS equations) \
for the string on S^3 x\\nR sector of AdS_5 x S^5 from the integrable \
nonhomogeneous dynamical spin chain\\nfor the string sigma model proposed in \
GKSV. It is clear from the derivation\\nthat AFS equations can be viewed only \
as an effective model describing a\\ncertain regime of a more fundamental \
inhomogeneous spin chain.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
