            "10.1088/1126-6708/2006/09/024", "report-no" -> "DAMTP-06-38", 
            "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> Null, "abstract" -> 
            "  We study the classical spectrum of string theory on AdS_5 X \
S^5 in the\nHofman-Maldacena limit. We find a family of classical solutions \
corresponding\nto Giant Magnons with two independent angular momenta on S^5. \
These solutions\nare related via Pohlmeyer's reduction procedure to the \
charged solitons of the\nComplex sine-Gordon equation. The corresponding \
string states are dual to BPS\nboundstates of many magnons in the spin-chain \
description of planar N=4 SUSY\nYang-Mills. The exact dispersion relation for \
these states is obtained from a\npurely classical calculation in string \
theory.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Tue, 16 May 2006 14:54:44 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Wed, 14 Jun 2006 11:21:26 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2009-11-11", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"Chen", "Heng-Yu", ""}, {
              "Dorey", "Nick", ""}, {"Okamura", "Keisuke", ""}}}], 
