               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the holographic principle of the two-point \
function in the case of a\\nspinning string in the AdS/CFT correspondence. \
Following the general method\\nproposed by Yoneya et al. for the \
bulk-boundary correspondence in the large $J$\\nlimit, we study the spinning \
string solution which starts and ends at the\\nboundary. We then show that \
the spinning string solution directly gives a\\ntwo-point function that is \
consistent with the spin chain picture in gauge\\ntheory.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
