               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0606126\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Marija Zamaklar\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Gleb Arutyunov, Sergey Frolov and Marija Zamaklar\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Finite-size Effects from Giant Magnons\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"42 pages, many figures, movies are available at\\n  \
http://www.aei.mpg.de/~peekas/magnons/ ; v2: Additional comments included and\
\\n  references added\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Nucl.Phys.B778:1-35,2007\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1016/j.nuclphysb.2006.12.026\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"AEI-2006-049, ITP-UU-06-28, SPIN-06-24\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In order to analyze finite-size effects for the \
gauge-fixed string sigma\\nmodel on AdS_5 x S^5, we construct one-soliton \
solutions carrying finite\\nangular momentum J. In the infinite J limit the \
solutions reduce to the\\nrecently constructed one-magnon configuration of \
Hofman and Maldacena. The\\nsolutions do not satisfy the level-matching \
condition and hence exhibit a\\ndependence on the gauge choice, which however \
disappears as the size J is taken\\nto infinity. Interestingly, the solutions \
do not conserve all the global\\ncharges of the psu(2,2|4) algebra of the \
sigma model, implying that the\\nsymmetry algebra of the gauge-fixed string \
sigma model is different from\\npsu(2,2|4) for finite J, once one gives up \
the level-matching condition. The\\nmagnon dispersion relation exhibits \
exponential corrections with respect to the\\ninfinite J solution. We also \
find a generalisation of our one-magnon\\nconfiguration to a solution \
carrying two charges on the sphere. We comment on\\nthe possible implications \
of our findings for the existence of the Bethe ansatz\\ndescribing the \
spectrum of strings carrying finite charges.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Wed, 14 Jun 2006 16:48:06 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v2\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Sun, 17 Sep 2006 13:29:03 GMT\""}]}], "}"}]}], 
                   "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2008-11-26\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Arutyunov\"", ",", "\"Gleb\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Frolov\"", ",", "\"Sergey\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Zamaklar\"", ",", "\"Marija\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}]}], "}"}]}]}}, RowSpacings -> 1, ColumnAlignments -> 
