               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Magnons, Classical Strings and beta-Deformations\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"v2: 15 pages. Improved and extended version, new section \
added with\\n  more details on the interpretation of our solution\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP0611:093,2006\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1088/1126-6708/2006/11/093\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"IPPP/06/37, DCPT/06/74\""}]}, {
              
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Motivated by the recent work of Hofman and Maldacena we \
construct a classical\\nstring solution on the beta-deformed AdS_5 \\\\times \
\\\\tilde{S}^5 background. This\\nstring solution is identified with a magnon \
state of the integrable spin chain\\ndescription of the N=1 supersymmetric \
beta-deformed gauge theory. The string\\nsolution carries two angular \
momenta, an infinite J_1 and a finite J_2 which\\nclassically can take \
arbitrary values. It corresponds to the magnon of charge\\nJ_2 propagating on \
an infinite spin chain. We derive an exact dispersion\\nrelation for this \
magnon from string theory.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
