               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We investigate the 1/2-BPS Wilson-'t Hooft loops in \
${\\\\cal N}=4$\\nSuper-Yang-Mills theory. We use the bulk D-brane with both \
electric and\\nmagnetic charges to calculate the all genus contribution of \
the circular loops.\\nThe expectation value of Wilson-'t Hooft loops are in \
perfect agreement with\\nthe result through supersymmetric condition and \
duality transformation in the\\ngauge theory.\\n\""}]}, {
