           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0607190\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Yuji Satoh\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Kazuhiro Sakai, Yuji Satoh\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"A large spin limit of strings on AdS_5 x S^5 in a \
non-compact sector\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"11 pages, 1 figure; (v2) a reference added; (v3) comments \
added,\\n  typos corrected\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Phys.Lett.B645:293-298,2007\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1016/j.physletb.2006.12.035\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"UTHEP-522\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the scaling law of the energy spectrum of \
classical strings on AdS_5\\nx S^5, in particular, in the SL(2) sector for \
large S (AdS spin) and fixed J\\n(S^1 \\\\subset S^5 spin). For any finite \
gap solution, we identify the limit in\\nwhich the energy exhibits the \
logarithmic scaling in S, characteristic to the\\nanomalous dimension of \
low-twist gauge theory operators. Our result therefore\\nshows that the log S \
scaling, first observed by Gubser, Klebanov and Polyakov\\nfor the folded \
string, is universal also on the string side, suggesting \
another\\ninteresting window to explore the AdS/CFT correspondence as in \
the\\nBMN/Frolov-Tseytlin limit.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
