               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 
                 "\"  We formulate the Hopf algebra underlying the su(2|2) \
worldsheet S-matrix of\\nthe AdS_5 x S^5 string in the AdS/CFT \
correspondence. For this we extend the\\nprevious construction in the su(1|2) \
subsector due to Janik to the full algebra\\nby specifying the action of the \
coproduct and the antipode on the remaining\\ngenerators. The nontriviality \
of the coproduct is determined by length-changing\\neffects and results in an \
unusual central braiding. As an application we\\nexplicitly determine the \
antiparticle representation by means of the\\nestablished antipode.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
