            "  We study the scattering of magnon boundstates in the \
spin-chain description\nof planar N=4 SUSY Yang-Mills. Starting from the \
conjectured exact S-matrix for\nmagnons in the SU(2) sector, we calculate the \
corresponding S-matrix for\nboundstates with an arbitrary number of \
constituent magnons. The resulting\nexpression has an interesting analytic \
structure with both simple and double\npoles. We also calculate the \
semiclassical S-matrix for the scattering of the\ncorresponding excitations \
on the string worldsheet known as Dyonic Giant\nMagnons. We find precise \
agreement with the magnon boundstate S-matrix in the\nlimit of large 't Hooft \
coupling.\n", 
