               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this paper we study correlation functions of \
circular Wilson loops in\\nhigher dimensional representations with chiral \
primary operators of N=4 super\\nYang-Mills theory. This is done using the \
recently established relation between\\nhigher rank Wilson loops in gauge \
theory and D-branes with electric fluxes in\\nsupergravity. We verify our \
results with a matrix model computation, finding\\nperfect agreement in both \
the symmetric and the antisymmetric case.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
