           "id" -> "hep-th/0608077", "submitter" -> "Diego Trancanelli", 
            "authors" -> "Simone Giombi, Riccardo Ricci, Diego Trancanelli", 
            "title" -> 
            "Operator product expansion of higher rank Wilson loops from \
D-branes and\n  matrix models", "comments" -> 
            "28 pages, latex; v2: minor misprints corrected, references \
added", "journal-ref" -> "JHEP0610:045,2006", "doi" -> 
            "10.1088/1126-6708/2006/10/045", "report-no" -> "YITP-SB-06-33", 
            "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> Null, "abstract" -> 
            "  In this paper we study correlation functions of circular \
Wilson loops in\nhigher dimensional representations with chiral primary \
operators of N=4 super\nYang-Mills theory. This is done using the recently \
established relation between\nhigher rank Wilson loops in gauge theory and \
D-branes with electric fluxes in\nsupergravity. We verify our results with a \
matrix model computation, finding\nperfect agreement in both the symmetric \
and the antisymmetric case.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Fri, 11 Aug 2006 19:25:17 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Mon, 2 Oct 2006 14:15:58 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2009-11-11", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"Giombi", "Simone", ""}, {
              "Ricci", "Riccardo", ""}, {"Trancanelli", "Diego", ""}}}], 
          "Tooltip"]& ], 
