            "  We give a direct path-integral calculation of the partition \
function for pure\n3+1 dimensional U(N) Yang-Mills theory at large N on a \
small three-sphere, up\nto two-loop order in perturbation theory. From this, \
we calculate the one-loop\nshift in the Hagedorn/deconfinement temperature \
for the theory at small volume,\nfinding that it increases (in units of the \
