            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0608213\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Tomoyoshi Hirata\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Tomoyoshi Hirata and Tadashi Takayanagi\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"AdS/CFT and Strong Subadditivity of Entanglement \
Entropy\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"29 pages, harvmac, 7 figures, references added\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 0702:042,2007\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1088/1126-6708/2007/02/042\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"KUNS-2038\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"hep-th cond-mat.str-el gr-qc quant-ph\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Recently, a holographic computation of the entanglement \
entropy in conformal\\nfield theories has been proposed via the AdS/CFT \
correspondence. One of the\\nmost important properties of the entanglement \
entropy is known as the strong\\nsubadditivity. This requires that the \
entanglement entropy should be a concave\\nfunction with respect to geometric \
parameters. It is a non-trivial check on the\\nproposal to see if this \
property is indeed satisfied by the entropy computed\\nholographically. In \
this paper we examine several examples which are defined by\\nannuli or \
cusps, and confirm the strong subadditivity via direct \
calculations.\\nFurthermore, we conjecture that Wilson loop correlators in \
strongly coupled\\ngauge theories satisfy the same relation. We also discuss \
the relation between\\nthe holographic entanglement entropy and the Bousso \
bound.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Wed, 30 Aug 2006 10:11:53 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v2\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Fri, 8 Sep 2006 11:51:02 GMT\""}]}], "}"}]}], 
                   "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2010-02-03\""}]}, {
