               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We discuss the bihamiltonian structure of the \
Metsaev-Tseytlin superstring in\\nAdS_5 x S**5. We explicitly write down the \
boost-invariant symplectic structure\\nfor the superstring in AdS_5 x S**5 \
and explain its relation to the standard\\n(canonical) symplectic structure. \
We discuss the geometrical meaning of the\\nboost-invariant symplectic \
structure for the bosonic string.\\n\""}]}, {
