            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0609158\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Donovan Young\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Gordon W. Semenoff, Donovan Young\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Exact 1/4 BPS Loop - Chiral Primary Correlator\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"17 pages, 4 figures, a few minor typos corrected\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Phys.Lett.B643:195-204,2006\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1016/j.physletb.2006.10.047\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Correlation functions of 1/4 BPS Wilson loops with the \
infinite family of 1/2\\nBPS chiral primary operators are computed in \
$\\\\mathcal{N}=4$ super Yang-Mills\\ntheory by summing planar ladder \
diagrams. Leading loop corrections to the sum\\nare shown to vanish. The \
correlation functions are also computed in the\\nstrong-coupling limit by \
examining the supergravity dual of the loop-loop\\ncorrelator. The strong \
coupling result is found to agree with the extrapolation\\nof the planar \
ladders. The result is related to known correlators of 1/2 BPS\\nWilson loops \
and 1/2 BPS chiral primaries by a simple re-scaling of the\\ncoupling \
constant, similar to an observation of Drukker, hep-th/0605151, for\\nthe \
case of the 1/4 BPS loop vacuum expectation value.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
