construct a\nthree-spin giant magnon solution describing a long open string \
in AdS_5 \\times\nS^5 which rotates both in two angular directions of S^5 and \
in one angular\ndirection of AdS_5. Through the Virasoro constraints the \
string motion in AdS_5\ntakes an effect from the string configuration in S^5. \
The dispersion relation\nof the soliton solution is obtained as a \
superposition of two bound states of\nmagnons. We show that there is a \
correspondence between a special giant magnon\nin AdS_2 and the sinh-Gordon \
soliton.\n", 
