               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the two circular Wilson loop correlator in \
which one is of\\nanti-symmetric representation, while the other is of \
fundamental representation\\nin 4-dimensional ${\\\\cal N}=4$ super \
Yang-Mills theory. This correlator has a\\ngood AdS dual, which is a system \
of a D5-brane and a fundamental string. We\\ncalculated the on-shell action \
of the string, and clarified the Gross-Ooguri\\ntransition in this \
correlator. Some limiting cases are also examined.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
