            "  The kappa-symmetry-fixed Green-Schwarz action in the AdS_5 x \
S^5 background\nis treated canonically in a version of the light-cone gauge. \
After reviewing\nthe generalized light-cone gauge for a bosonic sigma model, \
we present the\nHamiltonian dynamics of the Green-Schwarz action by using the \
transverse\ndegrees of freedom. The remaining fermionic constraints are all \
second class,\nwhich we treat by the Dirac bracket. Upon quantization, all of \
the transverse\ncoordinates are inevitably non-commutative.\n", 
