Zarembo", "title" -> "Worldsheet Scattering in AdS_5 x S^5", "comments" -> 
             "51 pages, v2: references added, v3: sign in (2.12), (6.19) and \
(6.21)\n  corrected; v4: discussion of classical YBE is considerably \
