        TagBox[
         TooltipBox[DiskBox[{19.27958869631382, -3.3932855877239785`}, 0.],
          TagBox[
           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0612079\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Juan Maldacena\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Juan Maldacena and Ian Swanson\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Connecting giant magnons to the pp-wave: An interpolating \
limit of\\n  $AdS_5 \\\\times S^5$\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"39 pages 5 figures; v2: Statement about singularities at \
$u_1-u_2 =\\n  i$ corrected; v3: Typos, signs and coefficients \
corrected\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Phys.Rev.D76:026002,2007\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1103/PhysRevD.76.026002\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We consider a particular large-radius limit of the \
worldsheet $S$-matrix for\\nstrings propagating on $AdS_5 \\\\times S^5$. \
This limiting theory interpolates\\nsmoothly between the so-called plane-wave \
and giant-magnon regimes of the\\ntheory. The sigma model in this region \
simplifies; it stands as a toy model of\\nthe full theory, and may be easier \
to solve directly. The $S$ matrix of the\\nlimiting theory is non-trivial, \
and receives contributions to all orders in the\\n$\\\\alpha'$ expansion. We \
analyze a guess for the full worldsheet $S$ matrix that\\nwas formulated \
recently by Beisert, Hernandez and Lopez, and Beisert, Eden, \
and\\nStaudacher, and take the corresponding limit. After doing a Borel \
resummation\\nwe find that the proposed $S$ matrix reproduces the expected \
results in the\\ngiant-magnon region. In addition, we rely on general \
considerations to draw\\nsome basic conclusions about the analytic structure \
of the $S$ matrix.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
