         Annotation[#, 
          
          TableForm[{
           "id" -> "hep-th/0612079", "submitter" -> "Juan Maldacena", 
            "authors" -> "Juan Maldacena and Ian Swanson", "title" -> 
            "Connecting giant magnons to the pp-wave: An interpolating limit \
of\n  $AdS_5 \\times S^5$", "comments" -> 
            "39 pages 5 figures; v2: Statement about singularities at \
$u_1-u_2 =\n  i$ corrected; v3: Typos, signs and coefficients corrected", 
            "journal-ref" -> "Phys.Rev.D76:026002,2007", "doi" -> 
            "10.1103/PhysRevD.76.026002", "report-no" -> Null, "categories" -> 
            "hep-th", "license" -> Null, "abstract" -> 
            "  We consider a particular large-radius limit of the worldsheet \
$S$-matrix for\nstrings propagating on $AdS_5 \\times S^5$. This limiting \
theory interpolates\nsmoothly between the so-called plane-wave and \
giant-magnon regimes of the\ntheory. The sigma model in this region \
simplifies; it stands as a toy model of\nthe full theory, and may be easier \
to solve directly. The $S$ matrix of the\nlimiting theory is non-trivial, and \
receives contributions to all orders in the\n$\\alpha'$ expansion. We analyze \
a guess for the full worldsheet $S$ matrix that\nwas formulated recently by \
Beisert, Hernandez and Lopez, and Beisert, Eden, and\nStaudacher, and take \
the corresponding limit. After doing a Borel resummation\nwe find that the \
proposed $S$ matrix reproduces the expected results in the\ngiant-magnon \
region. In addition, we rely on general considerations to draw\nsome basic \
conclusions about the analytic structure of the $S$ matrix.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Mon, 11 Dec 2006 20:58:34 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Mon, 11 Dec 2006 23:16:11 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v3", "created" -> 
               "Thu, 8 Mar 2007 15:31:06 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v4", "created" -> 
               "Fri, 27 Apr 2007 05:32:16 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2008-11-26", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"Maldacena", "Juan", ""}, {
              "Swanson", "Ian", ""}}}], "Tooltip"]& ], 
        TagBox[
         TooltipBox[DiskBox[{8.851385916234829, -5.983842559848895}, 0.],
