           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0701167\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Matteo Beccaria\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Matteo Beccaria, Gian Fabrizio De Angelis, Luigi Del \
Debbio, Marco\\n  Picariello\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Highest states in light-cone $AdS_5\\\\times S^5$ \
superstring\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"33 pages, 3 eps figures\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 0704:034,2007\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1088/1126-6708/2007/04/034\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the highest states in the compact rank-1 \
sectors of the AdS5 X S5\\nsuperstring in the framework of the recently \
proposed light cone Bethe Ansatz\\nequations. In the su(1|1) sector we \
present strong coupling expansions in the\\ntwo limits L,lambda -> OO \
(expanding in power of lambda^{-1/4} with fixed large\\nL) and lambda, L -> \
OO (expanding in power of 1/L with fixed large lambda)\\nwhere lambda is the \
't Hooft coupling and L is the number of Bethe momenta. The\\ntwo limits do \
not commute apart from the leading term which reproduces the\\nresult \
obtained with the Arutyunov-Frolov-Staudacher phase in the lambda, L ->\\nOO \
limit. In the su(2) sector we perform the strong coupling expansions in \
the\\nL->OO limit up to O(lambda^{-1/4}), and our result is in agreement with\
\\npreviuos String Bethe Ansatz analysis.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Thu, 18 Jan 2007 14:36:51 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2010-10-27\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Beccaria\"", ",", "\"Matteo\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"De Angelis\"", ",", "\"Gian Fabrizio\"", ",", "\"\""}],
                     "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Del Debbio\"", ",", "\"Luigi\"", ",", "\"\""}],
                     "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Picariello\"", ",", "\"Marco\"", ",", "\"\""}],
                     "}"}]}], "}"}]}]}}, RowSpacings -> 1, ColumnAlignments -> 
