Klebanov\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"On the Strong Coupling Scaling Dimension of High Spin \
Operators\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"26 pages, 2 figures\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 0704:082,2007\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1088/1126-6708/2007/04/082\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We give an exact analytic solution of the strong \
coupling limit of the\\nintegral equation which was recently proposed to \
describe the universal scaling\\nfunction of high spin operators in N = 4 \
gauge theory. The solution agrees with\\nthe prediction from string theory, \
confirms the earlier numerical analysis and\\nprovides a basis for developing \
a systematic perturbation theory around strong\\ncoupling.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
