            "abstract" -> 
            "  We study the classical current algebra for principial chiral \
model defined on\ntwo dimensional world-sheet with general metric. We develop \
the Hamiltonian\nformalism and determine the form of the Poisson brackets \
between currents. Then\nwe determine the Poisson bracket for Lax connection \
and we show that this\nPossion bracket does not depend on the world-sheet \
metric. We also study the\nNambu-Gotto form of this model. We prove an \
existence of the Lax connection and\ndetermine their Poisson bracket.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
