            "authors" -> "Makoto Sakaguchi and Kentaroh Yoshida", "title" -> 
            "Non-relativistic String and D-branes on AdS_5 x S^5 from \
Semiclassical\n  Approximation", "comments" -> "28+1 pages", "journal-ref" -> 
            "JHEP 0705:051,2007", "doi" -> "10.1088/1126-6708/2007/05/051", 
            "report-no" -> "KEK-TH-1125, OIQP-06-21", "categories" -> 
            "hep-th", "license" -> Null, "abstract" -> 
            "  We show that non-relativistic actions of string and D-branes \
on AdS_5 x S^5\ncan be reproduced as a semiclassical approximation of the \
string and D-brane\nactions around static 1/2 BPS configurations. This is \
contrastive to the\nPenrose limit. For example, the pp-wave string can be \
recaptured as a\nsemiclassical approximation around a 1/2 BPS particle \
rotating at the velocity\nof light. We argue that small deformation of a \
straight Wilson line would give\na composite operator in the gauge-theory \
side that corresponds to a\nsemiclassical state of the non-relativistic \
string, according to the\nsemiclassical interpretation.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
