               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0703104\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Diego Hofman\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Nick Dorey, Diego M. Hofman and Juan Maldacena\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"On the Singularities of the Magnon S-matrix\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"40 pages, 14 figures; typos corrected, references \
added\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Phys.Rev.D76:025011,2007\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1103/PhysRevD.76.025011\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We investigate the analytic structure of the magnon \
S-matrix in the\\nspin-chain description of planar ${\\\\cal N}=4$ SUSY \
Yang-Mills/$AdS_{5}\\\\times\\nS^{5}$ strings. Semiclassical analysis \
suggests that the exact S-matrix must\\nhave a large family of poles near the \
real axis in momentum space. In this\\narticle we show that these are double \
poles corresponding to the exchange of\\npairs of BPS magnons. Their \
locations in the complex plane are uniquely fixed\\nby the known dispersion \
relation for the BPS particles. The locations precisely\\nagree with the \
recent conjecture for the $S$ matrix by Beisert, Hernandez,\\nLopez, Eden and \
Staudacher (hep-th/0609044 and hep-th/0610251). These poles do\\nnot signal \
the presence of new bound states. In fact, a certain non-BPS\\nlocalized \
classical solution, which was thought to give rise to new bound\\nstates, can \
actually decay into a pair of BPS magnons.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
