               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0703131\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Matteo Beccaria\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Matteo Beccaria, Gian Fabrizio De Angelis, Valentina \
Forini\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"The scaling function at strong coupling from the quantum \
string Bethe\\n  equations\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"25 pages, 5 eps figures\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 0704:066,2007\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1088/1126-6708/2007/04/066\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"HU-EP-07/06\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study at strong coupling the scaling function \
describing the large spin\\nanomalous dimension of twist two operators in \
${\\\\cal N}=4$ super Yang-Mills\\ntheory. In the spirit of AdS/CFT duality, \
it is possible to extract it from the\\nstring Bethe Ansatz equations in the \
$\\\\mathfrak{sl}(2)$ sector of the $\\\\ads$\\nsuperstring. To this aim, we \
present a detailed analysis of the Bethe equations\\nby numerical and \
analytical methods. We recover several short string\\nsemiclassical results \
as a check. In the more difficult case of the long string\\nlimit providing \
the scaling function, we analyze the strong coupling version of\\nthe \
Eden-Staudacher equation, including the Arutyunov-Frolov-Staudacher \
phase.\\nWe prove that it admits a unique solution, at least in perturbation \
theory,\\nleading to the correct prediction consistent with semiclassical \
string\\ncalculations.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Wed, 14 Mar 2007 16:23:56 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2010-10-27\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
