Discrete Hirota\\n  Dynamics\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Minor changes: misprints fixed, references added\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
