               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We obtain the giant magnon of Hofman-Maldacena and its \
dyonic generalisation\\non R x S^3 < AdS_5 x S^5 from the general elliptic \
finite-gap solution by\\ndegenerating its elliptic spectral curve into a \
singular curve. This alternate\\ndescription of giant magnons as finite-gap \
solutions associated to singular\\ncurves is related through a symplectic \
transformation to their already\\nestablished description in terms of \
condensate cuts developed in\\nhep-th/0606145.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
