               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/0703187\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Per Sundin\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Alexander Hentschel, Jan Plefka, Per Sundin\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Testing the nested light-cone Bethe equations of the \
AdS_5 x S^5\\n  superstring\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"34 pages, 1 figure, 12 tables, JHEP style. v2: \
clarifications and\\n  references added. v3: reference added, version to be \
published\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 0705:021,2007\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1088/1126-6708/2007/05/021\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"HU-EP-07/07\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We perform a detailed test of the quantum integrability \
of the AdS_5 x S^5\\nsuperstring in uniform light-cone gauge in its near \
plane-wave limit. For this\\nwe establish the form of the general nested \
light-cone Bethe equations for the\\nquantum string from the long range \
psu(2,2|4) Bethe equations of Beisert and\\nStaudacher. Moreover the scheme \
for translating excited string states into\\nBethe root excitations is given. \
We then confront the direct perturbative\\ndiagonalization of the light-cone \
string Hamiltonian in the near plane-wave\\nlimit with the energy spectrum \
obtained from the general nested light-cone\\nBethe equations in various \
higher rank sectors. The analysis is performed both\\nanalytically and \
numerically up to the level of six impurity states and\\nsubsectors of \
maximal rank four. We find perfect agreement in all cases lending\\nstrong \
support to the quantum integrability of the AdS_5 x S^5 \
superstring.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
