               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We propose a method for computing the energy level \
spacing around classical\\nstring solutions in AdS(5)xS(5). This method is \
based on the integrable\\nstructure of the string and can be applied to an \
arbitrary classical\\nconfiguration. Our approach treats in equal footing the \
bosonic and fermionic\\nexcitations and provides an unambiguous prescription \
for the labeling of the\\nfluctuation frequencies. Finally we revisit the \
computation of these\\nfrequencies for the SU(2) and SL(2) circular strings \
and compare our results to\\nthe existing ones.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
