               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  I review some recent works on the Hermitean one-matrix \
and d-dimensional\\ngauge-invariant matrix models. Special attention is paid \
to solving the models\\nat large-N by the loop equations. For the one-matrix \
model the main result\\nconcerns calculations of higher genera, while for the \
d-dimensional model the\\nlarge-N solution for a logarithmic potential is \
described. Some results on\\nfermionic matrix models are briefly reviewed. \
Talk at the Workshop on Quantum\\nField Theoretical Aspects of High Energy \
Physics, Kyffhaeuser, Germany,\\nSeptember 20-24, 1993\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
