                  "\"  The lattice model of principal chiral field \
interacting with the gauge\\nfields, which have no kinetic term, is \
considered. This model can be regarded\\nas a strong coupling limit of \
lattice gauge theory at finite temperature. The\\ncomplete set of equations \
for collective field variables is derived in the\\nlarge N limit and the \
phase structure of the model is studied.\\n\""}]}, {
