               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the large-$N$ limit of adjoint fermion \
one-matrix models. We find\\none-cut solutions of the loop equations for the \
correlators of these models and\\nshow that they exhibit third order phase \
transitions associated with $m$-th\\norder multi-critical points with string \
susceptibility exponents $\\\\gamma_{\\\\rm\\nstr}=-1/m$. We also find \
critical points which can be interpreted as points of\\nfirst order phase \
transitions, and we discuss the implications of this critical\\nbehaviour for \
the topological expansion of these matrix models.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
