             "Nucl.Phys. B480 (1996) 317-340", "doi" -> 
             "10.1016/S0550-3213(96)00471-3", "report-no" -> "SMI-96-4", 
             "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> Null, "abstract" -> 
             "  The non-Abelian analog of the classical Coulomb gas is \
discussed. The\nstatistical mechanics of arrays of classical particles which \
transform under\nvarious representations of a non-Abelian gauge group and \
which interact through\nnon-Abelian electric fields are considered. The \
problem is formulated on the\nlattice and, for the case of adjoint charges, \
it is solved in the large N\nlimit. The explicit solution exhibits a first \
order confinement-de-confinement\nphase transition with computable \
properties. In one dimension, the solution has\na continuum limit which \
describes 1+1-dimensional quantum chromodynamics (QCD)\nwith heavy adjoint \
matter.\n", "versions" -> {{
               "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
                "Wed, 19 Jun 1996 17:23:14 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
             "2009-10-30", 
             "authors_parsed" -> {{"Semenoff", "G. W.", ""}, {
               "Zarembo", "K.", ""}}}], "Tooltip"]& ]}, 
        TagBox[
         TooltipBox[DiskBox[{6.353660935221184, -6.039556330323429}, 0.],
          TagBox[
           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/9607072\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Gabriele Ferretti\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Gabriele Ferretti (Uppsala)\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"The Critical Exponents Of The Matrix Valued Gross-Neveu \
Model\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"19 pages, LaTeX.2e + macro epsfig. Two eps figures, four \
LeTeX\\n  pictures\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Nucl.Phys. B487 (1997) 739-755\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1016/S0550-3213(96)00708-0\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"UUITP-14/96\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th cond-mat\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We study the large N limit of the MATRIX valued \
Gross-Neveu model in 2<d<4\\ndimensions. The method employed is a combination \
of the approximate recursion\\nformula of Polyakov and Wilson with the \
solution to the zero dimensional large\\nN counting problem of Makeenko and \
Zarembo. The model is found to have a phase\\ntransition at a finite value \
for the critical temperature and the critical\\nexponents are approximated by \
nu = 1/(2(d-2)) and eta=d-2. We test the validity\\nof the approximation by \
applying it to the usual vector models where it is\\nfound to yield exact \
results to leading order in 1/N.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Tue, 9 Jul 1996 15:42:22 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
              
