                RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  We discuss properties of D-brane configurations in the \
matrix model of type\\nIIB superstring recently proposed by Ishibashi, Kawai, \
Kitazawa and Tsuchiya.\\nWe calculate central charges in supersymmetry \
algebra at infinite N and\\nassociate them with one- and five-branes present \
in IIB superstring theory. We\\nconsider classical solutions associated with \
static three- and five-branes and\\ncalculate their interactions at one loop \
in the matrix model. We discuss some\\naspects of the matrix-model \
formulation of IIB superstring.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
