             GridBox[{{
                RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/9703038\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Yuri Makeenko\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"A. Fayyazuddin, Y. Makeenko, P. Olesen, D.J. Smith, K. \
Zarembo\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Towards a Non-perturbative Formulation of IIB \
Superstrings by Matrix\\n  Models\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"23pp., Latex; final version to be published in Nucl. \
Phys. B\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Nucl.Phys. B499 (1997) 159-182\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"10.1016/S0550-3213(97)00321-0\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"NBI-HE-97-09, ITEP-TH-09/97\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  We address the problem of a non-perturbative \
formulation of superstring\\ntheory by means of the recently proposed matrix \
models. For the model by\\nIshibashi, Kawai, Kitazawa and Tsuchiya (IKKT), we \
perform one-loop calculation\\nof the interaction between operator-like \
solutions identified with D-brane\\nconfigurations of type IIB superstring \
(in particular, for parallel moving and\\nrotated static p-branes). Comparing \
to the superstring calculations, we show\\nthat the matrix model reproduces \
the superstring results only at large\\ndistances or small velocities, \
corresponding to keeping only the lowest mass\\nclosed string modes. We \
propose a modification of the IKKT matrix model\\nintroducing an integration \
over an additional Hermitian matrix required to have\\npositive definite \
eigenvalues, which is similar to the square root of the\\nmetric in the \
continuum Schild formulation of IIB superstrings. We show that\\nfor this new \
matrix action the Nambu-Goto version of the Green-Schwarz action\\nis \
reproduced even at quantum level.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
