               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We describe a way to compute scattering amplitudes in \
M(atrix) quantum\\nmechanics, that involve the transverse five-brane. We then \
compute certain\\nscattering processes and show that they have the expected \
SO(5) invariance,\\ngive the correct transverse-five-brane mass, and agree \
with the supergravity\\nresult.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
