            "authors" -> "Juan M. Maldacena", "title" -> 
            "Probing Near Extremal Black Holes with D-branes", "comments" -> 
            "12 pages, 1 figure. v2: References added. v3: Remark about the\n \
 position of the horizon corrected", "journal-ref" -> 
            "Phys.Rev. D57 (1998) 3736-3741", "doi" -> 
            "10.1103/PhysRevD.57.3736", "report-no" -> "RU-97-30", 
            "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> Null, "abstract" -> 
            "  We calculate the one loop effective action for D-brane probes \
moving in the\npresence of near BPS D-branes. The $v^2$ term agrees with \
supergravity in all\ncases and the static force agrees for a five dimensional \
black hole with two\nlarge charges. It also agrees qualitatively in all the \
other cases. We make\nsome comments on the M(atrix) theory interpretation of \
these results.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Thu, 8 May 1997 18:20:30 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Wed, 28 May 1997 14:02:37 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v3", "created" -> 
               "Wed, 8 Jul 1998 16:09:21 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2009-10-30", 
            "authors_parsed" -> {{"Maldacena", "Juan M.", ""}}}], 
          "Tooltip"]& ], 
