               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Explicit computations of the partition function and \
correlation functions of\\nWilson and Polyakov loop operators in \
theta-sectors of two dimensional\\nYang-Mills theory on the line cylinder and \
torus are presented. Several\\nobservations about the correspondence of two \
dimensional Yang-Mills theory with\\nunitary matrix quantum mechanics are \
presented. The incorporation of the\\ntheta-angle which characterizes the \
states of two dimensional adjoint QCD is\\ndiscussed.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
