            Null, "abstract" -> 
            "  We derive Schwinger-Dyson equations for the Wilson loops of a \
type IIB matrix\nmodel. Superstring coordinates are introduced through the \
construction of the\nloop space. We show that the continuum limit of the loop \
equation reproduces\nthe light-cone superstring field theory of type IIB \
superstring in the large-N\nlimit. We find that the interacting string theory \
can be obtained in the double\nscaling limit as it is expected.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Sat, 17 May 1997 07:34:45 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
