               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  I comment on a curious relation between Siegel's model \
of random lattice\\nstrings and type IIB matrix model. The comparison of the \
two theories suggests\\nthat there may exist extra terms in the latter which \
are overlooked in the weak\\nstring coupling limit.\\n\""}]}, {
