           "id" -> "hep-th/9708115", "submitter" -> "Simon Dalley", "authors" -> 
            "S. Dalley", "title" -> 
            "Adjoint QCD2 and the Non-Abelian Schwinger Mechanism", 
            "comments" -> 
            "10 pages LaTeX, uses boxedeps.tex. Figures clarified now", 
            "journal-ref" -> "Phys.Lett. B418 (1998) 160-166", "doi" -> 
            "10.1016/S0370-2693(97)01474-3", "report-no" -> "CERN-TH/198", 
            "categories" -> "hep-th", "license" -> Null, "abstract" -> 
            "  Massless Majorana fermions in the adjoint representation of \
SU(N_c) are\nexpected to screen gauge interactions in 1+1 dimensions, \
analogous to a similar\nHiggs phenomena known for 1+1-dimensional U(1) gauge \
theory with massless\nfundamental fermions (Schwinger model). Using the \
light-cone formalism and\nlarge-N_c limit, a non-abelian analogue of the \
Schwinger boson is shown to be\nresponsible for the screening between heavy \
test charges. This adjoint boson\ndoes not exist simply as a physical state, \
but boundstates are built entirely\nfrom this particle.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Thu, 21 Aug 1997 17:00:23 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
               "Fri, 3 Oct 1997 11:22:44 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
            "2009-10-30", "authors_parsed" -> {{"Dalley", "S.", ""}}}], 
          "Tooltip"]& ], 
        TagBox[
         TooltipBox[DiskBox[{5.839797194965257, -1.4353548169648036`}, 0.],
          TagBox[
           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/9709098\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"B. P. Mandal\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Bhabani Prasad Mandal and Subir Mukhopadhyay\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"D-brane interaction in the type IIB Matrix Model\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Revtex, 18 pages, No figure\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Phys.Lett. B419 (1998) 62-72\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1016/S0370-2693(97)01421-4\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"IP-BBSR/97-33\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We calculate the potential between bound states of \
D-branes of different\\ndimension in IIB matrix model upto one loop order and \
find nice agreement with\\nthe open string calculations in short and large \
distance limit. We also\\nconsider the scattering of bound states of \
D-branes, calculate the scattering\\nphase shift and analyze the effective \
potential in different limits.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
