        TagBox[
         TooltipBox[DiskBox[{5.590863198515663, -1.2841091508836815`}, 0.],
          TagBox[
           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/9802085\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Hajime Aoki\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"H. Aoki, S. Iso, H. Kawai, Y. Kitazawa, T. Tada\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Space-Time Structures from IIB Matrix Model\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"39 pages, Latex, uses epsf and axodraw\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Prog.Theor.Phys. 99 (1998) 713-746\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1143/PTP.99.713\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"KEK-TH-559, TIT/HEP-382\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We derive a long distance effective action for \
space-time coordinates from a\\nIIB matrix model. It provides us an effective \
tool to study the structures of\\nspace-time. We prove the finiteness of the \
theory for finite $N$ to all orders\\nof the perturbation theory. Space-time \
is shown to be inseparable and its\\ndimensionality is dynamically \
determined. The IIB matrix model contains a\\nmechanism to ensure the \
vanishing cosmological constant which does not rely on\\nthe manifest \
supersymmetry. We discuss possible mechanisms to obtain \
realistic\\ndimensionality and gauge groups from the IIB matrix \
model.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Thu, 12 Feb 1998 12:21:47 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2009-10-31\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Aoki\"", ",", "\"H.\"", ",", "\"\""}], "}"}], 
                    ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
