          Annotation[#, 
           
           TableForm[{
            "id" -> "hep-th/9902095", "submitter" -> Null, "authors" -> 
             "A.A. Tseytlin and K. Zarembo", "title" -> 
             "Effective potential in non-supersymmetric SU(N) x SU(N) gauge \
theory and\n  interactions of type 0 D3-branes", "comments" -> 
             "14 pages, latex, v2: minor corrections, v3: a comment and \
references\n  added at the end of section 5", "journal-ref" -> 
             "Phys.Lett.B457:77-86,1999", "doi" -> 
             "10.1016/S0370-2693(99)00471-2", "report-no" -> 
             "ITEP-TH-4/99, Imperial/TP/98-99/41", "categories" -> "hep-th", 
             "license" -> Null, "abstract" -> 
             "  We study some aspects of short-distance interaction between \
parallel\nD3-branes in type 0 string theory as described by the corresponding\
\nworld-volume gauge theory. We compute the one-loop effective potential in \
the\nnon-supersymmetric SU(N) x SU(N) gauge theory (which is a Z_2 projection \
of the\nU(2N) n=4 SYM theory) representing dyonic branes composed of N \
electric and N\nmagnetic D3-branes. The branes of the same type repel at \
short distances, but\nan electric and a magnetic brane attract, and the \
forces between self-dual\nbranes cancel. The self-dual configuration (with \
the positions of the electric\nand the magnetic branes, i.e. the diagonal \
entries of the adjoint scalar\nfields, being the same) is stable against \
separation of one electric or one\nmagnetic brane, but is unstable against \
certain modes of separation of several\nsame-type branes. This instability \
should be suppressed in the large N limit,\ni.e. should be irrelevant for the \
large N CFT interpretation of the gauge\ntheory suggested in hep-th/9901101.\n\
", "versions" -> {{
               "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
                "Fri, 12 Feb 1999 22:54:19 GMT"}, {
               "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
                "Mon, 22 Feb 1999 16:12:04 GMT"}, {
               "version" -> "v3", "created" -> 
                "Wed, 24 Feb 1999 10:59:34 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
             "2009-09-17", 
             "authors_parsed" -> {{"Tseytlin", "A. A.", ""}, {
               "Zarembo", "K.", ""}}}], "Tooltip"]& ]}, 
        TagBox[
         TooltipBox[DiskBox[{13.156634465602389`, -1.0563168538239953`}, 0.],
