            "  We study five dimensional non critical type 0 string theory \
and its\ncorrespondence to non supersymmetric Yang Mills theory in four \
dimensions. We\nsolve the equations of motion of the low energy effective \
action and identify a\nclass of solutions that translates into a confining \
behavior in the IR region\nof the dual gauge theories. In particular we \
