near-horizon geometry is the\n$AdS_3\\times S^3\\times T^4$ space and that \
there is no tachyon instability in\nthis background. The Bekenstein-Hawking \
entropy is calculated. The worldvolume\ntheory on the D$5_{\\pm}$-D$1_{\\pm}$ \
