             "  The AdS/CFT correspondence predicts a phase transition in \
Wilson loop\ncorrelators in the strong coupling N=4, D=4 SYM theory which \
arises due to\ninstability of the classical string stretched between the \
loops. We study this\ntransition in detail by solving equations of motion for \
