Brane\\n  Configurations\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"18 pages, Latex. 2 figures. v2: refs. added, additions to \
the\\n  introduction concerning the twisted sector\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "\"JHEP 9907 (1999) 011\""}]}, {
              
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1088/1126-6708/1999/07/011\""}]}, {
