          TableForm[{
           "id" -> "hep-th/9906179", "submitter" -> "Ben Craps", "authors" -> 
            "Ben Craps and Frederik Roose", "title" -> 
            "NS fivebranes in type 0 string theory", "comments" -> 
            "LaTeX, 12 pages, no figures; v3: section on S-duality revised,\n \
 references added, to be published in JHEP", "journal-ref" -> 
            "JHEP 9910:007,1999", "doi" -> "10.1088/1126-6708/1999/10/007", 
            "report-no" -> "KUL-TF-99/24", "categories" -> "hep-th", 
            "license" -> Null, "abstract" -> 
            "  The massless degrees of freedom of type 0 NS5-branes are \
derived. A\nnon-chiral, purely bosonic spectrum is found in both type 0A and \
0B. This\nnon-chirality is confirmed by a one-loop computation in the bulk. \
Some puzzles\nconcerning type 0B S-duality are pointed out in this context. \
An interpretation\nof the spectra in terms of ``type 0 little strings'' is \
proposed.\n", 
            "versions" -> {{
              "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
               "Wed, 23 Jun 1999 20:12:03 GMT"}, {
              "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
