                RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  Correlators of Wilson loop operators with O_4=Tr(F_{\\\
\\mu\\\\nu}^2+...) are\\ncomputed in N=4 super-Yang-Mills theory using the \
AdS/CFT correspondence. The\\nresults are compared with the leading order \
perturbative computations. As a\\nconsequence of conformal invariance, these \
correlators have identical forms in\\nthe weak and strong coupling limits for \
circular loops. They are essentially\\ndifferent for contours not protected \
by conformal symmetry.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
