            "abstract" -> 
            "  A matrix model for type 0 strings is proposed. It consists in \
making a\nnon-supersymmetric orbifold projection in the Yang-Mills theory and \
identifying\nthe infrared configurations of the system at infinite coupling \
with strings.\nThe correct partition function is calculated. Also, the usual \
spectrum of\nbranes is found. Both type A and B models are constructed. The \
model in a torus\ncontains all the degrees of freedom and interpolates \
between the four string\ntheories (IIA, IIB, 0A, 0B) and the M theory as \
different limits are taken.\n", 
