               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/9908141\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Hajime Aoki\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"H. Aoki, N. Ishibashi, S. Iso, H. Kawai, Y. Kitazawa and \
T. Tada\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Noncommutative Yang-Mills in IIB Matrix Model\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"21pages, LaTeX, no figures, typos corrected\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Nucl.Phys. B565 (2000) 176-192\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1016/S0550-3213(99)00633-1\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"KEK-TH-637, KUNS-1595\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We show that twisted reduced models can be interpreted \
as noncommutative\\nYang-Mills theory. Based upon this correspondence, we \
obtain noncommutative\\nYang-Mills theory with D-brane backgrounds in IIB \
matrix model. We propose that\\nIIB matrix model with D-brane backgrounds \
serve as a concrete definition of\\nnoncommutative Yang-Mills. We investigate \
D-instanton solutions as local\\nexcitations on D3-branes. When instantons \
overlap, their interaction can be\\nwell described in gauge theory and \
AdS/CFT correspondence. We show that IIB\\nmatrix model gives us the \
consistent potential with IIB supergravity when they\\nare well separated.\\n\
\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
