               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We explicitly show the area law behavior of a circular \
Wilson loop in\\nconfining theories from supergravity. We calculate the \
correlator of two Wilson\\nloops from supergravity in confining backgrounds. \
We find that it is dominated\\nby an exchange of a ``scalarball'' that is \
lighter than the glueballs. We\\ninterpret these results in terms of the \
meson-meson potential in such theories.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
