                RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th/9911246\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Zarembo\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"A. A. Tseytlin, K. Zarembo\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Magnetic Interactions of D-branes and Wess-Zumino Terms \
in Super\\n  Yang-Mills Effective Actions\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"14 pages, 1 figure; a clarification and two important \
references\\n  added; v4: comments on higher-derivative terms and on anomaly \
inflow on\\n  D8-branes are added\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Phys.Lett.B474:95-102,2000\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"10.1016/S0370-2693(99)01499-9\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"ITEP-TH-69/99, OHSTPY-HEP-T-99-028\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  There is a close relation between classical \
supergravity and quantum SYM\\ndescriptions of interactions between separated \
branes. In the case of D3\\nbranes, the equivalence of leading-order \
potentials is due to\\nnon-renormalization of the F^4 term in N=4 SYM theory. \
Here we point out the\\nexistence of another special non-renormalized term in \
quantum SYM effective\\naction. This term reproduces the interaction \
potential between electric charge\\nof a D3-brane probe and magnetic charge \
of a D3-brane source, represented by\\nthe Chern-Simons part of the D-brane \
action. This unique Wess-Zumino term\\ndepends on all six scalar fields and \
originates from a phase of the euclidean\\nfermion determinant in SYM theory. \
It is manifestly scale invariant (i.e. is\\nthe same for large and small \
separations between branes) and can not receive\\nhigher loop corrections in \
gauge theory. Maximally supersymmetric SYM theories\\nin D=p+1>4 contain \
mixed WZ terms which depend on both scalar and gauge field\\nbackgrounds, and \
which reproduce the corresponding CS terms in the supergravity\\ninteraction \
potentials between separated Dp-branes for p>3. Purely scalar WZ\\nterms \
appear in other cases, e.g., in N=2 gauge theories in various \
dimensions\\ndescribing magnetic interactions between Dp and D(6-p) \
branes.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Tue, 30 Nov 1999 05:06:21 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v2\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Wed, 1 Dec 1999 03:49:20 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v3\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Tue, 7 Dec 1999 01:19:49 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v4\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Wed, 29 Dec 1999 23:45:15 GMT\""}]}], "}"}]}], 
                    "}"}]}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2009-09-17\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
