               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We consider IIB matrix model with D1-D5-brane \
backgrounds. Using the fact\\nthat noncommutative gauge theory on the \
D-branes can be obtained as twisted\\nreduced model in IIB matrix model, we \
study two-dimensional gauge theory on\\nD1-branes and D5-branes. Especially \
the spectrum of the zero modes in the\\noff-diagonal parts is examined. We \
also consider the description of D1-branes\\nas local excitations of gauge \
theory on D5-branes. Relation to supergravity\\nsolution is also \
discussed.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
