obtained as twisted\nreduced model in IIB matrix model, we study \
two-dimensional gauge theory on\nD1-branes and D5-branes. Especially the \
spectrum of the zero modes in the\noff-diagonal parts is examined. We also \
consider the description of D1-branes\nas local excitations of gauge theory \
on D5-branes. Relation to supergravity\nsolution is also discussed.\n", 
