               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  In this paper we investigate the Schwinger parametric \
representation for the\\nFeynman amplitudes of the recently discovered \
renormalizable $\\\\phi^4_4$ quantum\\nfield theory on the Moyal non \
commutative ${\\\\mathbb R^4}$ space. This\\nrepresentation involves new \
{\\\\it hyperbolic} polynomials which are the\\nnon-commutative analogs of \
the usual \\\"Kirchoff\\\" or \\\"Symanzik\\\" polynomials of\\ncommutative \
field theory, but contain richer topological information.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
