            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"nucl-th/0609013\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Edward Shuryak\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Edward Shuryak\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"The conical flow from quenched jets in sQGP\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"17 pages, a talk at Hard Probes 06, Monterey July \
2006\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Nucl.Phys.A783:31-38,2007\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"10.1016/j.nuclphysa.2006.11.011\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"nucl-th\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  Starting with a reminder of what is strongly coupled \
Quark-Gluon Plasma\\n(sQGP), we proceed to recent advances in jet quenching \
and heavy quark\\ndiffusion, with a brief summary of various results based on \
AdS/CFT\\ncorrespondence. The conical flow is a hydrodynamical phenomenon \
created by\\nenergy and entropy deposited by high energy jets propagating in \
matter, similar\\nin nature to well known sonic boom from the supersonic \
planes. After a brief\\nreview, we discuss excitations of two hydro modes -- \
sound and ``diffuson'' --\\nwhich can be excited in this way. We also study \
expanding matter case, with a\\nvariable sped of sound, and use adiabatic \
invariants to show that the parameter\\n$v/T$ ($v$ velocity in the wave, $T$ \
temperature) is increasing, up to a factor\\n3, during expansion. At the end \
we discuss recent results of the Princeton\\ngroup which derived conical flow \
from AdS/CFT.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Tue, 5 Sep 2006 21:35:11 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
              
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2008-11-26\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
