           TagBox[
            GridBox[{{
               RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"nucl-th/0701067\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Mark G. Alford\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Mark G. Alford (Washington U., St. Louis), Matt Braby \
(Washington U.,\\n  St. Louis), Sanjay Reddy (LANL), Thomas Schaefer \
(NCSU)\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Bulk viscosity due to kaons in color-flavor-locked quark \
matter\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"23 pages, LaTeX; corrected typos and a numerical error in \
the last 3\\n  figures. Conclusions unchanged\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"Phys.Rev.C75:055209,2007\""}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1103/PhysRevC.75.055209\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"LA-UR-07-0429\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{
                "\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"nucl-th astro-ph hep-ph\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
               
               RowBox[{
                "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 "\"  We calculate the bulk viscosity of \
color-superconducting quark matter in the\\ncolor-flavor-locked (CFL) phase. \
We assume that the lightest bosons are the\\nsuperfluid mode H and the kaons \
K0 and K+, and that there is no kaon\\ncondensate. We calculate the rate of \
strangeness-equilibrating processes that\\nconvert kaons into superfluid \
modes, and the resultant bulk viscosity. We find\\nthat for oscillations with \
a timescale of milliseconds, at temperatures T << 1\\nMeV, the CFL bulk \
viscosity is much less than that of unpaired quark matter,\\nbut at higher \
temperatures the bulk viscosity of CFL matter can become larger.\\n\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Wed, 24 Jan 2007 16:54:46 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v2\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Wed, 5 Sep 2007 19:49:04 GMT\""}]}], "}"}]}], 
                   "}"}]}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2008-11-26\""}]}, {
               RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"Alford\"", ",", "\"Mark G.\"", ",", "\"\"", ",", 
                    "\"Washington U., St. Louis\""}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"Braby\"", ",", "\"Matt\"", ",", "\"\"", ",", 
